window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS=(window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2501,"title":"Chapter 2501: Inside Primordial Chaos","paragraphs":["Seeing Zi Xuan slaughter magical beasts left and right, the Demon Annihilation Sword refused to simply stand by and also rushed forward to kill some on her own, subconsciously feeling a sense of rivalry with Zi Xuan without even realizing it herself.","Although the Demon Annihilation Sword specialized in slaying demons, it was still a masterpiece whose sharpness rivaled even Celestial-grade treasures.","However, unlike Zi Xuan, who could wield Supreme Sword Aura as naturally as breathing, the Demon Annihilation Sword couldn’t even use basic Sword Aura.","Yet, it did not lose to Zi Xuan and slayed magical beasts just as fast as her.","In just a few days, Yuan arrived at the second level of the Primordial Chaos.","While the first level had been mostly barren, filled with jagged mountains and rugged terrain, the second level began to show signs of vegetation. However, every tree there was dry, withered, and seemingly devoid of life.","Not only that, but the Chaotic Essence within the area had also become denser and far more abundant, while the magical beasts there had risen to the third level of God Ascension.","Of course, this wasn’t a problem for Zi Xuan, who was at the peak of God Ascension.","That being said, even though Zi Xuan could easily defeat the magical beasts, it was not as though she could recklessly expend her spiritual energy without consequence.","At the end of the day, unlike Yuan, she did not possess a Chaotic Heart and therefore could not naturally replenish her spiritual energy within the Primordial Chaos.","\"Dear, I’m running low on spiritual energy,\" Zi Xuan said to Yuan once she could no longer defeat the magical beasts with a single strike.","Without saying a word, Yuan transferred some of his spiritual energy to Zi Xuan, allowing her to continue fighting at full strength.","Meanwhile, the Demon Annihilation Sword continued slaughtering the magical beasts through pure raw power alone, showing no signs of slowing down.","Although Zi Xuan was fully capable of doing the same, she deliberately chose to fight in her spirit form while using Supreme Sword Aura instead, as it had been far too long since she’d been able to properly exercise herself like this.","With two powerful existences protecting him, Yuan was able to travel through the Primordial Chaos without needing to slow down, appearing completely at ease the entire time.","In the blink of an eye, they arrived at the third level, where the scenery finally began showing more noticeable signs of life.","Yuan stopped moving for a moment to examine the plants and trees in the area.","\"I think I have seen them in the Primal Expanse before...\" he mumbled in a low voice.","Suddenly, Yuan’s eyebrows twitched as something else caught his attention, prompting him to turn his head toward the source.","\"What’s wrong?\" Zi Xuan asked when she couldn’t sense anything nearby.","\"...\"","A slight frown appeared on Yuan’s face as he replied in a cautious voice, \"I sense Eternal Essence. Someone is using Eternal Essence ahead of us.\"","\"There’s an Eternal nearby?!\" Zi Xuan exclaimed in shock.","Yuan fell silent for a moment before responding, \"Although it’s a bit weak, it’s definitely Eternal Essence. Now that I think about it, the Primordial Chaos is outside the Absolute Power’s influence, so it wouldn’t be impossible for an Eternal to show up here...\"","\"What should we do?\" Zi Xuan then asked. \"Go around them or confront them directly?\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before replying, \"Let’s just keep moving forward. If it really is an Eternal, they most likely already know we’re here, so trying to avoid them might actually draw their attention instead.\"","He then shrugged and added, \"Besides, maybe they won’t even care about us. To beings like them, we’re nothing more than mere ants.\"","A short while later, they continued moving forward, albeit with heightened vigilance.","The closer Yuan got, the clearer he could sense the Eternal Essence radiating from the other party, and it gradually became apparent what this individual was doing there.","’They seem to be training their Eternal Essence against magical beasts... There’s no way an actual Eternal would waste their time doing something like this, so who else could it be?’ Yuan pondered inwardly.","Eventually, they arrived at the fourth level of the Primordial Chaos, where even the weakest magical beasts had reached at least the sixth level of God Ascension.","\"I have always wondered this, but where in heaven’s name are these magical beasts coming from?\" Zi Xuan suddenly asked out loud.","\"I initially thought they came from the Primal Expanse, but none of them possess a Chaotic Heart, which is a defining characteristic of beings from that place,\" Yuan remarked.","\"Yet for some reason, they’re still capable of cultivating with Chaotic Essence even without one. It’s truly bizarre.\"","\"Anyway, we’re getting close to that individual using Eternal Essence.\"","A few hours after entering the fourth level, Yuan was finally close enough to observe the mysterious individual with his divine sense.","However, not wanting to provoke their attention, he chose not to investigate further and simply continued moving forward while pretending to ignore their presence.","’Just ignore us...’ Yuan prayed inwardly as they drew closer.","Unfortunately, the moment they passed by the mysterious individual, their presence suddenly began moving toward them.","Realizing that a confrontation was practically unavoidable at this point, Yuan came to a complete stop and quietly waited for the other party to approach.","\"Come back to me,\" Yuan said to Zi Xuan and the Demon Annihilation Sword.","Without hesitation, they reverted to their sword form and returned to his side.","Several tense minutes later, the mysterious individual finally arrived before Yuan.","\"You...\" They started speaking first, their voice full of surprise. \"You are still alive?!\"","\"Hm?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows as he focused his gaze on this individual’s face.","His jaw dropped slightly upon recognizing her face.","\"Mu Xuelian?\"","The mysterious individual turned out to be none other than Mu Xuelian—the woman Yuan had met within White Hell who had followed him outside before the two were forced to separate during his clash with Saaruk."]},{"number":2502,"title":"Chapter 2502: Meeting Shiva Again","paragraphs":["\"Mu Xuelian? What are you doing here?\" Yuan muttered after seeing her familiar face.","\"I should be saying that to you! No, how are you—\"","Mu Xuelian was abruptly cut off mid-sentence as the being possessing her body suddenly seized control.","The temperature in the surrounding area instantly plummeted, becoming so cold that frost crystals began forming in the air itself.","\"Shiva,\" Yuan called out to the Eternal currently possessing Mu Xuelian’s body.","Shiva narrowed her gaze at Yuan, her eyes flickering with doubt and confusion.","\"Why are you still alive?\" she eventually asked.","\"That’s the first thing you say after abandoning me during my fight with Saaruk? How cold...\" Yuan remarked while pretending to shiver dramatically.","Shiva gritted her teeth for a bit before shouting angrily, \"I had no choice! What else was I supposed to do?! Help you fight Saaruk with this body that cannot even use Eternal Essence properly?! I may owe you for breaking my seal, but I will not meaninglessly sacrifice my life for you!\"","\"Calm down a little,\" Yuan said while shaking his head. \"It’s not like I’m actually blaming you for leaving me behind. It was the correct decision, and if I were in your position, I probably would’ve done the same thing.\"","Despite Yuan claiming that he did not blame her, the frown on Shiva’s face did not lessen in the slightest.","\"So how did you survive? Did you somehow manage to escape? Or did Saaruk let you go... unlikely as that sounds?\" Shiva asked again, unable to comprehend how Yuan had managed to survive the encounter, as she was certain that he would die at Saaruk’s hands.","’There’s no way a mere mortal like him could escape from an Eternal... But it’s even more impossible for someone like Saaruk to spare his life...’ Shiva thought inwardly while waiting for Yuan’s explanation.","\"Neither,\" Yuan eventually replied, a slow smile creeping onto his face.","\"What would you say if I told you that I defeated him?\"","\"No way!\" Shiva instantly rejected the idea without even a second of hesitation, making it abundantly clear just how little faith she had in him.","However, one could hardly blame Shiva for underestimating Yuan. After all, she had spent her entire life viewing humans as little more than insignificant ants.","Yuan chuckled and said, \"Well, you’re right. I didn’t defeat him, but he didn’t kill me, either.\"","\"Are you saying that he was incapable of killing you, so he backed off?\" Shiva asked.","\"It’d be more accurate to say that he was forced to back off because he used a little too much power trying to kill me.\"","\"The Absolute Power!\" Shiva’s eyes widened as she started understanding the situation more and more.","Yuan proceeded to explain the whole situation in more detail.","\"Unbelievable...\" Shiva muttered as she began looking at Yuan in a new light.","’Not only was he able to survive a fight against Saaruk, but he’d even managed to chase Saaruk away...’","\"So, what are you doing here?\" It was Yuan’s turn to ask. \"From what I could tell, it looked like you were training.\"","\"Because that is exactly what we were doing. Training.\" Shiva looked down at her own palms before continuing, \"After our encounter with Saaruk, I realized just how powerless I was before other Eternals.\"","She then clenched her hand slightly and said, \"There’s a high chance I’ll have to fight them in order to reclaim my body someday, so I’ve been training this body to withstand my Eternal Essence better.\"","\"Does it actually work? Can a mortal body be tempered to withstand Eternal Essence?\" Yuan asked with visible curiosity.","\"An ordinary mortal body? No,\" Shiva replied. \"However, this body was specifically created for that very purpose through countless generations of refinement. Still, the progression is pathetic. Even though we’ve been training for years nonstop, she can barely handle a hundred thousand years’ worth of Eternal Essence. At this rate, it’ll take tens of millions of years before she can wield even a decent amount.\"","\"...\"","Without warning, Yuan suddenly reached out and grabbed Shiva’s arm—or more precisely, Mu Xuelian’s body.","\"What are you doing?\" Shiva asked with a deep frown, clearly displeased by the fact that Yuan had touched her.","Yuan released a sigh and said, \"I just examined her body, and as expected, it’s a complete wreck. Forget tens of millions of years—I’d be surprised if she can even survive another hundred in this condition.\"","\"As long as I continue possessing this body, she won’t die, so there’s no need for you to worry about that,\" Shiva remarked nonchalantly.","The moment Yuan heard those words, a surge of anger rose within him.","\"I finally understand what it is about you Eternals that’s been bothering me this whole time,\" Yuan muttered in a cold voice, his eyes burning with fury.","\"The way you Eternals so naturally treat humans as nothing more than disposable tools to further your own goals... it disgusts me.\"","\"...\"","After a brief moment of silence, Shiva finally spoke, \"Using others to achieve one’s goals is not something exclusive to Eternals.\"","She narrowed her eyes at Yuan calmly and continued, \"Humans do the exact same thing to their own kind as well.\"","Yuan closed his eyes and released a deep sigh.","\"I won’t deny that disgusting humans like that exist as well,\" he said in a low voice. \"But that still doesn’t make it acceptable.\"","\"Then what else am I supposed to do?\" Shiva asked.","\"At this point, she is the only way for me to recover my true body. Or what? Are you going to take her place and help me recover it instead?\"","\"If it means you’ll stop treating her body as though it belongs to you, then I don’t mind helping you recover your true body,\" Yuan said calmly.","\"Even if it only brings you more trouble? There’s a very high chance you’ll offend other Eternals by helping me,\" Shiva warned him.","Yuan casually shrugged and said, \"Believe it or not, offending Eternals has basically become a lifestyle for me at this point.\""]},{"number":2503,"title":"Chapter 2503: What It Means To Be A Prime Eternal","paragraphs":["Shiva silently stared at Yuan with disbelief written all over her face. Never in her life had she imagined meeting a mortal like him—someone who was not only unafraid of Eternals, but who seemingly went out of his way to offend them.","’Even as Eternals, we tend to avoid offending each other, but this crazy bastard...’ she sighed inwardly.","\"Fine,\" Shiva eventually spoke out loud. \"If you’re really going to help me recover my true body, I’ll stop bothering her.\"","Yuan nodded, \"I promise I will recover your body.\"","Without saying another word, Shiva relinquished control of the body back to Mu Xuelian.","\"...\"","After regaining control of her body, Mu Xuelian silently stared at Yuan with a confused expression on her face.","\"Are you wondering why I’m doing this?\" Yuan suddenly asked, as though he could read her mind.","Mu Xuelian quietly nodded in response.","\"I don’t have a special reason,\" he calmly said. \"However, if I have to give a reason, it’d be that I pity you.\"","\"You pity me...?\" Mu Xuelian’s eyes widened slightly, unsure how she should feel about being pitied by someone else, as she had never once considered herself pitiful.","\"I don’t understand,\" she said a moment later. \"Why do you pity me?\"","\"You were born for the sole purpose of becoming a tool for someone else,\" Yuan replied calmly. \"Nor do you have true free will. How is that not pitiful?\"","\"So what if I don’t have free will? I’m perfectly satisfied serving Lady Shiva! That is my purpose in life!\" Mu Xuelian exclaimed.","Yuan shook his head and sighed, \"You’re just brainwashed.\"","Mu Xuelian gritted her teeth and shouted, \"Lady Shiva! There’s no need to listen to him! I’m willing to continue training! Please... allow me to remain useful to you!\"","Yuan then calmly said, \"If you still want to continue training, then go ahead. However, I’m not going to let you die under my watch.\"","He then added, \"After all, I promised your grandmother that I would take care of you.\"","\"You heard him,\" Shiva spoke directly into Mu Xuelian’s mind. \"You may continue training at your own discretion. After all, there’s no guarantee he’ll truly be able to recover my body, so we may ultimately have to rely on ourselves in the end.\"","Some time later, Mu Xuelian asked Yuan, \"Lord Shiva asked what you’re doing in this place.\"","\"I have somewhere I need to be. Want to tag along?\"","\"Of course,\" she immediately responded.","Thus, Yuan resumed his journey toward the fifth level, with Mu Xuelian following him.","\"So, what’s the real reason you’re helping them?\" Zi Xuan’s voice suddenly echoed inside Yuan’s head. \"I highly doubt you’d help an Eternal just because you pity that little girl.\"","A subtle smile appeared on Yuan’s face as he replied, \"It’s true that I pity her, but the real reason I’m helping them—helping Shiva—is because she can help me obtain an Eternal’s blacksmithing techniques.\"","\"Oh?\"","\"Actually, it’s more like she knows someone who can help me. Unfortunately, we do not have the time for that right now.\"","\"Then what about my upgrade? Are we not going to do it right now?\"","\"No, we’ll do it right now, but it’ll be a partial upgrade instead of a full one.\"","\"What a pity... not that I am complaining,\" she said.","As they continued traveling together, Yuan decided to strike up a conversation with Shiva—or more accurately, use the opportunity to extract information from her.","\"Hey, Shiva, what do you know about humans? And I don’t mean the ones Eternals cloned for their selfish experiments.\"","The moment she heard those words, Mu Xuelian’s body trembled slightly before Shiva abruptly took control once again.","\"How do you know about that?!\" she demanded in a shocked voice.","\"How else? I learned about it from another Eternal.\"","\"I don’t believe you!\" Shiva immediately retorted. \"This is a sensitive subject that most Eternals avoid discussing altogether!\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow after hearing that.","\"Sensitive? I’m surprised you Eternals even understand the meaning of that word.\"","Since Eternals could experiment on humans and use them like disposable tools without batting an eye, Yuan was genuinely surprised to learn that there were topics even they considered sensitive.","\"So, what do you know about them?\" Yuan continued to ask.","\"Then tell me what you know first,\" Shiva quickly responded.","\"Well, I know that Eternals once cloned humans for their experiments, but something eventually happened that resulted in those humans being wiped out.\"","\"Seriously... which idiot would reveal something like this to a mortal?\" Shiva sighed aloud in disbelief.","\"That would be Deemo,\" Yuan suddenly revealed.","\"Huh?\" Shiva immediately froze with a bewildered expression on her face.","\"D-Did you just say Deemo? Prime Eternal Deemo?\" Shiva asked in a nervous voice.","Even among Eternals, the strong were revered with awe and respect. However, what truly shocked Shiva was not the fact that Yuan had met a Prime Eternal, but that he somehow had connections to one of the most reclusive Prime Eternals in existence.","\"That’s right. Deemo, the Demon God. The creator of the Demonic Realm,\" Yuan confirmed.","\"W-What is your relationship with Deemo? I cannot imagine someone like him being on friendly terms with a mortal.\"","Yuan shrugged, \"It’s a bit complicated. Although we’re not friends, we’re also not enemies.\"","\"It’s practically a miracle that you even managed to speak with him. Deemo is infamous for being extremely reclusive, always remaining within his own territory and almost never stepping outside of it,\" Shiva remarked. \"Not only that, but for him to share such sensitive information with you... Honestly, I’m a bit envious.\"","\"Envious? You are?\" Yuan muttered with a surprised face.","\"Do you even know what it means to be a Prime Eternal?\" Shiva suddenly asked.","\"Isn’t it just a title for the strongest Eternals?\" he replied.","Shiva shook her head and sighed, \"You need more than just raw strength to acquire the title of ’Prime’.\"","\"Care to elaborate?\"","Shiva then said, \"In order to become a ’Prime Eternal, ’ one must satisfy three requirements.\""]},{"number":2504,"title":"Chapter 2504: Five Prime Eternals","paragraphs":["\"Three requirements, huh?\" Yuan muttered.","\"Let me guess—they need to possess enough power, have sufficient achievements, and have lived for a certain amount of time?\"","\"You’ve got one right,\" Shiva said. \"Indeed, one must possess enough power... at least a hundred trillion years of Eternal Essence.\"","\"A hundred trillion years?\" Yuan’s eyes widened at this number, as this meant that Prime Eternals have lived at least that amount, which was a hundred times more than the amount of Eternal Essence he can currently use.","’Does that mean Deemo is at least a hundred times stronger than me right now?’ Yuan swallowed nervously when he realized just how vast the difference was between them.","’I guess it was true when he said that he could’ve killed me at any time during our fight...’ he sighed inwardly.","He knew that he still had a lot of work to do before he could contest a Prime Eternal, but he could never have imagined how much work it truly was until today.","\"Alright, what about the other two requirements?\"","\"The second requirement is to possess enough territory, which directly correlates to one’s influence and status,\" Shiva revealed.","\"Territory? How exactly does that work?\" Yuan asked with a raised eyebrow.","\"Just as you humans claim land as your territory, we Eternals do the same,\" Shiva explained. \"However, our scale is far greater. Instead of claiming houses or continents, we claim the universe itself—the void.\"","\"I can figure that much out on my own, but how does it actually work?\" Yuan asked. \"How do you determine who owns which part of the void?\"","He then looked around him in the endless starry sky and continued, \"The universe is practically boundless, so I can’t even begin to imagine how something like that is measured or verified.\"","\"We Eternals are capable of ’marking’ our territory using Eternal Essence,\" she replied. \"Although Eternal Essence itself cannot normally be distinguished the same way one identifies an aura or presence, there are methods that allow us to make it recognizable.\"","\"Moreover, Eternals are able to sense everything that happens in their territory, even if they are light-years away, and unless invited, they all tend to stay away from each other’s territories.\"","\"And since we need Eternal Essence to mark our territory, this also means that we need sufficient prowess.\"","\"How much territory do you have?\" Yuan asked out of curiosity.","\"...I do not have any right now, and I think you know why,\" she sighed.","\"I see. What about the final requirement?\"","\"Sorry, but I can’t tell you.\" Shiva shook her head.","\"Huh? Why not?\"","\"Because, quite frankly, I don’t want someone like you learning about it.\"","\"Someone like me? What’s that supposed to mean?\" Yuan asked.","\"Exactly what it sounds like,\" Shiva replied. \"I can’t believe I’m actually saying this, but you are a danger to us Eternals.\"","She then narrowed her eyes slightly and continued, \"And if you were to learn about that... I don’t even want to imagine the consequences.\"","\"If you say something like that, it’ll only make me want to learn about it more,\" Yuan said with a cold smile.","’This information might reveal a weakness of the Eternals... I have to learn it somehow!’ Yuan thought inwardly.","Up until now, he had always viewed Eternals as godlike existences without flaws or weaknesses, but it seemed that might not entirely be the case.","However, since Shiva clearly had no intention of telling him, Yuan decided not to press the matter any further for now.","\"How many Prime Eternals are there right now?\" Yuan asked, changing the topic.","\"There are five, as far as I am aware.\"","\"I know about Deemo and someone named Morveth. Who are the other three?\"","\"Why do you want to know? So you can offend them later?\" Shiva sneered.","\"Of course not. Prime Eternals are far beyond my league right now, so I’d rather avoid offending them if possible,\" Yuan replied.","Shiva narrowed her eyes at him for a moment before finally answering, \"Hilla, Alisher, and Kakos.\"","A serious look then appeared on her face as she added, \"If you seriously value your life, do not offend Kakos. Even we Eternals avoid that individual like the plague.\"","\"Is this Kakos the strongest Prime Eternal?\" Yuan asked, looking intrigued.","\"It’s not his strength that makes him terrifying, but his nature,\" Shiva replied with a grim expression.","\"As a matter of fact, Kakos is the only Eternal known to have truly killed another Eternal before.\" She paused for a moment before adding, \"Or rather... he’s the only one genuinely capable of killing us.\"","\"Oh?\" Yuan became even more intrigued upon hearing this.","But before he could ask more, Shiva said, \"Forget about it. I don’t want to speak about Kakos anymore.\"","At the same time, Zi Xuan spoke, \"We’ll arrive at our destination soon.\"","Zi Xuan then entered her spirit form and began leading the way.","\"Who is that?\" Mu Xuelian asked with raised eyebrows after witnessing Yuan’s sword transform into a beautiful woman.","\"My sword,\" Yuan calmly explained.","\"...\"","Mu Xuelian did not question further for some reason.","A few hours later, they finally arrived at the Apocalyptic Chasm, a region engulfed in scorching heat and overflowing with lava.","However, unlike ordinary lava, the lava there possessed a light blue hue, making the entire place resemble a vast ocean rather than a massive sea of molten rock.","Having spent most of her life within the freezing environment of White Hell, Mu Xuelian found the atmosphere there unbearably uncomfortable, as it was the complete opposite of everything she was accustomed to.","\"What are we doing here?\" Mu Xuelian asked while using her tribe’s martial techniques to cool her overheated body.","\"My home is somewhere around here,\" he calmly explained.","\"You... live here?\" Mu Xuelian wore a dumbfounded look on her face.","\"My personal world,\" he elaborated.","\"You created your personal world in the middle of the Primordial Chaos? Are you insane?\"","Yuan merely shrugged and replied, \"Insane or not, it’s the perfect place for a hideout since almost nobody would dare come here.\""]},{"number":2505,"title":"Chapter 2505: Tian Qiyuan’s World","paragraphs":["Shortly after arriving at the Apocalyptic Chasm, Zi Xuan suddenly came to a stop above a massive lake of azure-colored lava.","\"We’re here,\" Zi Xuan said with a smile on her face.","An immense surge of excitement stirred within her soul, as it had been countless years since she had last returned to this place.","Yuan followed her gaze toward the surface below, and in the next moment, memories suddenly began surfacing within his mind—memories belonging to Tian Qiyuan.","\"I remember now,\" he muttered with a dazed look on his face.","\"A little too late if you ask me,\" Zi Xuan shook her head.","\"Anyway, I’ll go remove the seal.\"","Without offering any explanation, Zi Xuan suddenly reverted to her sword form before diving straight into the lava below, its temperature nearly comparable to True Primordial Fire.","Several minutes later, the surface of the lava lake suddenly began to tremble, and the molten lava started swirling as though a massive vortex had formed beneath it.","Moments later, the lake split open, revealing a massive hole that seemed to lead to another world.","\"I am already on the other side,\" Zi Xuan’s voice resounded in Yuan’s head.","Yuan turned to look at Mu Xuelian and said, \"Follow closely.\"","Then, the two of them flew directly into the portal, vanishing from the Primordial Chaos.","Upon stepping through the portal, Yuan and Mu Xuelian were instantly teleported to a floating island suspended within a boundless sky, almost as if they’d returned to the Nine Heavens.","\"Welcome back home, my dear.\" Zi Xuan appeared before Yuan in her spirit form and greeted him with a beautiful smile on her face.","Yuan returned the smile and said, \"I’m home.\"","Mu Xuelian surveyed her surroundings with awe written all over her face.","Although she was neither a blacksmith nor particularly knowledgeable about materials, even she could tell that everything in this place was priceless.","From the golden trees surrounding the shimmering golden lake to the multi-colored crystal mountains standing majestically, the entire scene felt almost surreal. Hell, when examined closely, even the clouds themselves were treasures.","Amidst all of those priceless treasures stood a simple wooden house.","Compared to the extravagant surroundings, the humble structure looked completely out of place, almost absurdly ordinary within a world overflowing with immeasurable wealth.","\"You can look around if you’d like,\" Yuan suddenly said to Mu Xuelian. \"There’s something I need to do, so I will be gone for a bit.\"","\"Alright,\" she nodded.","While Mu Xuelian wandered around the world, curiously examining the various materials scattered throughout the area, Yuan flew away from the island and disappeared into the distant horizon.","A few minutes later, he came to a stop after arriving before a certain hovering object.","A smile slowly appeared on his face as he gazed at the massive floating gates connected to a flight of stairs that seemed to be made for giants.","It was the Stairway to Heaven.","He placed his hand on the door and whispered to it, \"You could’ve hidden anywhere in this world, but you decided to return home...\"","Suddenly, the doors creaked open.","Without a word, Yuan entered the Stairway to Heaven.","\"Master...\"","A familiar voice echoed in the darkness, and before long, Tian’er appeared before Yuan like a ghost.","\"Are you okay?\" Yuan asked.","\"Yes,\" she calmly nodded. \"That level of attack can’t harm me.\"","\"Then do you know who attacked you?\"","She shook her head.","After a brief pause, Tian’er continued, \"Those people were using an energy that felt similar to Eternal Essence.\"","\"You mentioned that before. Can you elaborate?\" he asked, prompting her to elaborate further.","\"It’s hard to describe. It feels like Eternal Essence, but not at the same time.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before muttering, \"It sounds like fake Eternal Essence, but I can’t be certain unless I see it for myself.\"","\"In that case...\" Tian’er suddenly made a grasping motion with her hand, summoning a wisp of mysterious energy before him.","\"This is...\" Yuan’s eyes widened.","\"I collected it when I was attacked,\" she said.","Yuan examined the Eternal Essence with a slight frown on his face.","\"As I thought, it’s similar to the energy Supreme Ruler Grant was using, though there are some noticeable differences,\" Yuan remarked.","Compared to Supreme Ruler Grant’s Eternal Essence, this energy felt less refined—but not in the same manner as Supreme Ruler Dena’s imitation Eternal Essence.","Supreme Ruler Grant’s energy had felt complete and refined, whereas Supreme Ruler Dena’s was incomplete and simplistic.","This energy, however, existed somewhere in between. It was complete, yet lacking refinement.","’If Supreme Ruler Grant acquired his ability from Deemo, it’s very likely that these attackers were granted similar powers by another Eternal.’ Yuan thought, quickly putting the pieces together.","’But why would an Eternal attack the Stairway to Heaven?’","He could not comprehend why an Eternal would take interest in the Stairway to Heaven, a treasure that primarily served as a convenience for the inhabitants of the Nine Heavens.","Although it also functioned as a storage treasure, nobody besides Yuan should know about that secret.","’Even if this Eternal somehow discovered it, there’s no way they would be interested in a mortal treasure...’","The more he thought about it, the more incomprehensible the Eternal’s actions became.","However, Yuan wasn’t concerned about the Eternal’s motives.","’If I put the Stairway to Heaven into commission again, it would only be attacked again...’","After some thought, he reached a conclusion.","\"Sorry, but it looks like you’ll have to hide a little longer—at least until I figure out why you’re being attacked and deal with it,\" he said to Tian’er a moment later.","\"Then what about the Nine Heavens? Without me, the people there won’t be able to travel between the realms,\" Tian’er said with a perplexed expression.","After serving in such a role for countless years, she had long since come to view assisting the people of the Nine Heavens as her responsibility.","\"I’ll just make another treasure with the same function,\" Yuan calmly said, leaving Tian’er speechless."]},{"number":2506,"title":"Chapter 2506: Crafting A New Stairway to Heaven","paragraphs":["\"You’ll... make another treasure... to replace me...?\" Tian’er muttered in a dazed voice after hearing Yuan’s words.","\"You... are going to replace me...?\"","Tian’er’s eyes trembled slightly, looking as though she were on the verge of tears.","Seeing her reaction, Yuan quickly waved his hands and said, \"I’m not replacing you! It’s only temporary!\"","He then continued in a reassuring voice, \"Once I deal with whoever attacked you, you can return to the Nine Heavens.\"","\"You promise?\"","\"Of course,\" Yuan said, feeling surprised, as this was the first time he’d seen such a reaction from her.","\"Okay.\" Tian’er nodded her head, quickly calming down.","’To think she’s capable of crying now... she’s really grown,’ Yuan smiled inwardly.","In the past, Tian’er had never been the expressive type. Despite her youthful appearance, she always carried herself with a calm and mature demeanor, remaining composed no matter the situation.","In fact, this was the reason why Tian Qiyuan allowed her to manage the Stairway to Heaven by herself—to bear such massive responsibilities.","After talking with Tian’er for a little longer, as well as reassuring her that he’d never replace her, Yuan left the Stairway to Heaven and returned to the island.","\"How was it?\" Zi Xuan asked Yuan after his return.","\"Everything is fine... for now,\" he replied. \"Unfortunately, she won’t be able to return to the Nine Heavens for a little longer.\"","Yuan proceeded to explain the entire situation to her.","\"An Eternal targeting the Stairway to Heaven? That’s definitely a first...\" Zi Xuan muttered with a thoughtful expression.","However, just like Yuan, she could not come up with any reasonable explanation for such strange behavior.","\"So, what are you planning to do now?\" Zi Xuan then asked.","\"I’m going to craft a new Stairway to Heaven,\" Yuan replied. \"This is the only place that has enough materials and a proper blacksmithing environment, so since I’m already here, I might as well make it now.\"","\"A new Stairway to Heaven?\" Zi Xuan’s eyes widened with surprise. \"What about Tian’er? And if I recall correctly, it took you several thousand years to craft her.\"","\"I’m only going to use it temporarily. Once I resolve the issue with the Eternal, Tian’er will be able to return to the Nine Heavens,\" Yuan explained again.","\"Besides, this time I’m only crafting it with the traveling function, so it won’t take nearly as long.\"","Compared to Tian’er, this new Stairway to Heaven would be extremely bare-bones. It would not possess storage capabilities or the numerous world-class defensive mechanisms integrated into Tian’er, which was precisely why it would require far less time to craft.","\"Anyway, since it’s been a while, I’ll craft the new Stairway to Heaven first as a warm-up,\" Yuan said as he approached the nearby wooden house.","The interior of the building was just as humble and simple as its exterior. Aside from a single bed spacious enough to comfortably fit two people, the only other furnishings were basic necessities such as a table and a few chairs.","Yuan walked to the closet beside the bed and retrieved a set of blacksmithing attire, then changed out of his current clothes and into it. Unsurprisingly, it fitted him perfectly.","The moment Zi Xuan saw Yuan wearing Tian Qiyuan’s blacksmithing attire, a chill ran down her spine, causing her body to tremble uncontrollably with excitement.","\"What are you doing now?\" Mu Xuelian suddenly returned and asked him.","\"Crafting treasures.\"","\"Oh? What kind?\"","\"The Stairway to Heaven... something like that.\"","Mu Xuelian raised her eyebrows and asked, \"Could it be... are you trying to replace the one that disappeared?\"","\"That’s right.\"","\"Why bother? It’s none of your business. Seems like a waste of time and effort. Or are you really that generous?\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"Actually, it is my business, since I was the one who created the original one.\"","\"What?\" Mu Xuelian’s eyes widened in disbelief after hearing his words.","However, Yuan did not bother elaborating further and simply turned around and walked away.","Some time later, he arrived at a cave located at the foot of the multicolored crystal mountain before calmly stepping inside.","Although the cave appeared pitch-black from the outside, the moment Yuan stepped inside, the walls began emitting a faint glow that steadily grew brighter until the entire interior was fully illuminated.","The light revealed a long tunnel that stretched deeper into the mountain, leading toward a spacious chamber further within.","At the center of the chamber stood a massive anvil that appeared brand new, with not even a single scratch.","Meanwhile, hanging on a nearby wall was a black hammer radiating an overwhelming aura. Its presence was so immense that the gravity surrounding it had become several times heavier simply because it existed there.","Hanging beside the hammer was another object—a golden wheel that naturally emitted an overwhelming amount of heat.","The temperature surrounding it was so intense that anyone without strong fire immunity would likely combust simply by standing too close to it.","After taking a moment to reminisce about this place and the countless treasures he had forged in the past, Yuan walked toward the wall and grabbed the black hammer.","\"Oh!\" Yuan let out a startled sound when his entire arm suddenly dropped unnaturally, as though he had just picked up something far heavier than he anticipated.","However, he’d managed to adjust his strength right before the hammer touched the floor.","\"I forgot how heavy you were...\" Yuan muttered with a smile as he lifted it back up.","Meanwhile, Zi Xuan and Mu Xuelian had followed Yuan into the mountain, but the two of them stopped at the entrance of the chamber instead of entering it.","\"You do not want to be inside once he starts working,\" Zi Xuan said as she suddenly raised her arm to stop Mu Xuelian, who had nearly stepped into the chamber.","\"Especially not someone like you, who already struggles with heat,\" she added.","Some time later, Yuan spoke, \"I’m going to do some mental training first.\"","He then took a seat on the ground and closed his eyes."]},{"number":2507,"title":"Chapter 2507: Upgrading Number One Under Heaven","paragraphs":["After closing his eyes, Yuan immediately began his mental simulations, and for the next several hours, he’d craft the treasure again and again until he felt prepared.","He opened his eyes and stood up before approaching the anvil. He then reached underneath the anvil, retrieving an emerald-colored spatial ring.","Inside the spatial ring were countless priceless materials that Tian Qiyuan had collected over the years as the God of Creation.","Being one of the most experienced and skilled God of Creation in history, he’d easily racked up unfathomable wealth. However, he’d spent pretty much all of that wealth to purchase more materials and to create this world.","After confirming that he had plenty of materials to work with, even if he failed a few times, Yuan declared, \"I am going to start now.\"","\"How is he supposed to forge treasures without any fire?\" Mu Xuelian asked with a puzzled expression.","Although she was not a blacksmith herself, she still understood the basics. Yet from the appearance of the chamber, there was neither a furnace nor even the slightest trace of flames.","\"In the past, he had a helper produce the flames. Unfortunately, she’s not available right now. That being said, he has his own ways...\" Zi Xuan replied.","The next moment, Yuan gestured toward the golden wheel hanging on the wall, causing it to fly into the air and hover directly above the anvil.","Yuan then infused the golden wheel with his spiritual energy, causing it to slowly begin spinning.","At first, its rotation was sluggish, but it rapidly accelerated until it became nothing more than a golden blur.","At that moment, Yuan retrieved a material from his spatial ring and placed it atop the anvil.","He then raised the black hammer high into the air, and just before he brought it down, the spinning golden wheel suddenly erupted with flames.","Like a blazing waterfall, the fire poured down from above, engulfing the anvil and Yuan’s entire figure.","\"What the—?!\" Mu Xuelian cried out loud after seeing this, startled by the unexpected turn of events.","Then, Yuan swung the hammer down and struck the material resting on the anvil.","A crisp ’ting’ echoed throughout the chamber, while the surrounding flames exploded outward from the impact, scattering across the room like a fiery storm.","\"Heavens!\" Mu Xuelian shouted loudly as she instinctively jumped backward upon seeing the flames surge toward them. In contrast, Zi Xuan remained perfectly still.","Just as the raging fire reached the entrance of the chamber, it abruptly stopped, blocked by an invisible barrier.","\"I stopped you from going inside for a reason,\" Zi Xuan remarked without looking away from the scene.","Clang! Ting! Clang!","Yuan moved with a rhythmic flow, each strike of his hammer producing sounds that blended together like a mesmerizing piece of music.","After refining the first material, Yuan retrieved another from his spatial ring and fused it together with the refined piece.","All the while, he remained constantly engulfed in the blazing flames pouring down from above. Fortunately, due to his Fire Harmony, the flames could not harm him in the slightest.","In the past, Tian Qiyuan had acquired his Fire Immunity purely through blacksmithing, having spent countless years working amidst unbearable heat day and night.","Two days later, the golden wheel suddenly started spinning in the opposite direction, and instead of producing flames, it collected them instead.","Soon, it cleared all the fire in the room, allowing Mu Xuelian and Zi Xuan to see inside the chamber clearly.","<Congratulations! You have crafted a Celestial-grade treasure!>","Meanwhile, Yuan picked up the fist-sized object on the anvil and inspected it.","<Give a name to your newly crafted treasure?>","\"Let’s just call it Nameless Stairway,\" he muttered with a satisfied smile on his face, and he tossed it into his spatial ring.","\"Are we done now?\" Mu Xuelian asked him.","Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, we’re just getting started.\"","\"What do you mean?\" she raised her eyebrows in a puzzled manner.","\"I still need to be upgraded,\" Zi Xuan said as she entered the chamber.","However, Yuan quickly said, \"Not yet. I am going to craft several more treasures before I work on you.\"","\"Huh?\" Zi Xuan halted in her steps, looking dumbfounded.","\"What else do you need to make?\" she then asked.","\"Some treasures for a few friends,\" he replied with a smile.","Since he was in the perfect situation and had plenty of materials, he might as well craft some treasures for Meixiu and the other members of the Demon Sealing Faction.","\"Oh... Okay...\"","Without wasting another moment, Yuan immediately returned to crafting more treasures.","A few days later, a small mountain of Celestial-grade treasures appeared beside Yuan.","\"Alright, this should be enough,\" he muttered as he casually tossed them into his spatial ring.","\"Is it finally time for my upgrade?\" Zi Xuan asked.","Yuan looked at her and nodded with a smile.","\"Finally!\"","Zi Xuan immediately flew into the chamber and sat on top of the anvil.","\"Do I need to leave the sword while you work on it? Or can I remain inside while you upgrade it?\"","\"Of course you’ll need to leave,\" Yuan replied with a sigh. \"There’s a chance it might damage your soul if you remained, and I am not going to risk that.\"","\"Fine...\" Zi Xuan replied with a reluctant look on her face.","A moment later, she reverted to her sword form before emerging from it.","\"This is my first time leaving the sword after becoming its spirit,\" she said in a saddened voice before leaving the chamber.","Yuan retrieved the material he planned on using to upgrade Number One Under Heaven and examined it.","\"Infinite Obisidian... I will need to study this material a little before I use it,\" he mumbled to himself.","The material Yuan intended to use to upgrade Number One Under Heaven was none other than Infinite Obsidian, a mysterious material he had obtained from the Refined Obsidian Dragon during his visit to the Primal Expanse."]},{"number":2508,"title":"Chapter 2508: Upgrading Number One Under Heaven(2)","paragraphs":["Yuan moved Number One Under Heaven to the side before placing the Infinite Obsidian onto the anvil.","He then lightly tapped it with his hammer to gauge its toughness, only to be surprised by the result.","He proceeded to stare at the Infinite Obsidian in silence for a moment before suddenly raising the hammer high into the air and bringing it down with his full strength.","CLANG!","The entire chamber trembled violently from the overwhelming pressure generated by the impact.","\"Wow...\" Yuan muttered in a surprised voice after seeing the results.","Despite using his full strength, the Infinite Obisdian remained unscathed.","\"Is this thing indestructible or something?\" he wondered aloud, as he’d never seen a material this durable before.","Suddenly, Mu Xuelian approached the chamber and said, \"Lord Shiva has something to say.\"","\"Hm?\"","By the time Yuan turned to look at her, Shiva had already taken control of Mu Xuelian’s body and was slowly approaching him.","However, her attention was not on Yuan at all, but on the piece of Infinite Obsidian resting atop the anvil.","\"Do you recognize it?\" he asked her.","She nodded and said, \"We call it Void Fragment, and it’s commonly used for crafting treasures by Eternals who are into that.\"","\"Where does it come from?\" Yuan then asked.","\"From inside black holes,\" she calmly replied.","\"What?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, doubting whether he had heard her correctly.","\"As black holes continuously consume matter over time, everything inside them becomes compressed beyond logic,\" Shiva explained in a calm voice. \"We simply harvest the remnants whenever we need them, since materials like these are actually quite abundant there.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan asked, \"Then how do they refine something like this?\"","\"How would I know?\" Shiva shrugged. \"Very few Eternals are actually interested in crafting treasures.\"","She then continued, \"However, since we’re talking about Eternals, they most likely use Eternal Essence. After all, Eternal Essence is capable of cutting through even the supposedly indestructible.\"","\"Oh? Using Eternal Essence to forge treasures? Why didn’t I think of that sooner?\"","A flicker of excitement appeared within Yuan’s eyes the moment he realized the possibility.","Yuan immediately infused some Eternal Essence into his hammer before striking the Void Fragment once again, though this time he deliberately held back his strength.","Ding!","Even though he had only used a few billion years’ worth of Eternal Essence, Yuan finally managed to make progress on the material, slightly flattening the previously unmoving Void Fragment.","\"It... actually worked?\" Yuan muttered in a somewhat dazed voice.","He could’ve never imagined the solution would be so simple.","\"In my eyes, you’re doing too much,\" Shiva suddenly said.","\"What do you mean?\"","Without saying a word, Shiva suddenly reached toward the Void Fragment with her bare hands.","The moment she grabbed it, she wrapped her hand in Eternal Essence and began stretching and molding the material as though it were nothing more than ordinary clay.","Seeing this absurd scene unfold before him, Yuan was left utterly speechless.","\"I have seen an Eternal crafting treasure once, and this is what they did,\" she said as she placed the material back on the anvil, now shaped like a rod.","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent.","A few moments later, he turned to look at Number One Under Heaven, and then Zi Xuan.","\"What’s the matter?\" Zi Xuan asked.","Yuan released a deep sigh and said, \"Because of the refinement method required for this material, I won’t be able to upgrade Number One Under Heaven using my usual methods. There’s a high chance I’ll have to completely melt it down and recreate it from scratch.\"","\"What?!\" Zi Xuan exclaimed in shock. \"At that point, it’s not even an upgrade anymore—it’s a complete reconstruction!\"","\"That’s right. Which is why I want to know how you feel about it,\" Yuan said.","After all, Number One Under Heaven was not solely his treasure, but something the two of them shared together. If he was going to make such a drastic decision, he needed Zi Xuan’s approval first.","Zi Xuan fell silent, a contemplative expression appearing on her beautiful face.","Eventually, she parted her lips and softly spoke, \"Although this is incredibly sudden, it’s not all that different from how people in life are sometimes forced to leave behind their old homes and move into new ones.\"","\"Some end up with better lives afterward, but most end up worse off.\"","She then looked at Yuan with a faint smile and continued, \"But since it’s you, I don’t have to worry about it turning out worse.\"","\"I’ll do my best not to disappoint your expectations,\" Yuan said with a serious expression on his face.","After a brief pause, he continued, \"However, since this is my first time working with a material like this—not to mention using a completely new forging method—I’ll need to experiment with it first through a few practice attempts.\"","Once Shiva left the chamber, Yuan immediately began forging several more treasures. However, rather than completing them entirely, he intentionally left them in a half-finished state, with the materials already fully refined and only the final shaping remaining.","He would then tear off a small piece from the Void Fragment and fuse it with the unfinished treasures.","Since the Void Fragment he possessed was fairly large, Yuan was not overly concerned about wasting a few small portions for his experiments, especially since it would lower the chances of him breaking Number One Under Heaven.","Over the next several days, Yuan would experiment with the Void Fragment using several techniques.","The first treasure Yuan forged using the Void Fragment turned out far more durable and powerful than he had anticipated, but he did not stop there and continued experimenting.","Over the following several days, he forged multiple treasures that clearly surpassed any Celestial-grade treasure he had ever created in the past.","Yet despite their astonishing quality, Yuan remained unsatisfied. It felt as though something crucial was still missing from his creations.","\"What am I missing?\" he mumbled as he stared at the scattered treasures before him."]},{"number":2509,"title":"Chapter 2509: Affinity","paragraphs":["\"Do you want to know what you’re missing?\" Shiva suddenly spoke.","\"Hm?\" Yuan turned to look at her with raised eyebrows. \"I thought you didn’t know much—if anything—about blacksmithing.\"","\"I don’t recall ever saying I know nothing about it,\" Shiva calmly replied. \"While it’s true that I’ve never personally forged a treasure before, I still understand the fundamentals, especially since I know someone who enjoys doing it and never stops yapping about it.\"","\"What am I missing?\" Yuan then asked. \"Besides the obvious—a technique.\"","Shiva entered the chamber and said, \"You may know how to use Eternal Essence, but your understanding is limited to the very basics. In fact, when it comes to utilizing Eternal Essence, you’re no different from a newborn Eternal.\"","\"Eternal Essence is the purest form of all existence. It is the true origin of everything. Whether it originates from water, fire, or anything else, once it becomes Eternal Essence, it all returns to the same source.\"","\"I don’t understand,\" Yuan said as he shook his head.","Without saying another word, Shiva raised both of her arms and revealed her open palms to him.","In the next moment, Eternal Essence gathered around both of her hands.","\"What is the difference between the two?\" she then asked.","Yuan examined the Eternal Essence on her palms for a moment before responding, \"Nothing...? Or is this some sort of trick question?\"","Without offering any explanation, Shiva suddenly clapped her hands, combining the Eternal Essence.","\"Any difference?\" she asked again.","\"Nope.\"","Shiva separated her hands and closed her left hand.","A second later, she reopened it, and the Eternal Essence surrounding that hand had completely changed.","It now emitted an icy, chilling aura that instantly covered parts of the chamber in frost, despite the room having been unbearably hot just moments earlier.","She clapped her hands again, fusing the cold Eternal Essence with the ordinary one, creating a block of ice from thin air.","\"If you combine fire with an even stronger fire, it will still remain fire,\" Shiva said.","\"Unlike forging mortal treasures, when it comes to crafting Eternal-quality treasures, the materials themselves are not the most important aspect.\"","She then looked directly at Yuan and continued, \"Your Eternal Essence is.\"","A flicker of realization suddenly flashed across Yuan’s face, as though he had just experienced a moment of enlightenment.","However, even though he knew the problem, there was still one major issue.","\"I understand what I’ve been missing now... but how did you do what you just did?\" Yuan asked a moment later.","He summoned some Eternal Essence of his own and attempted to imitate Shiva’s cold Eternal Essence, but no matter what he tried, he failed to replicate it.","\"This isn’t something you can simply replicate,\" Shiva said while shaking her head.","\"Every being—including Eternals—has their own specialty. It’s similar to how humans are all born with different talents. Some possess a natural affinity with yin, while others are more suited for yang. In the same way, you need to discover what your Eternal Essence is best suited for and materialize it.\"","\"How do I know what affinity I have?\" Yuan asked with raised eyebrows.","\"Through experience and experimentation,\" Shiva replied calmly. \"This isn’t something you can uncover in just a day or two.\"","She then continued, \"Typically, it takes an Eternal several hundred billion years before they discover their true affinity.\"","\"That still doesn’t explain anything...\" Yuan sighed. \"I don’t even know where I’m supposed to begin.\"","Shiva then said, \"Quite frankly, I don’t even know whether a mortal like you is capable of wielding Eternal Essence the same way we Eternals do.\"","She paused for a moment before continuing, \"For us, it simply becomes a natural part of our existence after enough time passes.\"","\"So what? Does it just come to you naturally? Like how we learn to breath naturally?\"","\"Pretty much.\"","Yuan rubbed his eyes and sighed, wondering if he needed to delay upgrading Number One Under Heaven until he figured this thing out.","\"Also, I know humans typically only have a few, like water, fire, earth, and wind. However, when it comes to Eternal Essence, there are many more types of affinity, like blood or shadow. Mine just happens to be something as simple as ice.\"","\"Is it really impossible to create an Eternal-grade treasure without this affinity nonsense?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Well, if you have a material that has already been properly refined, it’s possible. For example, I can refine that Void Fragment for you with my Eternal Essence.\"","Yuan immediately shook his head and said, \"If I were upgrading another treasure, I wouldn’t mind doing it that way. However, Number One Under Heaven is special, and my pride will not allow it.\"","\"I guess you’re out of luck then,\" Shiva shrugged.","\"...\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before speaking, \"Fortunately, there’s still some time before the banquet. I’ll try to find my affinity before then. If not, I’ll just postpone this until later.\"","\"What banquet?\" Shiva asked. \"And when is it?\"","\"Just a little something I had planned before coming here. I still have a little over a month. If I cannot find my affinity in three—two weeks, I’ll give up trying to upgrade my treasure for now.\"","\"Two weeks?\" Shiva sneered coldly. \"If you can truly discover your affinity in such a short amount of time, I’ll start calling you Father.\"","\"You’ll call me Father...?\" A competitive smile immediately appeared on Yuan’s face after hearing those words.","There was no way he would pass up an opportunity to make an Eternal address him in such a manner.","Without wasting any more time, he sat down and started fiddling with his Eternal Essence, trying all sorts of things to discover his affinity.","Meanwhile, after working nonstop, the Demon Sealing Clan had finally finished constructing the venue for the upcoming banquet—a massive platform supporting a grand courtyard with a direct line of sight toward the Demonic Realm nearby.","And even though there was still more than a month remaining before the banquet was set to begin, guests had already started arriving with gifts in hand."]},{"number":2510,"title":"Chapter 2510: Venue for the Divine Paragon’s Banquet","paragraphs":["\"Welcome to the Demon Sealing Clan! If you have gifts for the Divine Paragon, please hand them over to the attendants stationed at the red-clothed table over there!\"","\"And if you did not bring anything, please proceed to the blue-clothed table to check in! The venue has not officially opened yet, but it will be ready soon!\"","The Demon Sealers enthusiastically greeted the arriving guests.","\"Where is the Divine Paragon? I’d like to pay my respect to him before the banquet begins,\" inquired one of the guests.","\"I apologize, but the Divine Paragon is not present at this moment.\"","\"What about the new leader of the Demon Sealing Clan?\"","\"The Clan Leader is currently not accepting any guests due to her tight schedule.\"","Meanwhile, the Demon Sealers working inside the courtyard would glance at the new guests from time to time out of curiosity.","\"Wow! That’s the current head of the Array Masters’ Association, Ye Chen!\"","\"Isn’t that the Divine Essence Monastery’s Holy Empress? Even if it’s the Divine Paragon, to think she’d travel from the Ninth Heaven just to see a man!\"","\"Who’s that veiled woman beside her?\"","\"Isn’t that the Holy Maiden, the number two genius of the younger generation? I heard she’s the kind of genius that only appears once in a billion years.\"","\"Surely, that must be an exaggeration. From what I’ve heard, nobody even knows what she’s capable of and is questioning her position in the ranking.\"","\"Didn’t the Heavenly Son fight her and acknowledge her strength?\"","The Demon Sealers continued chatting about the Holy Maiden for several minutes before another recognizable figure arrived at the venue.","Meanwhile, the guests passed the time by observing the newly arriving attendees as they waited for the venue to officially open.","Unsurprisingly, the vast majority of the guests who arrived were influential and widely renowned figures.","Of course, there were also attendees with little to no reputation whatsoever. Under normal circumstances, such people would have been ridiculed or outright chased away from a gathering of elites. However, since the Divine Paragon had personally declared that anyone was allowed to attend, the other guests could do nothing but tolerate their presence.","\"Do you think the Celestial Emperor will show up?\"","\"Who knows? But if he wants to, it won’t take any effort, since he can still travel between the realms even without the Stairway to Heaven.\"","\"He clearly already possesses the technology to create treasures capable of teleportation between realms. I don’t understand what’s taking him so long to replace the Stairway to Heaven.\"","\"I bet he doesn’t even want to replace the Stairway to Heaven. There’s a reason he restricted access to the Stairway to Heaven not too long ago.\"","A week passed in the blink of an eye, and before long, the venue for the banquet officially opened, with the Demon Sealing Clan finally allowing guests into the grand courtyard.","However, due to the overwhelming number of attendees, those with the greatest influence and status were given priority entry first.","\"There’s still a month until the banquet, but there’s already tens of thousands of people here... I can only imagine how much more crowded it’ll get later.\"","\"Do they even have room for all of us?\"","\"I doubt it... Hell, most of us will probably have to watch from outside the venue altogether.\"","Soon, another week passed, and as the banquet drew nearer, even more people began arriving from all directions.","Despite the venue being located within the Starry Sky, nearly everyone who was capable tried their best to attend the banquet.","Before long, the number of guests exceeded the venue’s capacity, forcing many attendees to remain outside the venue entirely.","However, since such a situation had long been expected, hardly anyone voiced any complaints about it.","As for the guests within the courtyard, they were all served food and drinks while they waited.","\"I’ve never seen such an enormous gathering of influential figures before. I doubt even the Celestial Emperor could gather this many people at once for nothing more than a banquet,\" one of the Demon Sealers remarked with a dazed expression.","\"The Divine Paragon is a legend amongst legends, after all. They’re all so intrigued by his existence that they’d come to a place like this just to see him.\"","Suddenly, the atmosphere around the venue shifted, and a loud voice echoed throughout the area.","\"Make way for the Celestial Family!\"","A path was swiftly opened through the massive crowd gathered around the venue, allowing an extravagant carriage to pass through.","\"The Celestial Family? I suppose the Celestial Emperor won’t be attending personally and has sent his family in his stead...\"","\"I bet one of his daughters is inside that carriage...\"","\"Hah... I guess even someone as powerful as the Celestial Emperor isn’t above resorting to such tactics...\"","Such whispers could be heard from the crowd.","Once the carriage arrived at the venue, its door slowly opened, and two figures stepped out.","\"Heavens! It’s Madam Jun and the First Princess! To think he’d send his most precious daughter! The Celestial Emperor must truly value the Divine Paragon to send her to him!\"","The people there were shocked to see the First Princess, who was not only the eldest but also the most influential within the Celestial Family, appear at the banquet.","Shortly after their arrival, a figure flew out from within the courtyard and approached them.","\"Welcome, Madam Jun and Lady Jun. I am Yan Hara, the current leader of the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","Madam Jun then spoke, \"While we would like to participate in the banquet, our time is unfortunately limited. We were wondering if it would be possible for us to meet the Divine Paragon directly.\"","An apologetic expression appeared on Yan Hara’s face as she responded, \"I’m terribly sorry, but the Divine Paragon is not present yet.\"","\"Do you know when he’ll arrive?\"","\"Unfortunately not...\" Yan Hara shook her head.","\"What a pity...\" Madam Jun muttered softly before turning to look at the veiled figure silently standing beside her, seemingly waiting for the First Princess to speak."]},{"number":2511,"title":"Chapter 2511: Eternals’ Cultivation Method","paragraphs":["After a moment of silence, the First Princess spoke in a soft voice, \"It’s fine, I can wait.\"","Madam Jun raised an eyebrow and spoke to her using voice transmission, \"You know our schedule is full, and we’re already running late, right? In the first place, I agreed to come here only because you said you’d leave immediately after meeting the Divine Paragon.\"","\"Yes, I will leave after meeting the Divine Paragon, but until then... the others can wait.\"","Madam Jun pinched her nose bridge and released a weary sigh.","\"This is a crucial period for securing your position within the family. Even if you currently hold the advantage, it is only by a slight margin. If you continue to dawdle like this, your siblings will eventually surpass you.\"","After a slight pause, she continued, \"Even if the Divine Paragon is a legend, we are long past his era. Once all of the excitement dies down, he will quickly become irrelevant, so if you’re trying to acquire his backing...\"","\"I didn’t come here to recruit him,\" said the First Princess, leaving Madam Jun speechless.","\"You’re not? Then why are we wasting our time here?\"","Instead of responding to her question, the First Princess said, \"Can’t you just let me be selfish for once?\"","\"Will that help you defeat your siblings? If so, then you may be as selfish as you wish. Listen, Jun’er... I’m only doing this for your own good. Moreover, it’s not like this is your only chance to meet the Divine Paragon.\"","Eventually, the First Princess gave up and muttered in a somewhat reluctant voice, \"...Fine.\"","Without saying anything else, the First Princess turned around and returned to the carriage.","The entire conversation had been conducted through voice transmission, so nobody present knew what they had discussed. Even if someone possessed the ability to intercept their conversation, nobody there was foolish enough to eavesdrop on the Celestial Family and risk offending them.","\"They’re leaving just like that?\"","The others were surprised to see the Celestial Family departing right after they arrived.","\"There’s no way. Did the Celestial Emperor not send the First Princess to seduce the Divine Paragon?\"","Yan Hara watched the Celestial Family disappear into the void with a slightly puzzled look on her face, wondering why they wanted to meet the Divine Paragon.","\"Clan Leader Yan! Do you have some time right now? I’d love to—\"","Suddenly, people began approaching Yan Hara, who finally made her presence known.","However, Yan Hara quickly waved them off and said, \"Sorry, but I am busy.\"","After saying that, she quickly turned around and flew back into the courtyard. When some tried to follow her, they were immediately blocked by the Demon Sealers.","’Where are you now, Yuan...?’ Yan Hara sighed inwardly.","Time continued to pass, and soon, there were only two weeks left before the banquet was scheduled to begin. Yet, the Divine Paragon was still nowhere to be seen.","Meanwhile, Yuan had spent this entire time trying to discover his own affinity. Unfortunately, no matter how much effort he put into it, he made absolutely no progress.","After all, it was practically impossible to learn something when he did not even understand what that thing truly was.","\"Lord Shiva said to just give it up,\" Mu Xuelian suddenly said out loud. \"There’s no way you’ll be able to discover your affinity like that.\"","Yuan looked at her and asked, \"What were you doing when you first discovered your own affinity?\"","\"I was napping... said Lord Shiva,\" Mu Xuelian relayed her response.","\"What?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, looking utterly dumbfounded by her response.","\"Or more precisely, after I awakened from my nap,\" Shiva corrected herself. \"However, during my slumber, I had a dream where my entire existence was frozen—sealed within an indestructible block of ice.\"","\"After breaking out of that ice and waking up, I discovered my affinity,\" she added.","\"You can’t be serious...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan continued to ask, \"What were you doing prior to taking your nap?\"","\"What most Eternals do when they are not napping or fighting each other. I was cultivating.\"","\"Now that I think about it, I have never seen an Eternal cultivating. Does it differ from how I do it?\" Yuan asked as he began absorbing the surrounding essence.","\"Unfortunately, I cannot cultivate Eternal Essence with this body. That being said, it’s definitely different, and I can show you how it’s done.\"","Shiva suddenly took control of Mu Xuelian’s body and approached Yuan.","\"I’ll show the method to your soul directly,\" she said. \"However, since I’m essentially sharing a cultivation method meant for Eternals, the price will be immense.\"","She narrowed her eyes at him before continuing, \"Quite frankly, there’s a real chance that you could die from it. Knowing this now, are you still willing to learn?\"","Yuan subconsciously swallowed nervously after hearing her warning. However, before he could say anything, Shiva continued speaking.","\"What you’re currently doing is essentially no different from how an unborn Eternal cultivates,\" she said. \"It’s simple... but terribly inefficient.\"","Yuan then asked, \"Do all Eternals cultivate using the same method?\"","\"Technically, yes,\" Shiva replied. \"Although every Eternal eventually develops their own unique cultivation method, they all originate from a single source and are merely altered versions.\"","\"And where did this cultivation method originally come from?\" Yuan asked with a curious expression.","\"That... does it really matter?\" Shiva responded after a brief pause.","\"Huh?\" Yuan immediately narrowed his eyes at her with suspicion. \"Of course it matters. How am I supposed to know this isn’t some dangerous technique?\"","He then continued in a wary voice, \"I know better than to cultivate a method with an unknown origin—especially one coming from an Eternal.\"","\"Do you think I’m trying to control your mind with this technique or something?\" Shiva rebuked, clearly offended by his suspicion. \"If you don’t want to learn it, then don’t. I doubt you’ll even survive long enough to cultivate it anyway!\"","\"...\"","After a long moment of contemplation, Yuan finally responded, \"I want to learn it.\""]},{"number":2512,"title":"Chapter 2512: Learning the Eternals’ Cultivation Technique","paragraphs":["\"Why the sudden change of heart? Aren’t you worried that I might try to seize your body?\" Shiva sneered sarcastically.","\"I’m only going to learn it first. Whether I actually cultivate it or not will depend entirely on its contents,\" Yuan calmly replied.","\"And what about the risks? You do understand that there is a very high chance you could die, right?\" Shiva said, heavily emphasizing the word ’very’.","After all, unlike merely learning forbidden knowledge about Eternals, Yuan was attempting to learn their cultivation method itself—something that would never even be considered a possible topic for a mere mortal like him under normal circumstances.","\"I will be fine,\" Yuan replied in a casual, almost nonchalant tone.","Shiva narrowed her eyes at him and said, \"I will ask you again. Are you certain you want to learn this cultivation technique? There’s a good chance that you might not even be able to use it.\"","\"You’re really that worried about me, huh?\" Yuan chuckled, leaving her speechless.","\"You promised to help me regain my true body! I am not going to let you die so easily!\" she exclaimed angrily.","\"I appreciate the concern, but since I am already in the process of tempering an Eternal Constitution, I will need to learn your cultivation technique sooner or later.\"","\"...\"","Shiva fell silent, as she’d forgotten about Yuan possessing an incomplete Eternal Constitution.","’Since he’s practically half Eternal at this point, he might not need to sacrifice too much to learn our cultivation technique...’ she thought inwardly.","\"Alright. Prepare yourself.\"","Yuan nodded and took a minute to mentally prepare himself before declaring, \"I am ready.\"","Without the slightest hesitation, Shiva grabbed the top of Yuan’s head with a claw-like grip before directly transferring the cultivation technique into his soul.","The instant the information began flooding into him, Yuan’s entire expression went blank. Even his eyes lost all focus, becoming hollow and lifeless, as though he had suddenly turned into a mindless husk.","Not only was the cultivation technique of the Eternals fundamentally different from those practiced by mortals, but they were also unimaginably profound.","The moment Yuan received the technique, it felt as though he had been thrown into an endless ocean with no visible bottom, slowly drowning in it.","Very quickly, noticeable changes began appearing across Yuan’s body.","His skin, which had been flawlessly smooth only moments earlier, suddenly became dry and wrinkled. At the same time, his well-refined physique rapidly withered, his muscles shrinking as though all vitality had been drained from him in an instant.","In mere moments, he looked as if he had suddenly aged into an old man.","Shiva narrowed her eyes slightly upon seeing Yuan’s condition, but she was neither shocked nor alarmed by it, as she had already anticipated such a reaction.","This phenomenon was caused by the rapid consumption of Yuan’s longevity. Even so, Shiva made no attempt to stop the transfer and continued with a somewhat nonchalant expression.","After all, the moment Shiva began transmitting the technique to him, Yuan had already paid the price in full. Even if she were to stop midway, it would not restore the longevity that had already been sacrificed.","Meanwhile, from Yuan’s perspective, the information contained within the technique was no different from incomprehensible gibberish, much like when he had first attempted to learn Heaven’s Secret Art from Xiao Hua.","Eternals possessed their own language, and the cultivation technique had been written entirely in that language.","Despite this, Yuan was not overly worried. If this situation were anything like when he had learned Heaven’s Secret Art, he would naturally come to understand it eventually. Because of that, he did not even attempt to forcibly decipher or comprehend the information, merely allowing it to flow into his mind.","\"Dear...\" Zi Xuan watched the situation unfold with a nervous expression on her face, her hands tightly clasped in anxiety.","She had accompanied Yuan through multiple lives and incarnations, yet never before had she seen him in such a frail and weakened state.","A few hours later, Shiva finished transferring the technique and finally released her grasp on Yuan.","The moment she did, his body collapsed limply onto the ground, his skeletal figure hitting the floor with a soft, lifeless thud.","\"Dear!\" Zi Xuan hurried over in panic, but there was nothing she could actually do except watch helplessly. Even if she wanted to hold him, she lacked a physical body and could not even touch him.","\"He’s still alive... surprisingly,\" Shiva suddenly said.","\"However, acquiring the cultivation technique consumed nearly all of his longevity, leaving behind only a tiny fragment of it. If nothing is done, he’ll die within a few days.\"","\"What can we do?!\" Zi Xuan immediately asked in a panicked voice.","\"Since he isn’t actually injured, recovery treasures will be useless,\" Shiva replied calmly. \"What he needs is something capable of replenishing his lost longevity.\"","\"Treasures capable of restoring longevity...?\" Zi Xuan muttered with a dumbfounded expression.","Although Tian Qiyuan’s world was unimaginably rich in resources—perhaps one of the wealthiest places in existence when it came to materials—it contained almost nothing outside of blacksmithing resources. As such, treasures capable of restoring longevity simply did not exist there.","Although Yuan still possessed his spatial ring, Zi Xuan was incapable of accessing it due to being a sword spirit. The same applied to Mu Xuelian, who was not the ring’s owner and therefore could not open it either.","As for Yuan himself, he was far too weak to even lift a finger, possessing only enough strength to continue breathing.","Suddenly, Shiva returned control of the body to Mu Xuelian, who immediately said, \"I will share some of my longevity with him.\"","Without another word, she knelt beside Yuan and extended her hand toward his chest.","After taking a deep breath, Mu Xuelian began extracting her own longevity before carefully transferring it into Yuan’s body.","Almost immediately, Zi Xuan noticed a visible improvement in Yuan’s condition. His breathing became steadier, and some of his vitality gradually returned, making him look less like a dried corpse. However, he still looked like a sick old man."]},{"number":2513,"title":"Chapter 2513: The Origin of the Cultivation Technique","paragraphs":["Thud.","\"That’s it... That’s the most I can do for him,\" Mu Xuelian said as she collapsed backward onto the ground, landing on her buttocks in complete exhaustion.","Zi Xuan narrowed her eyes at Yuan, whose condition had clearly improved after receiving some of Mu Xuelian’s longevity.","Although he no longer resembled a dying old man, his skin remained wrinkled, while his body was still sickly pale and frighteningly thin, almost like a living skeleton.","\"I have given him as much longevity as I can right now, but he’s still in a dangerous situation,\" Mu Xuelian then said.","\"This is... more than... enough... Thank you...\" Yuan said in a weak voice.","\"Can you... help me... into... the lotus position...?\"","Mu Xuelian took a moment to catch her breath before helping Yuan into a lotus position.","Once seated, Yuan slowly closed his eyes and took a deep breath.","He began circulating the spiritual energy within his body, gradually recovering a portion of his strength. However, no matter how much he cultivated, there was only so much vitality he could regain through spiritual energy alone. What he truly lacked was longevity.","A few hours later, Yuan opened his eyes and said to Mu Xuelian, \"Can you bring me outside of this world and into the Primordial Chaos?\"","\"What are you planning on doing?\" she asked with raised eyebrows. \"There’s nothing but beasts out there.\"","\"I need them to replenish my longevity,\" he responded.","\"Is that so?\"","Without asking any further questions, Mu Xuelian lifted Yuan with her spiritual energy and carried him outside.","The moment they stepped back into the Primordial Chaos, several powerful magical beasts immediately sensed their presence and began approaching from multiple directions.","\"Do you need protection?\" Mu Xuelian asked in a calm voice, as though the approaching magical beasts were of no concern to her.","\"No,\" Yuan replied. \"However, I will need your help. After I use this technique, I’ll probably become too weak to even move.\"","Mu Xuelian silently nodded and watched attentively, waiting to see what Yuan intended to do.","Before long, the magical beasts arrived and immediately locked onto Yuan, whose weakened state made him appear to be the easiest prey among them.","However, before the magical beasts could even approach him, an ominous aura suddenly erupted from Yuan’s body.","In the very next moment, every magical beast charging toward them froze midair, as though time itself had suddenly stopped around them.","<Forbidden Blood Extraction!>","Yuan had just used Forbidden Blood Extraction to forcibly extract the Blood Essence from the magical beasts.","Since Blood Essence was essentially a magical beast’s refined life force, it could be used to help replenish the longevity he had lost.","However, the moment he finished extracting their Blood Essence, Yuan collapsed onto the ground once again.","\"Can you collect their Blood Essence and feed it to me?\" Yuan weakly said to Mu Xuelian.","Still somewhat dazed by what she had just witnessed, Mu Xuelian silently nodded before moving to retrieve the Blood Essence.","\"How am I supposed to feed these to you?\" Mu Xuelian asked after gathering all of the Blood Essence.","She examined them with curiosity, as each one resembled a tiny crimson crystal radiating pure vitality.","Yuan silently opened his mouth, indicating that she should feed them to him directly.","Without saying anything further, Mu Xuelian began placing the Blood Essence into his mouth one crystal at a time.","The moment the Blood Essence touched Yuan’s tongue, it instantly melted away, dissolving into pure energy that disappeared into his body.","Rather than refining the Blood Essence into spiritual energy like most would do, Yuan directly converted it into vitality to replenish his lost longevity.","Although each Blood Essence restored only a few years of life, it was still enough for him to recover sufficient strength to move on his own once again.","And while Blood Essence could be consumed directly, most people preferred using it to refine longevity pills instead, as doing so was far more efficient and allowed them to extract significantly more vitality from it.","However, since Yuan essentially had an unlimited supply available to him, he could not care less about such inefficiencies.","\"Thanks a lot. I should be fine for now,\" Yuan said as he slowly stood up and dusted off his clothes.","\"What kind of technique was that?\" Mu Xuelian suddenly asked.","\"I could tell you, but then I’d have to kill you,\" Yuan replied with a serious expression on his face, completely catching Mu Xuelian off guard.","A moment later, he casually added, \"I’m joking.\"","\"...\"","\"You can head back for now. I’ll return after I restore a bit more of my longevity,\" Yuan said before flying away to hunt more magical beasts.","Once Yuan disappeared into the distance, Shiva quietly took control of Mu Xuelian’s body and silently stared in the direction he had gone.","\"That power...\" Shiva muttered with a contemplative look on her face.","It felt strangely familiar to her, as though she had encountered something similar somewhere in the distant past, yet for some reason, she could not remember where.","Two days later, Yuan returned to Tian Qiyuan’s world, looking completely refreshed. However, his complexion still appeared slightly pale.","\"How much longevity did you recover?\" Mu Xuelian asked.","\"A few thousand years,\" he calmly replied. \"It’s not much, but it’s more than enough for now. I’ll properly recover my longevity later.\"","\"Lord Shiva asked when you plan to cultivate the technique,\" Mu Xuelian said.","\"I’ve been going through its contents while hunting magical beasts over the past two days, but I still can’t understand it well enough to begin cultivating it,\" Yuan replied.","\"That being said, I’ve understood enough of it to know its origin.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes at Mu Xuelian—or rather, at Shiva residing within her—and continued, \"This cultivation technique... was it created by the Absolute Being?\"","Shiva took control of Mu Xuelian’s body before calmly responding, \"That’s correct. This cultivation method, used by every single Eternals at one point, was created by the Absolute Being.\""]},{"number":2514,"title":"Chapter 2514: Studying the Cultivation Technique","paragraphs":["\"Not only was this cultivation technique created by the Absolute Being, but it was also forced upon all of us,\" Shiva continued with a calm expression on her face.","\"What do you mean?\" Yuan asked, his head slightly tilted with puzzlement.","\"Just like how humans are born with the instinct to breathe, every single Eternal is born into existence already knowing this cultivation technique,\" Shiva elaborated.","\"Huh? How does that work? What about the Eternals born after the Absolute Being’s death?\"","Shiva looked at him with an odd expression and remarked, \"Why would you say the Absolute Being is dead?\"","\"He’s not?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, as he’d always had this assumption.","\"If the Absolute Being is still alive, why are Eternals fighting to acquire the Absolute Power that he left behind? Surely, they wouldn’t be doing such a thing if the Absolute Being were still alive.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Shiva spoke again.","\"While it’s true that nobody has seen the Absolute Being for an incredibly long time, nobody possesses any concrete evidence that he is dead either.\"","She paused briefly before continuing, \"That being said, many Eternals believe he has already perished. However, I personally believe he is still alive. After all, there is simply no way a being as powerful as the Absolute Being could truly die. The very idea is unthinkable.\"","Despite speaking with such conviction, Yuan could clearly detect a faint trace of doubt hidden within Shiva’s eyes, as though even she subconsciously questioned her own words.","’If Eternals are nearly impossible to kill, then it makes sense why she believes the Absolute Being cannot perish,’ Yuan pondered inwardly.","’However, if he were truly still alive, then what about the Absolute Power he left behind? He must have left it there for a reason. And if he were actually alive, he would have already stopped the others from trying to covet his power.’","\"Anyway, we are born knowing the Absolute Being’s technique because it’s nature,\" Shiva answered his question a moment later.","\"I don’t get it. How is it natural if you’re forced to learn it?\"","\"Because it is a law of this universe,\" Shiva elaborated.","\"Just as the ruler of a world can impose laws upon that world and its inhabitants, the Absolute Being—as the master of the universe itself—can establish laws that apply to all existence.\"","\"And one of those laws is that every Eternal is born with this cultivation technique already engraved into their existence.\"","Yuan’s jaw slowly dropped after hearing her explanation.","He had always known that the Absolute Being was regarded as the strongest Eternal, but such a title had always felt too abstract for him to truly comprehend.","However, after hearing Shiva’s words, Yuan finally gained a small glimpse into just how terrifying the Absolute Being’s powers truly were.","To impose a law upon the universe itself—one that affected every Eternal, including those not yet born—was simply beyond the comprehension of a mortal like Yuan.","Seeing Yuan’s expression, Shiva spoke, \"If you’re thinking about asking me the reason, don’t bother. Besides those close to the Absolute Being before his disappearance, nobody knows. Hell, there’s a good chance that even they don’t know why he made such a law.\"","\"So from my understanding, every Eternal begins with this cultivation technique, but eventually modifies it and turns it into their own unique version?\" Yuan asked for clarification.","\"That’s correct,\" Shiva nodded in confirmation.","\"Anyway... What are you going to do now that you have the technique?\"","\"I’m going to study it,\" he said. \"Maybe it’ll help me discover my affinity.\"","Shiva sneered in disdain, \"If it were that easy, it wouldn’t have taken us so much time to discover our own affinity.\"","Yuan didn’t entertain her and closed his eyes to focus on the cultivation technique.","<You have discovered the first cultivation technique in existence>","<Your progress toward Path to Eternity has increased>","[Progress: 20%]","Although Yuan still could not fully comprehend the cultivation technique, he was able to recite it flawlessly without the slightest issue.","As a result, he repeatedly recited the technique over and over, hoping that he would eventually grasp its meaning naturally through repetition, just as he did with Heaven’s Secret Art.","’What a waste of time...’ Shiva inwardly shook her head before returning control of the body to Mu Xuelian.","In Shiva’s eyes, even if Yuan somehow managed to fully comprehend the cultivation technique, he still would not be capable of using it because he lacked the necessary body to support it.","She never bothered mentioning this to him because, to her, it was unnecessary.","However, just as Shiva was prepared to take a nap, she suddenly sensed Eternal Essence leaking from Yuan’s body.","At first, she did not think much of it, but she still decided to take a closer look.","’Th-This is—!’","Shiva immediately seized control of Mu Xuelian’s body again and stared at Yuan with a dumbfounded expression on her face.","’Although his Eternal Essence is still ordinary... I can sense something changing within it, almost as though an affinity is in the process of being born!’","Naturally, Yuan was completely unaware of the changes occurring within his Eternal Essence, as he was wholly immersed in comprehending the cultivation technique.","’How is this even possible?! He’s nothing more than a mortal!’","Shiva subconsciously clenched her fists in agitation.","’This feeling... am I actually feeling inferior to a mere mortal?!’ she cried inwardly in disbelief.","’No... this must be some sort of mistake. There’s no way he’s actually discovering his affinity out of nowhere like this.’","Shiva quickly took a deep breath to compose herself.","’Let’s think through this rationally and wait a little longer before I come to any conclusions...’","Shiva proceeded to spend the next several hours closely observing Yuan and the Eternal Essence emanating from his body, which was becoming increasingly refined with every passing moment.","’I once witnessed an Eternal in the process of discovering their affinity, and what I’m seeing from him right now is incredibly similar...’ she sighed inwardly."]},{"number":2515,"title":"Chapter 2515: Yuan’s Affinity","paragraphs":["’If he’s truly discovering his affinity now, what kind of affinity will show up in a mortal body?’ Shiva wondered inwardly as she continued watching Yuan.","Though she was irritated that Yuan might discover his affinity so soon, she was also intrigued by the possibilities.","’A mortal cultivating a cultivation technique meant for gods, huh? Will his incomplete Eternal Constitution even be able to handle the stress?’","’Perhaps I shouldn’t even have given him the technique in the first place, as it only makes him even more of a threat to us...’","Shiva was slowly beginning to regret sharing the cultivation technique with Yuan, a mortal who was clearly not afraid of offending or clashing with Eternals.","A few more hours later, the Eternal Essence radiating from Yuan began undergoing a fundamental transformation, and the outline of his affinity slowly started to reveal itself.","Suddenly, a powerful chill ran down Shiva’s spine, causing her to instinctively leap away from Yuan.","’What was that feeling?!’ she cried inwardly, her eyes narrowing at Yuan.","That was when Shiva realized that everything surrounding Yuan was being converted into Eternal Essence.","However, upon closer inspection, she discovered that Yuan had not actually begun cultivating the technique yet. Instead, the surroundings around him were being transformed into Eternal Essence automatically.","As the Eternal Essence surrounding Yuan grew stronger and denser, his surroundings began transforming into essence at an increasingly rapid pace.","Naturally, this also meant that the chamber itself was slowly being destroyed by the process.","’Wait! Something isn’t right!’ Shiva’s eyes widened when she noticed this.","When an Eternal begins discovering their affinity, their surroundings naturally reflect the nature of that affinity.","For example, when Shiva discovered her own affinity in her slumber, she awoke to find herself completely surrounded by indestructible ice.","\"What kind of affinity is this...?\" Shiva mumbled in a puzzled voice.","The more Shiva examined Yuan’s Eternal Essence, the more confused she became.","Although there existed countless different affinities—far more than the number of Eternals themselves—she was familiar with many of them. Yet never before had she seen or even heard of an affinity capable of turning its surroundings into essence.","’Perhaps I was mistaken this entire time, and this phenomenon isn’t caused by him discovering an affinity at all...’ Shiva eventually thought inwardly.","’No, let’s watch a little longer...’","While Shiva wanted to watch longer, Zi Xuan had a different thought.","\"Wake up!\" she shouted at Yuan.","\"What are you doing?\" Shiva frowned.","\"Isn’t it obvious that I am trying to wake him up?!\" Zi Xuan exclaimed.","Before Shiva could respond, Zi Xuan continued, \"Look around us! This place is going to be destroyed if things continue!\"","\"So what? If you disturb him now, he might never—\"","\"Shut up! This place might mean nothing to you, but it means everything to me!\"","Without hesitation, Zi Xuan took advantage of her existence as his sword spirit and spoke directly into Yuan’s mind through their connection. After all, she knew that he’d never hear her voice if she tried speaking to him normally.","Soon, Yuan slowly opened his eyes, and the Eternal Essence surrounding him gradually vanished soon after.","\"If I had simply left you alone, you would’ve completely destroyed this entire place along with everything inside it,\" Zi Xuan said with a deep sigh.","Yuan looked around the chamber, and sure enough, it appeared as though an intense battle had taken place there.","Fortunately, the anvil and the golden wheel remained completely undamaged, as they were far more durable than the chamber itself.","\"Thank you,\" Yuan said as he stood up. \"If you hadn’t stopped me, I would’ve completely wrecked this place, as well as this...\"","Yuan looked at the golden wheel with a nostalgic air around him.","\"You could have discovered your affinity if you hadn’t stopped,\" Shiva said to him.","\"My affinity? What are you talking about?\" Yuan asked with raised eyebrows.","Shiva then explained everything that had happened while he was immersed in the cultivation technique.","\"I see...\" Yuan muttered afterward. \"Although it’s somewhat regrettable, I can always try again another time. If this place gets destroyed, it cannot be replaced.\"","\"That being said, I still have more time. Let’s try again at another location.\"","Yuan left the chamber shortly afterward and continued cultivating outside, where there was nothing important he could accidentally destroy.","Shiva inwardly shook her head and sighed.","’To waste a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity over something so insignificant... what a waste.’","She genuinely believed that what Yuan had experienced inside the chamber was the result of pure luck and that such a phenomenon could never be replicated again.","However, less than an hour after Yuan resumed cultivating, Eternal Essence once again began emanating from his body.","’What is going on...?’ Shiva muttered with a bewildered look on her face.","Not only had the phenomenon returned, but it was now far stronger than before.","The ground beneath Yuan—and even the very air surrounding him—rapidly transformed into essence.","’T-This is—!\"","Shiva’s entire body trembled as a sudden realization struck her.","It had not been obvious before, but now she could finally discern the true nature of Yuan’s affinity.","’No! It can’t be! This is impossible!’","Shiva slowly stepped away from Yuan, a horrified expression appearing on her face, as though she had just witnessed something truly terrifying.","Suddenly, killing intent surfaced within Shiva’s gaze, and her hands slowly clenched into tight fists.","’Should I just kill him before he realizes it...?’ Shiva wondered inwardly.","However, Shiva had little time to dwell on those thoughts because almost immediately after the killing intent surfaced within her, Zi Xuan sensed it and attacked her from behind.","\"What do you think you’re doing?\" Shiva slowly turned to look at Zi Xuan after blocking her attack with ease.","\"I should be asking you that,\" Zi Xuan calmly responded. \"I can sense your killing intent toward my darling. What are you trying to do?\"","\"...\"","Shiva remained silent for a brief moment before calmly responding in a nonchalant voice, \"Nothing. It’s just a misunderstanding.\"","The killing intent in her eyes vanished completely afterward, and she returned to observing Yuan as though nothing had happened at all."]},{"number":2516,"title":"Chapter 2516: Shiva’s Killing Intent","paragraphs":["’This bitch really thinks I’m stupid...’ Zi Xuan narrowed her eyes at Shiva’s back.","Even though Shiva had withdrawn her killing intent and claimed it was merely a misunderstanding, Zi Xuan did not believe her in the slightest.","However, Zi Xuan ultimately decided against attacking Shiva and instead continued observing her carefully.","After all, even if she did make a move, she had no real confidence in her ability to defeat Shiva, especially since they were not in the Nine Heavens.","Meanwhile, as Yuan’s affinity gradually became more pronounced, his understanding of the cultivation technique also deepened accordingly.","Suddenly, after an entire day had passed, the Eternal Essence surrounding Yuan violently expanded outward like a bursting bubble, transforming everything it touched into essence.","Zi Xuan and Shiva hastily retreated the moment it happened, nearly getting caught within the expanding wave of Eternal Essence themselves.","The Eternal Essence continued expanding outward for countless miles, completely erasing everything in its path.","Fortunately, Yuan had deliberately moved far enough away beforehand, preventing the main island from being entirely consumed. Even so, by the time the expanding wave finally stopped, a sizeable portion of the island had vanished.","Yuan slowly opened his eyes shortly afterward.","He then released a small amount of Eternal Essence from his palm and quietly examined it.","\"Shiva was right...\" he muttered. \"I can naturally sense my affinity now.\"","<You have discovered your Affinity!>","<Your progress toward Path to Eternity has increased!>","[Progress: 30%]","However, there was still one slight issue remaining.","Yuan returned to the main island, where Shiva and Zi Xuan had retreated earlier, before looking at Shiva and asking,","\"What kind of affinity is this?\"","He revealed his Eternal Essence to her, and unlike before, it now radiated with a myriad of colors resembling a miniature galaxy, as though he were holding the entire universe within the palm of his hand.","Shiva subconsciously swallowed nervously and did her utmost to maintain a calm exterior.","Then, with a deliberately nonchalant expression, she answered, \"I... don’t know.\"","\"What?\" Yuan frowned.","\"There are countless different affinities in existence and only so many Eternals,\" Shiva explained in a calm voice. \"Do you really think I would recognize every single affinity out there?\"","Of course, she was lying.","\"With that being said, I believe it would be best if you refrain from using that affinity too openly, especially in the presence of other Eternals...\" Shiva continued.","\"Unless, of course, you wish to become the subject of their experiments.\"","\"Furthermore, an unknown affinity is far more dangerous than you realize,\" Shiva warned him.","Yuan glanced around at the destruction surrounding them before releasing a helpless sigh.","\"You don’t need to tell me that.\"","Some time later, after restoring the damaged portion of the island, Yuan returned to the chamber to test his newly awakened Eternal Essence.","He plucked off a tiny piece of the Void Fragment and began crafting another treasure with it.","However, the moment he attempted to refine the Void Fragment using his newly awakened Eternal Essence, his eyes widened in shock.","The Void Fragment was completely destroyed upon contact with it.","\"What the...?\" Yuan muttered before looking at Shiva with a puzzled face.","\"What exactly do you expect me to say?\" Shiva shrugged.","\"What am I doing wrong?\" Yuan asked.","\"What you’re doing isn’t inherently wrong,\" Shiva replied. \"If anything, the issue lies with your affinity itself. You’ve only just awakened it, so naturally, you’re still unable to properly control it.\"","\"So I am using too much of it?\"","Yuan tried again, but this time, he carefully controlled his Eternal Essence and used as little of it as possible.","Yet, the result remained exactly the same. The instant his Eternal Essence fused with the Void Fragment, the material completely vaporized into thin air.","Shiva subconsciously clenched her fists as she watched Yuan use his newly awakened Eternal Essence.","’I’m almost certain that his affinity is...’ She sighed inwardly, uncertain about how she should handle the situation moving forward.","As an Eternal, Shiva understood that it would be in her best interest to kill Yuan herself, because even if she chose not to act, the other Eternals would undoubtedly try to eliminate him the moment they discovered the nature of his affinity.","’A mortal capable of threatening gods—threatening our very existence... Such a thing would have once been utterly unthinkable. But now... it may truly become reality,’ Shiva sighed inwardly.","\"Hey.\" Yuan suddenly called out to Shiva, snapping her out of her daze.","\"My Eternal Essence still destroyed it even when I used the smallest amount possible. Could this not be an issue of quantity?\" He narrowed his eyes thoughtfully before continuing, \"Perhaps my affinity has something to do with destruction?\"","Shiva trembled the moment she heard his words, her eyes widening slightly. And despite her efforts to suppress it, a trace of killing intent once again surfaced within her gaze.","Yuan raised an eyebrow the moment he sensed the killing intent radiating from her, though he could not understand the reason behind it.","\"That’s quite a dangerous look you have there, Shiva. Are you feeling alright?\" he asked cautiously.","Upon realizing that her killing intent had leaked out once again, Shiva immediately relinquished control of the body back to Mu Xuelian.","Rather than answering Yuan’s question, she chose to avoid the situation altogether and retreated into silence.","\"Umm... Lord Shiva said that she isn’t feeling well and needs to rest...\" Mu Xuelian spoke a moment later, her voice sounding unusually stiff and awkward.","Yuan wanted to press further, but he could tell that Mu Xuelian herself was just as confused by the situation as he was.","After witnessing Shiva’s strange behavior for a second time, Zi Xuan decided to tell Yuan about what had happened during his cultivation through voice transmission, including the moment Shiva had revealed killing intent toward him earlier.","In the end, Yuan chose to remain silent about the matter for the time being while secretly raising his guard around Shiva.","Yuan soon returned to crafting treasures once again. However, because his supply of Void Fragments was limited, he decided not to use them until he figured out a way to refine materials without destroying them.","Thus, he began testing his Eternal Essence on ordinary materials. Though these \"ordinary\" materials would still be considered priceless treasures within the Nine Heavens."]},{"number":2517,"title":"Chapter 2517: New Stairway to Heaven","paragraphs":["One... ten... a hundred—after nearly two hundred failed attempts and destroyed materials, Yuan finally began gaining a deeper understanding of his affinity.","However, even with his monstrous level of comprehension talent, he still could not grasp it quickly enough to finish before the banquet.","As a result, he ultimately decided to stop his experiments for the time being.","Afterward, Yuan stored the Void Fragment back into his spatial ring, along with the hammer, the anvil, and the golden wheel.","\"Are you finished?\" Zi Xuan asked him.","\"For now, yes,\" Yuan replied. \"If I continue working on it, I’ll definitely gain enough understanding of my affinity to properly refine materials with it. However, at the current pace, it would take far too long.\"","He then continued in a defeated tone, \"And even if I somehow managed to succeed, I still wouldn’t dare use it on Number One Under Heaven until I’m completely confident in my ability to control it.\"","\"Sorry, but your upgrade will have to wait a little longer.\"","Zi Xuan shook her head and responded, \"It’s fine. If I’m going to receive an upgrade, then I want it to be something truly worthwhile—not just some insignificant improvement.\"","\"Who knows? You might find something even better to use on my upgrade than the Void Fragment by then.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Not to mention, I am still lacking their crafting technique.\"","Zi Xuan returned to Number One Under Heaven shortly after.","\"I am going to take a nap. Staying outside for so long is more tiring than I anticipated,\" she said.","\"Let’s go,\" Yuan said to Mu Xuelian a moment later.","\"Where to now?\"","\"To partake in a banquet, but I have one more thing to do before then...\"","A week before the Divine Paragon’s banquet was scheduled to begin, something completely unexpected occurred within the Nine Heavens, causing widespread commotion.","The Stairway to Heaven, which had mysteriously vanished for many years, had returned just as suddenly.","\"I heard the Stairway to Heaven has returned!\"","\"No, it’s not the original Stairway to Heaven, but something that merely resembles it!\"","However, those who went to inspect the treasure immediately realized that something was different about this new Stairway to Heaven, as its appearance was entirely unlike the original.","\"Huh? If it’s not the original Stairway to Heaven, what is it? And who does it belong to?\"","\"Probably the Celestial Emperor. After all, His Majesty did mention that he was working on replacing the Stairway to Heaven.\"","\"Believe it or not, it wasn’t the Celestial Emperor’s doing,\" said someone more knowledgeable on the subject. \"According to those who went to examine the treasure, a certain name was engraved into it!\"","\"What name?\"","\"The Exalted Blacksmith!\"","\"...Who?\"","Most ordinary people were unfamiliar with the title Exalted Blacksmith, but when blacksmiths across the world heard that name, they were shaken to their very core and immediately rushed over to examine the treasure for themselves.","\"You don’t know who the Exalted Blacksmith is?!\" A passing blacksmith who happened to overhear their conversation immediately interjected before proudly explaining, \"He is none other than the most influential and experienced blacksmith in all of history!\"","\"Listen carefully! The Exalted Blacksmith crafted over thirty percent of all existing Celestial-grade treasures in existence—over seventy percent in his era! Not only that, but during his God of Creation Ceremony, he forged one hundred Celestial-grade treasures back-to-back without a single failure in less than a week!\"","\"In the world of blacksmithing, the Exalted Blacksmith is a true god! There isn’t a single blacksmith alive who doesn’t know his name!\"","\"If he’s really that incredible, then how come I’ve never heard of him?\"","The blacksmith released a deep sigh before responding, \"Because the Exalted Blacksmith suddenly disappeared shortly after becoming the God of Creation, and nobody has heard a single thing about him ever since...\"","His eyes then widened with excitement as he continued, \"Until today!\"","\"How can you be so certain it’s genuine and not some impostor? There have been plenty of people like that appearing lately.\"","\"Well... we’re currently trying to verify it ourselves,\" the blacksmith replied. \"In fact, the current God of Creation has already announced that he’ll personally examine the treasure later today.\"","\"If the Exalted Blacksmith has truly returned... then I wonder what kind of masterpiece he will bestow upon this world next. His abilities were already far ahead of their time before he disappeared millions of years ago. I can’t even begin to imagine how terrifying his craftsmanship must be now.\"","Sure enough, later that same day, the current God of Creation personally arrived at the newly appeared Stairway to Heaven in the Ninth Heaven to examine it.","By the time he arrived, the area surrounding the treasure was already packed with countless people, the majority of them being blacksmiths.","\"Welcome, God of Creation!\"","The crowd enthusiastically greeted the God of Creation the moment he arrived.","He quickly recognized many familiar faces among the gathering. In fact, every single Divine Blacksmith in the Ninth Heaven was present as well.","After speaking with some of the blacksmiths, the God of Creation got a rough idea about the situation.","Even before the God of Creation had arrived, several Divine Blacksmiths had already carefully examined the engravings on the treasure, comparing them to the works the Exalted Blacksmith had created in the distant past.","And every single one of them had reached the exact same conclusion... it was authentic.","However, despite being almost completely certain of its authenticity, they still had to wait for the current God of Creation to personally examine it before officially announcing the news to the public.","Some time later, the God of Creation retrieved several treasures from his spatial ring before approaching the stairway.","He then carefully compared the engravings on his already authenticated treasures crafted by the Exalted Blacksmith with the engravings carved onto the stairway itself.","Meanwhile, everyone else watched with nervous expressions, silently waiting for the God of Creation to announce his conclusion.","Several minutes later, the God of Creation took a deep breath and announced the results.","\"It’s real.\""]},{"number":2518,"title":"Chapter 2518: Divine Paragon’s Public Appearance","paragraphs":["\"I-It’s real! The God of Creation has confirmed it!\"","The entire crowd exploded with excitement.","\"Does this mean the Exalted Blacksmith has returned?!\"","\"Heavens! Didn’t another legendary figure just return recently after disappearing for millions of years?! What in heaven’s name is happening?!\"","However, the God of Creation suddenly spoke again, instantly halting the crowd’s excitement.","\"Although I can confirm that this treasure was indeed crafted by the Exalted Blacksmith, there is no evidence proving that he himself has returned.\"","He paused briefly before continuing, \"Think about it logically. The Exalted Blacksmith disappeared without a trace shortly after becoming the God of Creation millions of years ago, and nobody has seen or heard from him ever since. Why would he suddenly reappear now just to replace the Stairway to Heaven?\"","\"If you ask me, I believe this treasure was most likely placed here by somebody else.\"","The God of Creation then narrowed his eyes at the stairway before adding, \"Furthermore, the Exalted Blacksmith was famous for being far ahead of his era. Yet this treasure does not appear significantly superior to the treasures he crafted millions of years ago. How could so much time pass without his craftsmanship improving drastically?\"","He concluded, \"That leads me to believe this treasure was actually forged by him in the distant past and only revealed now.\"","After hearing the God of Creation’s explanation, the crowd’s excitement quickly diminished as they realized they had allowed themselves to get carried away too soon.","Someone in the crowd suddenly raised their hand and asked, \"Even if we don’t know who placed this treasure here, we can at least assume it’s safe to use... right?\"","The God of Creation responded, \"I will personally examine this treasure and determine its functions.\"","\"May I accompany you?\" one of the Divine Blacksmiths immediately asked.","Even to this day, newly discovered treasures crafted by the Exalted Blacksmith continue to surface from time to time, and every single discovery would shake the world of blacksmithing.","Naturally, this treasure was no exception.","In the end, the God of Creation allowed the Divine Blacksmiths there to accompany him.","And since they were already there, they wasted no time and immediately started their investigation.","Meanwhile, news of the situation continued to spread.","With so many expert blacksmiths jointly inspecting the treasure, it took only two days for the investigation to conclude.","In the end, they determined that the treasure functioned similarly to the original Stairway to Heaven and was safe to use.","When the Celestial Emperor heard the news, he did not know whether to laugh or cry. After all, he had already spent many years and an enormous amount of resources creating a replacement for the Stairway to Heaven, even going as far as hiring the current God of Creation for the task. However, he still decided to continue with his original project.","Even if the Stairway to Heaven had already been replaced, its origins remained completely unknown. And for something that allowed people to freely traverse the Nine Heavens, the Celestial Emperor would much rather possess one that remained entirely under his own control.","On the fifth day following the discovery of the new Stairway to Heaven, the Celestial Emperor officially granted temporary permission for its usage, allowing people to traverse between realms once more.","However, because this was technically an entirely new treasure, all previous trial records tied to the original Stairway to Heaven were not present.","As a result, anyone wishing to ascend—even those originating from the Upper Heavens—would have to retake the trial from the beginning if they wanted to use it.","This situation immediately caused a massive uproar, especially among those who had descended to a lower heaven and ended up stranded there because of the Stairway to Heaven’s sudden disappearance. Now, if they wished to return home, they would be forced to retake the trial all over again.","Unfortunately, there was little the Celestial Emperor could do about the situation besides reassure the public that he still intended to replace the Exalted Blacksmith’s treasure once his own version was completed.","Until then, he warned everyone against traveling to a lower heaven unless absolutely necessary.","Even then, many from the Eighth Heaven and Ninth Heaven still decided to use the stairway to travel to the Seventh Heaven to participate in the Divine Paragon’s banquet.","Several hours before the banquet was scheduled to begin, Yuan finally arrived at the venue.","To his utter shock, the place was already packed beyond capacity with people, far surpassing even his wildest expectations.","From afar, the countless figures gathered around the venue resembled a vast black sea that had suddenly appeared beside the Demonic Realm.","Shortly before showing up at the venue, Yuan sent Mu Xuelian to another place, as he did not want her present at the banquet for several reasons.","Some time later, Yuan used Void Manipulation, bypassing the massive crowd and teleporting directly into the courtyard.","\"Divine Paragon!\"","\"The Divine Paragon has arrived!\"","The Demon Sealers swiftly announced after noticing his sudden appearance.","\"What? That’s the Divine Paragon?\"","Everyone stopped whatever they were doing to look at Yuan, their eyes wide with awe and admiration.","\"...Yingzhe?\" Xiang Biyu subconsciously muttered in a dazed voice after seeing the Divine Paragon’s face, her eyes wide with disbelief and doubt.","Yuan had grown and matured significantly since she last saw him, so she didn’t immediately think of him when she saw his face. Rather, he reminded her of Tian Yingzhe, the founder of the Celestial Overlords.","As for the Holy Maiden seated beside her, her expression remained hidden beneath her veil, but her hands had quietly tightened into fists for some reason.","The next moment, Yan Hara appeared before him and said, \"Welcome back, Senior Tian. There are still a few hours before the banquet is scheduled to begin, but we can start at your discretion.\"","Yuan nodded and turned to face the crowd.","\"Before we start the banquet to celebrate my return, I would like to say a few words first,\" he began."]},{"number":2519,"title":"Chapter 2519: Revealing the Truth to the Nine Heavens","paragraphs":["\"First and foremost, allow me to properly introduce myself,\" Yuan spoke calmly as he faced the hundreds of thousands of guests gathered before him.","\"Most of you know me as the Divine Paragon, but my real name is Tian Chenyu, the first leader of the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","\"As many of you already know, I mysteriously vanished near the end of the Demonic Era,\" Yuan continued.","\"In truth, after sealing the Demonic Realm, I accidentally returned there through a second entrance and became trapped inside ever since...\"","After a brief pause, he calmly added, \"To be frank, I could have returned much sooner. However, I chose to use that opportunity to explore the Demonic Realm and better understand the existence of demons, something I didn’t really get to do during my first visit.\"","\"I spent an unimaginably long time exploring the Demonic Realm, learning about their history and their existence as a whole. And what I discovered there shocked me to my very core—so much so that it completely changed the way I view demons.\"","Yuan’s gaze slowly swept across the countless guests before him before he continued,","\"Today, I will reveal everything I learned to all of you.\"","The guests swallowed nervously as many thoughts raced through their minds. They could not help but wonder what kind of shocking truth could possibly cause someone also known as the Bane of Demons to change his perspective on their existence.","A few moments later, Yuan took a deep breath before revealing the same information he had shared with the Demon Sealing Clan not long ago.","\"There are two kinds of demons. Ordinary demons, who behave no differently from us, and the Forsaken—the ones who have terrorized our world and slaughtered our people since their very first appearance.\"","\"In the Demonic Realm, the Forsaken are originally ordinary demons who have been corrupted for reasons still unknown, transforming them into bloodthirsty fiends that even prey upon their own kind.\"","He then continued, \"They are no different from the criminals in our own world who prey upon the innocent. Because of this, ordinary demons imprison the Forsaken in a place known as the Deprived Crimson Valley.\"","\"Unfortunately, because the Forsaken are immortal and incredibly difficult to kill, the prison quickly became overcrowded. In the end, the demons chose to cast them into another location beyond their world, completely unaware that our world even existed and that they’d made us experience hell...\"","\"This is the truth behind the invasion during the Demonic Era. Are there any questions so far?\" Yuan asked.","The moment those words left his mouth, thousands of hands shot into the air simultaneously, while many others began shouting questions out loud without even waiting to be called upon.","Yuan ignored those who lacked basic manners and pointed toward someone in the crowd who had patiently raised their hand.","\"You there—the second-level God Ascension wearing red robes with a spear on your back.\"","The man subconsciously smiled before asking, \"I thought the Demonic Realm was created by some demon called the Red Tyrant?\"","\"That was merely an unconfirmed rumor from back then,\" Yuan calmly replied. \"The Demonic Realm existed long before the demons ever invaded our world. In fact, it even predates the existence of the Nine Heavens themselves.\"","Yuan then pointed toward another person in the crowd, who quickly asked, \"Can you tell us more about these ordinary demons? What do you mean when you say they behave like us? Could you elaborate further?\"","Yuan nodded calmly before replying, \"Just like us, ordinary demons have families, occupations, and their own society where people simply strive to survive and live their lives to the fullest.\"","\"Aren’t all demons immortal? How different are their lives from ours?\"","\"While it’s true that demons are essentially immortal even without cultivating, they are not truly immortal in the sense that they can survive forever without sustenance,\" Yuan explained calmly.","\"Just like mortals, they still require nourishment to sustain themselves. If they go for too long without it, they risk becoming a Forsaken, which is essentially considered death among their kind.\"","\"What is the purpose of revealing all of this to us?\" someone in the crowd suddenly asked.","Yuan calmly replied, \"I wanted to change your perspective on demons. As far as the world is concerned, all demons are viewed as bloodthirsty creatures that humanity can never coexist with. However, I believe coexistence is possible—just as humans eventually learned to coexist with beasts.\"","\"Even if there truly are demons that are not violent, there is still the possibility that they could eventually become Forsaken, correct? Forgive me for being blunt, but I don’t believe coexistence is possible unless that issue is resolved first.\"","Yuan calmly responded, \"While it’s true that this is indeed an issue, it’s also something we already face in our daily lives. For example, cultivators who suffer from Qi Deviation can lose their rationality and become no different from the Forsaken. Then there are those who practice forbidden techniques and eventually lose their minds because of them.\"","\"Even if that’s true, there’s not much we can realistically do about people like that. However, demons are different. We can simply keep them confined within the Demonic Realm. After all, why should we take such a risk?\"","Yuan shook his head and replied, \"Only time will tell whether coexistence between humans and demons is truly possible or not.\"","\"As for permanently sealing the Demonic Realm... unfortunately, that was never a realistic solution to begin with. The seal I placed on the Demonic Realm was only a temporary solution, and the only reason they haven’t destroyed it despite being fully capable is because I was in the Demonic Realm to stop them.\"","\"There are many demons who are curious about our world, just as I’m certain there are many people here who are interested in the Demonic Realm, and demons visiting our world in the future is inevitable.\"","He then swept his gaze across the crowd before asking, \"And when that day comes... will you attack them and force them back into the Demonic Realm simply because they are demons? How do you think that will turn out?\"","\"...\"","Silence.","Yuan then spoke, \"Nothing? In that case, I will tell you that it will only lead to another all-out war with the demons, and quite frankly, our world is not prepared to face them.\""]},{"number":2520,"title":"Chapter 2520: Revealing the Truth to the Nine Heavens(2)","paragraphs":["After a long moment of silence, someone in the crowd nervously asked, \"What do you mean when you say we are not prepared to face the demons? Are you saying that we would lose in an all-out war against the Demonic Realm?\"","\"That’s correct,\" Yuan answered in a loud and clear voice, instantly dumbfounding countless people present.","He continued in a grave tone, \"That is precisely what I am trying to say. If the Nine Heavens were to clash against the Demonic Realm in a full-scale war, we would be completely at their mercy.\"","\"There’s no way!\"","\"How is that possible?!\"","Yuan then explained, \"Time flows much faster in the Demonic Realm than it does in the Nine Heavens, and a single year there is equivalent to roughly a single day here.\"","\"This means that, in terms of cultivation, they have already surpassed us by an unimaginable margin.\"","He paused briefly to let them digest this information before continuing in a solemn voice, \"Not only are Cultivation Gods as common as weeds in the Demonic Realm, but they have already discovered the realm beyond the Cultivation God Realm.\"","\"WHAT?!\"","Countless shocked gasps and cries instantly erupted throughout the venue the moment they heard those words, many staring at Yuan with wide eyes filled with disbelief.","Cultivation Gods as common as weed? A realm beyond what they considered the peak of cultivation? This was hard to believe, even though it was coming from a legend like the Divine Paragon.","However, some people were shocked for entirely different reasons.","Suddenly, one of them raised their hand and nervously asked, \"Senior... if time truly flows much faster in the Demonic Realm... then wouldn’t cultivators who train there become far stronger in much less time than those who remain in the Nine Heavens?\"","Yuan nodded before responding, \"Yes, those who cultivate in the Demonic Realm would indeed progress much faster... provided they can actually survive the environment there. The very air within the Demonic Realm is vastly different from that of the Nine Heavens, and most people would struggle to remain there for extended periods of time.\"","\"Then how come you seem fine? If you’ve been there for millions of years in our world... that means you’ve spent billions of years over there!\"","\"Don’t compare me to ordinary people,\" Yuan sneered. \"Not only do I possess a special constitution, but I have also consumed countless demon cores over the years, which greatly helped me adapt to the environment of the Demonic Realm.\"","The crowd once again fell into silence after hearing Yuan’s arrogant yet undeniable words.","A moment later, Yuan continued speaking, \"If any of you wish to visit the Demonic Realm, then by all means, go ahead.\"","He then narrowed his eyes at the crowd and added, \"However, if you yourselves are unwilling to coexist with demons in our world, then what makes you think they would willingly allow you to cultivate in theirs?\"","\"...\"","\"Anyway, let’s move on to the next topic and delve into the origin of demons. After learning about their origin, some of you might have an easier time accepting them.\"","\"As all of you already know, demons closely resemble humans, whether it be their physique, limbs, or facial features. Sure, they may possess different skin tones or certain distinct traits, but overall, the similarities between us are undeniable.\"","\"In fact, this resemblance becomes even more pronounced among higher-ranking demons. Hell, there are demons in the Demonic Realm that are indistinguishable from humans, and there is a reason for that.\"","Yuan took a deep breath before revealing what was perhaps the most shocking piece of information yet.","\"That’s because demons... used to be human at one point in time.\"","\"...What?\"","Everyone present, aside from the Demon Sealers, stared at Yuan with expressions filled with bewilderment and disbelief, many of them gawking openly as though they had just heard the most absurd statement in their entire lives.","\"Demons were once humans,\" Yuan repeated, his voice clearly echoing throughout the stunned silence.","\"However, a certain catastrophe eventually befell them, transforming them into what we now know as demons.\"","He then shook his head slightly before adding, \"Unfortunately, I cannot reveal the details behind that catastrophe, so don’t bother asking.\"","When Yuan immediately shut down the very question lingering in everyone’s minds, the silence that followed became even heavier and longer than before.","\"Well, that’s pretty much all I have to say. If you have any questions, feel free to approach me and ask, as I will be available for questioning for as long as the banquet lasts—seven days.\"","Yuan then looked at the Demon Sealers and said, \"Let the banquet officially begin!\"","Immediately, the Demon Sealers started serving food and drinks, and some of them even started playing the instruments and dancing on a nearby platform.","Despite how sudden and weird it felt at first, people started approaching Yuan shortly after.","\"Senior Divine Paragon—\"","\"You can just use my real name.\"","\"Then, Senior Tian... Can you tell me more about what you saw in the Demonic Realm?\"","\"Of course. What do you want to know?\"","Thus, the banquet officially began.","It didn’t take long before a huge crowd gathered around Yuan, listening to his stories and adventures inside the Demonic Realm.","\"Do you truly believe that we will be able to coexist with demons?\" someone asked.","\"I believe they deserve a chance, and I used to be the biggest demon hater,\" Yuan chuckled.","\"I know I can’t ask you about the catastrophe that turned them into demons, but what about your reason for not telling us? Wouldn’t it be better to tell us so we can prepare for and prevent it?\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"There’s no need to prepare for it, as it’s not an illness or disease, but that’s all I will say.\"","\"Then are demons contagious?\" someone suddenly asked in a tense voice. \"If we want to coexist, we first need to know whether there’s any chance of humans turning into demons simply by being around them.\""]},{"number":2521,"title":"Chapter 2521: Final Day of the Banquet","paragraphs":["\"Contagious?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow after hearing the question before quickly shaking his head.","\"No, it is not possible for us to become demons simply by being near them. While it is true that demons were once human, they are not exactly the same as us. There are fundamental differences between our races, and the thing that turned them into demons could only affect them.\"","After a brief pause, he added, \"Not only that, but I have consumed their blood directly, and it did not affect me. That being said, since I have a unique constitution, things might be different for others.\"","\"Senior, you mentioned a realm above Cultivation God. Can you elaborate on that?! Have you seen their prowess? How much stronger are they?\"","Yuan nodded and calmly replied, \"Not only have I seen one, but I have even directly clashed against one. In the Demonic Realm, they have an entirely different cultivation system, and a Cultivation God is called a True God there. As for the realm above True God, that would be Absolute God.\"","\"An Absolute God is incredibly powerful, so powerful that I wouldn’t be surprised if even a single one of them could completely destroy the Nine Heavens.\"","\"A single one could destroy the Nine Heavens?! They’re that powerful?!\"","The people gasped in shock after hearing this information, unsure how to feel about such a threat looming over their heads.","Many people turned to look at the entrance to the Demonic Realm that was not far away from the venue and swallowed nervously.","\"How... how many of these Absolute Gods exist in the Demonic Realm?\" someone suddenly asked in a nervous voice.","\"Several,\" Yuan answered without hesitation.","The entire venue instantly fell silent.","The realization that multiple demons possessed strength capable of potentially ending their world left countless people speechless, their faces pale with shock.","\"What’s with the gloom and doom?\" Yuan suddenly said, \"I have spoken with some of the strongest demons in the Demonic Realm, and they promised not to attack the Nine Heavens. Moreover, they despise the Forsaken just as much as us.\"","Some time later, the guests continued asking Yuan questions.","\"Senior! Are you married? If not, what about a partner? Are you looking for one?\"","\"I am not married, but I am already committed to someone.\"","\"Who is this lucky woman?!\"","Yuan shook his head with a calm smile, refusing to go into detail.","\"Let’s stay away from personal affairs.\"","Time passed, and after an entire day of answering questions from guests in the courtyard, Yuan went outside to speak with those who couldn’t enter the venue due to overcrowding.","The guests outside the venue were overjoyed and even somewhat grateful that Yuan had not ignored them.","As a result, they enthusiastically greeted him and eagerly engaged in conversation whenever given the opportunity.","As the days passed, people would leave the banquet, but even more would show up to witness the legendary Divine Paragon with their own eyes.","On the final day of the banquet, a certain individual approached Yuan.","\"Hello, Senior Tian. My name is Xiang Biyu.\"","\"What would you like to ask me, Lady Xiang?\" Yuan greeted her with a calm expression.","\"...\"","Xiang Biyu did not respond, merely staring at his face with a dazed expression.","\"Lady Xiang?\" Yuan called out to her a moment later when she remained silent.","Xiang Biyu finally blinked and spoke, \"This is not a question, but rather a request.\"","\"When you have the time, would you visit me at the Divine Essence Monastery? There is something important I need to tell you.\"","\"...\"","The guests who were familiar with Xiang Biyu were instantly stunned by her words.","After all, the Divine Essence Monastery had strictly forbidden the presence of men ever since its creation. Yet here she was, openly inviting a man to visit the monastery in front of hundreds of thousands of people.","To many of them, this was just as shocking as some of the revelations Yuan had shared today.","\"I will visit when I have time,\" Yuan calmly nodded after a moment of silence.","\"Thank you.\"","Without saying anything else, she turned around and walked away.","However, Xiang Biyu stopped a few steps later when she realized that a certain someone wasn’t following behind her.","She turned around, and to her surprise, this individual was standing in front of the Divine Paragon, silently staring at him.","\"Do you have a question for me?\" Yuan asked the veiled figure standing before him.","Instead of answering, her hands slowly rose toward the veil covering her face, as though she intended to remove it and reveal her appearance to everyone present.","However, just as she began lifting the veil, Yuan suddenly looked away from her with a frown on his face, as did many people present.","\"W-What is this presence?!\"","Moments later, people began noticing countless silhouettes approaching from a distance.","Before long, tens of thousands of figures could be seen advancing from all directions, gradually surrounding the entire venue.","\"D-Demons! Demons have appeared!\"","The people exclaimed with shock and disbelief.","Yuan slowly ascended into the air, his expression calm as he faced the massive army of demons surrounding the venue.","\"Quite bold of you to come here knowing that I am present,\" he said, his voice carrying clearly across the void.","The very next moment, a single figure emerged from the sea of demons and flew forward to confront him.","\"Q-Qian Chu?!\"","The Demon Sealers instantly recognized the individual and cried out in shock.","After all, the person leading this enormous force of demons was none other than Qian Chu—the former Clan Leader of the Demon Sealing Clan.","The sight of a man who had recently led the Demon Sealing Clan now appearing among the demons left them utterly stunned.","\"Isn’t that Qian Chu, the previous Clan Leader of the Demon Sealing Clan?\"","\"I heard rumors that he had been working with the demons, but I never truly believed them... until now, that is...\"","The guests stared at the scene with widened eyes, silently wondering what was happening."]},{"number":2522,"title":"Chapter 2522: The Appearance of an Ancient","paragraphs":["\"Aren’t you the one I encountered during the Demon Slaying Parade and the previous leader of the Demon Sealing Clan? What are you doing here with an army of Forsaken?\" Yuan calmly questioned Qian Chu, deliberately calling them Forsaken rather than demons.","He then swept his cold gaze across the vast army of demons before him, continuing with a mocking smile.","\"Don’t tell me you came here seeking revenge. Unfortunately for you, even if you brought every single Forsaken in existence with you today, it still wouldn’t be enough to defeat me.\"","\"We will see about that,\" Qian Chu responded in a cold voice.","He raised his arm and continued, \"Today, I will make you pay for humiliating me, you fake Divine Paragon!\"","He aggressively swung his arm in Yuan’s direction and commanded, \"Kill the fake Divine Paragon! Afterward, kill everybody present!\"","In the next moment, the tens of thousands of demons rushed at Yuan.","\"Assist the Divine Paragon and protect the guests!\" Yan Hara shouted as she immediately flew toward Yuan, prompting the Demon Sealers to move as well.","However, before any of them could get close, Yuan’s voice rang out across the battlefield.","\"Do not interfere!\"","Yan Hara and the Demon Sealers instantly halted their movements before staring at Yuan with puzzled expressions, unable to understand why he would stop them when an entire army of demons stood before them.","Yuan ignored their confusion and kept his gaze fixed on Qian Chu.","A moment later, he spoke in a calm yet imposing voice.","\"Since you—and likely many others—believe that I am a fraud...\"","A faint smile appeared on his face as a tremendous surge of Demon Sealing Aura erupted from his body like a volcanic explosion, bursting outward in every direction.","The overwhelming aura instantly engulfed the entire venue, washing over every guest, Demon Sealer, and demon present alike.","In the blink of an eye, the heavens and earth seemed to tremble beneath its might.","\"Heavens!\"","The Demon Sealers exclaimed in unison, their faces filled with unmistakable awe and reverence.","Meanwhile, the demons that had been charging toward Yuan quickly slowed to a halt, with more than half of them being sealed by the aura alone.","The mere eruption of Yuan’s Demon Sealing Aura was enough to suppress and seal tens of thousands of demons on the spot, and the battlefield, which had seemed on the verge of descending into chaos only moments ago, suddenly became deathly silent.","It wasn’t just the demons who were affected by Yuan’s Demon Sealing Aura, either, as even the guests present could feel their bodies becoming stiffer while being bathed in it.","However, Yuan was just getting started, and the Demon Sealing Aura coming from him continued to intensify.","\"This is a little something I learned while I was in the Demonic Realm,\" Yuan remarked casually.","As soon as those words left his mouth, his Demon Sealing Aura began to change.","The once-overwhelming yet stable aura became violent and chaotic, surging like a raging storm that threatened to tear apart everything in its path.","The very next moment, anguished screams erupted from the demon army.","\"Aargh!\"","\"W-What is happening?!\"","The demons writhed in agony as the transformed aura washed over them.","Then, those who had already been sealed began to crack apart. Fine fractures rapidly spread across their petrified bodies before the cracks deepened and widened.","Moments later, they shattered into countless fragments before quickly crumbling into dust that vanished into the void.","As for those who were not sealed, their bodies began to break down directly, as if their existence were being erased.","In the span of a few breaths, over two hundred thousand demons had been reduced to nothingness, and Yuan had achieved it without so much as lifting a finger.","The entire battlefield fell into stunned silence as everyone stared at Yuan with expressions of horror and disbelief. Even many of the Demon Sealers felt chills run down their spines at the sight.","For the first time, they truly understood why the demons feared and avoided him like the plague.","\"Now that all of the Forsaken are gone, what are you going to do next? Fight me yourself?\" Yuan asked Qian Chu, who had a look of disgust, looking like he’d just swallowed a live fly.","Eventually, Qian Chu responded in a low, desperate voice, \"This isn’t over yet...\"","He suddenly retrieved an object from his spatial ring and laughed madly, \"Do you know what this is?! This is a treasure that will allow me to summon one of the strongest beings in the Demonic Realm—an Ancient!\"","Without another word, Qian Chu activated the treasure.","The very next moment, the space before Qian Chu suddenly split apart vertically, as if cut by a sword, and a massive tear appeared in the fabric of the void itself, revealing a dark and seemingly endless abyss beyond.","An oppressive aura immediately poured from the rift, causing the hearts of everyone present to tremble.","Then, from within that abyss, a solitary figure slowly emerged.","With a single step, the mysterious individual walked out of the rift, as though the abyss itself had given birth to their existence.","The figure that emerged from the abyss was a beautiful woman with incredibly pale, flawless skin and pitch-black eyes that seemed capable of devouring all light.","An unfathomable aura surrounded her entire being, making it impossible for anyone to gauge the depths of her strength.","The moment she appeared, a suffocating pressure descended upon the world, and many of the weaker cultivators immediately collapsed unconscious, while others dropped to their knees on the spot, unable to withstand her mere presence.","Even the experts present felt their hearts tighten and their breathing grow heavy.","It was as though the woman standing there was not a living being, but a walking calamity sent to end their existence.","\"What is this madness...?\" Yan Hara muttered as she stared at the woman, barely able to keep herself from falling to her knees.","Yuan narrowed his eyes at this woman, trying to remain calm, but the nervousness in his gaze was noticed by many people."]},{"number":2523,"title":"Chapter 2523: The Appearance of an Ancient(2)","paragraphs":["After the mysterious woman emerged from the rift, the entire venue fell into a deafening silence.","Nobody spoke or moved a muscle, and nearly everyone unconsciously held their breath, not even daring to breathe, as though they were prey instinctively trying to avoid attracting the attention of an apex predator.","The atmosphere was so oppressive that even the sound of a pin dropping would have seemed deafening.","However, it was not because the pale-skinned woman had threatened them, nor had she released any killing intent.","Her mere existence was enough.","Just by simply standing there, she exuded a presence so overwhelming that everyone instinctively understood one thing... that if such a being wished for their deaths, there was nothing they could do to resist.","And for many, including experts who have experienced countless life-or-death situations, it was the first time in their live they were experiencing this level of fear.","Eventually, the suffocating silence was broken, and it was the mysterious woman who broke it.","She slowly turned her pitch-black eyes toward Qian Chu and asked in a calm yet chilling voice, \"Are you the one who summoned me?\"","\"Yes.\" Qian Chu acknowledged without hesitation before pointing directly at Yuan. \"I want you to help me kill that bastard and destroy this world.\"","\"...\"","The woman slowly turned her gaze toward Yuan.","Then, without even looking back at Qian Chu, she casually swung her arm.","The movement was simple and unremarkable. Yet, what followed left everyone frozen in shock.","Her target was not Yuan but Qian Chu, and before he could react, his entire body was turned into a bloody mist before quickly vanishing into the void.","One moment he existed, and the next he was gone. Not only was his physical body erased, but even his soul was completely annihilated, leaving him zero chance of reincarnation.","The crowd stared at the empty space where Qian Chu had been hovering moments ago, their minds unable to process what they had just witnessed.","Meanwhile, the woman’s expression remained completely indifferent, as though she had merely swatted away an insignificant insect.","\"How dare an insignificant being command me?\" she sneered in disdain, revealing her reason for killing Qian Chu.","She then looked around, seemingly examining her surroundings and situation.","\"This is your world, correct?\" the woman asked, focusing her gaze on Yuan.","\"That’s right. It’s been a while, Annabella,\" Yuan responded with her name, revealing that he was familiar with her.","A cold smile appeared on Annabella’s face before she laughed madly, \"So this means I am no longer in the Demonic Realm? Hahaha! This is great! As this means you’re no longer being protected by that woman, and that I can finally kill you!\"","\"You weren’t able to kill me inside the Demonic Realm even when I was alone, so what makes you think you can kill me here?\" Yuan coldly sneered.","\"You will experience it for yourself soon,\" she said. \"And after I kill you, I will enslave every single human being in this world just to spite you—even if you’re already dead!\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes and silently stared at her for a moment before declaring out loud, \"Listen carefully, everyone! This is a Forsaken who has ascended beyond the realm of Cultivation God and entered the realm of Absolute God! Not only that, but she has always desired to conquer the Nine Heavens and make it her playground! If it weren’t for the demons’ assistance, I would’ve never been able to stop her from invading this world! Unfortunately, Qian Chu has brought her to our world!\"","\"Today, you will witness what an Absolute God is capable of and why we’ll never survive an all-out war with the demons if we point our weapons at them!\"","The next moment, Yuan retrieved the Demon Annihilation Sword and pointed it in Annabella’s direction before asking in a cold voice, \"Any last words before I kill you?\"","\"GO TO HELL!\" Annabella roared as she unleashed her aura.","If her mere presence had been suffocating before, then what followed was akin to the descent of a natural disaster.","BOOM!","An overwhelming wave of pressure exploded from her body, sweeping across the Starry Sky, even reaching the Seventh Heaven and Eighth Heaven.","The very fabric of space itself seemed to collapse beneath its weight, and everyone in the area instantly fell to their knees, unable to withstand the crushing force.","\"A-Activate the defensive formation!\" Yan Hara commanded while blood dripped from the corner of her lips.","Seconds later, a massive defensive formation enveloped the whole venue and everyone there besides Yuan, protecting them from some of Annabella’s unfathomable aura and allowing them to breath properly again.","Shortly after the defensive formation was put up, Zhou Yanfei approached Yan Hara with rushed movements and apologized with teary eyes and bloodied lips, \"I-I sincerely apologize for doubting you, Leader Yan! You were right to be cautious and set up this defensive formation ahead of time! If it weren’t for you, we would’ve all been crushed by that monster’s pressure and died just now!\"","It wasn’t just Zhou Yanfei, as multiple Demon Sealers apologized to Yan Hara the following moment. After all, many of them had questioned her decision to prepare a defensive formation while they were building the venue.","In their eyes, the banquet would have top experts from around the world and even the Divine Paragon himself present, so such caution was needless worry.","However, Yan Hara was adamant about preparing the defensive formation, as if she had foreseen this situation.","Hearing their words and apologies, Yan Hara shook her head and replied, \"I do not deserve your gratitude, nor can I take credit for preparing the defensive formation in advance, as I was simply following the Divine Paragon’s instructions.\"","\"T-The Divine Paragon...?\" Zhou Yanfei mumbled with a dazed look on his face.","Yan Hara nodded and elaborated, \"The Divine Paragon said he had a gut feeling that something might happen during the banquet, so he requested me to prepare accordingly.\"","\"I-Is so that...\"","After recovering from their shock, everyone shifted their focus to Yuan, who was surging with even more Demon Sealing Aura than previously as he clashed with Annabella."]},{"number":2524,"title":"Chapter 2524: Last Resort","paragraphs":["Shortly after the defensive formation went up, Annabella’s aura soared even higher. It was to the point where even the barrier blocked most of her aura; it was still strong enough to cause great discomfort to many of the guests present.","Not wanting to look weak, Yuan also unleashed as much Demon Sealing Aura as he could.","As both of their auras reached their peak, their figures abruptly vanished from sight.","For a brief split second, it was as though they had disappeared from existence entirely.","Then—","A violent ripple suddenly erupted across the Starry Sky, spreading outward like a colossal wave, and before anyone could even process what had happened, their figures reappeared, already clashing.","The collision of their powers detonated with a force that shook the surrounding space, warping and twisting it, almost as if whirlpools had appeared in the Starry Sky.","On their second exchange, cracks spread in the fabric of space around them, while torrents of chaotic energy erupted in every direction, strong enough to push the venue further into the distance.","\"Heavens! Is that the prowess of an Absolute God?! That’s several times stronger than a Cultivation God!\"","The cultivators watched the battle with a mixture of horror and fascination etched across their faces.","On one hand, they were terrified of Annabella’s unfathomable strength—a power so overwhelming that it could likely erase their entire existence with little effort.","On the other hand, they could not help but admire her profound cultivation.","After all, she had reached a realm that they had not even known existed until recently, and it was human nature to admire the strong.","To many of the experts present, it felt like they were witnessing the beginning of a new era.","Every movement she made seemed to contain profound truths beyond their comprehension, while every clash between her and Yuan revealed a glimpse of a world far above their own.","Of course, it was not just Annabella who earned the cultivators’ admiration. If anything, their attention was drawn even more toward Yuan.","Despite facing a being whose mere presence could suffocate the Nine Heavens, he was not only holding his ground but actively contesting her.","To many of the spectators, that was even more incredible than Annabella’s frightening strength, and every exchange between them only deepened the crowd’s admiration for him.","As Yuan had mentioned earlier, many guests there doubted his identity as the Divine Paragon. However, upon witnessing his fight with Annabella, all of their doubt and suspicions vanished like smoke.","Meanwhile, as they clashed, Yuan communicated with Annabella through a unique method that could not be intercepted, \"I know we’re just pretending, but you should really fight with the intention of killing me to make it more believable, Angela.\"","Annabella was none other than Angela, who was pretending to be a Forsaken to scare the Nine Heavens.","\"I am just getting warmed up!\" she laughed as her aura suddenly increased again.","This entire time, Angela had been fighting without using her powers as an Absolute God, relying solely on ordinary Celestial Qi.","As for Yuan... he was also restricted to using only Demon Sealing Aura and had no intention of transforming or using Eternal Essence.","BOOM!","Once Angela began utilizing Refined Celestial Essence, her aura underwent a drastic transformation. The already overwhelming pressure surrounding her became even more domineering and suffocating, rising to an entirely different level.","\"What is that energy?! Her aura is completely different now!\"","Angela’s presence was so powerful that the defensive formation was being damaged merely by the shockwaves generated from it.","At that moment, everyone present gained a deeper understanding of just how terrifying a being beyond the Cultivation God Realm truly was.","A genuine nervous smile tugged at Yuan’s lips as he faced Angela’s pressure.","’It’s several times stronger than the Supreme Ancestor...’ he thought inwardly.","Unlike the Supreme Ancestor, who could barely control his power, Angela’s control over her Refined Celestial Essence reached near perfection, allowing her to wield it with precision and more efficiently.","Yet, even with near-perfect control, Yuan could tell that the Refined Celestial Essence was still damaging her.","’Truly a double-edged sword...’ Yuan thought.","Shortly afterward, the two of them clashed once again.","This time, however, the outcome was noticeably different.","The moment they collided, a devastating shockwave erupted across the Starry Sky as Yuan’s figure shot through space, leaving behind a trail of shattered void.","Although the spectators hoped Yuan could overcome it, none were really surprised that he could no longer keep pace with Angela after she began using Refined Celestial Essence.","However, Yuan refused to give up and continued fighting back with unwavering determination.","Unfortunately, each exchange only made the disparity between them more obvious.","Their clashes continued to shake the Starry Sky, but with every collision, Yuan was pushed farther and farther back.","<Demon Annihilation Array!>","With a mere breath from Angela, the array shattered into countless fragments.","<Demon Annihilation Legion!>","With a mere swing of her arm, the entire army was annihilated.","Yuan threw everything he had at Angela, but without the assistance of Eternal Essence, he was nowhere near her level.","’I guess it’s about time, huh?’ Yuan sighed inwardly.","After taking a deep breath, he loudly declared, \"I will kill you today, even if it’s the last thing I do in this life!\"","\"You’re all talk, Tian Chenyu!\" Angela laughed madly.","Yuan gritted his teeth and used Void Manipulation to get behind Angela before embracing her tightly from behind.","\"What do you think you are doing?\" Angela sneered with clear disdain.","\"I will admit that I am not strong enough to defeat you normally,\" Yuan said.","\"That’s why I am going to take you down with me.\"","\"What?\" Angela frowned.","\"This is my last resort.\"","Suddenly, Yuan’s aura surged violently, the energy surrounding him rapidly condensing into a single point within him, gathering with such intensity that even the surrounding space began to distort.","When the spectators witnessed this scene, realization immediately dawned upon them, and their expressions twisted with shock and disbelief.","\"N-No...\"","\"He can’t be...\"","\"Divine Paragon!\"","Cries erupted throughout the venue as despair filled their hearts.","Some clenched their fists until blood dripped from their palms, while others lowered their heads, unable to continue watching.","\"I’ll leave the Demon Sealing Clan in your hands, Leader Yan!\" Yuan shouted with a smile, his voice echoing across the Starry Sky.","The next moment, Yuan ignited the condensed energy. In an instant, it expanded from within him and erupted into a blinding light that illuminated the Starry Sky, resembling the birth of a radiant sun.","\"Senior Tian!\" Yan Hara cried out loud as the light consumed both Yuan and Angela’s figures."]},{"number":2525,"title":"Chapter 2525: Divine Paragon’s Sacrifice","paragraphs":["The small sun in the void caused by Yuan’s sacrifice did not fade until many moments later, and when it finally did, Yuan and Angela were nowhere to be seen, as if they’d been erased from existence.","Yet, nobody moved or spoke, merely staring at the empty void with blank expressions on their faces.","After a long moment of silence, someone finally broke the silence and muttered in a dazed voice, \"S-Soul... Soul Rupture... the Divine Paragon detonated his soul just to defeat that monster...\"","Soul Rupture functioned similarly to Dantian Destruction, a forbidden technique in which a cultivator destroyed their own Dantian—the very source of their cultivation—to unleash immense destructive power. Naturally, such a drastic measure was only taken in the most desperate life-or-death situations.","When a cultivator used Dantian Destruction, their cultivation would perish entirely. However, there remained a slim chance that they could survive and eventually rebuild their Dantian.","Soul Rupture, however, was different. Although it was several times more powerful than Dantian Destruction, there was no coming back from it. Using it meant certain death, and even the soul itself would perish afterward, leaving the individual without any chance of reincarnation.","Because of this, almost nobody would dare to use such a technique, even in the face of certain death. At the very least, death still offered the possibility of reincarnation, whereas Soul Rupture erased even that final hope.","Hell, even a madman would hesitate to resort to such a technique.","\"Yuan... why...?\" Yan Hara fell to her knees and muttered in a voice as faint as a mosquito’s buzz from a mile away, tears streaming down both sides of her face.","When she had asked Yuan how he intended to live as both the Divine Paragon and Yuan, his answer had been to kill off the Divine Paragon. Because of that, she already knew that the Divine Paragon would eventually die.","However, she had never expected Yuan to use Soul Rupture—a technique that would kill both of them. This made her wonder if something had gone wrong.","\"Why...?\" Xiang Biyu mumbled, her face dazed and her eyes unfocused. \"Why did this have to happen?\"","The Holy Maiden standing beside her remained as still as a statue. Although her expression was hidden behind her veil, tears could be seen dripping from beneath it, staining her pure-white robes with dark spots.","Unfortunately for everyone present, the situation was far from over. Before anyone could truly mourn the Divine Paragon’s death, a familiar presence suddenly enveloped the area.","\"T-This pressure?! That monster didn’t die?! How is that possible?!\"","Panic erupted among the people when they realized that the Absolute God—the Forsaken that the Divine Paragon had sacrificed his life to kill—was still alive.","\"I am getting out of here!\"","It didn’t take long for people to start fleeing from the venue.","However, before they could get far, a massive barrier rose around the area, completely trapping them inside.","\"Who gave you insignificant insects permission to leave?\"","An unfamiliar voice resounded through the area. Then, right before everyone’s eyes, many of those who had tried to escape suddenly exploded into bloody mist, dying in the same gruesome manner as Qian Chu had earlier.","In the blink of an eye, thousands of people perished. Because there were so many of them, their blood did not immediately vanish; instead lingering in the void like raindrops.","A moment later, the people finally saw the one behind the voice and the slaughter—a beautiful woman with features strikingly similar to the Forsaken the Divine Paragon had killed.","\"H-How...? Where did she come from?!\"","Yan Hara suddenly realized something and turned to look in the direction of the Demonic Realm.","\"The seal is gone!\" she exclaimed.","\"It must have disappeared with the Divine Paragon’s death!\" someone remarked.","\"Silence!\"","The woman roared as she slowly appeared before them, looking as though the Goddess of Death herself had descended upon the world.","\"I’m impressed... shocked, even, that a mere ant managed to kill my sister,\" she said in a grim voice, her pressure gradually intensifying.","When she reached the defensive formation protecting them, she gently blew on it, instantly shattering it into countless pieces.","\"Although her death was unexpected and saddening...\" After a brief pause, she suddenly burst into maniacal laughter. \"At least this means I won’t have to share this world and its resources with her anymore!\"","Her pitch-black eyes, brimming with bloodlust and malice, swept over the people before her.","Then, she continued in a voice trembling with delight, \"With that annoying bug Tian Chenyu gone, I won’t have to worry about his annoying buzzing while I feast upon his world!\"","\"You insignificant ants should be grateful for the honor of becoming my nourishment!\"","She looked around before muttering, \"But there are so many of you that I am having trouble picking my first meal...\"","Suddenly, her eyes narrowed on a certain individual, and a sinister smile tugged at her lips as she pointed at them.","\"I’ll make you my first meal.\"","After saying that, she vanished like a ghost before reappearing directly in front of her target.","\"Leader Yan!\"","The Demon Sealers cried out loud when the demon appeared in front of Yan Hara.","\"P-Protect the Clan Leader!\" Zhou Yanfei shouted in a trembling voice before instinctively attacking the woman.","However, the others were so terrified of the woman that they couldn’t even move, much less attack her.","\"What the hell are you doing?!\" Zhou Yanfei shouted angrily. \"If we don’t kill her, not only will we all die, but this entire world will be finished! We can no longer rely on the Divine Paragon to save us from these monsters!\"","Almost immediately after Zhou Yanfei’s words rang out, another individual sprang into action and attacked the woman.","However, she was not a Demon Sealer, but the Holy Empress—Xiang Biyu!","Still with tears flowing down her face, she loudly declared, \"I’ll kill you even if it costs me my life!\"","After blocking their attack without any effort, the woman replied with a cold smile, \"I don’t mind getting a little exercise before my meal. It will only make it taste that much better, after all.\""]},{"number":2526,"title":"Chapter 2526: An Undefeatable Monster","paragraphs":["Shortly after the Holy Empress made her move, others began finding the courage to join the fight. However, what truly spurred them into action were Zhou Yanfei’s words.","If they failed to bring down this monster, there would be no future for them—or the Nine Heavens. Even if every last one of them had to die there, they had no choice but to fight.","Fueled by this realization, the hundreds of thousands of people present launched their attacks at the woman, with more joining in every passing moment.","Unfortunately for them, their attacks had no effect on the woman. She was an Absolute God, while not a single Cultivation God was present among them.","\"Hahaha! How hilarious! Your futile efforts, I mean!\" the woman laughed madly as she calmly allowed their attacks to strike her body, only for her to emerge completely unscathed.","The entire banquet venue was quickly destroyed, reduced to countless tiny fragments that drifted deeper into the void.","At first, the woman did not seem interested in attacking and merely allowed their strikes to land on her. However, that did not last long. Before anyone could react, she began slaughtering them one after another, turning them into bloody mist.","\"I don’t want to kill too many of you since I prefer my meals fresh and alive,\" the woman remarked with a sinister grin on her face, sending chills down the spines of everyone who saw her expression.","\"It’s hopeless! Without the Divine Paragon, we have no chance of stopping this monster!\"","After personally facing an Absolute God, they finally understood just how overwhelming—and utterly unbeatable—such an existence truly was.","\"Is this all you’ve got?! Struggle a little harder! Entertain me more!\" the woman laughed as her aura began surging with even greater intensity.","\"She’s still holding back?! Just how powerful is she?!\"","\"It’s over... It’s all over...\"","One by one, the people began lowering their weapons.","The determination in their eyes faded, replaced by despair and helplessness. Many even lowered their heads, no longer able to muster the will to continue fighting.","After just a few short exchanges, they realized the truth—that the being standing before them was simply too powerful... too overwhelming... and too far beyond their understanding.","To them, she was an existence that could not be defeated or defied.","And so, one after another, they abandoned any thoughts of victory and resigned themselves to their fate.","\"Do not give up!\" Yan Hara shouted, blood staining her robes as she struggled to remain conscious.","\"The Divine Paragon did not sacrifice himself so that we could surrender!\"","Her voice rang across the battlefield, reigniting the fading spirits of many cultivators, especially the Demon Sealers.","\"We will fight until our very last breath!\" she declared.","The woman looked at her for a moment before slowly shaking her head.","\"You still don’t want to give up?\"","A sigh escaped her lips, as though she were disappointed by their stubbornness.","\"I suppose I should stop playing around and show you the reality of defying me.\"","The next moment, she brought her hands together in front of her chest. The movement was slow and almost graceful, yet it caused countless people to tense instinctively.","Then, she began pulling her hands apart.","As her palms separated, a tiny speck of black energy materialized between them.","At first, it was no larger than a grain of sand, but it rapidly grew larger as she continued spreading her arms.","The black energy seemed to devour everything around it, including the very void itself, as if it were a miniature black hole.","\"Heavens...\"","Yan Hara and many others muttered in a dazed voice as they stared at the woman, their pupils dilating.","Even though the woman was clearly not finished with the technique, they could tell that even in its unfinished state, it could easily wipe out everyone present in the blink of an eye.","\"Is this truly the end for us all?\" Yan Hara mumbled to herself.","Just as the black energy reached the size of a watermelon, the woman abruptly halted and frowned, quickly turning to look in the direction of the Demonic Realm.","Then, without warning, she tossed the black energy. However, to everyone’s astonishment, she did not target them and instead threw it toward the Demonic Realm.","The black sphere shot through the Starry Sky, streaking across the void with unfathomable power and consuming everything in its path, drastically growing larger and larger in size as it traveled.","Everyone watched in stunned silence as the sphere rapidly approached the entrance to the Demonic Realm.","Just as the energy was about to consume the entrance to the Demonic Realm, a slender figure suddenly appeared before it like a ghost and calmly extended a hand toward the incoming sphere before making a simple grasping motion.","The massive sphere, capable of erasing everything in its path, instantly compressed, quickly shrinking in size until it became as small as a pebble.","At that moment, the mysterious figure reached out and seized the pebble-sized sphere in their hand. Although the sphere had shrunk, the energy and raw power contained within it remained unchanged. Yet the figure grasped it barehanded, treating it as though it were nothing.","\"Selena!\" the woman roared angrily, a hint of fear flashing in her eyes.","The mysterious figure, Selena, suddenly vanished from where she stood and appeared before the woman like a ghost, instantly seizing her by the neck.","Then, she spoke in a low yet enraged voice. \"Tian Chenyu’s life tablet shattered... Did you kill him, Hela?\"","\"N-No!\" Hela immediately denied. \"I didn’t kill him! It was Annabella, and she’s already perished!\"","\"...\"","Selena did not respond.","Instead, she turned to look at Yan Hara and the others, seemingly trying to grasp the situation.","After a moment of silence, she spoke again. \"We promised Tian Chenyu not to harm the humans of this world, yet here you are... doing exactly that.\"","\"Bullshit! Annabella and I never agreed to such a thing! That was something you decided on your own!\" Hela shouted.","\"And as the Absolute Ruler of the Demonic Realm, my words are law. Since you defied them, I have no choice but to get rid of you.\""]},{"number":2527,"title":"Chapter 2527: Selena, Absolute Ruler of the Demonic Realm","paragraphs":["\"Get rid of me...?\" Hela sneered in disdain before swinging her arm at her own neck.","In an instant, her head flew from her body, allowing her to escape Selena’s grasp.","After retreating to a safe distance, Hela shouted angrily, \"Why the hell do you still care about your promise with Tian Chenyu when that bastard is already dead?!\"","\"Are you saying we should forget our promises the moment the other party is gone? How tasteless.\" Selena narrowed her eyes and replied. \"Besides, I am not doing this merely because of our promise. I also desire to coexist with the humans of this world.\"","\"There’s no way that will happen! They will never accept you!\"","\"Only time will tell...\"","\"If you are that adamant on siding with these pathetic and weak beings, then you can go ahead and do that! However, I want no part in your foolishness!\"","After saying that, Hela attacked Selena, unleashing even more power than before.","Seeing this, Selena merely shook her head in silence.","The moment Selena and Hela clashed, the collision of their energy made it seem as though the entire universe was trembling. The ripples of their battle even reached the Ninth Heaven, alarming countless experts—including the Celestial Emperor himself.","\"W-What is this crazy amount of energy?!\"","\"Not even a Cultivation God would be able to exude so much power!\"","\"Is it a treasure being born?!\"","Upon sensing the energy unleashed by Selena and Hela’s battle, many experts from the Ninth Heaven began making their way toward its source, completely disregarding the danger it might pose. Of course, this was simply the nature of cultivators—drawn to danger like moths to a flame.","Meanwhile, the Celestial Emperor commanded several squads of Heaven’s Mandate to investigate the source of the energy.","Since Heaven’s Mandate possessed teleportation treasures that allowed them to traverse the Nine Heavens with ease, they were naturally the first to arrive at the scene.","However, the moment they arrived, they were stunned speechless by what they witnessed, unable to comprehend it.","\"W-Wat the hell is going on here?! Who are those two fighting?!\" The soldiers quickly asked the others.","\"D-Demons... from the Demonic Realm...\" someone answered in a dazed voice.","\"Huh? Demons? Both of them? Why are they fighting with each other?\"","The answer only made them even more puzzled by the situation.","\"General, what should we do? Should we stop them?\" one of the soldiers suddenly asked.","\"Stop them?\" The General immediately frowned. \"Are you fucking insane? Can’t you sense their auras? The ridiculous energy being released from their clashes? Forget stopping them—we’d perish the moment we get too close! The only thing we can do here is wait until they are finished!\"","After a brief pause, he added, \"In the meantime, go gather information from everyone here!\"","\"Yes!\"","The soldiers immediately began questioning those who had been present since the beginning, and as they gained a deeper understanding of the situation, their shock only continued to grow.","However, before the soldiers could report back to their leader, the fight between Selena and Hela reached its climax.","\"Die.\"","Selena muttered in a low voice as she devoured Hela’s entire being with a massive black hole, erasing her from existence.","\"...\"","After killing Hela, Selena turned her attention toward the people of the Nine Heavens and began approaching them.","\"Do not come closer!\" The General of Heaven’s Mandate shouted with a fearful expression on his face, and his soldiers subconsciously raised their weapons, pointing them at her.","Seeing this, Yan Hara hastily shouted at him, \"Immediately lower your weapons! She’s not our enemy!\"","Normally, nobody would dare to command Heaven’s Mandate around, but in this situation, pretty much everyone there started yelling at them following Yan Hara’s words.","\"Lower your weapons, you idiots! Are you trying to get us all killed?!\"","Some of the people there even lunged at the soldiers to seize their weapons.","\"What the hell do you think you’re doing?! Unhand me!\"","\"You dare lay your hands on us?!\"","\"Shut the hell up!\"","\"Calm down, humans of the Nine Heavens,\" Selena suddenly spoke, her calm voice instantly bringing the commotion to a halt.","\"I am Selena, the Absolute Ruler of the Demonic Realm, and a friend of Tian Chenyu. Rest assured, I have no intention of harming anyone.\"","\"...\"","Everyone present fell silent, giving Selena their full attention.","\"First and foremost, allow me to apologize for what happened today. Had I dealt with the Forsaken ’Hela’ and ’Annabella’ sooner, none of this would have happened, and Tian Chenyu might still be alive...\"","\"I am aware that many of you fear demons because of what happened between you and the Forsaken in the past. However, as the ruler of the Demonic Realm, I promise you that such a tragedy will never happen again, and that we ordinary demons have no intention of fighting you. If anything, we wish for peace.\"","\"I understand that asking for coexistence between our worlds right now is impossible. That is why I will remain in this world for the time being, to clear up any misunderstandings, answer any questions you may have, and hopefully start a peaceful relationship between our worlds. Not only that, but I will also clean up all of the Forsaken that linger in this world—or any that may trespass into this world in the future.\"","Yan Hara and everyone present swallowed nervously at Selena’s words. Although they sounded too good to be true, it was also a fact that Selena protected them from Hela.","After a moment of silence, Selena spoke again, \"Now then... Who here is the closest or the most familiar with Tian Chenyu? I’d prefer starting with someone that I can trust.\"","Hearing Selena’s question, many people there turned to look at Yan Hara.","Seeing this, Yan Hara swallowed nervously before raising her hand and responding, \"T-That would be me... I am the leader of the Demon Seal—\"","She abruptly stopped mid-sentence and cleared her throat before continuing, \"Ahem... I am Senior Tian’s successor, Yan Hara.\""]},{"number":2528,"title":"Chapter 2528: He’s Still Alive","paragraphs":["After Yan Hara’s introduction, Selena suddenly vanished into the void before reappearing in front of her with a calm smile on her face.","\"You don’t have to be wary or try to hide the Demon Sealing Clan from me since I’ve already heard about it from Tian Chenyu.\"","\"Sorry, but I am a little overwhelmed right now, and I don’t think I will be able to have a proper conversation with you...\" Yan Hara responded after a moment of silence.","Selena nodded and said, \"Understandable, especially since you’ve just lost someone close to you. Take all the time you need.\"","However, at the same time, Selena spoke to Yan Hara via voice transmission, \"He’s still alive.\"","\"Huh?\" Yan Hara’s face immediately twisted in surprise, her eyes slowly widening with disbelief.","\"I said that he’s alive. Tian Chenyu, that is,\" Selena repeated, not worried that anyone there could intercept her voice transmission due to her vastly superior cultivation.","\"Now, repeat after me...\"","Yan Hara then spoke, following Selena’s instructions, \"I-If you don’t mind, would you like to stay at our headquarters in the meantime?\"","Selena quickly nodded.","\"Of course.\"","\"T-Then...\" Yan Hara turned to look at the others and declared, \"As much as I wish to say more, I am simply at a loss for words. Therefore, I ask everyone to return home and tend to your injuries. Once I have composed myself and spoken with Senior Selena, I will give a proper response regarding everything that happened today.\"","After saying that, Yan Hara turned around and began to leave, with the Demon Sealers quickly following behind her.","However, the General of Heaven’s Mandate suddenly shouted, \"Wait! You can’t leave until we are finished here!\"","Yan Hara halted at his words.","Without turning around, she responded, \"If you—or the Celestial Emperor—have any questions regarding today’s events, you may come to the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library at a later date. As I said earlier, I need some time.\"","Then, she continued on her way, quickly disappearing from their view.","The General trembled with anger after being ignored by Yan Hara—and in front of so many people, no less. However, there was nothing he could do. Just a single glance from Selena had shattered his courage, leaving him unable to utter another word.","Once Yan Hara—or more precisely, Selena’s presence—could no longer be sensed, the General turned to face the others and roared, \"Nobody else leaves until we finish our investigation! This is an order issued under my authority as the General of Heaven’s Mandate’s Third Squad! If anyone dares to disobey, I will have your head!\"","Soon, Heaven’s Mandate resumed questioning everyone present, refusing to let anyone leave until they had a clear understanding of the entire situation.","\"What? The Divine Paragon is dead?\" The General was shocked to learn this.","Once he had gathered enough information to understand the situation—or rather, its gravity—he immediately requested backup, as well as notifying the Celestial Emperor of everything.","\"To think the Divine Paragon would perish so quickly after his return... It’s almost comical.\" The Celestial Emperor shook his head after learning of Tian Chenyu’s death.","\"Absolute Ruler of the Demonic Realm, huh? If I had someone like that on my side, it would make getting rid of that bastard a lot easier...\"","Some time later, the Celestial Emperor summoned Heaven’s Mandate First Squad and commanded them to visit the Demon Sealing Clan and invite the Absolute Ruler for a conversation with him.","At the same time, news of the Divine Paragon’s death, along with the information he had shared with everyone at the banquet, spread like wildfire, sending massive tremors throughout the Nine Heavens and shocking everyone to the core.","\"Huh? The Divine Paragon is dead? There’s no way!\"","\"It’s real! I heard that he’d sacrificed his own life to kill a demon with a cultivation above Cultivation God!\"","\"Did you hear? The Divine Paragon used Soul Rupture, sacrificing his life and chance of reincarnation just to protect our world!\"","\"There are two kinds of demons, and they all used to be human? What the heck am I supposed to do with this information?!\"","The Divine Paragon immediately became the hottest topic, mentioned in nearly every corner of the world. Because of his sacrifice, he became a hero again, becoming a legend whose fame somehow surpassed even his former glory as the savior of humanity.","Meanwhile, at the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library, a surprise awaited the Demon Sealers who had just arrived at the location.","\"D-Divine Paragon?!\"","The Demon Sealers were shocked to their core when they saw the Divine Paragon standing before the closed entrance to the library, each of them looking as though they had just seen a ghost.","\"How are you still alive after using Soul Rupture?!\"","\"Huh? What are you talking about? Soul Rupture? Why would I use such a dangerous technique?\" Yuan remarked with a confused expression on his face.","\"Yuan...?\" Yan Hara mumbled in a dazed voice after seeing his handsome face.","\"What? Yuan?\"","The Demon Sealers stared at Yuan in shock and bewilderment.","\"That’s right. I’m Yuan. That Divine Paragon joke is getting old, you know?\"","\"By Yuan... do you mean the Little Founder?! Fuck! You nearly gave us a heart attack!\"","\"Little Founder? Who the heck is that? If he’s not the Divine Paragon, then why does he look so similar? No, I’d even say he looks identical to the Divine Paragon!\" someone who used to belong to the Demon Sealing Grotto exclaimed.","\"He’s a talented Demon Sealer who joined the Demon Sealing Clan not long ago. He became famous for his striking resemblance to the Divine Paragon, which earned him the nickname ’Little Founder’...\" explained someone familiar with his story.","\"That being said... he was much younger the last time I saw him. Now that he has grown up, I truly cannot discern any difference between him and the Divine Paragon!\"","\"You can’t be serious... How can someone like that even exist? Are the Heavens mocking us...?\"","\"How can we be sure that he’s not the Divine Paragon messing with us?\"","\"Didn’t you all witness it yourself? The Divine Paragon used Soul Rupture... There’s no way he could’ve survived that...\"","\"...\"","Everyone fell silent shortly after, quietly staring at Yuan as though struggling to believe that he was not the Divine Paragon."]},{"number":2529,"title":"Chapter 2529: Little Founder’s Return","paragraphs":["After a long moment of silence, Selena suddenly spoke in a calm voice. \"Although he may look similar to Tian Chenyu, the resemblance is only on the surface. If you take a closer look, you can see clear differences.\"","\"S-She’s right! The Divine Paragon’s nose is a bit shorter, and his jaws are not as defined!\"","\"Now that you mention it, the Divine Paragon’s eyes are a bit rounder.\"","The Demon Sealers began to notice more and more differences between Yuan and the Divine Paragon after Selena’s words. Eventually, it reached the point where they could no longer see the Divine Paragon in Yuan.","Unbeknownst to these Demon Sealers, Yuan had purposefully adjusted the Divine Paragon’s facial features before returning to the Nine Heavens. After learning Bone Manipulation, he could adjust his appearance without any appearance-altering pills, something that would be easily detected by experts.","\"It’s unfortunate, but he’s really not the Divine Paragon...\"","Yuan frowned and said, \"I’ve already said from the beginning that I am not the Divine Paragon. What’s going on? And why do you all look like you’d been to hell and back?\"","Yan Hara responded with a question, \"Where have you been this entire time?\"","\"I was in seclusion,\" Yuan calmly answered. \"After coming out, I decided to come here, but the doors were sealed.\"","Yan Hara sighed and said, \"A lot has happened, but I’ll go through them with you, so come with me.\"","However, Zhou Yanfei suddenly said, \"Leader Yan, you can leave such mundane tasks to me or anyone else here. There’s no need for you to—\"","\"It’s fine. He’s my disciple, after all,\" Yan Hara quickly interrupted. \"I also happen to have some private business with him.\"","\"If Leader Yan insists... We’ll let you deal with him...\" Zhou Yanfei said.","\"I’m sure you’re all exhausted, both mentally and physically, so take some time to recover. With Senior Selena here, we won’t have to worry about demons—the Forsaken for now. However, we still have to deal with the Demon Worshippers later.\"","Some time later, Yan Hara brought Selena and Yuan into her private quarters.","The moment she closed the door and ensured the concealment formation inside was working properly, Yan Hara turned to face Yuan, took a deep breath, and shouted angrily, \"ARE YOU INSANE?!\"","Yuan subconsciously plugged his ears with his fingers and remarked, \"Are you trying to blow out my eardrums? Relax a little.\"","\"Relax?! Not only did you kill the Divine Paragon, but you also gave me a heart attack when you used Soul Rupture! How in heaven’s name did you even survive that?! Or was that some sort of trick?!\"","\"Oh, that was no trick,\" Yuan reassured her. \"I really did blow up my soul using Soul Rupture.\"","\"Then how the hell are you still alive?! Not even a Cultivation God could survive their soul being blown to bits!\"","Yuan chuckled, \"I have my ways.\"","\"...\"","Yan Hara fell silent, but the frown on her face remained.","\"Although you managed to fool everyone with the Divine Paragon’s death... at what cost? You never told me there would be real sacrifices. If you had, I would never have agreed to it.\"","\"Huh? What are you talking about?\" Yuan asked with a genuine puzzled face.","\"Are you really playing dumb with me right now? I am talking about all of the people who died! There were tens of thousands of deaths, you know!\"","Despite hearing that so many people had died, Yuan somehow managed to smile.","\"You—\"","\"Do you really think I’d go as far as killing random people just for the sake of my little show?\" Yuan interrupted Yan Hara just as she opened her mouth.","\"I thought you knew me better...\" Yuan sighed, shaking his head in disappointment.","\"B-But I saw it with my own eyes! Or are you trying to say that you’d somehow managed to fake that many deaths?\" Yan Hara exclaimed, puzzled by the whole situation.","\"No, those people really died,\" Yuan then said, bewildering her.","He quickly continued, \"However, they were all demons disguised as humans that I planted within the crowd before the banquet even began.\"","\"D-Demons...? Disguised as humans...?\"","Yuan nodded and elaborated, \"If nobody died during such a chaotic battle, it would have seemed suspicious and far less convincing.\"","He continued, \"There were a few things I wanted to achieve with the play today. First, I wanted the humans of the Nine Heavens to experience the terror and power of the Forsaken firsthand, so they would think twice before acting aggressively toward the demons who may visit in the future.\"","\"Second, I wanted to introduce Selena as their protector and as the ambassador of the Demonic Realm. That way, she could become the voice of both worlds—and hopefully, the bridge that connects the Nine Heavens and the Demonic Realm. She’s also proof that coexisting with demons is possible.\"","\"Third, I wanted the Divine Paragon to disappear for good. At the end of the day, the real Divine Paragon perished long ago and does not belong in this era. Moreover, while the Divine Paragon could try to convince the Nine Heavens to trust the demons, I have a feeling his existence would have the opposite effect and become a roadblock instead.\"","\"Lastly... well, it isn’t related to the Divine Paragon or the Demon Sealing Clan, so I’ll just skip it.\"","Yan Hara fell backward, kissing the floor with her buttocks after hearing Yuan’s explanation.","\"I apologize for keeping many things from you, but I needed it to be as convincing as possible,\" Yuan apologized a moment later.","\"What now...?\" Yan Hara asked after a full minute of silence.","\"I want you to work with Selena and create a future where both of our worlds can coexist. I know I am asking a lot from you, but you can do it as the Leader of the Demon Sealing Clan and successor of the Divine Paragon, right?\"","Yan Hara released a deep sigh and nodded in a defeated manner before responding, \"Even though I didn’t sign up for this... I guess it’s better than fighting demons for the rest of my life.\""]},{"number":2530,"title":"Chapter 2530: The Celestial Emperor’s Invitation","paragraphs":["\"If you need any help, I will also be here,\" Yuan said with a smile.","\"In that case, I will request your assistance immediately,\" Yan Hara said. \"You want the Nine Heavens and the Demonic Realm to coexist, but that is easier said than done.\"","\"There are two major roadblocks standing in the way of coexistence. Not only do the people of this world still fear demons, but we must also find a solution to demons turning into Forsaken.\"","Yuan quickly replied, \"I am well aware that it will not be easy, and that it could take a very long time. Hell, whether coexistence is even possible remains questionable. However, now that both worlds are clearly aware of each other’s existence, it is inevitable that they will interact more often in the future.\"","\"Cultivators from the Nine Heavens will venture into the Demonic Realm to advance their cultivation, while those from the Demonic Realm will visit the Nine Heavens out of curiosity. And once they discover the abundance of resources in our world, they will definitely want to interact with us more.\"","\"As for your main concerns... the people of the Nine Heavens’ distrust toward demons can be resolved with time and Selena’s presence. As for the Forsaken... I already have something in mind. However, since I am not certain it will work, I will not reveal it yet and raise your hopes unnecessarily.\"","Yan Hara then said, \"I’m not so sure people will learn to trust demons with time. Do you remember when someone asked you during the banquet if demons were contagious? There will be many more people with the same concern. Unless we can prove with certainty that it is safe to be around demons, I doubt anything will change.\"","\"What do you think?\" Yuan turned to look at Selena. \"You’re more knowledgeable than me in this aspect.\"","Selena pondered for a moment before answering, \"Since the mutation was created for the humans of my world, and the humans of this world are fundamentally different, it is highly unlikely that we would affect you simply by being nearby. However, if the humans of this world were to come into contact with our blood... or somehow merge with it... I cannot say what the results would be without experimenting.\"","Before Yuan could respond, Selena continued, \"I know you probably don’t want us to experiment on your people, so—\"","\"I have an idea,\" Yuan suddenly interrupted. \"You need humans for your experiments, right?\"","\"Yes...?\" Selena nodded, wondering where Yuan was going.","A smile tugged at Yuan’s lips as he continued, \"We happen to have humans who would be more than willing to participate in your experiments if we tell them there’s a chance they could become demons.\"","\"Y-You don’t mean...\" Yan Hara’s eyes and mouth widened when she realized what Yuan was thinking.","\"That’s right. I mean the Demon Worshippers. This way, they will finally serve some purpose and contribute to our world for once in their lives.\"","\"Of course, I am not saying we should force them to partake in these experiments. However, I have a feeling they wouldn’t say no.\"","\"I will keep this in mind when we capture them...\" Yan Hara nodded in a dazed manner.","\"Anyway, here are a few things to help you with your new responsibilities.\" Yuan retrieved a spatial ring and tossed it at Yan Hara.","After catching it, she immediately peeked inside.","\"T-This is...!\" Yan Hara’s eyes widened with bewilderment after seeing what was inside.","\"The rest of my techniques. Although it won’t be as useful anymore, I figured that you should still have them, especially when you’re my successor.\"","\"Thank you! I will treasure them!\"","Yan Hara and Yuan continued talking about the future of the Nine Heavens and the Demonic Realm until someone knocked on the door and announced they had guests.","\"Leader Yan! Heaven’s Mandate is here, and they wish to request an audience with Absolute Ruler Selena!\"","\"Heaven’s Mandate? What’s that?\" Selena asked with a raised eyebrow.","\"They’re the servants of the Celestial Emperor, who is the ruler of the Nine Heavens. You met them before,\" Yan Hara explained.","\"Ah, those foolish ones? What do they want from me?\"","\"Hard to say without meeting them...\"","\"They’re probably here because the Celestial Emperor wants to speak with her,\" Yuan suddenly said.","\"You sound confident. What makes you think so?\" Yan Hara asked with a curious face.","\"If you were a ruler of an entire world, what would you do if a ruler of another world suddenly visits yours?\" Yuan responded with a question. \"If it were me, I’d probably want to meet them and set some ground rules.\"","\"Set ground rules...? That only applies if the two of them are on equal standing...\" Yan Hara looked at Selena and recalled her terrifying prowess, thinking to herself that even the Celestial Emperor would not be able to make her bow.","However, if Selena offended the Celestial Emperor, it would definitely make coexisting with the Nine Heavens much more difficult.","\"Let’s see what they have to say,\" Selena said.","Yan Hara nodded before leaving to welcome Heaven’s Mandate.","Some time later, Yan Hara returned to the room with a small group.","\"We greet the Absolute Ruler of the Demonic Realm. We are Heaven’s Mandate, servants of the Celestial Emperor, ruler of the Nine Heavens.\"","The group hastily knelt on the ground and greeted Selena with lowered heads.","Under normal circumstances, Heaven’s Mandate would never bow to anyone but the Celestial Emperor, even under threat. However, this was a special situation, and the Celestial Emperor himself had ordered them to treat her as they would him.","\"What is your purpose for seeking an audience with me?\" Selena responded.","\"Our Master, the Celestial Emperor, has invited you to the Celestial Palace for a private conversation.\"","Selena smiled slightly and said, \"Normally, I wouldn’t accept such a half-assed invitation, but since I am a guest here, I’ll tolerate it once. As for my response to the Celestial Emperor’s invitation...\"","Selena’s eyes glanced at Yuan.","\"Go ahead,\" he said to her via voice transmission. \"You’ll have to meet with him sooner or later, anyway.\""]},{"number":2531,"title":"Chapter 2531: Two Reasons","paragraphs":["After hearing Yuan’s words, Selena responded to Heaven’s Mandate, \"Very well. I’ll meet your emperor.\"","They smiled inwardly after hearing this, and the General of the squad said, \"In that case, let’s leave immediately!\"","However, Selena narrowed her eyes and said, \"I will go when I am ready.\"","\"B-But His Majesty is waiting—\"","\"So what?\" Selena interrupted in a cold voice, her eyes narrowing slightly. \"Let us make something clear right now. Although I may be a guest here, do not order me around. I will tolerate your insolence this once, but if you treat me as though I am beneath your emperor and disrespect me again, I will punish you accordingly, regardless of your identity.\"","\"M-My apologies! I will watch my mouth from this moment forth!\"","The General trembled at Selena’s invisible pressure, his back soaked in cold sweat.","\"Then we will wait outside until you are ready to leave. Once you are ready, please let us know.\"","After saying that, Heaven’s Mandate swiftly retreated outside.","\"Are you sure you should be acting so arrogantly?\" Yan Hara asked in a concerned tone once they were alone again. \"The Celestial Emperor plays a crucial role in uniting our worlds. If you offend him... things will only become more difficult.\"","\"I have no intention of lowering my head to the emperor of this world,\" Selena calmly replied. \"If anything, he should be the one lowering his head to me, as the fate of this world currently rests in my hands.\"","\"Although I do not want the humans of this world to fear me, I also do not want them to look down on me. There must be a balance, or coexistence will be impossible.\"","Yuan suddenly said, \"As crazy as it sounds, the Immortal Monarch once united humans and beasts through fear and violence. That being said, I don’t think it would work as well in this situation.\"","Selena looked at him and asked, \"So, when do you want me to meet with this Celestial Emperor? And what do you want me to say to him? How should I act?\"","\"You can meet him as soon as I leave this place. As for what to say...\" Yuan paused for a moment before shrugging his shoulders. \"I couldn’t care less what you do as long as you don’t kill him.\"","Yan Hara’s jaw dropped at his words, and she quickly spoke, \"You don’t intend on going with her?\"","\"No, I have other things to do. Also, I don’t intend on meeting the Celestial Emperor unless I need to kill him.\"","\"What did you just say?\" Yan Hara’s eyes widened at his outrageous words, even doubting her own ears for a moment. \"You want to kill the Celestial Emperor? Why would you want to do that?\"","\"It’s not like I want to kill him, but if he continues to stand in my way, I will have no choice but to get rid of him.\"","\"...Just what is happening between you and the Celestial Emperor?\"","Yuan merely shook his head at her question.","\"Then when are you going to leave?\" Yan Hara changed her questions after realizing that Yuan didn’t want to continue talking about the Celestial Emperor.","\"Very soon.\"","\"In that case, before you leave, I want to let you know that I plan on hosting a proper funeral for the Divine Paragon. After all, it’d be weird if we don’t do one.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Do as you please.\"","After chatting for several more hours, Yuan left the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library alone.","Meanwhile, Yan Hara returned to her duties as the Demon Sealing Clan’s leader and began preparing for the Divine Paragon’s funeral. As for Selena, she went with Heaven’s Mandate to the Ninth Heaven to meet with the Celestial Emperor.","After leaving the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library, Yuan returned to Tian Qiyuan’s personal world, where Helena, Angela, and Mu Xuelian were waiting.","\"So, how did it go? Was it convincing enough?\" Angela asked him.","He nodded with a smile, \"More than enough.\"","Angela sighed before admitting, \"Even though it was an act, when you ruptured your soul, it really startled me for a second. Your Soul Strength is too strong for a mere mortal. If I wasn’t prepared for it, I would’ve probably died to it.\"","\"At least you weren’t forced to fight Selena. It’s been a while since I had such a fierce exchange with her,\" Helena shook her head.","\"So, where’s Selena right now?\" Angela then asked.","Yuan explained the situation and Selena’s whereabouts to them.","\"The Celestial Emperor, huh? I wonder what she’s going to do,\" Helena muttered.","\"As long as he doesn’t piss her off, it should be fine,\" said Angela.","Then, she turned to Yuan and continued, \"I know you picked Selena to become the representative because you think she’s more reasonable and less aggressive than Helena and me, but you haven’t seen what she’s capable of when she’s angry.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow at such words and inquired, \"What’s she like when she’s angry?\"","\"You don’t want to find out.\"","\"...\"","Yuan became speechless for a moment before clearing his throat and speaking, \"I... trust her.\"","A moment later, Yuan turned to look at a nearby individual and said, \"Anyways, let’s go speak with our new friend.\"","He walked several meters before standing before a man who was currently restrained.","\"How are you feeling, Qian Chu?\" Yuan asked him with a smile.","Everyone at the banquet had witnessed Qian Chu being annihilated by Angela, but unbeknownst to them, the Qian Chu that had been killed was just an avatar created by Angela, much like Supreme Ruler Umbra, and the real one was very much still alive.","\"Are you finally going to tell me why you kidnapped me instead of killing me?\" Qian Chu asked calmly despite his situation.","\"I have two reasons for sparing you... for now. Firstly, I’m interested in your goals. The other reason is that I want you to finish what you started and summon an ’Ancient’ for me.\"","\"You can’t be serious...\" Qian Chu stared at Yuan with widened eyes."]},{"number":2532,"title":"Chapter 2532: Removing Qian Chu’s Restraints","paragraphs":["\"Why the hell do you care about my goals? Moreover, why do you want me to summon an Ancient when you already have two of them standing right beside you?\" Qian Chu responded with a deep frown on his face.","\"Oh? You knew they were Ancients?\" Yuan muttered.","\"I am not stupid,\" he coldly sneered. \"Only an Ancient could possibly exude such a ridiculous presence, not to mention their ability to command the demons like slaves. I may have never seen an Ancient before, but I am aware of their capabilities.\"","\"Is that so? Well, is it really so strange that I want to know your goals? I don’t know how you escaped the purge and arrived in the Nine Heavens, but you could have lived a peaceful life. Yet instead, you chose to become the leader of the Demon Sealing Clan and scheme behind the scenes with the Forsaken. Since you’re already captured and have no way out, you might as well tell me everything and relieve yourself of some of that burden.\"","\"...\"","Qian Chu fell silent for a moment before responding in a low voice, \"My goal is simple. I want revenge against the demons for purging my kind, and the humans for assisting them.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and said, \"I understand your hatred for the demons, but I was the only human who helped them. Why bring the entire Nine Heavens into your mess?\"","A cold smile tugged at Qian Chu’s lips as he answered, \"Because human sacrifices are necessary to complete my second goal.\"","\"To summon an Ancient, correct? How does that work? These two are pretty certain that there’s no method to summon them.\"","\"If you remove the restrictions on me, I can demonstrate to you how it’s done,\" said Qian Chu with a mysterious smile. \"And you don’t need to worry about me running away.\"","\"Run away? That concern never even crossed my mind, as there’s no way for you to escape,\" Yuan said with full confidence.","Not only were there two Transcendents beside him, but he himself could easily catch Qian Chu if he attempted to escape.","\"Then why are you hesitating? Free me, and I’ll give you exactly what you want. Or, you can just kill me right now.\"","\"Free him,\" Angela suddenly said to Yuan. \"I want to see what kind of nonsense he has up his sleeves.\"","\"I am also curious,\" said Helena.","\"I was going to do that even if he didn’t say anything, but he clearly has an ulterior motive.\"","\"So what? No matter what happens, there’s nothing he can realistically do to us,\" Angela spoke with a calm smile.","Yuan pondered for a moment before saying, \"Let’s bring him outside before I remove his restraints.\"","Some time later, they left Tian Qiyuan’s world and brought Qian Chu somewhere in the Primordial Realm.","\"Don’t disappoint me now, Qian Chu,\" Yuan said to him before removing his restraints, allowing him to move and use his cultivation again.","After being released, instead of acting immediately, Qian Chu took his sweet time cracking his neck and stretching his limbs, acting like a prisoner who’d just regained their freedom.","Rather than being annoyed, Yuan was intrigued by Qian Chu’s behavior, as he was acting like someone who no longer cared about anything.","Qian Chu then lifted his head and gazed in a certain direction in the void, as though staring at something invisible to the naked eye.","\"Soon... I will avenge all of you...\" He muttered.","After saying those words, Qian Chu suddenly plunged his hand into his own chest and pulled out his heart.","Yuan raised an eyebrow at his puzzling actions but didn’t interrupt him.","Moments later, Qian Chu began mumbling in a language that Yuan could not understand, and in response, the heart in his grasp started to shrink, condensing into a perfectly round crimson bead.","Despite having a gaping hole in his chest and his heart ripped out, Qian Chu’s expression remained calm, almost tranquil, as if he were in a trance.","Then, without warning, he put the crimson bead into his mouth and swallowed it.","\"What the hell is he doing?\" Angela could no longer remain silent and questioned aloud.","\"He must have gone crazy,\" Helena remarked.","Shortly after Qian Chu swallowed his own heart, a small black sphere suddenly appeared at the center of his abdomen, and his body began to twist and contort in a surreal fashion, slowly consumed by it.","Once Qian Chu’s entire being disappeared, the black sphere began to expand until it became a portal that was large enough for a person to fit.","\"What in the...?\"","Not just Yuan, but the other two were dumbfounded by the turn of events.","However, before they could even figure out what Qian Chu had just done, a pale leg suddenly stepped out of the portal.","\"T-That’s—!\" Angela and Helena’s eyes widened with shock and disbelief when they saw the face of the individual who had just emerged from the portal.","\"L-Lucian!\" Helena shouted.","\"Lucian?\" Yuan stared at the individual before him, who had a similar appearance to that of all Transcendents, except that, instead of being a woman, he was a man.","\"You two...\"","The individual named Lucian narrowed his eyes at Angela and Helena for a brief moment before widening them in surprise.","\"Helena?! Angela?! What the hell are you doing here?!\" he exclaimed in shock.","\"We should be asking you that! How are you alive?! We witnessed the Demon God kill you back then with our own eyes!\" Anegla shouted back.","However, Lucian did not answer her question. Instead, his surprised expression quickly faded, and his gaze became eerily tranquil.","\"Lucian?\" Helena called out to him, but he remained unresponsive.","Suddenly, Yuan shouted at them, \"Get back!\"","In the next instant, immense killing intent surged from Lucian’s body, and he lunged at Angela and Helena, enveloped in a profound aura that felt disturbingly similar to Eternal Essence.","Although his sudden attack had taken them by surprise, Angela and Helena reacted quickly enough to avoid it.","\"What the fuck are you doing, you bastard!\" Angela roared angrily."]},{"number":2533,"title":"Chapter 2533: Lucian","paragraphs":["After barely avoiding his sneak attack, Angela and Helena stared at Lucian with wide eyes.","\"What the fuck are you doing, you bastard!\" Angela immediately shouted at him.","However, Lucian didn’t show even the slightest reaction on his face and lunged at them again for a second time.","\"Snap out of it, Lucian!\" Helena shouted at him.","\"Stop wasting your breath. He obviously can’t hear you,\" Yuan remarked as he calmly stood there.","Even though Yuan had blocked Lucian’s first attack, Lucian completely ignored him and went straight for the other two.","\"Why is he only attacking us?!\" Angela exclaimed with a puzzled face as she continued dodging Lucian’s attacks.","Yuan shrugged, \"Beats me.\"","\"Hey! Why are you just standing there and watching him attack us?! Come help us! He is using a weird energy that is similar to yours, and we cannot handle it alone!\" Helena shouted at Yuan.","Yuan sighed before confronting Lucian again. However, just like before, Lucian would completely ignore him, only going after Angela and Helena.","Seeing this, Yuan said to them, \"Since he is clearly targeting you two, get out of here. I will hold him back.\"","\"You want us to run away? No way!\" Angela immediately refused.","Helena then said, \"He is clearly suffering from some kind of affliction. We cannot abandon him! He’s our friend!\"","\"Then you can continue fighting him by yourselves,\" Yuan shook his head as he stopped trying to block Lucian.","\"If he’s acting like this because of your presence, then he might return to normal once you leave,\" he added a moment later.","\"That’s...\"","Angela and Helena exchanged glances with each other before finally agreeing to leave.","\"If nothing changes, call us back!\" Angela said as she used Void Manipulation to teleport away.","\"If he does return to normal, make sure you ask him about it!\" Helena said before teleporting away as well.","However, Lucian had no intention of letting them escape so easily and immediately attempted to use Void Manipulation.","\"No, you don’t!\" Yuan shouted, barely managing to intercept him before he could chase after them.","With Angela and Helena gone, Lucian finally turned his attention to Yuan.","\"So you can actually see me, huh? I was starting to think I was invisible to you or something,\" Yuan muttered with a calm smile.","\"...\"","Unsurprisingly, Lucian remained silent.","Then, without warning, he attacked.","\"I won’t kill you since you’re their friend, but I will have to defend myself and wake you up somehow.\"","Yuan’s body immediately surged with Eternal Essence.","The moment Lucian sensed it, his body briefly froze, as though reacting to its power.","However, Yuan paid it no mind and struck without hesitation, driving a straight punch into his gut.","\"Argh!\" Lucian coughed up a mouthful of blood as the impact rippled through his body, shattering his bones and tearing apart his muscles from within.","Knowing that Lucian was a Transcendent, Yuan didn’t hold back because he wasn’t afraid of killing him by accident.","Of course, Yuan limited himself to using only ordinary Eternal Essence.","\"Aaaah!\"","Lucian roared as he unleashed even more of his fake Eternal Essence.","Unfortunately for him, no amount of fake Eternal Essence would allow him to defeat Yuan.","For the next several hours, Lucian endured a completely one-sided beating.","\"When are you going to wake up? Do you really want to die like this?\" Yuan questioned, his hand wrapped tightly around Lucian’s neck.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence and complete stillness, Lucian’s body suddenly began to relax, and light slowly returned to his eyes.","\"Oh?\"","Upon seeing the change, Yuan released his grasp on Lucian.","\"Cough!\"","Lucian spat out another mouthful of blood before looking at Yuan with a dazed expression.","\"W-Who are you...?\" Lucian asked.","\"Yuan.\"","\"Yuan? I have never heard of you. Are you an Eternal? You don’t look like one, though...\" Lucian questioned with a puzzled expression.","Yuan shook his head and calmly replied, \"I’m human.\"","\"What?\" Lucian’s eyes widened with shock. \"B-But you can wield Eternal Essence!\"","\"Don’t worry about it. Right now, I have some questions for you,\" Yuan then said.","\"Angela and Helena, you know them, right?\"","Lucian raised an eyebrow and responded with a surprised face, \"Huh? How do you know those names? Did you meet them?\"","It was Yuan’s turn to raise his eyebrows.","\"You don’t remember?\" he asked.","\"Remember what?\"","\"That you met and attacked them. We were fighting for a reason, you know?\"","\"!!!\"","A look of realization flashed across Lucian’s face, and he fell silent for a moment before asking in a concerned tone, \"I... I didn’t hurt them, did I?\"","\"Physically? No.\"","Lucian released a sigh of relief after hearing this.","\"Care to elaborate on why you attacked them out of nowhere? You were also moving around like a lifeless puppet when we fought.\"","\"Sorry, but I cannot disclose anything to you.\" Lucian shook his head.","\"Are you sure? I know Deemo very well, you know?\" Yuan said, mentioning the Demon God.","\"Y-You know my Master?!\" Lucian exclaimed in disbelief.","\"Not only that, but I even plan on fighting for him during the next ’event’, if you know what I am talking about.\"","\"!!!\"","Lucian’s expression changed once again when Yuan mentioned the event.","\"You are going to participate in the Eternals’ Reckoning, too? And under Master Deemo?\" Lucian asked in a somewhat doubtful voice. \"But you’re a human from the Nine Heavens.\"","Without saying a word, Yuan activated his Transcended Demonic Awakening, taking on his demon form.","\"?!?!\"","Lucian subconsciously backed away from Yuan after sensing his ridiculous presence.","\"What about now?\" Yuan asked with a smile on his face.","\"How in...\" Lucian rubbed his eyes and looked again, as if trying to make sure he was not seeing things.","\"To be honest with you, I have not decided whether I will participate in the event yet, and Deemo really wants me to fight for him. I think you know why. However, if you refuse to tell me about your situation, I’ll tell Deemo that I won’t participate—and then I’ll blame it all on you,\" Yuan said, pointing at him.","\"What?! That’s ridiculous! And unreasonable!\"","Yuan shrugged and said, \"If you don’t want that to happen, then tell me everything. I won’t tell Deemo. I promise.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Lucian released a defeated sigh and said, \"I cannot go into the details, because doing so would cost me my life—literally.\"","\"Then tell me what you can.\"","Lucian nodded.","\"Before that, I have a question for you. How much do you know about my origin, if anything at all?\"","\"I know about the Great Cataclysm, as well as the Transcedents’ clash with Deemo. I was also told that some of you were killed during that clash.\"","Lucian then spoke, \"No, we weren’t killed. Master Deemo saw potential in us and had us participate in the Eternals’ Reckoning, and we’ve been training and fighting for him ever since then.\"","\"As for why I attacked those two... It’s due to a curse, and I have no control over it.\"","\"Did Deemo cast this curse on you?\" Yuan then asked.","Lucian nodded.","\"We are forbidden from coming into contact with anyone from our world. If we do... we are forced to eliminate them, regardless of who they are.\"","\"What purpose could such a curse possibly serve?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, puzzled by the restriction.","However, Lucian merely shook his head in silence, either because he did not know the answer himself or because he was unable to reveal it.","\"So, are the rest of the Transcendents still alive right now?\" Yuan then asked.","A grim expression appeared on Lucian’s face as he responded in a dejected voice, \"There were six of us in the beginning, but only two of us remain now.\"","\"How did they die?\"","\"How else? They all died during the Eternals’ Reckoning.\"","\"Huh? I’m surprised that Deemo allowed you guys to die. I thought he valued the Transcendents.\"","\"Are you kidding me?\" Lucian sneered. \"We’re nothing but tools in his eyes.\"","\"Even so, there are so few of you. What will he do if you all perish?\"","\"He’ll just find others to replace us.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan spoke, \"Alright. I get the gist of your situation. Now I need to know your connection to Qian Chu—the one who summoned you here.\"","\"He’s just another expendable pawn for my Master.\"","\"What?\" Yuan tilted his head, looking utterly confused.","\"Sorry, but I cannot tell you the details.\"","\"Then what is your role in all this?\"","Lucian silently shook his head.","\"Looks like I will have to ask Deemo myself...\" Yuan sighed aloud.","Lucian proceeded to stare at Yuan intently, looking as though he wanted to say something.","\"What is it?\"","\"I don’t know what kind of relationship you have with my Master, but if you are not close to him, you should stay away. Otherwise, you will inevitably become entangled in his schemes and cruelty,\" Lucian warned.","\"Anyway, I will take my leave now. Give my regards to Angela and Helena... Oh, and thank you for stopping me from killing them.\"","Before Yuan could even open his mouth to respond, Lucian vanished into the void."]},{"number":2534,"title":"Chapter 2534: Leaving Primordial Chaos","paragraphs":["Even long after Lucian left the scene, Yuan remained lingering in the void with a pondering expression on his face, contemplating everything he’d just learned.","Although he still had many questions, there was one thing that he understood clearly from his conversation with Lucian.","’Deemo... that bastard cannot be trusted.’ Yuan thought to himself.","While he already had a vague feeling that Deemo was hiding things from him, he could never have anticipated that Qian Chu was somehow related.","’Just what was Qian Chu doing for Deemo? And why did Lucian just leave after being summoned?’","Some time later, Yuan returned to Tian Qiyuan’s world, where Angela and Helena were nervously waiting.","\"You’re back!\"","They rushed over the moment they sensed his presence enter the world.","\"Where’s Lucian? What happened?\"","\"Did you kill him?\"","They bombarded him with questions.","\"Calm down,\" Yuan said to them as he took a few steps back. \"He’s fine, and he told me about a few things. Do you want to hear the good or bad news first?\"","\"Uh...\"","Helena and Angela exchanged glances for a moment before responding simultaneously, \"The good news first.\"","\"Good news, there are still other Transcendents out there. Bad news, there are only two of them left, so there are five of you in existence right now.\"","\"Only two left...? What happened to the others? Selena told us that the Demon God claimed he didn’t kill them during our fight, even though we witnessed it with our own eyes,\" asked Angela with a puzzled face.","\"It’s true,\" Yuan said before elaborating. \"The Demon God did not kill your friends. Instead, he forced them to participate in some gladiator-style event used purely to entertain Eternals—gods like the Demon God.\"","\"What?! So they’ve been fighting for the Demon God this entire time?! That’s a fate even worse than death!\" Angela exclaimed in shock after hearing this.","Yuan nodded.","\"According to Lucian, there were six of them in the beginning. Unfortunately, there are only two of them remaining now.\"","\"...\"","Helena fell silent, her head lowered slightly, as if mourning her companions.","\"Did you find out why he suddenly attacked us?\" Angela then asked.","\"It’s a curse from the Demon God that forces them to kill any demon they encounter for whatever reason.\"","\"That’s outrageous!\"","\"Does that mean we can’t even meet them? Since they will just try to kill us?\" Helena asked.","\"Most likely, unless we remove the curse.\"","\"Damn it...\" Angela gritted her teeth angrily.","\"It’s unfortunate, but there’s nothing we can do now,\" Yuan said while shaking his head.","After all, Deemo was simply too powerful.","\"Unless we somehow find another Prime Eternal who’d be willing to help us deal with Deemo, there’s nothing we can realistically do to him,\" he added.","\"And what are the chances of something like that happening?\"","Yuan shrugged.","\"I don’t know any other Prime Eternals besides Deemo...\"","After a slight pause, he added, \"Actually, I do know another Prime Eternal, but they are after my life, so there’s that.\"","\"Lord Shiva wants me to ask—which Prime Eternal did you offend?\" Mu Xuelian suddenly asked.","\"Someone called Morveth.\"","\"MORVETH?!\" Shiva abruptly took control of Mu Xuelian’s body just to exclaim in shock.","\"You offended Morveth?! How in the universe did you manage to do that?!\"","\"I killed one of her pets or something,\" he calmly replied.","\"Unbelievable...\" she muttered in a daze before continuing, \"Out of the five Prime Eternal, Morveth is the most vengeful. If you offend her even slightly, you can expect a gruesome retaliation.\"","\"Well, she’s already tried to kill me once. If it weren’t for Deemo, I wouldn’t be alive right now.\"","\"You... should probably return to the Nine Heavens and stay there.\" Shiva shook her head.","\"So, what are your plans now? And what should we do?\" Angela asked.","Yuan looked at them and said, \"I promised that I’d let you explore this world if you helped me clean up with Forsaken, and since you’ve done just that, I don’t have a reason to keep you with me any longer. Go and have fun, but remember not to cause any trouble.\"","\"I guess it’ll help us take our minds off the others...\" Helena sighed.","\"When do you think Selena will be able to join us?\"","Yuan shrugged, \"She’ll likely be busy trying to unite the Demonic Realm and the Nine Heavens for some time, but you can join her if you’d like. Just make sure you don’t go in your true appearance and disguise yourself like her.\"","\"Alright. We’ll meet up with her first, then decide.\"","Angela and Helena left his world shortly after, leaving Yuan and My Xuelian behind.","\"What now?\" Shiva asked.","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"I was going to deal with the Celestial Overlords, but I am currently waiting for something, so instead, let’s go visit another Eternal.\"","\"What?\" Shiva raised her eyebrows.","\"You said you know another Eternal who’s being sealed in the Nine Heavens, correct? Let’s go meet them.\"","\"Seriously? You’d be willing to help?\"","\"That will depend entirely on the Eternal’s personality and whether they’re dangerous or not. Do you know where they are sealed?\"","\"Well, I know where he was sealed before this world was split into nine realms, but not anymore.\"","\"Do you remember any details about the location?\"","\"I remember that it had a lot of mountains, and there were beasts that recently settled nearby.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow at her description and wondered if this Eternal was the same one he had encountered in Heavenly White Valley.","\"I want to bring you somewhere first,\" Yuan said a moment later.","Some time later, they left Tian Qiyuan’s world and prepared to return to the Nine Heavens.","However, as they traversed the Primordial Chaos, they noticed something off about the atmosphere there.","\"Is it just me, or has this place gotten a lot quieter?\" Mu Xuelian wondered aloud.","\"No, it has definitely gotten quieter,\" Yuan responded with a thoughtful expression. \"We were being swarmed by magical beasts on our way here, but now I cannot detect even a single one with my divine sense.\"","It was almost as if all the magical beasts in the Primordial Chaos had been erased.","Suddenly, Mu Xuelian came to a halt, and her entire aura changed, as Shiva had taken over.","\"Shiva?\" Yuan turned to look at her, only to find her staring in a certain direction in the void. However, when he followed her gaze, he saw nothing but countless stars scattered across the vast distance.","\"What do you see?\" Yuan asked.","\"I don’t know,\" she replied in a nervous voice.","\"What?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, looking puzzled.","Not only did Shiva make no sense, but this was the first time he’d seen her look so nervous.","\"I don’t see anything, but my instincts are screaming at me right now,\" she continued. \"My instincts as an Eternal...\"","\"Wait...\"","A look of realization suddenly appeared on her face, and she muttered, \"But there’s no way... Why would she be here?\"","\"Who?\" Yuan inquired with a frown, an ominous feeling growing in his guts.","\"Hil—\"","Shiva opened her mouth to speak, but before she could even say a single word, she felt something covering her mouth.","Sensing this, Shiva did not dare to move, her entire body turning as stiff as a frozen statue.","\"I wanted to remain as a spectator for a little longer, but you had to ruin it.\"","A calm voice suddenly echoed in the void, alerting Yuan, even though he still could not sense anyone nearby.","\"Allow me to introduce myself.\"","The voice continued, and the space behind Shiva suddenly began to bend, revealing a figure—or more precisely, a barely noticeable outline of an invisible figure who had their hand covering Shiva’s mouth.","\"Who are you?\" Yuan asked, preparing to engage in combat at any moment.","\"My name is Hilla.\"","\"Hilla?\" Yuan quickly recognized the name.","\"One of five Prime Eternals?\"","\"Oh? You recognize my name? How unexpected for a mortal.\"","\"And what does a powerful being like you want from us?\"","The invisible figured claiming to be Hilla removed her hand from Shiva’s mouth and said, \"Nothing.\"","\"You really expect me to believe that?\"","\"Saaruk,\" Hilla suddenly mentioned another familiar name.","\"Recognize it?\" she asked.","\"Of course...\" Yuan narrowed his eyes slightly. \"Don’t tell me you’re here to avenge him or something?\"","\"Avenge him...?\" Hilla muttered in a somewhat dumbfounded voice.","\"Hahaha!\" she suddenly burst into laughter.","\"He is nothing more than an idiot who loves pretending to be stronger than he truly is. I could not care less if an idiot like him is killed.\"","\"Then why did you mention him?\"","\"Because he allowed me to discover an intriguing existence like you, being useful for once.\"","The invisible figure slowly approached Yuan before circling around him.","\"...\"","Yuan watched her every movement in silence, wondering what she was planning.","Then, Hilla spoke again, \"A mortal who is not only capable of wielding Eternal Essence, but one that can even absorb the Essence of the Void? You have piqued my interest,\" Hilla said."]},{"number":2535,"title":"Chapter 2535: Prime Eternal Hilla","paragraphs":["\"What?! He can absorb Essence of the Void?!\" Shiva exclaimed in shock after learning this for the first time.","Since it happened after she abandoned him, she had no idea until Hilla mentioned it.","\"Mortal, I want to witness it with my own eyes,\" Hilla then spoke.","\"You want me to absorb the Essence of the Void right now?\" Yuan asked with a raised eyebrow.","\"Yes, or would that be a problem? You can absorb it, can’t you?\" Hilla answered, sounding adamant.","\"Well, I haven’t tried again after my fight with Saaruk because I was only able to absorb a limited amount before feeling like I’d reached a bottleneck,\" he admitted.","’However, I might actually be able to absorb more now, given that my cultivation and understanding of the Power of the Void had improved significantly since then...’ Yuan thought to himself.","After pondering for a moment, Yuan looked at Hilla’s transparent figure and said, \"Okay, I will try to absorb the Essence of the Void. Give me a minute to prepare myself.\"","He had a feeling Hilla would not let him leave unless she got what she wanted, especially since she took her time traveling all the way to the Nine Heavens to meet him.","Moreover, he’d rather not offend another Prime Eternal if he didn’t need to, as he already had Deemo and Morveth to deal with.","’She feels different from other Eternals for some reason... Although I still cannot trust her, let’s see where this goes...’ Yuan thought to himself as he prepared to cultivate.","A moment later, Yuan took a deep breath and started feeling the ’essence’ of the void.","Due to his improved understanding of the void overall, he was able to sense it much quicker this time.","Almost immediately after sensing the Essence of the Void, Yuan began attempting to absorb it.","Shiva’s eyes slowly widened with shock and disbelief as Yuan really started absorbing the Essence of the Void moments later.","’This monster! His Eternal Constitution isn’t even complete, and he can already absorb the Essence of the Void that true Eternals like me have trouble doing?! This doesn’t make any sense at all! How is he achieving this with a body like that?!’ she cried inwardly.","It was at this moment that Shiva started to suspect something was fundamentally different about Yuan’s physique because, logically speaking, his body should not be able to handle Essence of the Void.","Meanwhile, Hilla watched Yuan in silence, her expression unknown due to her invisible features.","After he began absorbing the Essence of the Void, Yuan could sense his Eternal Essence growing at a rapid pace. Every minute of cultivation produced the equivalent of over ten years’ worth of Eternal Essence.","This incredible rate of improvement was precisely why all Eternals cultivated the Essence of the Void whenever possible, as it allowed them to progress far faster than absorbing ordinary essence. Unfortunately, not even Eternals could cultivate the Essence of the Void without limit. Each of them had their own threshold, and once they reached it, they would be forced to take a break.","And it was this very limit that differentiated one Eternal from another. In a way, it was the standard by which Eternals measured their talent.","<Your understanding of the Power of the Void has increased significantly>","<Your understanding of the Power of the Void has reached the next realm>","<You have learned Supreme Void Understanding>","<Your Void Manipulation has reached a new level>","It didn’t take long before Yuan reached a new level of Void Understanding, as he was already on the verge of a breakthrough during his last cultivation of Essence of the Void.","The moment his Void Understanding reached Supreme-level, Yuan’s ability to sense the Essence of the Void became even clearer, and his absorption rate increased even more.","As for the rate he acquired Eternal Essence, it also skyrocketed.","A few days later, Yuan stopped cultivating when he started feeling the bottleneck again.","\"Are you satisfied?\" Yuan turned to look at Hilla, who had remained as still and quiet as a statue during the last few days.","Hilla remarked a moment later, \"You’re even more interesting than I thought.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow at such a remark, wondering if he’d gotten himself in more trouble.","\"If you’re satisfied, can we go now?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Sure.\"","\"Really?\"","Yuan doubted his ears when Hilla agreed so easily to allow them to leave.","\"Why do you seem so surprised that I am letting you go?\" she asked, sounding intrigued by his reaction.","\"Because I find it hard to believe that you would travel all the way here just to see me cultivate,\" he admitted.","\"Then what else are you expecting me to do?\"","He shook his head.","\"I don’t know.\"","Hilla then said, \"Although I wouldn’t mind it if you lingered a little longer, that wouldn’t be interesting at all. After all, I wish to see more of what you’ll achieve, and that can only be done if you continue doing your own thing.\"","\"Wait... that sounds like you intend to keep watching me.\" Yuan’s eyes widened at her words.","\"Of course. It has been such a long time since I found something this interesting. It would not make sense for me to leave before seeing it through.\"","Yuan swallowed nervously before asking, \"Does that mean...\"","He paused for a second.","\"You’ll follow me around?\"","He already had Shiva following him around, and the idea that another Eternal—a Prime Eternal, at that—following him sounded awful.","\"Follow you? To that place with ’his’ power? I’d rather not, as I can watch you perfectly fine from out here.\" Hilla said.","Hearing this, Yuan inwardly sighed in relief. Even so, it still felt strange knowing that a Prime Eternal would be constantly watching over him. Unfortunately, there was nothing he could realistically do about it.","\"Then... I’ll be leaving now...\"","Yuan turned to look at Shiva before beginning to leave.","Shiva quickly tried to follow, but she immediately froze in her tracks when Hilla’s voice echoed behind her.","\"Shiva, I am not done with you.\""]},{"number":2536,"title":"Chapter 2536: Prime Eternal Hilla(2)","paragraphs":["Shiva cried inwardly when she heard Hilla’s words, but she didn’t dare to complain and stopped to face her invisible figure.","\"What do you want from me?\" Shiva asked with a slight frown.","Even though she was facing a Prime Eternal, Shiva was still an Eternal herself and had to maintain her composure. As long as she did nothing to offend Hilla, she had no real reason to fear her.","Meanwhile, Yuan also stopped to watch them. However, both Shiva and Hilla suddenly vanished from his perception, becoming completely invisible and undetectable even to his divine sense.","’I guess she doesn’t want me to hear whatever they are going to discuss...’ Yuan shook his head inwardly.","Still, he lingered, as he did not want to leave without Shiva.","Not far away, Hilla and Shiva began their conversation within a concealment barrier.","\"Why are you with this mortal? Last I heard, you were sealed after losing a fight.\" Hilla questioned.","\"He was the one who freed me from my seal,\" Shiva answered truthfully. \"And he promised to help me regain my true body, so I am just following him around until then.\"","\"So, you have no intention of acquiring the power that resides within his world?\"","\"The Absolute Power? Hah!\" Shiva sneered. \"I am not stupid enough to chase after some imaginary power that nobody has been able to prove truly exists.\"","\"Even though there is evidence that it exists?\"","\"If you mean how our powers get weaker the closer we get to that world, I wouldn’t consider it real evidence. Who knows? It could be a special trait of the world and has nothing to do with the Absolute Power.\"","\"...\"","Hilla fell silent, as if pondering something.","\"Did you stop me just to ask me a few questions?\" Shiva then asked.","\"That mortal...\" Hilla spoke, but paused midway and did not continue.","\"No... forget it. There are still a few things I need to confirm.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Shilva raised her eyebrows, looking puzzled.","However, Hilla refused to elaborate and vanished into the void.","At the same time, the barrier around Shiva disappeared, allowing Yuan to see her again.","Shiva turned to look at him and remarked, \"You’re still here?\"","\"Why would I leave without you? Unlike a certain someone, I am not the type to abandon others,\" Yuan replied, taking a jab at her for abandoning him before.","Shiva sucked her teeth in annoyance but did not say anything else and returned control of the body to Mu Xuelian.","Shortly later, Yuan and Mu Xuelian continued leaving the Primordial Chaos, quickly returning to the Nine Heavens.","\"I’m surprised that she actually let us go so quickly,\" Yuan muttered.","\"Lord Shiva said it’s unexpected but not shocking, considering that Prime Eternal Hilla is the most mysterious amongst the five Prime Eternals,\" Mu Xuelian said.","\"The most mysterious?\" Yuan asked.","\"Lord Shiva said that nobody ever knows what she’s thinking, and that she doesn’t participate in a lot of things, merely keeping to herself.\"","\"The only thing I want to know is...\"","Yuan paused briefly before continuing via voice transmission, \"Should I be worried about her?\"","\"Lord Shiva said that Prime Eternal Hilla is the least aggressive Prime Eternal and that she tends to be an observer most of the time.\"","\"Still, I don’t know how to feel about having a Prime Eternal constantly watching over me like a creep...\" Yuan shivered.","\"Believe it or not... There are Eternals constantly watching the Nine Heavens. You just aren’t aware of them because they don’t make themselves known.\"","\"So the Absolute Being’s power doesn’t block their surveillance, huh?\"","\"It doesn’t take much energy to look, so no, it doesn’t. Also, it’s not like they constantly keep watch. They usually just take a peek before returning to their own business.\"","\"Good to know.\"","After returning to the Seventh Heaven, Yuan brought Mu Xuelian directly to the Nameless Stairway.","Upon arriving, Yuan was surprised to find the area crowded with people. However, most of them did not appear to be climbers. Instead, they were inspecting the stairway with great interest.","\"What’s going on here?\" Yuan approached one of the people there and asked.","\"You haven’t heard? After this new Stairway to Heaven was confirmed to have been crafted by a legendary blacksmith from the past, blacksmiths from all over the world gathered here just to inspect it.\"","\"Is that so?\"","Yuan turned to look at Mu Xuelian and said, \"Let’s go.\"","Without waiting for a response, he jumped toward the stairway, landing right before the door.","\"Hey, you guys mind moving out of the way?\"","\"Shut up, can’t you see that we’re busy here?\"","Yuan sighed, \"I know you’re excited about this new treasure, and I don’t blame you, but you shouldn’t block the whole thing, preventing people from using it.\"","\"...\"","However, the blacksmiths completely ignored him and continued to examine the stairway.","Unbeknownst to them, they were completely ignoring the very person who created the Nameless Stairway they were inspecting.","\"Just give up,\" another climber waiting for the blacksmiths to finish said to Yuan. \"They won’t move for anyone. If one of them leaves, another blacksmith will immediately take their spot.\"","\"It’s also unwise to offend them, or your life may become complicated in the future.\"","Since most blacksmiths were members of the same association, offending one of them was no different from offending all of them. If that happened, one could be barred from purchasing weapons or having their own weapons repaired, which would make any cultivator’s life extremely difficult.","Of course, the same could be said for offending alchemists. However, unlike blacksmiths, alchemists have many different organizations, so offending a few would not be the end of the world, as long as they did not belong to a top one.","That being said, Yuan couldn’t care less about offending them. Even if he offended every single blacksmith in the world, it would not matter to him.","After taking a deep breath, Yuan approached one of the blacksmiths, grabbed him by the back of his robes, and yanked him away from the door, shocking everyone watching."]},{"number":2537,"title":"Chapter 2537: Indestructible Steel Association","paragraphs":["\"?!?!\"","The entire place suddenly became dead silent, and for the first time, the blacksmiths turned their attention away from the Nameless Stairway to look behind them, their eyes wide with shock and disbelief.","\"D-Do you have any idea what you have just done?!\"","The cultivator who had warned Yuan not to offend them muttered, a bewildered look on his face.","The very next moment, an angry shout echoed through the area as the man Yuan had yanked away from the stairway flew back into the air, his face twisted with rage.","\"How dare you, you little bastard! Do you have any idea who I am and what you’ve just done?!\"","Yuan’s expression remained nonchalant as he replied, \"Who are you? If I had to remember every insignificant little ant like you, my life would be miserable.\"","The man trembled some more before shouting loudly, \"In that case, allow me to introduce myself!\"","He suddenly made a few hand gestures before poking Yuan in the chest with his index and middle fingers. Although Yuan could’ve easily avoided the man’s attack, he was intrigued, so he allowed himself to be struck.","However, the man did not attack Yuan, doing something else entirely instead.","\"Oh?\" Yuan muttered in a slightly surprised voice when he realized what the man had just done to him.","\"I have just barred you from ever receiving support from the Indestructible Steel Association and every single blacksmith under its wing! Do you finally realize how fucked you are right now and who you’ve offended?!\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and calmly replied, \"I understand the first part, but that doesn’t tell me anything about your identity. In fact, I still have no clue who you are.\"","\"Bastard! Only a Divine Blacksmith can block people from the association without needing a formal approval, and I am one of only a hundred Divine Blacksmiths in existence!\"","\"Oh, you were a Divine Blacksmith? I would’ve never been able to guess with how lowly you were acting,\" Yuan said, still remaining nonchalant about the whole situation.","\"Y-You ignorant bastard! You must have no idea what kind of mess you’ve gotten yourself into! The Indestructible Steel Association is the largest association for blacksmiths in the Nine Heavens, with the majority of blacksmiths in the world under our name! Now that you’ve been barred from receiving our assistance, good luck buying treasures or getting them repaired by us! Not only that, but everyone associated with us will also avoid you like the plague!\"","\"I am aware, and I still don’t think it’s a big deal. Hell, I wouldn’t let you repair my treasures even if you paid me,\" Yuan remarked.","\"Hmph!\" The Divine Blacksmith coldly sneered. \"You can keep acting tough, but as long as that brand is attached to your soul, you can forget about receiving our help!\"","A calm smile appeared on Yuan’s face, and he replied, \"Is that all you have to say? Because I have places to be and have already wasted enough time dealing with an idiot like you.\"","The Divine Blacksmith trembled at Yuan’s words before erupting in even greater fury. \"It seems you are not satisfied with your punishment and require further discipline!\"","His fists ignited with flames as he launched a punch straight at Yuan’s chest.","However, instead of letting the Divine Blacksmith strike him, Yuan actually blocked it this time, casually catching his fist.","\"?!\"","The Divine Blacksmith wore a shocked face when Yuan casually blocked his fist. Although he didn’t intend to kill Yuan, his attack had enough force to break a few ribs.","\"Since you didn’t strike with the intend to kill, I won’t punish you too harshly—\" Yuan muttered before clenching tightly, crushing the Divine Blacksmith’s hand into a bloody mess.","\"Aahh!\" The Divine Blacksmith screamed in pain as he pulled back, staring at his mutilated hand with a terrified expression on his face.","\"Don’t worry, you can fix that with a few good pills. I’m sure you’re more than capable of buying them with your resources as a Divine Blacksmith. Though it might affect your abilities for a little.\"","\"S-Senior Huang!\"","The other blacksmiths finally snapped out of their daze when they saw the Divine Blacksmith injured. The next moment, they surrounded Yuan, their hammers raised.","\"Save your energy,\" Yuan said as he revealed a fraction of his hidden aura.","A terrifying pressure instantly engulfed the area, making everyone feel as though mountains had suddenly been placed upon their backs.","\"W-Who the hell are you?!\" The Divine Blacksmith muttered with a pale complexion.","\"I’m Yuan,\" he revealed his true identity without a care.","Then, without another word, he walked to the door and tapped on it.","The door immediately opened for him.","Before stepping inside, Yuan said, \"Oh, right. Starting today, every blacksmith from the Indestructible Steel Association is prohibited from using the stairway. If you have any problems, come find me.\"","\"What...?\"","Without elaborating, Yuan entered the stairway, disappearing into the darkness. Mu Xuelian silently followed, the door closing behind her.","Once Yuan and his pressure had disappeared, the blacksmiths quickly rushed to the Divine Blacksmith’s side and began offering him recovery pills for his injured hand.","\"Here, Senior Huang! Quickly consume this before your injury gets any worse!\"","However, the Divine Blacksmith ignored them and silently stared at the Nameless Stairway, Yuan’s final words echoing inside his head like some kind of curse.","\"Move!\"","The Divine Blacksmith shouted as he pushed them aside and rushed to the door.","\"Open up!\"","He pounded on the door with his other hand.","Yet, the stairway remained unresponsive.","Seeing this, the Divine Blacksmith’s complexion paled even further.","\"Impossible...\" he muttered in a dazed voice, looking as though he’d just realized something.","\"What’s going on, Senior Huang?\"","The other blacksmiths asked him with puzzled faces.","The Divine Blacksmith swallowed nervously before responding in a shaky voice, \"That man... was the mysterious owner of the stairway!\"","\"HE’S WHAT?!\" Not just the blacksmiths, but everyone present exclaimed in shock, their eyes wide with bewilderment."]},{"number":2538,"title":"Chapter 2538: Returning to Heavenly White Valley","paragraphs":["\"T-This must be some kind of misunderstanding! There’s no way some rude bastard like that could be the owner of the stairway!\"","The blacksmiths refused to believe it, even though it was coming from a Divine Blacksmith.","\"If you don’t believe me, go ahead and try using the stairway!\" said the Divine Blacksmith.","The blacksmiths swallowed nervously before they approached the door and knocked on it, trying to enter it one by one.","However, the Nameless Stairway remained unresponsive to all of them.","Seeing this, the Divine Blacksmith suddenly pointed at one of the cultivators who had been waiting for the blacksmiths to finish and said, \"You wanted to climb, right? Do it now.\"","Although the cultivator had already intended to climb, it still felt strange to be ordered around in such a manner. Yet, there was nothing he could do but silently nod and follow the Divine Blacksmith’s command.","When the cultivator reached the door and knocked on it, the Nameless Stairway opened for him, leaving the blacksmiths it had ignored completely stunned and speechless.","The next moment, the cultivator entered the stairway and disappeared inside.","Just as the door began to close, one of the blacksmiths suddenly shot forward and slipped into the stairway before it could fully shut.","\"He went inside!\"","However, a second later, the door opened again, and the blacksmith who had tried to sneak in was ejected like trash, leaving a trail of blood in the air.","The other blacksmiths gasped in shock and hurriedly rushed to catch him. After examining his condition, they sighed in relief upon discovering that he was not dead and had suffered only superficial injuries.","\"How does the treasure differentiate us?\" one of the blacksmiths suddenly questioned aloud.","The Divine Blacksmith, who had just consumed a recovery pill, responded with a grim expression. \"Most likely through our association’s identification symbol.\"","Just as every faction possessed a distinct symbol that identified both the organization and its members—a symbol its members were required to carry on their bodies—the Indestructible Steel Association had something similar. Every blacksmith under its banner bore the same identifying symbol.","\"So are you saying that unless we remove our symbol, which is akin to leaving the association, that we would not be able to use the new Stairway to Heaven?! That’s outrageous! Who the hell does that man think he is?!\"","\"He basically just declared war on the entire association! Even if he’s the owner of the stairway, he won’t get away with this!\"","Soon, news that the owner of the new Stairway to Heaven had been identified began to spread, and Yuan’s name began echoing throughout the Nine Heavens again.","Meanwhile, Yuan and Mu Xuelian made their way to the Heavenly White Valley upon arriving in the Eighth Heaven.","\"Lord Shiva asks why you’re bringing her to this place,\" Mu Xuelian said as they traveled through the endless mountain valleys.","\"You’ll find out soon enough.\"","Eventually, they arrived at the location.","Yuan created a hole in the ground, revealing the tunnel he’d covered up before.","\"Let’s go.\"","Without explaining, Yuan entered the tunnel with Mu Xuelian following closely behind.","Some time later, they arrived at the underground cavern with the massive sealed gate.","\"What do you think?\" Yuan turned to look at Mu Xuelian, but Shiva had already taken control and was staring at the gates with wide eyes.","\"These inscriptions... It’s the language of Eternals!\" she muttered.","\"So, do you recognize this place?\" Yuan asked. \"Is it where your friend is sealed?\"","\"...\"","Shiva fell silent for a moment before shaking her head, \"I don’t recognize this place.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and said, \"Really? There’s an Eternal sealed inside.\"","\"I don’t sense an Eternal inside, though,\" Shiva quickly responded, which puzzled Yuan even further.","\"What do you mean? I spoke to them the last time I was here. They even shared a technique with me.\"","Yuan approached the gate and shouted loudly, \"Hey! Remember me? I have returned!\"","\"...\"","Silence.","Yuan wondered if the Eternal was slumbering, so he struck the gates like he did last time, but instead of using his sword, he kicked them with so much force that it shook the entire cavern.","\"Wake up! Or do you want to stay sealed?!\"","\"...\"","Still no response, as if the Eternal inside was no longer there.","\"As I said, I don’t sense any Eternals inside,\" Shiva said. \"Even if they are sealed, I should be able to sense them.\"","\"How is that possible? Don’t tell me someone else freed them?\" Yuan pondered out loud.","However, the only other person who knew this location was Bai Sulan, as she was with him at the time of the discovery. But he also had no reason to believe that Bai Sulan had any capability to unseal the Eternal.","\"You said the Eternal gave you a technique, right? Let me see it,\" Shiva suddenly asked.","Yuan was about to agree, but he stopped himself. Even he did not know why—perhaps it was simply a gut feeling.","\"Instead, why don’t you teach me your language?\" Yuan said a moment later. \"I understand a little of it, but not enough to comprehend the technique.\"","Shiva narrowed her eyes at him, sensing his distrust. However, she did not complain and simply said, \"Fine. I will teach you our language.\"","The next moment, she shared with him a translation of their language into the human tongue.","Yuan took a few minutes to digest the information. Then, he sat down and closed his eyes to study the technique given to him before by whatever was sealed behind the gates.","A few minutes later, his eyes opened, shock flickering within.","’I’m truly glad that I did not give this technique to her!’ he cried inwardly, realizing that he’d just dodged a bullet.","\"So? What did you learn?\" Shiva asked him after seeing his expression.","Yuan turned to look at her with a perplexed expression, debating whether he should tell her. After all, the information was too catastrophic to fall into the wrong hands."]},{"number":2539,"title":"Chapter 2539: Selena’s Audience With the Celestial Emperor","paragraphs":["\"Why are you staying quiet? You’re the one who brought me here, you know?\" Shiva remarked when Yuan refused to explain anything to her.","Yuan sighed and finally spoke, \"I know, but this turned out to be much more complicated than I thought.\"","Shiva fell silent before turning to look at the massive gates once again, her eyes narrowed slightly. She was certain that there was no Eternal sealed behind them, but Yuan had no reason to lie either.","’He started acting suspiciously after learning our language... What kind of technique did he acquire from whatever is behind the gates?’ she wondered inwardly.","Then, she focused on the gates themselves, as she’d only been paying attention to the inscriptions thus far.","’These gates...!’ Shiva’s eyes widened when she realized something after paying closer attention to the gates—or more specifically, the materials they were made of.","Yuan raised an eyebrow when Shiva suddenly started approaching the gates, even pressing her palm against it.","’As I thought, these gates aren’t meant to keep Eternals sealed inside but to hide whatever is inside from us!’","The materials used to craft the gates were a rare material that not only completely blocked their senses but was also especially durable against their power: Eternal Essence!","However, Shiva wasn’t completely certain, so she decided to test it out herself.","After gathering a tiny amount of Eternal Essence in her fist, she threw a punch at it.","\"What are you—\"","BOOM!","When Shiva’s fists collided with the gates, her Eternal Essence rippled throughout them before scattering like water being dropped on a surface covered in water-repellent substances.","\"What are you doing?\" Yuan asked with a puzzled look on his face.","Shiva turned to look at him and calmly replied, \"I have an idea why you’re hesitant about telling me what you know.\"","\"You do? Let’s hear it.\"","\"I don’t feel like it,\" Shiva shrugged before turning around and walking towards the exit. \"I’ll be waiting for you outside. Take your time in here.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"You’re going to open the gates and retrieve whatever is inside, right? I doubt you’ll want me around when you do that, so I’ll wait outside,\" she calmly said before returning control to Mu Xuelian, who quickly left the cavern, leaving Yuan alone.","\"...\"","Once he was alone, Yuan turned to stare at the gates.","Although he was alone in the cavern, it did not mean he was completely alone, as Prime Eternal Hilla could be watching him at this very moment.","After some thought, Yuan decided to open the gates anyway.","’Even if she is watching, she probably won’t be able to see inside once I close the doors behind me.’","With that thought in mind, Yuan approached the gates, placed his hands on the gates, and started mumbling unknown words that were not of the human language.","Moments later, the gates that had been sealed for an unknown amount of time started to slowly creak open.","However, the gates opened only a small crack, just large enough for Yuan to enter.","After taking a deep breath, Yuan took a step forward and entered the gates, which automatically closed behind him.","Meanwhile, somewhere in the Ninth Heaven, Selena entered the Celestial Palace while being surrounded by the entire Heaven’s Mandate—all 13 squads.","Despite having basically the entire army present, nobody there felt safe around Selena, a monster with a cultivation level beyond that of a Cultivation God.","\"So, how long do you plan on making me wait, Emperor of the Nine Heavens?\" Selena asked aloud after waiting for some time outside the Celestial Emperor’s audience room.","\"Excuse me for the delay, Absolute Ruler.\"","The Celestial Emperor’s voice resounded, and the doors to the room opened the following moment.","Selena calmly walked inside, followed by the generals of Heaven’s Mandate.","At the far end of the room sat the Celestial Emperor, with a masked figure standing silently beside him.","Selena stopped before the raised platform and, without even lifting her head to look at the Celestial Emperor, spoke in an annoyed voice. \"Not only did you make me wait, but you even dared to seat yourself above me, forcing me to look up at you?\"","Before the Celestial Emperor could respond, Selena continued in a domineering tone, \"But since you are not accustomed to being in the presence of someone above you, I will not blame you for this mistake. I will even give you a chance to correct it.\"","\"!!!\"","The generals of Heaven’s Mandate widened their eyes in shock at Selena’s bold words. Under normal circumstances, they would have immediately condemned such blasphemy. However, knowing her identity and strength, none of them dared to utter a word. Their mouths opened in disbelief, only to close again a moment later.","The Celestial Emperor remained silent for a moment before rising from his seat and descending the platform until he stood on the same level as Selena.","\"You are right. I apologize if my habits have offended you in any way, Absolute Ruler.\"","A cold smile tugged at Selena’s lips as she replied, \"I understand that you are wary of me. You even went to such lengths to create these defensive formations, but they are nothing more than a waste of resources. If I wished to, I could kill everyone here with ease.\"","Then, she took a step toward the Celestial Emperor. In the next moment, the invisible formation between them shattered like fragile glass.","\"?!?!\"","Seeing this, everyone present flinched, subconsciously reaching for their weapons.","However, the Celestial Emperor quickly raised his hand and spoke, \"Stand down.\"","Once the generals withdrew their hands, the Celestial Emperor continued, \"You may all leave. I wish to speak with the Absolute Ruler alone.\"","\"W-We cannot do that, Your Majesty!\"","The Celestial Emperor glared at them and said, \"As she has already stated, if she wished to harm me, none of you would be able to stop her. Therefore, it makes no difference whether you remain here or not. I will not repeat myself.\"","After a moment of silence, the generals reluctantly left the room, leaving Selena, the Celestial Emperor, and the masked man in the room alone."]},{"number":2540,"title":"Chapter 2540: Selena’s Audience With the Celestial Emperor(2)","paragraphs":["Selena glanced at the masked figure beside the Celestial Emperor for a brief moment before ignoring him and speaking to the Celestial Emperor, \"So, what do you wish to speak to me about?\"","\"It’s quite simple. I want to know what your true purpose for coming to our world is. Do you really wish for humans and demons to coexist, or are you looking for something else?\"","Selena raised an eyebrow at the Celestial Emperor’s choice of words. \"What makes you think I am looking for something?\"","\"I have no reason to think that,\" the Celestial Emperor replied. \"I was merely making an assumption.\"","\"...\"","Selena fell silent for a moment before speaking again. \"Although there is nothing I personally want from the Nine Heavens, I will admit that its resources will likely be sought after. The Demonic Realm’s resources have long since become scarce due to overpopulation and the immortality of our people.\"","\"Hmm... While our world does possess an abundance of resources, that does not mean we can use them without restraint. The only reason we have not exhausted them is because we enforce strict regulations to prevent overconsumption.\"","Selena nodded. \"I will ensure that strict regulations are imposed on any demons who visit this world, so they do not take more than they are allowed.\"","The Celestial Emperor shook his head. \"Their desire for our resources is not what concerns me most. It is our safety. From what I have been told, Cultivation Gods are fairly abundant in the Demonic Realm. Yet in this world, there are so few that they can be counted on one’s fingers.\"","He continued, \"If even a few of them were to visit our world, the balance of power would immediately collapse. Hell, your presence alone has already thrown it into disarray.\"","\"Because time flows differently between our worlds, it is not something I can truly regulate. However, it is possible to restrict the strength of those allowed to visit your world, ensuring that they remain within this world’s power level,\" Selena said.","Then, she continued, \"I have also heard that some of your people wish to visit the Demonic Realm to accelerate their cultivation, since time passes much faster in our world. However, I must warn you that our environment is vastly different and may not be suitable for humans like you. The Divine Paragon is an anomaly and should not be used as an example.\"","The Celestial Emperor nodded and said, \"We will also have regulations for humans who wish to visit the Demonic Realm.\"","\"Onto my next concern... could whatever turned your people into demons spread to our world? If there is even the slightest possibility, we will have no choice but to keep our world closed.\"","\"I do not have a clear answer for you right now, but once I have a concrete answer, I will let you know.\"","\"How do you plan to determine that without experimenting on our people?\"","\"I do not,\" Selena answered calmly. \"Because I intend to experiment on the humans of this world.\"","\"What?\" The Celestial Emperor immediately frowned at her outrageous words.","\"I have already discussed this matter with the leader of the Demon Sealing Clan. Apparently, there are people in this world who worship demons—Demon Worshippers. We plan to conduct the experiments on them... though, of course, their participation will be entirely voluntary.\"","\"...\"","The Celestial Emperor fell silent at her explanation, unsure how to feel about it. On one hand, he despised the Demon Worshippers as much as everyone else. On the other hand, allowing demons to experiment on humans did not sit right with him, even if it were voluntary.","Selena noticed the hesitation in the Celestial Emperor’s eyes and continued, \"Either that, or we can leave it to time to reveal the truth. That being said, I am quite confident that it is not contagious. Otherwise, you humans would have long since turned into demons during the Forsaken’s invasion in the past.\"","The Celestial Emperor narrowed his eyes slightly, finding her explanation difficult to refute. It was not as though demons had only just appeared in their world, since the Forsaken had existed there since ancient times. Yet, there had not been a single recorded case of a human turning into a demon.","Selena and the Celestial Emperor continued to discuss coexistence between humans and demons until there was nothing left to discuss.","\"Then let us end our meeting here,\" Selena said.","The Celestial Emperor nodded.","\"Once you have become more accustomed to our world, we can discuss the matter further in the future.\"","Selena didn’t linger and left shortly after, escorted back to the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library by Heaven’s Mandate.","Once Selena left, the Celestial Emperor returned to his own private chamber with the masked figure, who had not spoken a word since the beginning.","\"That woman is much harder to deal with than I anticipated,\" the Celestial Emperor sighed aloud. \"I wanted to invite her to our side, but I need to monitor her a little longer before I decide.","He turned to the masked figure and asked, \"What do you think, Master? Is she going to be a problem?\"","The masked figure finally spoke in a cold voice. \"That woman cannot be trusted. There is a good chance her creator, Deemo, sent her here to steal the Absolute Power from us.\"","He continued, \"Although she may become a problem in the future, it is not something we cannot handle. For now, she is of no concern.\"","After a brief pause, the masked man spoke in an irritated voice. \"Our focus right now should be on that bastard who forced us into slumber and delayed our plans. Although we killed him during our clash, we were unable to destroy his soul. He will undoubtedly return and cause even more trouble for us.\"","He turned to face the Celestial Emperor and commanded, \"Stop wasting time! Find that bastard and annihilate him! If you cannot kill him, then hinder him until we have fully recovered!\""]},{"number":2541,"title":"Chapter 2541: Earth?","paragraphs":["\"Yes, Master. I will use every resource at my disposal to eliminate that bastard who was foolish enough to defy you,\" the Celestial Emperor said, bowing to the masked figure.","\"...\"","Without another word, the masked figure suddenly collapsed to the ground like a lifeless corpse, and the mysterious aura emitted from their body vanished like smoke.","Moments later, the figure stood back up without picking up the mask that had fallen off during his fall.","\"Huh? What am I doing here?\" the man looked around with a dumbfounded look on his face.","\"Y-Your Majesty! Please forgive this subordinate for intruding in your private chambers! I swear I don’t—\"","\"Leave.\" The Celestial Emperor interrupted in a cold voice.","\"Yes!\"","The man didn’t dare to linger and hastily left the room while still being confused.","Once he was alone again, the Celestial Emperor stared into the empty horizon and mumbled, \"Where are you...? The moment you reveal yourself, I will end you once and for all!\"","Meanwhile, after leaving the Celestial Palace, Selena decided to return to the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library by herself, sending Heaven’s Madate away.","Shortly later, she was approached by Angela and Helena.","\"Are you done speaking with the Celestial Emperor or whatever?\" Angela asked.","Selena nodded, \"Yes. What are you two doing here?\"","\"Yuan gave us permission to explore this world, so that’s what we’re going to do. What about you? Are you really going to play the role of the Demonic Realm’s ruler and help unite our worlds?\"","\"I am. It’s actually a lot of fun, and I get to travel, too.\"","Angela and Helena exchanged looks with each other, wondering whether to reveal what they had learned to her so soon, as it could disturb her mind.","Eventually, Helena said, \"Selena, we have something to tell you. It’s about our comrades—the other Transcendents who were supposedly killed by the Demon God.\"","In the end, they decided to tell her everything.","\"...\"","Selena listened with a solemn expression. Although her face remained calm, a flicker of burning anger glinted in her eyes.","\"I see... so there are only two of them left...\" she mumbled.","\"We must avenge our comrades, Selena!\" Angela suddenly shouted.","Helena agreed by nodding silently.","Selena rubbed her eyes and sighed out loud. \"And how are we going to do that? Have you already forgotten how miserably we lost before? How will it be any different this time? It’s not that I don’t want to avenge our comrades, but there’s really nothing we can do, and I don’t want to pointlessly lose our lives.\"","\"B-But—!\" Angela opened her mouth to speak, only to realize that she had no response to Selena’s words.","Selena spoke again, \"I know what you’re feeling, but do you really want to throw away your life—your freedom, so soon after just regaining it? We have an eternity to figure out how to avenge our comrades and defeat the Demon God, so let’s take this slowly.\"","\"What about Lucian and the other Transcendent, who are still imprisoned by the Demon God? Although we are free, they are still prisoners who have been forced to fight this entire time.\" Helena said. \"They may be immortal, but they don’t have unlimited time like us.\"","Angela added, \"And who’s to say the Demon God wouldn’t make us fight for him after they die? We got lucky because we weren’t as strong as the others, but once we’re truly the only Transcedents left, the Demon God will definitely come after us.\"","\"I... will try to think of something, but for now, let’s just focus on our current situation.\"","\"In that case, can we join you? Yuan said we could if we wanted to.\"","Selena nodded, \"Of course.\"","’I wonder what he’s doing now...’ Selena wondered inwardly as Yuan’s face entered her mind.","At the same time, Yuan had just passed through the sealed gates and found himself surrounded by the Starry Sky, standing upon a lone path that stretched toward the distant horizon.","Without hesitation, Yuan began walking down the path.","As he walked, he carefully surveyed his surroundings.","Throughout his many past lives, Yuan had spent an immense amount of time in the Starry Sky—so much so that he remembered the position of nearly every star around the Nine Heavens. He could even immediately tell when a star had died or when a new one had been born.","At first, Yuan could tell that he was somewhere close to the Nine Heavens, as he recognized many of the stars around him. However, as he continued down the path, the positions of the stars gradually began to shift. Some vanished from view, while unfamiliar ones appeared in their place.","Eventually, the Starry Sky before him contained no stars he recognized, meaning he had traveled somewhere far beyond the Nine Heavens.","After walking for an unknown amount of time, the Starry Sky became completely unrecognizable, and even the flickering stars seemed fundamentally different.","Eventually, Yuan caught sight of the end of the path, where a lone black door stood ominously in the distance, silently beckoning him forward.","After reaching the end of the path, Yuan stood quietly before the door, examining it with great interest.","At first glance, the door appeared ordinary. However, an engraving covered its surface, depicting a group of human-like figures staring up at a massive being hovering above them—one that looked down upon them like some kind of god.","’Humans... and an Eternal?’ Yuan wondered inwardly.","After pondering for some time, Yuan pushed the door open and stepped into the abyss beyond it.","In the next moment, he felt his consciousness being drained away, as though his soul had left his body.","When he finally came to, Yuan found himself lying in a field of grass, staring up at a clear, bright-blue sky.","He quickly sat up and surveyed his surroundings.","\"Where... am I?\" Yuan muttered, his face filled with bewilderment as his gaze swept over the towering skyscrapers around him—buildings that reminded him of Earth.","\"Haha! You can’t catch me!\"","The sound of children playing nearby reached Yuan’s ears, causing him to turn toward them. Sure enough, a group of children was playing what appeared to be tag nearby.","However, there was something strange about these children.","\"Their auras... they’re cultivators?\" Yuan examined their aura closely, and to his absolute shock, every one of these children was a Cultivation God!","\"What?!\" Yuan shot to his feet in disbelief, drawing the children’s attention.","The children then approached him and stared at him in silence, their eyes flickering with intrigue, as if they were looking at something unusual.","\"Mister, I have never seen someone with such a weak aura before,\" one of the children suddenly remarked.","Yuan’s eyebrows twitched, and he replied, \"And I have never seen children with such a powerful aura. Are you really children? Or experts disguised as one?\"","The children exchanged puzzled looks with each other.","\"What is he talking about?\" one of them asked aloud.","\"Our aura is powerful? This is the first time I’ve been told such a thing,\" said another.","\"Surely, he must be messing with us.\"","The children turned their attention to Yuan again, and one of them asked, \"Mister, where are you from? I have never seen clothes like yours before.\"","Only then did Yuan realize that the children were wearing skin-tight full-body suits that covered them from neck to toe.","\"I’m from a place called the Nine Heavens. What is this place called?\"","\"Nine Heavens? Never heard of it.\"","\"We’re at Sector 11.\"","\"Sector 11? Is that a street name? What about this world?\" Yuan inquired.","Despite his odd questions, the children answered, \"Sector 11 is the area we’re in. Our planet is called Earth.\"","\"What? We’re on Earth?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows.","He immediately attempted to use his divine sense, only to realize it did not work, as if something were preventing him from using it.","That was when he noticed something else. The entire place was enveloped by something similar to a formation—one that suppressed spiritual energy perfectly.","\"Mister, where is this ’Nine Heavens’ place?\" one of the children questioned.","\"I don’t know how to explain it... But are you sure this world is called Earth? I used to live in a place called Earth, but it was nothing like this,\" Yuan said.","\"Are you saying that we’re lying?\"","\"We’re not lying! This world is really called Earth! Our teacher taught us about it yesterday, too!\"","Yuan rubbed his eyes at his puzzling situation.","’Is this another world that is similar to the Demonic Realm? A world created by an Eternal?’","He could not understand why the sealed gates had brought him to such a place. Hell, he was not even sure where he had been taken.","Suddenly, sirens began blaring in the distance, causing the children to tremble in fear.","Then, without warning, they turned around and started sprinting away.","\"Hey! Where are you guys going? What’s happening right now?\" Yuan asked as he chased after them."]},{"number":2542,"title":"Chapter 2542: Taking Shelter","paragraphs":["’These kids are fast!’ Yuan cried inwardly as he struggled to keep up with them.","Unable to use spiritual energy, he could only rely on the strength of his physical body to chase after these children. But despite tempering his body to an extreme degree that would overwhelm even a Cultivation God in the Nine Heavens, he was still having difficulty keeping up with children who appeared to be no older than ten.","’No! It’s not that they’re fast—it’s that I’m slow!’ Yuan suddenly realized as he began moving.","There was something fundamentally different about the atmosphere in this place. The gravity was unimaginably heavy, making Yuan feel as though mountains were chained to his back.","Perhaps his senses had been muddled after the teleportation, but he really didn’t notice the gravity until he just started moving.","\"Why are you moving so slow? Hurry up if you don’t want to disappear!\" One of the kids suddenly turned his head around to shout at Yuan.","\"What do you mean by that? I don’t even know what’s going on!\"","\"Are you serious?!\"","\"Are you really an adult? Even children younger than us know about it!\"","The children exclaimed in disbelief after hearing Yuan’s words.","\"I already told you that I am not from this place!\" Yuan sighed loudly.","\"We’ll explain it to you once we reach the shelter! Just keep running for now!\"","A few minutes later, they arrived at a small, unassuming rectangular building, and the children entered without hesitation.","Yuan raised an eyebrow at the structure, which resembled nothing more than a public restroom, before silently following them inside.","The moment Yuan stepped into the building, an odd sensation washed over him, as though he had just passed through an invisible barrier.","\"What the—?\"","Yuan raised his eyebrows at the sight before him. After following the children into the building, he found himself teleported to an entirely different place.","He was no longer inside a building, but in a vast underground expanse shrouded in darkness, with only dim lights illuminating the area.","There were many buildings scattered throughout the area as well, though none were as tall as the skyscrapers outside.","However, what stood out to Yuan most was the sheer number of people present, with more and more individuals teleported into the underground expanse with every passing second.","Yuan examined the cultivations of those around him, and the discovery left him utterly shocked. Everyone present was at least a Cultivation God, while many had even reached the Absolute God Realm.","Yet the most shocking part was that the majority of them emitted auras Yuan could not perceive at all. That could only mean one thing—that their cultivation was so high that even he was unable to see through it.","It had not been long since Yuan learned of a realm above the Cultivation God Realm in the Demonic Realm, and seeing so many people who might possess cultivations even beyond the Absolute God Realm left him utterly dazed.","’What cultivation level are these people? How long did it take them to achieve it? If it took trillions of years for the Demonic Realm to discover the realm of Absolute God, how old is this world?!’ Yuan cried inwardly, wondering if he’d somehow entered an ancient civilization unfathomably old, or if it was a world where time moved countless times faster than the Demonic Realm.","\"Mister, are you okay?\"","One of the children suddenly asked, snapping Yuan out of his daze.","Yuan lowered his head to look at the children standing before him. There were four of them—two boys and two girls—and they were all staring at him with curious, inquisitive gazes, as though intrigued by his unusual existence.","\"Do you really have no idea what is going on, Mister?\" one of them eventually questioned him.","Yuan calmly nodded.","Then, one of the boys said, \"When the sirens activate, everyone must enter the shelter, or you will disappear from this world.\"","Yuan then asked, \"How will you disappear?\"","However, the children shook their heads. \"We won’t know the details until we grow up. We are only told that we will disappear if we fail to seek shelter in time.\"","Upon hearing this, Yuan could not help but feel that something about the entire situation was suspicious. He wondered whether the children were being lied to or brainwashed. However, that still did not explain why there were so many adults inside the shelter.","\"Then how long do we have to stay down here?\" Yuan then asked.","\"It depends. Some days we won’t be able to return to the surface for weeks, while there are days when we can leave after just a few hours,\" replied one of the girls.","\"Then what do you all do down here?\"","\"The same thing we do on the surface.\"","\"And what is that?\"","\"School. Play. Everything.\"","\"What is this world’s population like? Is everyone here?\" Yuan asked as he looked around.","At a glance, he could easily count more than a hundred thousand people, with hundreds more appearing every passing second.","\"I don’t know how many people are in this world, but not everyone goes to the same place.\"","\"There are many shelters out there, one for each sector. And we’re currently in Shelter 11.\"","\"In that case, how many Sectors are on Earth?\"","\"There are ninety-nine Minor Sectors, nine Major Sectors, and one Core Sector.\"","\"What are the differences between seach sectors? Wealth? Fame? Influence?\" Yuan inquired.","\"I’m not too sure... What about you guys?\"","\"I don’t know, either.\"","\"Anyway, I have to return home now. It was nice meeting you, weird Mister!\"","\"Me, too! Let’s chat again next time!\"","One by one, the children scattered in different directions, quickly disappearing into the crowd.","Although Yuan still had many questions, he felt that he would not learn much more from them.","’Should I speak to another adult, or...?’","Yuan surveyed his surroundings with a thoughtful expression.","Eventually, he decided to take a brief tour of the area to better understand his new environment before approaching another resident."]},{"number":2543,"title":"Chapter 2543: Arrested","paragraphs":["As Yuan quietly walked down the crowded underground streets, his distinctive appearance drew the attention of nearly everyone he passed.","While everyone present wore tight bodysuits that resembled futuristic spacesuits, Yuan wore loose robes from the Nine Heavens. However, it wasn’t his unique appearance alone that made him stand out, as his low cultivation at the 3rd level of God Ascension left many people speechless.","After all, even children at the age of 10 were Cultivation Gods in their world. Yet, an adult like Yuan was below that.","Yuan ignored the stares and examined the buildings’ structures.","’As I thought, they resemble those from Earth, but they are far more advanced... Could this place somehow be Earth’s future?’ Yuan wondered inwardly.","As absurd as the thought sounded, it made sense to him. After all, it would explain why the cultivators here possessed strength that far surpassed even those of the Demonic Realm—a world already far ahead of the Nine Heavens in the passage of time.","Moreover, he had already visited a world that was essentially the ancient Nine Heavens, so it would not be strange if, this time, he had arrived in the distant future instead.","’So this is what Earth would look like in the future, huh?’ Yuan’s intrigue surged after reaching this conclusion.","However, he still couldn’t understand why he was brought to this world in the first place, as he’d expected something else entirely after fully translating the technique given to him by the ’Eternal’ that was sealed the last time he visited the cavern.","’And this whole situation... what could they possibly be hiding from?’","If experts who stood far above the Absolute God Realm were frightened enough to hide underground, Yuan could not help but feel nervous about the kind of monsters they were hiding from.","As Yuan walked through the underground shelter, he began to understand what the children meant when they said that life below was no different from life on the surface.","There were restaurants, schools, and even parks in this shelter, making life underground the same as on the surface.","Moreover, the people present all acted as if it were normal, indicating they were used to such a lifestyle.","\"Hey, you with the weird appearance!\" A voice suddenly resounded loudly.","Even without looking, Yuan knew this person was calling out to him, so he stopped and turned around to face them.","\"?!?!\"","Yuan’s eyes widened with shock and disbelief when he saw the face of this individual.","\"Meixiu?!\" Yuan exclaimed when he saw the face of the individual who had called out to him.","At first, he thought she merely resembled Meixiu. However, even that would have been an understatement, as this woman looked exactly like her.","This woman, who resembled Meixiu, wore a black-and-white suit with a golden badge on her chest.","\"What nonsense are you babbling about? I am Officer Mei.\" The woman responded as she approached Yuan.","She looked at him from head to toe before questioning with a frown on her face, \"Where is your battlesuit?\"","\"Uh... I lost it?\" Yuan made a random excuse.","\"Are you serious? You know it’s against the law to walk around outside without your suit, right? A misdemeanor, to be exact. Let me see your ID,\" said Officer Mei, gesturing for his identification.","Yuan pretended to look around his robes before responding, \"Oh, right. I lost it along with my suit.\"","\"What?! How can you lose something like that?!\"","Yuan shrugged.","Officer Mei rubbed her eyes and sighed. \"In that case, you are under arrest.\"","Before Yuan could respond, Officer Mei flicked her arm, sending a streak of golden light toward him.","The moment it touched Yuan, the golden light coiled around his body like ropes, binding him in place.","\"?\"","Yuan stared at the bindings with a raised eyebrow. The next instant, he felt every ounce of strength drain from his body.","Thud.","Deprived of his strength, Yuan collapsed beneath the immense gravity of this world. Even at full power, he had struggled merely to move around.","\"This is why you wear your battlesuit outside,\" she remarked. \"That being said, I’m actually impressed that you’re walking around without your suit, since it helps resist the immense energy of this world.\"","\"...\"","Then Officer Mei grabbed the bind on Yuan with her hand, lifted him, and carried him away, treating him like luggage.","\"Where are you bringing me?\" Yuan inquired calmly despite his situation.","\"Where else? The station, so I can identify and charge you.\"","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent after that and allowed her to take him away.","Some time later, they arrived at the station.","\"Oh? Who is this weirdo you brought back, Officer Mei?\"","The moment they entered the station, the others inside turned to stare at Yuan with curious expressions.","\"Some idiot walking around without his suit or identification,\" she calmly replied.","\"Hahaha!\"","The entire room burst with laughter.","\"Anyway, I’m going to run his prints so I can charge him properly.\"","\"The room’s free, so go ahead.\"","Officer Mei nodded and carried Yuan into another room.","\"I’m going to loosen your restraints to retrieve some of your blood now,\" Officer Mei remarked as she seated Yuan on a seat with a machine right next to it.","\"Don’t do anything stupid,\" she then warned.","Yuan silently nodded.","After removing his restraints, Officer Mei grabbed his hand and fed it into the machine.","Yuan could immediately feel something prick his finger before drawing his blood.","\"Why are you staring at me so intently?\" Officer Mei questioned.","\"You resemble someone that I know,\" he said.","\"Meixiu?\" she asked.","Yuan nodded.","\"Is that so?\" she muttered indifferently before turning toward the machine that had begun to beep.","\"Huh?\" Officer Mei’s expression turned puzzled when she saw the results.","\"What’s going on? Inconclusive? How’s that possible?\"","She fell silent, then, after a moment’s thought, said, \"I am going to take the test again due to an unexpected error.\"","\"Do as you please, but it probably won’t work,\" Yuan remarked.","\"What do you mean?\" she asked, her eyebrows raised in a puzzled manner."]},{"number":2544,"title":"Chapter 2544: Registration","paragraphs":["\"Because no matter how many times you test my blood, it won’t work, since I am not from this world,\" Yuan calmly revealed to Officer Mei, without a care for the consequences.","Of course, Officer Mei did not believe a word he’d just said and thought that he was just spewing nonsense.","The next moment, she tested his blood again, completely ignoring his nonsense.","Yuan didn’t say anything and silently waited for the results.","\"Di! Di! Di!\"","Officer Mei turned to look at the result and made a puzzled face upon seeing it.","\"Inconclusive, again?\"","Officer Mei could not comprehend what was causing the error. She had worked as an officer for over a decade and examined tens of thousands of people, yet she had never encountered an error like this before.","\"I told you. I’m not from this world, so the system won’t recognize me, no matter how many times you try,\" Yuan repeated calmly.","Officer Mei frowned and said, \"Enough with the nonsense. Do you really expect me to believe that? Just because you’re wearing some weird outfit doesn’t mean you’re from another world!\"","Yuan shrugged.","\"Then be my guest and keep trying.\"","Officer Mei did just that, stubbornly testing his blood several more times. However, after failing for the tenth time, she restrained him again before leaving the room without a word.","\"What? That weirdo you just brought in isn’t recognized by the database? How’s that possible?\"","When the other officers learned of the situation, none of them could believe it.","\"Are you sure you did it properly?\" One of them asked.","Officer Mei frowned and said, \"Do you think this is my first time operating the machine or what? Either something is wrong, or that man isn’t in the database!\"","\"That is outrageous. Everyone is registered in the database at birth.\"","\"Some people may be unregistered if they were born in secrecy, but anyone absent from the database is considered nonexistent and would not be able to live a normal life, so they don’t stay unregistered for long.\"","\"That man looked to be an adult. Personally, I have never heard or met anyone who remained unregistered past their teenage years before.\"","\"There is always a first for everything,\" said another officer.","\"What should we do about him?\" Officer Mei then asked, not even bothering to bring up Yuan’s claim of being from another world since she felt it would make her sound foolish.","\"Learn how he managed to survive so long without an identification, and then register him.\"","Officer Mei nodded before returning to the room.","\"So, how did you make it to adulthood without an identification? Since you can’t live an ordinary life without being registered, someone must have helped you, which is a felony. If you tell me now, I’ll put in a good word for you, which might reduce your sentence.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and asked, \"Why does everyone need to be registered?\"","\"Why are you asking me? I don’t make the rules around here. I just follow and enforce them.\"","\"...Well, I already explained why I don’t—\"","\"I swear, if you say that you are from another world one more time...\" Officer Mei interrupted Yuan while rubbing her eyes in an irritated manner.","Yuan shrugged, \"Then I don’t know what else to say.\"","\"You little...\"","\"Fine. Don’t tell me if you don’t want me. I’m going to register you in our database now, whether you like it or not.\"","She grabbed him by the restraints and carried him into another room, treating him like luggage once again.","Yuan found his situation quite humorous and decided to see how things played out.","A few minutes later, inside another room, Officer Mei placed Yuan into a capsule-shaped machine and strapped him inside before closing the lid.","The next moment, Officer Mei pressed a green button on the machine, activating it. Almost immediately, liquid began to fill the capsule’s interior, quickly submerging Yuan completely.","Despite being submerged in an unknown substance, Yuan did not panic and patiently held his breath.","One minute... two minutes... three minutes later...","Officer Mei tapped on the small window on the capsule and spoke loudly, \"Stop holding your breath and breath it in! It won’t kill you! And since it’s part of the process, this won’t end until you do!\"","Hearing this, Yuan stopped holding his breath and started breathing, as weird and awkward as it felt.","’Oh? I can breathe in this liquid?’","As he started breathing normally, the liquid quickly filled his internal organs. Yet it was not painful, and it even felt a little comfortable.","\"Di! Di! Di!\"","The machine started beeping.","\"What is it this time?\" Officer Mei’s eyebrows furrowed into a deep frown as she checked the notification on the machine.","\"What the heck is going on...?\" she muttered in a dumbfounded voice as her eyes slowly widened with surprise.","[Warning!]","[Individual is already registered to a system]","[If you proceed with the process, it will override their existing system]","\"He’s already registered in the database? That’s impossible! If that were the case, why was the machine unable to identify him before?\" Officer Mei exclaimed in bewilderment.","She turned to look at Yuan’s handsome face through the window and wondered inwardly, ’What if it’s true that he’s from another world?’","However, that thought only lingered in her mind for a few seconds before she quickly shook it away.","’I must be going crazy to even believe his nonsense for a second.’","She looked at the screen again.","[Proceed with the override?]","[Yes][Cancel]","Without another thought, she pressed ’Yes’.","[Checking identification]","[Identity has been verified as ’Officer Mei’]","[Checking authorization]","[Authorization has been accepted]","[Override has been authorized by ’Officer Mei’]","[Override has begun]","Meanwhile, Yuan was enjoying the warmth in his body when a familiar noise suddenly snapped him out of his daze.","<Shura’s System Has Detected An Anomaly>","<System’s Defense Activated>","<System’s Defense Failed>","<Shura’s System Is Being Overridden>","<Shura’s System Has Been Overridden>","<Shura’s System Has Been Deleted>","<Gaia’s System Has Been Activated>"]},{"number":2545,"title":"Chapter 2545: Gaia’s System","paragraphs":["<Gaia’s System Has Been Activated>","’Shura’s System was replaced?!’ Yuan cried inwardly after he saw the notifications.","’Gaia’s System... Does this world belong to Gaia?’","Yuan immediately assumed this Gaia to be an Eternal since their name sounded like one, and the previous two systems he had used were also created by Eternals.","’Damn it... What now?’ Yuan pondered with a solemn look on his face.","He could never have anticipated Shura’s System being replaced in such a manner.","’I haven’t even been able to contact Shura once since my reincarnation, and now my only clue to finding him is gone...’ he sighed inwardly.","’This Gaia... to be able to override Shura’s System, they must be much stronger than him.’","Ding!","Suddenly, another notification popped up.","<Gaia’s System has sensed an anomaly in the user>","<Starting Examination>","<Anomaly Identified>","<Searching For Treatment>","<Treatment Found>","<Utilizing Level 9 Treatment>","[...]","[...]","[...]","<Error>","<User lacks the credentials for the level of treatment>","<Treatment will be postponed>","\"???\"","Yuan was left speechless by the notifications, struggling to comprehend what had just happened.","’An anomaly within me? Does it have something to do with the curses that are still affecting me? Or is it something else?’","Before he could give it any thought, more notifications popped up.","<Gaia’s System has sensed an anomaly in the user>","<Searching For Treatment>","<Treatment Found>","<Utilizing Level 1 Treatment>","[...]","<Treatment Completed>","<A curse has been removed from the user>","<Gaia’s System has sensed an anomaly in the user>","<Searching For Treatment>","<Treatment Found>","<Utilizing Level 2 Treatment>","<Error>","<User lacks the credentials for the level of treatment>","<Treatment will be postponed>","’It cured one of my curses!’ Yuan cried inwardly.","Although it had been confusing at first, he was beginning to understand Gaia’s System.","Based on everything that had happened so far, he could infer that Gaia’s System possessed a healing function capable of curing afflictions harmful to its user. However, receiving treatment required a certain level of credentials.","As for how he could increase those credentials, that remained unknown for the time being.","He had also learned that something potentially harmful was hidden within his body—something that required an exceptionally high level of credentials to treat. Yet, he had remained completely unaware of its existence until now, only aware of the curses.","’Just how terrifying is this anomaly if treating it requires credentials several levels higher than those needed for my curses?’ Yuan swallowed nervously.","His curses were already so powerful that he had struggled to remove them even with the Sacred Chalice of Purification. Yet Gaia’s System had erased one of them in the blink of an eye, and without requiring him to do anything at all.","’This Gaia’s System is so much more powerful and capable than the last two I had... Or should I say it’s more... complete?’","Yuan’s interest in this world and this Eternal named Gaia skyrocketed.","Suddenly, the liquid in the capsule began to drain, and the door opened shortly afterward.","Officer Mei grabbed his restraint and pulled him out of the capsule.","\"Your registration is done,\" she said with an odd look on her face.","\"Thanks, I guess...\"","\"...\"","\"What is it?\" Yuan asked when Officer Mei remained silent, quietly staring at him.","\"Nothing,\" she quickly said.","In truth, she wanted to question him about his existing system, but she decided against it since she had a feeling he would only waste her time with nonsensical answers.","\"What now?\" Yuan then asked. \"Am I free to go?\"","\"Are you serious?\" Officer Mei frowned before sneering, \"You’re still on the hook for breaking the law. Not only were you outside without a suit, but you weren’t even regis—\"","Officer Mei halted herself mid-sentence when she recalled that she had to override his system, so he technically had one.","\"So what? Are you going to throw me in jail?\"","\"Perhaps. It’s not too late to tell me the truth.\"","\"I have not lied to you,\" Yuan sighed while shaking his head.","\"...\"","Officer Mei could tell that Yuan was being genuine by his tone and crystal-clear eyes, but his explanation was just too outrageous.","\"If you’re really from another world, where did you come from?\"","\"A place called the Nine Heavens.\"","\"Nine Heavens? What a weird name,\" she remarked. \"Then where is it? And how did you come to our world?\"","\"I can’t answer your first question since I don’t know. As for how I got here... I also don’t know. I walked through a door, and before I knew it, I was here.\"","An incredulous expression appeared on Officer Mei’s face as she listened to this nonsense.","\"If you remove my restraints, I can prove it to you,\" Yuan then said.","\"...\"","After a bit of hesitation, Officer Mei removed his restraints. Since Yuan’s aura was so weak, she wasn’t worried that he might try something and was fully confident that she could take him down at any point.","\"Here, look at—\"","\"?!?!\"","Yuan’s eyes widened when he noticed that the Spatial Rings on his fingers had vanished.","\"Huh? Where did they go?\"","He immediately began patting down his body.","’No way! Did I drop them somewhere?’ he cried inwardly.","Then, he recalled the moment he first arrived in this world.","’No... They were already gone by the time I came here! Does this mean that only my soul has traveled to this world, and my true body is still in the Nine Heavens?’ he quickly came to this conclusion.","’\"I must admit...\" Officer Mei suddenly spoke.","\"I have arrested many people in my decade-long career, and your acting is on an entirely different level—one of the best I have seen. Unfortunately, you’re also one of the worst liars. Though, this works to my benefit since I would have been fooled by you if your deception was even half as good as your acting.\"","\"...\"","Yuan stared at her with raised eyebrows, wondering if there was anything he could say to convince this woman, who was a splitting image of Meixiu, that he wasn’t messing with her."]},{"number":2546,"title":"Chapter 2546: Perfected Heavenly Refinement","paragraphs":["\"Enough of your farce. Follow me. I am going to check your identity again,\" Officer Mei said to Yuan before bringing him back to the previous room to collect his blood with the machine again.","This time, there was no error, and Officer Mei could finally see Yuan’s identity.","[Name: Yuan]","[Age: ???]","[Cultivation: Third Level First Ascension]","[Physique: Perfected Heavenly Refinement]","[Credential Rank: 1]","\"?!?!?\"","Officer Mei’s eyes widened with shock after seeing Yuan’s information on the machine.","She rubbed her eyes a moment before looking again, as if hoping to see something different, but everything remained the same.","Although Yuan’s age being unknown was puzzling and his low cultivation was baffling, they were nothing compared to his physique.","\"Perfected Heavenly Refinement?! Impossible!\" she cried out loud.","\"What?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow at this new term.","Officer Mei turned to look at Yuan’s puzzled face and swallowed nervously.","\"H-How did you achieve Perfected Heavenly Refinement?\" she asked him.","\"What is that?\" Yuan asked, still with an eyebrow raised.","\"Stop messing with me already!\" she shouted in anger.","Yuan frowned. \"I really am not. I have no idea what this Perfected Heavenly Refinement is.\"","\"It is your physique!\"","\"Uh... Even if you ask me that, how am I supposed to explain it? And even if I could explain it, what would be the point when you do not possess the physique?\"","\"What nonsense are you spewing? Of course, I have the same physique,\" Officer Mei responded with a frown on her face.","\"What?\" Yuan wore a dumbfounded look after hearing her expected words.","\"You... also have the Heaven Refining Physique? I thought only one person could possess it at any given moment?\"","Officer Mei shook her head and sighed, \"There must really be something wrong with you. Acting like you’re the only one in this world with that physique when everyone in this world possesses the Heavenly Refinement physique.\"","\"Everyone?!\" Yuan exclaimed in disbelief. \"I don’t believe you. How can everyone possess such a powerful physique?\"","Officer Mei shrugged, \"Whether you believe it or not won’t change reality. Whatever. Don’t tell me if you don’t want to.\"","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent.","’Everyone in this world possesses the Heaven Refining Physique...? What the hell is going on?’","Suddenly—","<Lockdown has ended>","<You may return to the surface>","\"It ended quite swiftly this time...\" Officer Mei mumbled after seeing the same notification.","Yuan looked at her and asked, \"You can also see the notifications?\"","He already had a feeling that would be the case, but needed confirmation.","\"Isn’t it obvious? Everyone registered in the database has access to Gaia’s System.\"","Yuan then asked, \"Who is Gaia? Are they the Eternal who created this world?\"","\"Huh? What nonsense are you spewing now? Eternal? What is that?\"","’Gaia isn’t an Eternal? Or maybe they’re not aware of their existence...’","\"Never mind...\" Yuan shook his head before asking, \"So, what now?\"","Officer Mei narrowed her eyes at him.","A moment later, she spoke, \"Since the lockdown has ended, everyone will be returning to the surface soon. As for you... Although it’s a crime not to register in the database, there’s clearly something wrong with you... mentally. Therefore, instead of putting you in jail, I’ll recommend you for psychiatric care. Consider yourself lucky.\"","\"Psychiatric care...?\" Yuan’s jaw dropped, as he could never have imagined being put in such a position.","<Officer Mei has recommended you for Psychiatric Care>","<You must visit a Psychiatrist within 14 days or face penalties>","\"Done. You may leave now.\"","\"Just like that? But I still have some questions for you,\" Yuan said.","\"If you have any questions, ask your psychiatrist. If you linger around any longer, I’ll throw you in jail.\"","With no other choice, Yuan left the room. By the time he stepped outside the station, the once-crowded streets had become completely empty, and the underground city suddenly looked like a ghost town.","\"How do I return to the surface?\" Yuan mumbled.","Ding.","<Return to the surface now?>","When Yuan saw the notification, he wondered if the system would teleport him back to the surface.","He tapped on ’Yes’.","<Initializing Teleportation>","<Teleporting in 3...2...1>","Yuan’s vision blurred for an instant, and before he realized, he was back inside the building he had entered with the children before arriving at the underground shelter.","\"...What now?\"","He still had many questions, especially about Gaia’s System.","However, he didn’t know where to start.","Then, he looked at a certain notification that wouldn’t disappear.","<Visit a Psychiatrist>","<Time Limit: 13 days, 23 hours, 55 minutes, 27 seconds>","\"It’s almost like a quest... Do I really have to visit one?\" he sighed out loud, wondering what sort of penalties he’d face if he disobeyed it.","\"System, where can I find a Psychiatrist?\" he then asked, hoping the system could hear and answer him.","<Locating nearest Psychiatrist>","<Found Psychiatrist>","<Begin Direction Assistance?>","\"Wow, this thing is pretty convenient...\" Yuan stared at the notifications with awe.","\"Begin.\"","The next moment, a neon-green line appeared on the ground before him, presumably guiding him toward his destination.","When he looked closely, it even showed him the distance and time required to reach it.","Thus, Yuan started following the system’s directions.","As he started following the neon-green light, Yuan realized that the gravity in this world was no longer affecting him as much.","\"This world really resembles the Earth I know, except being countless times more advanced...\"","After reaching the end of the street and arriving at an intersection, a bright red ’Stop’ notification appeared before him.","Then, figures began soaring past Yuan along the road.","However, they were not riding ordinary vehicles. Instead, they stood atop what appeared to be hoverboards, surfing through the sky at incredible speeds.","\"Mother, why is that person’s aura so weak? Isn’t he an adult? Is there something wrong with him?\"","A nearby child suddenly spoke aloud, prompting Yuan to turn instinctively toward the voice, where he saw a little boy pointing directly at him.","\"It’s rude to point!\"","The boy’s mother quickly pressed his arm down before turning to face Yuan with an apologetic smile.","\"...\"","’Even a little kid like that is a Cultivation God...’ Yuan sighed inwardly.","Suddenly, he realized that he had not checked his status yet.","\"Show status.\"","[Name: Yuan]","[Age: ???]","[Cultivation: Third Level First Ascension]","[Physique: Perfected Heavenly Refinement]","[Credential Rank: 1]","’Third Level First Ascension?’ Yuan raised an eyebrow at his cultivation.","’Is that what God Ascension is called in this world?’","Then he saw his physique, and sure enough, it was called Perfected Heavenly Refinement.","’Credential Rank... this must be what I need to raise in order to cure my other curses... but how do I raise it?’","Ding!","<In order to raise your Credential Rank, you must contribute to society>","’Contribute to society...?’","\"Hm?\"","Before Yuan realized it, he had reached what appeared to be a dead end.","A tall wall stood before him, with a single entrance guarded by several people. Above the entrance, the number ’10’ was marked.","\"How do I get past?\" Yuan asked one of the guards.","The guard pointed to the machine standing nearby and said, \"We will need to check your credentials.\"","Yuan approached the machine, which resembled the one inside the station that examined his identity, and placed his hand into the slot.","A moment later, he felt a drop of his blood being collected.","Di.","A green light appeared on the machine.","\"You may pass,\" said the guard as he opened the door.","Yuan didn’t question it and passed through the door.","<You have entered Sector 10>","Yuan continued following the green line on the ground, and after another half an hour of walking, he reached a large building that was clearly a hospital.","\"...\"","After staring at it for a long moment, Yuan reluctantly entered the building and approached the front desk.","\"I was recommended to see a psychiatrist,\" he said to the woman behind the desk.","Without a word, the woman pointed to the small machine on top of the desk.","Sure enough, it was another one of those identity-reading machines.","’Do I really have to give my blood every time I need to do something in this world?’ he sighed inwardly as he placed his hand into the slot, feeding it a drop of his blood.","\"Take a seat. We’ll call you when it’s your turn,\" said the woman.","Yuan went to the waiting area and waited for his turn. In the meantime, he continued testing the system’s capabilities.","\"System, tell me about this world.\"","<This world is called Earth>","\"Anything else?\"","<User lacks the credentials>","’So even information requires credentials, huh?’","\"Can you tell me about the reason we have to hide in the underground shelter?\"","<User lacks the credentials>","Right as Yuan was about to ask another question—","Ding!","<Your meeting with a psychiatrist has been approved. Head to Room 221 as soon as possible>","\"Already?\"","Even though he had just sat down, Yuan didn’t complain and immediately made his way to room 221.","Upon arriving at his destination, Yuan knocked on the closed door.","\"You can enter.\"","A female voice quickly responded.","When Yuan opened the door and stepped into the room, he was met by another familiar face.","\"Wang Xiuying?\" he muttered with a dazed expression.","\"Hm?\" The woman who resembled Wang Xiuying raised an eyebrow at him but didn’t respond.","A moment later, she gestured at the chair before her and said, \"Please, take a seat.\"","Once he was seated, the woman said, \"I am your psychiatrist, Doctor Ying. According to your referrer, Officer Mei, you believe that you are from another world. Can you tell me why you believe you are from another world?\""]},{"number":2547,"title":"Chapter 2547: Psychiatrist","paragraphs":["\"I am your psychiatrist, Doctor Ying. According to your referrer, Officer Mei, you believe that you are from another world. Can you tell me why you believe you are from another world?\" Doctor Ying questioned Yuan with a calm expression on her face.","\"Is there really a point in this? It’s not like you’ll believe me...\" Yuan sighed aloud.","\"If you don’t want to talk, then there’s nothing I can do. I won’t force you, either. However, until you do, your recommendation won’t go away, and you will be punished after the time limit,\" said Doctor Ying.","\"Out of curiosity, what is the punishment?\" Yuan inquired.","\"You’ll either go to jail or be forced to enlist in the military,\" she calmly replied.","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent. As absurd as his situation was, there was nothing he could do but go with the flow for now.","After all, he had no idea where he was—or when he would be able to return to the Nine Heavens.","’All of this is so ridiculous that it feels like I am dreaming, but it also feels too realistic to be one. Am I trapped inside an illusion? One so powerful that I cannot tell what’s real or fake?’ Yuan wondered inwardly.","If he were truly in an illusion, his best solution was to hope for Shiva to wake him up.","\"Are you ready to talk, or would you like to reschedule your appointment?\" Doctor Ying asked after Yuan remained silent for an entire minute.","Yuan sighed before responding, \"I will speak.\"","\"Good. Then, to start, tell me about the world you came from,\" she said, hoping to gauge the extent of his condition.","\"I came from a place called the Nine Heavens. It is a world that was once whole but was divided into nine separate realms after a certain incident,\" Yuan began, explaining the origins of the Nine Heavens.","\"However, I was born on Earth, one that is different from this one, which is also part of the Nine Heavens...\"","\"Can you tell me more about the Nine Heavens—particularly this other ’Earth’?\" Doctor Ying asked. \"For example, what was life like there? How is it different from this world?\"","After taking a deep breath, Yuan explained everything in detail to her.","\"...\"","Doctor Ying remained relatively calm at first, but the more she listened to Yuan, the more she realized just how serious his condition was.","’His level of imagination is off the charts!’ she cried inwardly. ’I have spoken with many patients before, but none of them are as delusional as this one! I’m surprised that he even made it to adulthood!’","Once she was satisfied, Doctor Ying said, \"Alright, I have a good idea of your condition.\"","She retrieved a machine from the back and said, \"I am going to check for any abnormal status now.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow, wondering if she believed that his ’illness’ could be cured through the system.","\"Step inside,\" she said, beckoning him to enter the capsule-shaped machine.","Although it resembled the one that gave him Gaia’s System at first, it had a slightly different shape and a completely different color.","Without a word, Yuan entered the capsule and waited for Doctor Ying to do her thing.","She closed the door on him and started the machine shortly after without any explanation.","Soon, an unknown liquid began to fill the interior, submerging Yuan in seconds.","Yuan didn’t bother holding his breath this time and breathed normally.","Meanwhile, Doctor Ying examined the results.","[Name: Yuan]","[Age: ???]","[Cultivation: Third Level First Ascension]","[Physique: Perfected Heavenly Refinement]","[Credential Rank: 1]","\"Perfected Heavenly Refinement?!\" Doctor Ying exclaimed after seeing his status.","Although everyone in this world possessed the Heavenly Refinement physique, it existed in several ranks. To Doctor Ying’s knowledge, Perfected Heavenly Refinement was the highest attainable rank—and one that is only theoretically possible.","This meant that nobody has ever achieved Perfected Heavenly Refinement... at least until now.","\"N-No way... There must be something wrong with the machine... How can someone with such a low cultivation achieve the legendary Perfected Heavenly Refinement?\"","Then, she looked down a little more, examining Yuan’s hidden status that can only be seen by those with enough credentials.","[Anomalies: Level 2 Curse, Level 3 Curse, Level 4 Curse, Level 5 Curse, Level 6 Curse, Level 7 Curse, Level 8 Curse, Level 9 Curse, ???, ???, ???]","\"?!?!\"","Doctor Ying’s eyes widened at the anomalies within Yuan, her jaw nearly touching the floor in shock.","\"What the heck is up with him?! How can a single person have so many anomalies?! There are even some that I do not have the credentials to see!\" she cried out loud, looking like she was witnessing a ghost.","As a doctor and a psychiatrist, Doctor Ying’s Credential Rank was naturally higher than that of the average person. Yet, even with her Rank 5 Credentials, she was unable to access all of Yuan’s information.","’This guy... how is he even still alive?!’","More importantly, she did not see the anomaly that would normally appear in mentally unstable individuals, as Gaia’s System was capable of detecting such conditions as well.","’Does this mean he is not insane? Is he actually telling the truth? No... This only proves that he is not mentally unstable. It tells me nothing about whether he is lying or telling the truth...’ Doctor Ying pondered with a serious expression.","She looked into the machine and saw Yuan calmly staring back with a smile.","’Just who is this man...?’","Some time later, Doctor Ying let Yuan out of the machine and said to him, \"I have confirmed that you are not mentally unstable, but that doesn’t mean you’re not an attention seeker lying to seek attention.\"","\"So, what now?\" Yuan asked.","\"Do whatever you want, but if you continue telling people you came from another world, you can expect things to get ugly really fast. Hell, you’re extremely lucky to have encountered Officer Mei and not someone else.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and asked, \"Do you know her? Officer Mei?\"","Doctor Ying nodded and said, \"We’re childhood friends.\""]},{"number":2548,"title":"Chapter 2548: Credential Rank","paragraphs":["\"What a coincidence...\" Yuan muttered aloud.","\"Anyway, do you mind if I ask you a few questions regarding Gaia’s System? Believe it or not, but I just registered, and I have no clue how it functions.\"","\"...What kind of questions?\"","\"For starters, how do I increase my Credential Rank?\"","\"You contribute to society, and pretty much everyone can achieve Rank 3 just by living an ordinary life. However, if you do something bad or get arrested, your credentials will drop.\"","\"I am trying to reach Rank 9. How long do you think it would take?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Credential Rank 9?\" Doctor Ying stared at him with a dumbfounded face.","’Is he really fine in the head...?’ she couldn’t help but wonder inwardly.","Doctor Ying shook her head and said, \"Forget about Rank 9. Most people cannot even reach Rank 5. As I told you earlier, an ordinary person can attain Rank 3 simply by living a normal life and staying out of trouble. However, to reach Rank 4 or Rank 5, you would need a high-credential profession, such as becoming a police officer or a doctor.\"","She continued, \"If you wish to rise beyond Rank 5, you will need to join the military, enter the special forces, or become a politician. That said, most people who reach Rank 6 or higher are born into privileged circumstances.\"","\"Is that really the only way? Join the military?\"","\"Don’t tell me you’re really thinking about it? Forget about it. With your low cultivation and lack of talents—\" Doctor Ying suddenly stopped mid-sentence when she recalled that he somehow had the Perfected Heavenly Refinement physique.","\"Hey, let me ask you a question of my own first. How did you acquire the Perfected Heavenly Refinement physique?\"","\"Officer Mei asked me the same thing. Why do you want to know? Is it something impressive?\" Yuan asked.","Considering that even children in this world were Cultivation Gods, Yuan would not have been surprised if his physique was nothing special—especially after being told that everyone possessed the same physique.","However, seeing that both Officer Mei and Doctor Ying were interested in his physique, he began to think it might be special even by this world’s standards.","\"Are you asking me that because you seriously have no idea?\" Doctor Ying narrowed her eyes at him, looking doubtful.","\"I’m getting tired of repeating myself,\" Yuan sighed while shaking his head.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Doctor Ying spoke. \"Perfected Heavenly Refinement is the highest attainable rank. As far as I am aware, nobody other than you has ever achieved it.\"","\"How many ranks are there?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Eight. The Heavenly Refinement physique can be refined a total of eight times. However, Perfected Heavenly Refinement is not included among those eight ranks. If we count it, then it would be the ninth rank.\"","’Nine times, huh? I don’t recall evolving my physique that many times... Did I skip a few steps? Or are our physiques completely different, and this is merely a misunderstanding?’","\"How do you guys train your physiques?\" he asked a moment later.","\"Whatever we’re doing, it’s clearly not as efficient as your methods, to reach the ninth rank with that level of cultivation...\" Doctor Ying sighed.","\"So, are you going to tell me or not? I won’t blame you if you don’t want to.\"","\"Sorry, but I don’t know how I acquired this physique,\" Yuan lied for the first time since his arrival in this world.","\"Why am I not surprised?\" Doctor Ying shrugged. \"Anyway, we’re done here, so please leave. I still have patients to see after you.\"","\"Alright...\"","Yuan left the hospital shortly after.","\"Looks like the quest is gone...\" Yuan muttered in a low voice when the notification vanished.","He looked around before taking a seat on the side of the staircase and proceeded to ponder his next steps.","’What should I do now? It’s been a long time since I’ve felt this lost...’ he sighed inwardly.","He had no idea how to leave this place, nor had he been given any hints before arriving here.","\"This situation feels like I am inside the Stairway to Heaven, undergoing one of its trials—\"","Yuan’s eyes suddenly widened as a thought flashed through his mind.","\"Wait a second...\"","Then, he recalled a certain line from the technique he’d acquired from the mysterious being sealed within the cavern.","\"I think I know what to do now...\" he mumbled.","\"What kind of trouble are you going to stir up now?\"","A familiar voice unexpectedly responded to Yuan’s mumbling.","\"Hm?\" Yuan turned his head and found Officer Mei standing beside him with her hands on her hips, looking as though she had just caught a troublemaker in the act.","\"Officer Mei. What a coincidence,\" Yuan stood up and greeted her with a calm smile.","Officer Mei turned to look at the hospital before asking, \"Did you just finish speaking with Doctor Ying?\"","He nodded before inquiring, \"Did you deliberately recommend me to your childhood friend?","Officer Mei immediately clicked her tongue in annoyance. \"She told a crazy man like you about our relationship? I should never have trusted her.\"","\"Did you really send me to this place because you think I am crazy?\" Yuan narrowed his eyes slightly, starting at her with a doubtful gaze.","\"I have no idea what you’re talking about,\" she shrugged.","Seeing her reaction, Yuan confirmed that she had ulterior motives.","\"What do you want from me?\" he then asked.","\"The truth,\" she calmly replied.","\"I already told you the truth. You just don’t want to believe me.\"","\"How can anyone sane believe your nonsense?\"","Yuan sighed, \"Forget it.\"","\"...\"","After a brief pause, Yuan continued speaking, \"Before you leave, I have a quick question. Where do I go to join the military?\"","\"Huh?\" Officer Mei raised her eyebrows at his unexpected question.","\"You... want to join the military? This is so random. Why?\" she asked, her interest piqued.","\"I want to—need to raise my Credential Rank,\" he answered without hesitation."]},{"number":2549,"title":"Chapter 2549: Officer Mei","paragraphs":["\"How ridiculous,\" Officer Mei sneered after hearing Yuan’s reason for wanting to join the military.","\"Do you think anyone can just join the military? Even if we ignored your laughably low cultivation, you still need at least Rank 3 Credentials to apply, as well as having no arrest record.\"","\"No arrest record?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, and he asked, \"So I can’t apply because you arrested me?\"","\"Although I did technically arrest you, unless you went to jail or did something heinous, there won’t be any records, so you’re still clean for now.\"","\"Anyway, I don’t know what nonsense you have planned, but give up on joining the military. It’s not a playground.\"","\"I am not going there to play,\" Yuan replied with a serious expression.","\"...\"","Officer Mei stared into his calm, unwavering eyes with a pondering expression.","After a moment of silence, she sighed, \"Wait here for me. If you run away, I’ll consider it fleeing from an officer.\"","Without offering any explanation, Officer Mei walked away, disappearing into the hospital.","While Yuan waited for her to return, Officer Mei went to look for Doctor Ying.","\"Hm? Why are you here?\" Doctor Ying asked, not expecting her visit so soon.","\"I wanted to talk to you about the weirdo I recommended to you,\" Officer Mei said.","Doctor Ying rubbed her eyes and sighed aloud, \"I had a feeling you would come ask me about him since you recommended him to me, but I didn’t expect you to come here almost immediately after our session ended. Did you stalk him or something?\"","\"What? Of course not. It’s just a coincidence, and I am here for my yearly checkup.\"","\"Is that so? Well, either way, he’s protected by patient confidentiality, so I cannot tell you about our session, even if you’re a police officer and my childhood friend, Mei.\"","\"I don’t care about your session with him. I just want to know your opinion on his physique,\" Officer Mei quickly replied.","\"...\"","Doctor Ying fell silent, her eyes narrowing slightly.","Seeing her reaction, Officer Mei sighed, \"Judging by your reaction, I guess his physique is truly the Perfected Heavenly Refinement. I thought the machine back at the station was bugged or something, so I sent him here to confirm.\"","\"You’re really using the hospital’s resources as you please, huh?\" Doctor Ying shook her head. \"Once news of the Perfected Heavenly Refinement being achieved spreads... I don’t even want to imagine what kind of life he’ll have—or not have.\"","\"Not only does he lack power and credentials, but his origin is unknown, too...\" Officer Mei remarked.","After a brief pause, she asked, \"Hey, Ying, do you think he’s actually from another world? I’m asking for your personal opinion.\"","\"It’s definitely quite an outlandish claim, but I couldn’t detect any lies within his tone or eyes.\"","\"Are you saying that you believe him?\"","\"I’m saying that he’s either a highly skilled manipulator, severely delusional, or... actually telling the truth.\"","\"I see...\"","\"So what are you going to do with him?\"","\"Nothing.\"","\"Really? Even though you went out of your way to do all of this?\"","\"I merely want to satisfy my curiosity. That’s all there is to it,\" said Officer Mei before walking for the exit.","\"Let’s go out for a drink later. It’s been a while since we went out to have fun,\" Officer Mei said as she reached the door.","\"If you’re that bored, get a boyfriend,\" Doctor Ying teased with a playful smile.","Officer Mei merely shook her head in silence before leaving the room. However, instead of going back outside for Yuan, she called someone.","\"System, call my mother.\"","<Calling ’Mother’>","<...>","<...>","<Connected>","\"...\"","Although the call connected, neither Officer Mei nor her mother spoke. For several long moments, the line remained completely silent.","\"What is it?\"","Eventually, a voice resounded, sounding somewhat surprised.","\"Mother, when are you not busy? I need your assistance with something.\"","\"Stop being vague and tell me what this is about.\"","\"Well, it’s like this...\" Officer Mei began explaining the situation to her.","Some time later, Officer Mei ended the call, left the hospital, and returned to find Yuan sitting quietly on the staircase, staring up at the blue sky.","\"Hey, you want to join the military, right? I can help you,\" Officer Mei started the conversation with some unexpected words.","\"What’s with the change of heart?\" Yuan asked with a raised eyebrow.","\"If you don’t want my help, that’s fine.\"","\"I didn’t say that,\" Yuan quickly replied.","\"Stop asking pointless questions and follow me,\" Officer Mei said.","’Is it because she resembles Meixiu that I cannot help but trust her?’ Yuan wondered inwardly as he followed her.","A few moments later, Officer Mei stopped in front of a square platform around the corner from the hospital and stepped onto it.","\"What’s this?\" Yuan asked out of curiosity.","\"You’ll find out in a second. Just step on the platform,\" she replied.","Once Yuan stepped onto the platform beside her, Officer Mei muttered, \"System, teleport us to...\"","After providing an address, both Yuan and Officer Mei vanished from the platform outside the hospital.","Yuan’s vision flickered, and before he realized, he found himself standing in a residential area.","’So these are teleporters, huh?’","As Yuan wondered how they functioned without a teleportation array, Officer Mei stepped off the platform and called out to him, \"What are you waiting for? You’ll block the teleporter if you don’t leave.\"","\"Oh.\"","Hearing that, Yuan quickly stepped off the platform and continued following her.","Some time later, they arrived before a large villa.","\"Is this your home?\" Yuan questioned.","\"It is.\"","\"You don’t mind bringing a complete stranger like me home?\"","\"It is not like you can do anything to me,\" Officer Mei said with a casual shrug. \"If you dare try anything, all it would take is a single flick of my finger to kill you.\"","\"And what are we doing here? I thought you were going to help me enter the military.\"","\"I know someone from the military, and they will be here in a bit to assess your qualifications,\" she explained."]},{"number":2550,"title":"Chapter 2550: Officer Mei(2)","paragraphs":["\"Now then, before that person arrives, I want to see what you are capable of. I do not want to embarrass myself by recommending you,\" Officer Mei said as they entered the building. \"If you are nowhere near good enough, I will simply cancel the appointment and save us all some time.\"","\"You want to spar with me?\" Yuan looked at her with a slightly surprised face.","\"That’s what I said, no? Or is there a reason you don’t want to spar with me? Are you not confident in your abilities?\" Officer Mei remarked with a provocative smile.","Yuan returned the smile and said, \"Alright. Let’s do it.\"","\"Come with me to the training room.\"","Yuan nodded and followed her into another room.","Although the villa itself was quite large, the training room was somehow several times bigger than the entire building, almost as though it existed within its own separate dimension.","\"Don’t worry, I will try to match your strength to make things fair,\" Officer Mei said as they walked to the center of the spacious room. \"That being said, your cultivation is a bit too low, and I might have trouble suppressing my strength to such an extent.\"","\"I don’t mind even if you use a little more strength,\" Yuan calmly replied.","\"...\"","Officer Mei narrowed her eyes at him and asked, \"Are you really going to fight in that outfit? I know it’s unique, but it’ll only hinder your own movements.\"","\"I’m used to it, and I don’t have a suit like yours.\"","\"Right... because you’re from another world...\" she mumbled with a skeptical expression.","Yuan took a moment to stretch his body before beckoning to Officer Mei.","\"Whenever you are ready,\" he said aloud.","In the very next instant, Officer Mei vanished from her spot like a ghost.","\"!\"","Although her speed caught him off guard, Yuan was still able to follow her movements. He swiftly raised his right hand beside his head, blocking Officer Mei’s leg strike just as it swept toward his face a split second later.","\"Oh? You actually managed to block that? I intended on ending it with one strike, too.\" Officer Mei remarked after distancing herself from him. \"You’re better than I expected.\"","\"I could say the same for you...\" Yuan responded, looking at the arm he had used to block her attack and feeling a slight numbness in it.","However, that numbness quickly faded when Yuan clenched his fist tightly.","\"Let’s continue.\"","This time, Yuan made the first move.","’He’s fast!’","Officer Mei cried inwardly when she could barely follow Yuan’s movements, nearly getting hit in the gut.","Yet Officer Mei did not panic, merely adjusting her strength as they continued to exchange strikes.","’This guy is growing increasingly more powerful with each passing moment!’","It quickly became clear to Officer Mei that Yuan’s low cultivation was extremely deceptive, as he was displaying prowess that was beyond what someone at such a level should be capable of.","\"Is something wrong?\" Yuan suddenly asked as he continued his assault. \"You are slowing down, Officer! Meanwhile, I am not even warmed up!\"","Officer Mei gritted her teeth at his blatant provocation and began unleashing more of her strength, increasing the speed and intensity of her attacks at a more noticeable rate.","\"That’s more like it!\" Yuan laughed excitedly, as it had been a while since he could go all out against a fellow human without worrying about his opponent being too weak.","While their fight was intense enough to shake the building, neither of them was expending any energy, as their cultivation was still suppressed.","’How is he still keeping up?! I am already using the strength of a Third Ascension cultivator!’ Officer Mei cried inwardly, feeling dazed by Yuan’s unfathomable strength.","’Is this the power of the Perfected Heavenly Refinement?!’","A nervous smile tugged at Officer Mei’s lips as she realized just how ridiculous—and dangerous this discovery was.","\"A-Alright, let’s stop here.\" Officer Mei eventually said, halting their spar.","\"Are you sure? I was barely just getting started,\" Yuan said with a disappointed look on his face, clearly not satisfied with how suddenly it ended.","\"I just wanted to see if you would be a waste of time. If you want to show off, do so during the real assessment,\" she sighed.","\"Speaking of the assessment... where is she? She should have arrived by now—\"","Officer Mei turned toward the exit, only to abruptly freeze as her eyes widened in shock.","\"Hm?\"","Yuan followed her gaze and was surprised to see a beautiful woman standing quietly by the entrance, her presence almost nonexistent, like a ghost.","\"M-Mother! When did you arrive?\" Officer Mei spoke aloud after snapping out of her daze.","\"I have been here for a while,\" her mother calmly replied.","\"In that case, why didn’t you say something?\"","However, her mother did not respond. Her gaze was fixed on Yuan, just as his was fixed on her.","\"Meifeng...\" Yuan muttered in a low voice.","Although Yuan appeared surprised, he was not surprised in the slightest that Officer Mei—who resembled Meixiu—would have a mother who looked just like Meixiu’s real mother, Meifeng.","Without a word, the woman approached Yuan with calm and purposeful steps.","\"So you are the one who claims to be from another world, huh? I came here thinking that my foolish daughter was being scammed, but now that I have seen you with my own eyes, you certainly seem... for lack of a better word, otherworldly.\"","\"I’m Yuan,\" he introduced himself. \"Are you the one who will help me join the military?\"","\"Not exactly,\" she replied. \"I am here to assess your qualifications. And, if I take everything at face value, you have already failed. Not only is your cultivation weaker than that of most children, but your credential is only at Rank 1.\"","\"With that being said, you have displayed prowess far beyond your cultivation’s capabilities, as well as possessing the Perfected Heavenly Refinement...\"","The woman fell silent for a moment before continuing, \"Anyway, recover your stamina for now. I am going to have a conversation with my daughter first.\""]},{"number":2551,"title":"Chapter 2551: Madam Mei","paragraphs":["\"Take your time, Officer Mei’s mother,\" Yuan said.","\"Just call me Madam,\" she said before walking outside with Officer Mei.","Once he was alone, Yuan sat on the cold floor and recalled his sparring with Officer Mei.","’Although she was very powerful... her combat experience was clearly lacking. If I didn’t go easy on her, I would’ve defeated her with ease,’ he thought to himself.","This meant that, despite having a high level of cultivation, the people of this world likely lacked combat experience. Moreover, being a police officer, Officer Mei’s combat capabilities should logically be higher than those of the average person.","’How did they achieve such high cultivations? The people of this world do not appear to be immortals who have lived for countless years, either.’","Yuan could not fathom how even children could reach the Cultivation God Realm—a level that normally required tens of millions of years to attain, not including the majority who are not even capable of achieving it in the first place.","Meanwhile, outside the training room, Madam Mei and Officer Mei spoke.","\"What do you want to talk about?\" Officer Mei asked.","\"Tell me your reason for dragging me into this mess,\" Madam Mei spoke with a slight frown on her face. \"Is this your ’revenge’?\"","\"I don’t know what you’re talking about,\" she responded with a nonchalant expression.","\"Do you really think I am stupid? I know you hate me for neglecting you as a child, but this situation is beyond your imagination.\"","\"This has nothing to do with our relationship. I saw a troubled and confused individual needing help, so I reached out to the only person who could help him,\" Officer Mei calmly replied.","\"...\"","Madam Mei fell silent for a moment before asking in a low voice, almost as if she was afraid of being heard, \"Does he really have the Perfected Heavenly Refinement?\"","\"That’s what the machine said... twice.\"","Madam Mei rubbed her eyes in a stressed manner and released a deep sigh.","\"If the world learns of his physique... I don’t even want to imagine what might happen.\"","\"Is it really that big of a deal? I mean, at the end of the day, it’s just a physique.\"","\"It is not just any physique. It is the pinnacle of humanity—or at least, that is what the experts claim. As humans, we naturally strive for perfection.\"","She paused, her expression turning slightly grim. \"Moreover, we need a breakthrough soon, as we are beginning to struggle with... Forget it. This isn’t something I should mention to a civilian.\"","\"Regardless, what do you expect me to do in this situation?\"","\"Well, what can you do? Knowing your credentials, I wouldn’t be surprised if you could enlist him in the military directly.\"","\"Even if I can do that, why should I do it for him? He is nobody to me,\" Madam Mei sneered.","\"Didn’t you just say that his existence is extremely important? You even implied that he could have a significant impact on our society. If you let someone like that slip away...\"","\"...\" Madam Mei fell silent again.","Then, without saying a word, Madam Mei turned around and walked back into the training room.","\"Before we begin your assessment, I have a few questions for you,\" Madam Mei said as she approached Yuan.","\"Why do you want to join the military?\"","\"I need to increase my credentials,\" he replied without hesitation.","Madam Mei raised an eyebrow at his answer.","\"Just to increase your Credential Rank? There are others ways to do so without signing away your life, you know?\"","\"Well, I need to reach Rank 9 credentials if I want to cure the curses within me,\" he calmly said, revealing the truth.","Madam Mei’s eyes widened with shock.","\"You’re cursed? And it’s so powerful that you need Rank 9 credentials?\" Madam Mei was speechless, and even though she wanted to doubt him, there were no signs of deception in Yuan’s crystal-clear eyes.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Madam Mei sighed.","\"Quite frankly, your reason for wanting to join the military doesn’t matter in the slightest, and I have heard far worse. However, in your current state, forget about joining. You won’t even qualify.\"","\"Is it my cultivation and Credential Rank?\" Yuan asked.","\"Yes. Although I can help you with your credentials, you will need to reach Third Ascension before you can qualify. However, there is something I am puzzled about. If you truly have the Perfected Heavenly Refinement physique, why is your cultivation so low?\"","\"Because where I am from, my cultivation is pretty decent,\" Yuan said.","\"Right... but you’re in our world now, so your cultivation should have soared even without needing you to do anything.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow at her words and asked, \"What do you mean? In fact, how do the people of this world even cultivate?\"","\"We cultivate through the system.\"","\"Huh?\" Yuan’s face became even more puzzled after hearing her answer.","How does one cultivate through the system?","\"Like this,\" said Madam Mei, and the aura around her suddenly began to shift.","Although Yuan couldn’t sense any energy before, the moment Madam Mei started cultivating, he could clearly sense Eternal Essence exuding from her body!","\"What?!\" Yuan was so shocked to see another human directly emitting Eternal Essence that he cried out loud.","He had always believed that humans were incapable of absorbing Eternal Essence—that only Eternals possessed such an ability.","Yet right before his eyes, that common sense was being shattered.","However, something felt off. After examining her more closely, Yuan realized what felt odd. Although he could sense Eternal Essence within Madam Mei’s body, it did not seem as though she was actively absorbing it. Instead, it was as if the Eternal Essence was being created from within her body.","\"W-What am I looking at right now?\" Yuan asked, unable to comprehend their cultivation method even after witnessing it firsthand.","\"Our cultivation method,\" Madam Mei replied calmly, as though she did not even need to focus in order to cultivate."]},{"number":2552,"title":"Chapter 2552: Gaia’s Stone","paragraphs":["\"I’m sorry, but I still do not understand how you are cultivating,\" Yuan said after a moment of silence. \"Where are you obtaining your energy from? It does not seem like you are absorbing it.\"","\"Absorbing it? Like this?\"","The next moment, Madam Mei began drawing in the energy from the air in the traditional manner Yuan was familiar with.","Yuan narrowed his eyes as he quickly noticed something peculiar. When Madam Mei began cultivating in the traditional manner, he had expected her to absorb Eternal Essence.","But to his surprise, she was drawing in spiritual energy instead.","Before Yuan could question her further, Madam Mei stopped cultivating and spoke.","\"Although it is possible to cultivate in that manner, it is extremely inefficient. That is why nobody does it. Instead, we cultivate through the system.\"","\"You have the system, right?\" she then asked.","Yuan nodded.","\"Then why not use it to cultivate and see for yourself how it works? It should help you understand things more easily,\" she said.","\"How do I cultivate through the system? I just acquired it today,\" he admitted.","\"...\"","Madam Mei fell silent after hearing this for the first time, and she turned to look at Officer Mei with narrowed eyes.","\"I do not mind helping you, but I am not someone who acts without gaining something in return,\" Madam Mei said, shifting her attention back to Yuan a moment later.","She continued without pausing, \"Not only will I help you join the military, but I will train you as well. In return, once you are accepted, you must join the division of my choosing.\"","Yuan responded without hesitation, \"I do not simply want to join the military. I want to take the path that will improve my credentials the fastest.\"","\"That is even better. The division I want you to join offers the fastest promotions in the entire military, which means your credentials will rise faster as well,\" she said with a proud smile.","\"Then I agree to your offer.\"","The next moment, a notification appeared before Yuan.","<You have been offered a contract by ’Mei Feng’>","[Contract Details: Mei Feng promises to help you join the military. Upon enlistment, you must join a division of her choosing.]","[Breaking the contract will result in penalties]","<Do you accept the contract?>","<Accepted>","\"Alright, let’s get started,\" Mei Feng said shortly after confirming that Yuan had accepted her contract.","\"In order to cultivate through the system, you must first consume this.\"","Mei Feng extended her empty hand toward Yuan before slowly closing it into a fist.","A second later, she opened her hand again, revealing a crystal resting in her palm as though it had appeared from thin air.","\"T-This is?!\" Yuan’s eyes widened with disbelief when he saw the crystal, as he recognized it.","\"Gaia’s Stone,\" Mei Feng began to explain. \"In order to cultivate through the system, one must first connect their Dantian to the system.\"","Despite Mei Feng mentioning an unfamiliar name, the crystal in her grasp was, without a doubt, the Heaven Refining Crystal, which had granted him the Heaven Refining Physique in the first place!","\"To be frank... I have consumed a crystal like this before in my world,\" Yuan admitted with a weird expression on his face. \"In fact, it was what gave me the Heavenly Refinement physique.\"","Mei Feng raised her eyebrows. After a moment of silence, she responded to his words.","\"Gaia’s Stone has two functions. First, it connects one’s Dantian to the system. The second... only activates under certain conditions—when an individual is born with their physique sealed.\"","\"Most people are born with the Heavenly Refinement physique, but on rare occasions, some are born without it. However, that does not mean they truly lack it, as their physique are simply in a dormant state.\"","\"That said, the majority awaken naturally over time. Only an extremely small minority requires Gaia’s Stone to awaken their physique.\"","\"...\"","Yuan’s eyes widened after learning the true origin of the Heaven Refining Crystal. He had always assumed it was either a treasure left behind by an Eternal or a naturally formed treasure.","However, this only raised another question.","’How did it end up in my world?’ he wondered. \"Also, this proves that there is a connection between the Nine Heavens and this strange world.’","Then he realized something else.","’Wait a second. Does this mean I always had the Heaven Refining Physique even as Tian Yang, and that it had been dormant until I consumed Gaia’s Stone, which awakened it?’","Yuan stared at the crystal resting in Mei Feng’s grasp for a moment before reaching for it.","However, just as he was about to reach it, she suddenly closed her hands and said, \"Before you consume it, I want you to try cultivating through the system first, so you know what I mean.\"","\"How do I do that?\"","\"Tell the system you want to start cultivating.\"","Yuan nodded and followed her instructions, mumbling, \"System, start cultivation.\"","Ding!","<Error>","<Unsuitable Dantian Detected>","<Cultivation has been forcefully canceled for the user’s safety>","\"Well?\" Mei Feng asked a moment later.","\"It doesn’t work,\" Yuan replied while shaking his head. \"It says I have an unsuitable Dantian.\"","Mei Feng opened her palm and offered Gaia’s Stone to him again.","\"Try again after consuming this.\"","Yuan accepted the crystal, tossed it into his mouth, and swallowed it without hesitation.","<You have consumed Gaia’s Stone>","<Perfected Heavenly Refinement has activated>","<Gaia’s Stone has been refined>","<Gaia’s Stone has merged with your Dantian>","<Your Dantian has begun to evolve>","<Your Dantian has evolved into True Heaven’s Dantian>","<You have unlocked Gaia’s Cultivation System>","\"How do you feel?\" Mei Feng asked shortly later.","\"Quite frankly, I don’t feel much different...\" Yuan replied.","\"Then try cultivating through the system again.\"","Without wasting a moment, Yuan immediately began his second attempt to cultivate through the system.","\"System, start cultivation.\"","<You have begun cultivating through Gaia’s Cultivation System>","<Due to your low cultivation and low Credential Rank, your Cultivation Speed has been automatically adjusted to Level 1>"]},{"number":2553,"title":"Chapter 2553: Gaia’s Cultivation System","paragraphs":["<Gaia’s Cultivation System has absorbed Eternal Essence>","<Gaia’s Cultivation System has refined Eternal Essence into Limitless>","<You have absorbed Limitless>","’Limitless...?’ Yuan raised an eyebrow at the notifications.","When Gaia’s Cultivation System started working, he could feel Eternal Essence being gathered around his Dantian. However, it did not enter his Dantian until the Eternal Essence was refined into another energy that felt similar on the surface.","’This Limitless... It feels almost identical to Eternal Essence, yet there is something fundamentally different about it,’ Yuan thought as he examined the strange energy.","However, because Limitless was so similar to Eternal Essence, Yuan could not determine how it differed without using it himself. And since he had only just begun cultivating, he did not possess enough of it to do so.","There was another thing Yuan quickly noticed.","His cultivation speed was extraordinarily slow—at least by his standards.","At first, Yuan found it strange. However, after giving it some thought, he realized that it made perfect sense.","After all, he was not cultivating in the traditional manner, but through Gaia’s Cultivation System, which possessed an entirely separate cultivation speed.","\"How long will it take me to reach this Third Ascension level?\" Yuan asked Mei Feng a moment later.","\"At your current speed? About twenty to thirty years,\" she calmly replied.","\"At least twenty years? That’s too long...\" Yuan frowned.","\"If you cultivate purely using Gaia’s Cultivation System, it’s normal. Not to mention, your Credential Rank is only at Rank 1. Of course, there are methods to improve your cultivation speed, the most obvious being to increase your Credential Rank.\"","\"What other methods are there?\" Yuan inquired.","Mei Feng retrieved another object and showed it to Yuan.","\"Gaia’s Stone? No... It’s a little different,\" Yuan mumbled after seeing the crystal-like object on her palms that resembled Gaia’s Stone at a glance.","\"This is called Gaia’s Gift. If you consume it, your cultivation speed will directly increase by a single rank. It’s useful up to Rank 3.\"","’There are also levels to my cultivation speed?’ Yuan raised an eyebrow.","He quickly checked his status, and sure enough, something new was present.","[Name: Yuan]","[Age: ???]","[Cultivation: Third Level First Ascension]","[Physique: Perfected Heavenly Refinement]","[Credential Rank: 1]","[Cultivation Speed: 1]","Yuan then asked, \"I have been meaning to ask this for a while now, but who is Gaia?\"","Mei Feng shook her head. \"I do not know. I doubt anyone alive knows, either.\"","\"I thought they were the God of this world or something along that line.\"","\"God?\" Mei Feng suddenly sneered in disdain. \"There is no such thing.\"","\"...\"","Yuan decided not to question further after seeing her reaction.","\"Anyway, take it. It’ll improve your cultivation a little.\"","After accepting Gaia’s Gift, Yuan immediately consumed it.","<You have consumed Gaia’s Gift>","<Your Cultivation Speed has increased by 1>","The moment his cultivation speed increased by a level, Yuan could feel the system absorbing Eternal Essence and refining it into Limitless at least three times faster than before.","Ding!","<Your cultivation has reached Fourth Level First Ascension>","\"You should reach the Third Ascension within five years at this rate,\" Mei Feng said.","Before Yuan could even say anything, she continued, \"However, that is still too slow, as the next recruitment for the military will begin in half a year.\"","\"I’ll give you another Gaia’s Gift later since I don’t have it on hand right now. In the meantime, I want you to improve your Credential Rank.\"","Mei Feng suddenly handed Yuan a semi-transparent card.","\"This will help you get started.\"","<You have received Mei Feng’s Endorsement>","<Your Credential Rank has increased a level>","Yuan’s Credential Rank directly increased a level.","\"Moreover, as long as you have this, you will be able to gain credentials at an accelerated rate—up to Rank 5 once you join the military,\" Mei Feng added.","\"I left my post unannounced, so I cannot stay here any longer. If you have any questions, you can ask my daughter. I will come back in a month with your second Gaia’s Gift. Until then, keep working on your Credential Rank.\"","\"Thank you for everything so far,\" Yuan said to her.","\"I am not doing this for you,\" she calmly rejected his gratitude before turning around and walking to the exit.","\"I’ll leave him in your care for now,\" Mei Feng said to Officer Mei, who was standing by the door with a stunned look on her face.","\"W-Wait! Why do I have to—\"","\"Because you found him,\" Mei Feng interrupted. \"Also, I should not have to say this, but make sure his physique remains a secret.\"","Officer Mei wanted to object, but knowing her mother, she also knew that doing so would not end well for her. Moreover, it was true that she willingly got involved with Yuan.","Once Mei Feng left, Officer Mei approached Yuan and sighed. \"Do you have any idea how lucky you are?\"","\"Not really,\" Yuan admitted. \"Care to enlighten me?\"","\"First of all, the Gaia’s Gift you consumed is incredibly precious and expensive. Not even I—her own daughter—have ever used one, yet she gave one to you so easily. Hell, she even plans on giving you a second one later on!\"","\"Then, there’s her endorsement, which is arguably even a bigger deal, as that is something you only give to someone you absolutely trust. After all, if you do something bad, it’d affect her, too, and considering her status... forget it.\"","\"In any case, if word got out about how well you have been treated here, countless people would be jealous—myself included,\" she sighed.","\"Is that so?\" Yuan calmly muttered before asking, \"So, how should I go about increasing my credentials now?\"","\"Get a job,\" Officer Mei said flatly, her expression completely serious.","\"Get... a job?\" Yuan mumbled with a dazed expression, as though he had just heard a foreign language.","Although he had technically worked as a professional musician when he was younger, he had never truly considered it a job, especially considering how long ago it had been."]},{"number":2554,"title":"Chapter 2554: Getting a Job","paragraphs":["\"What’s with that reaction? Have you never worked before?\" Officer Mei asked with her eyebrows raised.","\"Even if you tell me to find a job, I don’t know what to do. Any recommendations?\" Yuan sighed.","\"...\"","Officer Mei pondered for a moment before responding, \"If you want to increase your credentials as fast as possible, then you will want a job like mine.\"","\"You... want me to become an officer like you?\"","\"Of course not. You don’t even qualify in the first place,\" she quickly denied. \"However, with my mother’s Endorsement, you should be able to work as an assistant with ease. If you work as my assistant, I can keep an eye on you. As much as I dislike my mother, I don’t want you to destroy her reputation.\"","\"Working as your assistant, huh? Why not? It’s not like I have anything else in mind,\" Yuan quickly agreed with her idea.","\"In that case, let’s head to the station now.\"","They left the villa shortly after and made their way to the police station that Officer Mei worked at on the surface.","’This Gaia’s Cultivation System is quite ridiculous... It completely cultivates for me, similar to my soul cultivation technique.’","Yuan was beginning to understand how everyone, including children, acquired their high cultivation bases.","And as he gathered more Limitless, his comprehension of it improved as well.","’Limitless... It’s basically Eternal Essence, but altered and weakened to allow even humans to cultivate it. It may not be as powerful as raw Eternal Essence, but it’s definitely stronger than even Celestial Essence.’","Even though Yuan hadn’t even begun to understand Celestial Essence, which is required to reach the Absolute God realm, he could tell that Limitless was far superior.","’Whoever created this Gaia’s System that is capable of all this is definitely at the level of an Eternal, perhaps even a Prime Eternal!’","Upon arriving at the police station, Officer Mei brought Yuan to the front desk and said to the officer behind the desk, \"Sign him up to be my assistant.\"","\"What...?\"","The officer stared at them in disbelief.","\"He has my mother’s Endorsement. You can check if you don’t believe me.\"","\"Y-Your mother’s Endorsement?!\" The officer stood up in shock. \"Isn’t your mother—\"","\"I don’t need you to remind me of my mother’s identity,\" Officer Mei coldly interrupted. \"Hurry up and sign him up so we can start working already.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, the officer sat back down and started working.","\"I have never seen you so eager to work before,\" the officer remarked as he worked.","\"I’m not doing this because I want to,\" Officer Mei sighed.","A few moments later, the officer looked at Yuan and asked, \"Hey... weren’t you the oddball who was arrested by her earlier today?\"","Yuan nodded with a smile, \"A lot has happened.\"","\"...\"","Since Yuan was endorsed by Officer Mei’s mother, the officer decided not to question it anymore.","A few more moments later, the officer handed Yuan a badge and said, \"Here you go.\"","The instant Yuan accepted the badge, a notification appeared before him.","<You have been accepted as an Assistant Officer>","<You have been assigned to work as Officer Mei’s assistant>","’I get the job just like that?’ Yuan thought, a bit dumbfounded.","\"Make sure to change out of your weird outfit before you leave this building,\" said the officer as he glared at Yuan’s robes.","\"Follow me,\" Officer Mei said before guiding him to the men’s locker room.","\"Inside, you’ll find some tall machines. Remove your clothes and stand inside.\"","\"Okay.\"","Yuan entered the locker room shortly afterward, and sure enough, several upright, cylinder-shaped machines stood along the wall.","After removing his clothes, Yuan stepped inside the machine. Without requiring him to do anything, it began scanning him from head to toe.","After the initial scan, the machine paused for several seconds before scanning him again. This time, however, it did more than examine him, and it began creating a suit directly on his body, spraying the material over his skin.","Yuan stepped out of the machine once it was all done.","\"This feels... odd,\" Yuan mumbled as he looked down at the skin-tight suit. It was so light and breathable that it felt as though he were not wearing anything at all.","After leaving the locker room, Yuan asked Officer Mei, \"How durable is this suit?\"","\"Don’t underestimate its durability because of how thin it looks and feels,\" she remarked. \"It is enforced with multiple protective enchantments and can easily withstand attacks from anyone below the Fifth Ascension.\"","\"How many cultivation realms are there?\" Yuan then asked.","\"There are nine realms in total.\"","\"Nine...\" Yuan swallowed nervously at this information.","’If First Ascension is God Ascension, then I can probably assume that Third Ascension is the realm of Absolute God...’","The discovery of Absolute God was already shocking enough. Yet there were six more realms above that in this world.","’Good heavens... just how advanced is the cultivation in this world? I wouldn’t be surprised if the top cultivators of this world can rival even Eternals!’","\"Let’s get to work,\" Officer Mei said, snapping him out of his thoughts.","\"How does it work?\" he asked as he followed her outside.","\"If there are no active threats or issues, we simply patrol the city.\"","\"What about my credentials?\"","\"It will increase gradually as long as you are on the job, but it rises much faster when you take more active actions. For example, arresting a criminal will earn you far more credentials than simply wandering around a park.\"","Yuan sighed. \"I still do not understand what doing a job has to do with one’s credentials.\"","\"Your credentials are essentially a measure of how much Gaia’s System trusts you. The more you contribute to society without doing anything wrong, the more access you will receive, improving your overall quality of life.\"","\"Faster cultivation. Higher clearance. Better jobs. You name it. This entire world revolves around Gaia’s System.\"","\"With a system like that, I do not see the purpose of police officers. Can’t the system simply punish criminals outright?\" Yuan asked.","Officer Mei raised an eyebrow at him before responding, \"The system is neither omnipotent nor absolute. Although I do not know exactly how it works, it never acts according to its own interests and likely has rules of its own.\""]},{"number":2555,"title":"Chapter 2555: Getting a Job(2)","paragraphs":["\"Does that mean the system will not do anything even if someone commits a crime?\" Yuan asked.","Officer Mei nodded.","\"The only time the system issues punishment on its own is when a user violates one of its rules, such as breaking a contract. Other than that, it’s up to the real justice system to punish the criminals.\"","\"What’s the crime rate like in this world?\" Yuan then inquired.","\"In the Minor Sectors? We get hundreds of cases every day.\"","\"That’s a lot.\"","\"Not really. Since it accounts for all ninety-nine Minor Sectors, only a few cases occur in each Sector every day. In fact, most crimes take place between Sectors 70 and 99,\" Officer Mei explained.","\"I have been wondering about this for a while now, but what is the difference between the Sectors?\" Yuan asked. \"I thought they were simply names for different areas, but from the way you describe them, there seems to be something more significant.\"","\"The lower a Sector’s number, the better the living conditions in that area. For example, those who live in Sector 1 are generally wealthy, while Sector 99 is referred to by many as the ’Slum,’\" she explained with a heavy sigh.","\"Since we’re in Sector 10, I guess we’re in a pretty good area?\" Yuan remarked.","She nodded and said, \"I’m actually surprised that you managed to get here with your low Credential Rank. Normally, you’d need at least Rank 3 to even get beyond Sector 30.\"","Yuan shrugged. \"When I was teleported to this world, I was already in Sector 11. Speaking of which... why was I able to enter Sector 10 despite only having Rank 1 credentials?\"","\"Because there is no checkpoint between Sectors 10 and 11. Once you have passed the checkpoint at Sector 20, you can move freely through the areas beyond it, so Sectors 10 to 19. However, entering Sector 9 is a completely different matter.\"","\"Is that so?\"","The two continued chatting as they strolled through Sector 10, with Yuan mostly asking questions about their world. Although Officer Mei did not yet believe Yuan had truly come from another world, she answered his questions regardless.","\"Do magical beasts exist in this world?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"Magical... beasts? What are those?\" Officer Mei responded with a confused look on her face.","\"I guess that answers my question,\" he said before giving a brief explanation. \"In my world, they are something like wild beasts. Not only do they cultivate as well, but the people in my world hunt them for their resources.\"","\"We don’t have anything like that,\" Officer Mei shook her head.","’A world where magical beasts don’t exist, huh? Albeit rare, they existed even in the Demonic Realm...’ Yuan thought to himself.","And since magical beasts are failed experiments as a result of Eternals trying to clone already cloned humans, this meant that the Eternals have yet to touch this world.","’But then what about Gaia...? And according to the technique given to me by the unknown Eternal, I could find the Absolute Power here...’","Yuan lifted his head to look at the sky and sighed inwardly, ’Can I really find the Absolute Power in this place?’","Several hours later—","\"It’s already dark. When are we going to stop working?\" Yuan asked.","Officer Mei looked at him with a puzzled face and replied, \"What do you mean? Don’t tell me you want to stop working after just a mere few hours?\"","\"Then when do we stop?\" Yuan asked with a raised eyebrow.","\"We don’t, at least not until your Credential Rank reaches Rank 3.\"","Yuan’s eyes widened at her words.","\"So we’re going to keep working around the clock until my Credential Rank increases?\" he asked for confirmation.","\"That’s right. You want to increase your credentials as fast as possible, right? Since we only get credentials while we work, we can only keep on working.\"","Yuan rubbed his eyes and said, \"I appreciate you helping me out, but you don’t need to force yourself to work overtime for me. We can start again tomorrow.\"","\"What are you talking about? I am not doing anything special for you; this is just my normal routine. I usually work a few weeks at a time.\"","Yuan’s jaw dropped at her words.","\"That... sounds horrible.\"","\"Does it? It’s not like I have anything else to do.\"","After hearing such words, Yuan realized that since everyone in this world relied on Gaia’s System to cultivate, they had all the time in the world to do other things.","\"If you’re tired, you can head home. And since I doubt you have a place to stay, I’ll let you live in the guest room for now,\" Officer Mei said a moment later.","Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, I’m not tired. I can do this all day, every day, until I reach Credential Rank 3.\"","Thus, the two of them continued working through the night.","Due to their high cultivation, the people of this world could work for months—or even years—without needing a moment of rest.","This also meant that they had no need for food or water, and those who still ate did so purely for the experience.","At the end of the day, they did not encounter a single incident.","\"Hey, tell me about your world,\" Officer Mei suddenly said.","\"Oh?\" Yuan looked at her with a somewhat cheeky smile. \"Are you starting to believe me?\"","\"Of course not,\" she sneered. \"I just happen to like fairy tales and fictional stories.\"","\"What do you want to know about my world?\" Yuan asked.","\"Tell me about—\"","Officer Mei suddenly stopped mid-sentence and came to a halt.","\"I just received a call from the station. There is an incident that requires our immediate attention.\"","Without explaining further, Officer Mei started running toward the nearest teleporter.","Fortunately, the nearest teleporter was only a block away, and once both of them were on it, Officer Mei activated it, teleporting them to Sector 18."]},{"number":2556,"title":"Chapter 2556: Longevity","paragraphs":["The moment Yuan and Officer Mei appeared in Sector 18, they could feel vibrations in the air, as well as noticeably shaking in the ground, as if there were an active earthquake.","\"What is going on?\" Yuan asked as he continued running behind Officer Mei.","\"There appears to be an ongoing fight,\" she replied.","\"...\"","Yuan was left speechless by the cause of the incident, as he had expected something much worse given her urgency.","Once they arrived at the scene, Yuan quickly realized that it was even worse than he had imagined.","Due to the cultivation-suppressing formations that enveloped the entire city, the two people involved could only throw ordinary punches and kicks. Not only were they unable to use any techniques, but they fought as though neither had ever been in a fight before.","Yuan visibly cringed at how ridiculous the scene looked. When he turned to Officer Mei, she was already charging toward the two fighters with a solemn expression.","\"Hey! Both of you! Stop it!\" she shouted.","However, they completely ignored her and continued throwing wild attacks at one another.","Seeing this, Officer Mei’s expression darkened.","The moment she reached them, she threw two powerful punches, each landing squarely in their stomachs. The impact forced both men to their knees, clutching their abdomens as their faces twisted in pain.","Then, without a word, she restrained them in the same golden binding that she used to restraint Yuan before.","After being restrained, the two fighters quickly calmed down.","\"So, why were the two of you fighting?\" Officer Mei questioned them.","\"He bumped into me,\" one of them said.","\"No! HE bumped into me!\" the other one immediately refuted.","\"...\"","Officer Mei rubbed her eyes and sighed out loud, \"I will give you two choices. One, I remove your restraints, and the two of you shake hands and walk away, or two... I bring you back to the station and write you down, which will result in a loss of credentials. Which would you prefer?\"","The two men stared at each other for a moment before responding, \"One...\"","Officer Mei released their restraints and watched them shake hands before parting ways as if nothing had happened.","\"What was that about?\" Yuan remarked with a dumbfounded face.","\"What do you mean? Were you expecting something else?\" Officer Mei looked at him with raised eyebrows.","\"Honestly, I was. You had such a serious expression on your face that I thought something major had happened.\"","\"Something major? Like what?\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"Never mind.\"","He then looked at the sky and continued, \"Can I ask you about the formation that suppresses our cultivation? What is its purpose?\"","\"Isn’t it obvious? It’s to protect this world from ourselves,\" she quickly replied.","\"Take those two idiots just now, for example. If they had access to their cultivation, their little scuffle could’ve been disastrous.\"","\"That makes sense...\" Yuan nodded.","Despite the humorous fight they had just been engaged in, the two men possessed cultivation bases Yuan could not see through. Had they used their power recklessly and without restraint, they could have easily destroyed the entire city.","Moreover, Yuan had done the same thing on his own Earth, restricting everyone’s cultivation so they wouldn’t accidentally destroy the world with their newfound powers.","Yuan stared at the sky in silence, a pondering expression on his face.","\"What are you thinking about now?\" Officer Mei asked, her interest piqued by his expression.","\"I am wondering why everyone cultivates if they cannot even use their power,\" Yuan replied. \"Hell, I would not even call it cultivation when their strength improves without them needing to do anything. Is it simply to live longer, perhaps?\"","\"Huh? What are you talking about?\" Officer Mei muttered with a puzzled look on her face. \"How does improving our cultivation increase our longevity?\"","\"What?\"","It was Yuan’s turn to be confused.","\"Let me get something straight... Your longevity doesn’t increase alongside your cultivation?\" Yuan asked for confirmation.","\"Of course not,\" she replied, sounding like she was only stating the obvious.","’So despite possessing such high cultivation, it does not affect their longevity? Is this the consequence of cultivating entirely through the system?’ Yuan wondered inwardly after learning this surprising information.","\"Uh... What is the average lifespan in this world?\" Yuan then asked.","\"About three to five hundred years. However, a few individuals have lived for as long as a thousand.\"","\"I see... So it is still much longer than an ordinary mortal’s lifespan, but compared to cultivators, it is basically nothing.\"","\"What on earth are you talking about?\" Officer Mei inquired.","\"Believe it or not, but the cultivators in my world can live for tens of thousands of years with ease, and once we reach a certain cultivation realm, we basically become immortal.\"","\"What?! Immortal?!\" Officer Mei exclaimed in disbelief. \"That’s the most outrageous thing you’ve said to date!\"","Yuan shrugged and said, \"Many people in my world cultivate for immortality.\"","\"H-How does it work?\" Officer Mei asked in a nervous voice.","\"Do you remember when your mother cultivated manually and called it inefficient? That is how the cultivators in my world all cultivate.\"","\"What...? You can increase your longevity if you cultivate like that?\" Officer Mei muttered in a daze. \"But it barely improves our cultivation... In fact, most of us would long perish before we even increase our cultivation by a single level if we used that method.\"","\"That’s because you’ve inflated your cultivation with the system’s assistance.\" Yuan shook his head.","After a slight pause, he added, \"That being said, this is just my speculation.\"","\"Is that so? Anyway, let’s get back to work.\" Officer Mei said.","The two continued patrolling the city between the 10th and 19th Sectors and, over the next several days, encountered more incidents. Yet most of them were either fights or arguments sparked by the slightest provocations.","’This world... is quite peaceful,’ Yuan thought to himself.","Meanwhile, somewhere within the boundless Starry Sky, a massive figure that had been slumbering for countless years suddenly opened their eyes and muttered in a puzzled voice, \"My system was destroyed...? Who could’ve done it?\"","After a moment of silence, they turned toward the Nine Heavens with narrowed eyes and wondered inwardly, ’This wasn’t supposed to happen! What went wrong? Who intervened with my plans? I need to find out!’"]},{"number":2557,"title":"Chapter 2557: Gaia’s Sanctum","paragraphs":["Time passed quickly, and before Yuan realized, it had been almost an entire month since he arrived in this mysterious world.","<Your cultivation has reached Ninth Level First Ascension>","<Your Credential Rank has increased a level>","<You have acquired the required Credential Rank for Level 3 treatment>","<Begin Treatment?>","<Treatment Has Begun>","<Utilizing Level 3 Treatment>","<Treatment Completed>","<A curse has been removed from the user>","After working for twenty-eight days without rest, Yuan’s Credential Rank finally reached Rank 3, the bare minimum to qualify to join the military.","However, his cultivation was still in the First Ascension, and he needed to reach the Third Ascension to qualify fully.","\"Hey, my mother just messaged me. She said that she’ll be at the house in an hour, so let’s get back to the station and clock out,\" Officer Mei said to Yuan after receiving the message.","They returned to the station shortly after and clocked out.","\"How was it, Assistant Officer?\"","The officer who signed Yuan up for the job was still there when they returned.","\"A little more boring than I’d anticipated, not that I am complaining,\" he admitted.","The officer chuckled at his words and said, \"If you want more action, you should work at the 9th Precinct, which deals with the slums.\"","\"I would... but I already have another job planned,\" said Yuan while shaking his head.","\"Oh? Are you quitting already? What will you be doing next?\"","\"I’m joining the military.\"","\"...?!\"","The officer’s eyes widened with shock at Yuan’s words.","Then, he spoke in a hesitant voice, \"I don’t want to be rude, but I don’t think you’ll survive the military. Hell, you won’t even get in with your cultivation at such a low level.\"","Yuan shrugged and said, \"I may not qualify now, but I still have some time to fix it. As for whether or not I will survive the military... only time will tell.\"","After clocking out, Yuan followed Officer Mei back to her villa, where they waited for Mei Feng to show up.","A little over an hour later, Mei Feng finally arrived at the villa.","\"You’re still only at the First Ascension, huh? A little slower than I anticipated,\" she remarked the moment she saw Yuan.","\"At least my Credential Rank has increased to 3,\" Yuan said.","Without wasting any time, Mei Feng retrieved the second Gaia’s Gift and casually handed it to him.","Had Officer Mei not revealed the truth, Yuan would never have realized how precious the treasure was, given how nonchalantly Mei Feng treated it.","\"Thank you.\" Yuan accepted the treasure and immediately consumed it, increasing his Cultivation Speed by a level.","<You have consumed Gaia’s Gift>","<Your Cultivation Speed has increased by 1>","<Your cultivation has reached First Level Second Ascension>","Yuan could feel his body surging with newfound energy after reaching Second Ascension.","’Sure enough, Second Ascension is basically the realm of Cultivation God!’ Yuan silently compared the two.","\"You should reach the Third Ascension within a year at this rate, but it’s still not fast enough since we need to get you to the Third Ascension before the recruitment in five months.\"","\"What other methods are there that speed up one’s cultivation?\" Yuan asked.","\"Gaia’s Sanctum,\" she replied.","\"What’s that?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow at this new word.","\"It’s a place where people can partake in special trials to improve their cultivation. However, it’s quite tedious and difficult, so only those who really want to speed up their cultivation go there.\"","\"Trials, huh? Sounds fun. Where is it? I’ll head there right now.\"","\"Let’s slow down a little. There’s still something you must do before you can go there.\"","\"What I must do?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows in a puzzled manner.","\"Follow me.\"","Mei Feng brought Yuan to the living room, where a lone machine now stood.","\"What the...?\" Officer Mei muttered when she saw it.","The machine hadn’t been there before, so her mother must’ve brought it there.","\"Wait... Isn’t this equipment used by the military?\" Officer Mei remarked after taking a closer look at the machine. \"I thought it was not allowed to be taken off the premises.\"","\"It’s not allowed, which is why I sneaked it here and we have to get this over with as soon as possible before someone notices,\" Mei Feng said in a calm manner.","\"Are you insane?!\" Officer Mei exclaimed. \"I know you can get away with a lot of things because of your position in the military, but this is too much even for you!\"","Mei Feng shrugged and defended herself, \"It’s not like we can wait until he joins the military.\"","She turned to look at Yuan and continued, \"What are you waiting for? Get inside.\"","Although he had no idea what the machine was for, Yuan entered the machine and waited for Mei Feng to do her thing.","A few minutes later—","<With the authority of Mei Feng, your physique has been hidden and changed to Superior Heavenly Refinement>","Once Yuan exited the machine, Mei Feng gave a quick explanation, \"We don’t need the entire world to know about your Perfected Heavenly Refinement since it’ll cause too much trouble.\"","\"I didn’t know you could alter one’s status like this...\" Yuan remarked.","\"It’s not permanent, and your real physique can still be seen by those with a higher Credential Rank than me. With that being said, as long as you don’t do anything too outrageous, you shouldn’t attract their attention,\" she said.","\"Anyway, I have to bring this machine back. Mei, bring him to Gaia’s Sanctum and show him how it works. I’ll come back one more time right before the recruitment.\"","After giving Officer Mei more work, Mei Feng left with the machine.","\"Haa...\" Officer Mei released a long sigh before turning to look at Yuan.","\"Let’s go.\"","They left the villa shortly after and began making their way to Gaia’s Sanctum.","\"By the way, what rank is Superior Heavenly Refinement?\" Yuan asked as they traveled."]},{"number":2558,"title":"Chapter 2558: Gaia’s Sanctum(2)","paragraphs":["Hearing Yuan’s question, Officer Mei explained, \"The nine standard ranks of Heavenly Refinement are arranged from lowest to highest: Heavenly Refinement, Tempered Heavenly Refinement, Superior Heavenly Refinement, Supreme Heavenly Refinement, Inexhaustible Heavenly Refinement, Imperious Heavenly Refinement, Indestructible Heavenly Refinement, Invincible Heavenly Refinement, and Perfected Heavenly Refinement.\"","\"So your mother disguised my physique as the third lowest rank, huh? I guess that makes sense, considering my low cultivation,\" Yuan muttered with a thoughtful expression.","He then asked, \"What about you? What rank is your physique at?\"","\"I’m currently at Supreme Heavenly Refinement,\" she revealed.","\"Is that impressive? What’s the average physique rank in this world?\" Yuan then asked.","\"The average person who doesn’t really focus on their cultivation usually stops at Tempered Heavenly Refinement. Meanwhile, those who put in a little more effort will achieve Superior Heavenly Refinement, and those who are serious about their cultivation will reach Supreme Heavenly Refinement,\" she replied.","\"As for Inexhaustible Heavenly Refinement and the ranks above it, only those who join the military can attain them. The technique and resources required to reach those levels are heavily restricted.\"","\"Now that I think about it, what is the difference between the ranks of the physique?\" Yuan continued to ask. \"Even though I possess Perfected Heavenly Refinement, it doesn’t seem to affect my cultivation speed.\"","\"That... I am not too sure about. All I know is that it’s better to have a higher-ranked physique. As for the details, you can ask my mother.\"","\"Alright.\"","Some time later, they stepped on the teleportation platform, and Officer Mei teleported them directly to Gaia’s Sanctum.","\"This is... Gaia’s Sanctum?\" Yuan muttered in a daze as he examined his surroundings with wide eyes.","He found himself inside a vast indoor stadium so immense that its walls could not be seen with the naked eye.","The floor was covered in marble-like tiles, and tens of thousands of people filled the area, with most of them staring intently at the projections suspended above.","When Yuan looked at one of the many projections, he saw two individuals engaged in battle in an arena surrounded by water, as if they were in the middle of the sea.","\"I can improve my cultivation here...?\" Yuan asked aloud, wearing a dumbfounded expression. \"How does that even work? I was expecting trials, but this just looks like a series of sparring matches.\"","\"There are three types of trials you can participate in,\" Officer Mei explained. \"The first is called One Above All, one-on-one matches where you fight someone of a similar ranking, climbing higher as you win. The second is Last Man Standing, where a hundred people fight until only one remains. The third is Endless Assault, where you must fight artificial beings created by the system until you are defeated.\"","\"If you perform well during a trial, the system will reward you. Most of the time, those rewards come in the form of a boost to your cultivation.\"","\"...\"","Yuan was left speechless by these so-called trials.","’This feels like something straight out of a video game...’ he thought to himself.","\"So, which trial increases my cultivation the fastest?\" Yuan asked a moment later.","\"That depends on whichever one you think you’ll do the best at. After all, the higher rank you achieve, the more your cultivation increases.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"What happens if I rank high in all three of them? Do I get three times the reward?\"","Officer Mei raised an eyebrow and responded, \"I guess so.\"","\"Then I’ll start with the one-on-one matches,\" Yuan then said. \"Where do I go to get started?\"","\"Follow me.\"","As Yuan followed Officer Mei, he thought to himself, ’The cultivation in this world is so exaggerated and inflated that it feels... somewhat pointless.’","He couldn’t fathom why the system was handing out cultivation levels like some sort of currency.","’Even if they have a high cultivation, it’s not like they can do anything with it... Nor does it increase their longevity. So what is the point? Why is everyone cultivating?’","Although Yuan was deeply puzzled by this world, he had a feeling that the military held the answers he sought.","Realizing there was no point in pondering over something with no clear answers, Yuan decided to just focus on improving his cultivation and increasing his Credential Rank.","Some time later, they arrived at the reception.","\"My friend would like to sign up for the one-on-one matches,\" Officer Mei said to one of the workers there while pointing at Yuan.","The worker looked at Yuan and asked him, \"Have you been here before?\"","\"No, this is my first time.\"","\"In that case, we will need to register you first.\"","The worker gestured at the machine before her and said, \"Please.\"","Already used to this routine, Yuan shoved his hand into the machine without a word.","[Name: Yuan]","[Cultivation: First Level Second Ascension]","[Physique: Superior Heavenly Refinement]","[Credential Rank: 3]","<You have been registered as a Player at Gaia’s Sanctum>","The worker raised an eyebrow after seeing Yuan’s low cultivation.","\"Are you sure you want to participate in One Above All? I suggest starting with Endless Assault to get a feel for it since this is your first time.\"","Hearing this, Yuan asked, \"Does one’s cultivation matter in the one-on-one matches?\"","\"Of course it does. While you won’t need to worry too much in the beginning, since you will first be matched against those at the bottom of the rankings, there will still be a gap in cultivation, as most people do not participate in One Above All until they have reached at least the Third Ascension. If you’re unlucky, you could even encounter someone at Fourth Ascension.\"","\"Meanwhile, Endless Assault is more beginner-friendly because your opponents are artificial and will be matched to your cultivation level.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding with an excited smile.","\"Sign me up for One Above All.\"","\"...\"","The worker stared at Yuan in stunned silence for a moment and shook his head inwardly.","’He’ll learn the hard way.’"]},{"number":2559,"title":"Chapter 2559: First Match","paragraphs":["\"I have checked you in for One Above All.\"","The worker said to Yuan shortly after.","Yuan turned to Officer Mei and asked, \"What now?\"","\"Now you can enter the arena and wait for your matchmaking,\" she said.","As she led him to the waiting area, she explained a few rules.","\"During the fight, your cultivation will not be suppressed, so you can fight without reserve. Although you can’t die while inside Gaia’s Sanctum, and all damage is reverted after leaving the arena, you will feel everything.\"","\"Are weapons allowed?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Well, that depends on your ranking. In the lower ranks, you are only allowed to use your body and martial techniques, but upon reaching a certain rank, you can start fighting with weapons.\"","\"How many ranks are there?\"","\"You start without a rank, and as you progress, you will reach Novice, Warrior, Expert, Master, Grandmaster, Gladiator, Elite Gladiator, Supreme Gladiator, and One Above All, with the highest rank only attainable by the strongest on the ranking.\"","\"By the way, each trial has its own ranking.\"","\"I see.\"","Some time later, they reached a teleportation platform, and Officer Mei said, \"You’ll be teleported to the preparation area once you step on that. Good luck.\"","\"See you later.\"","Yuan did not waste any time and immediately stepped onto the platform, disappearing from the lobby.","<You have entered the waiting room for One Above All>","Yuan looked around the waiting room. He was alone in a spacious, square-shaped room furnished with a couch, a bathroom, and even a bed.","\"So, how does this work?\" he wondered out loud.","<Begin matchmaking?>","A notification popped up the next moment.","\"Begin.\"","Yuan responded without thinking.","<Checking Status>","<Player Profile has been created>","[Player: Yuan]","[Rank: Unranked]","[Cultivation: First Level Second Ascension]","<You have entered matchmaking for One Above All>","A few moments later—","<Opponent Found>","<Your match will begin in one minute>","A minute later—","<Your match will begin now>","<Teleporting to arena in 3... 2.. 1...>","When the countdown reached zero, Yuan was teleported to a new location, and he found himself standing beneath a blazing sun, with soft, unstable sand shifting beneath his feet.","Not too far away stood a lone figure—a young man who appeared to be a teenager. Yet, he was exuding the aura of a Third Ascension cultivator.","\"Second Ascension? Lucky me! This is essentially a free win!\" The young man laughed excitedly after seeing Yuan’s cultivation.","Meanwhile, Yuan wasn’t even paying attention to his opponent and was focused on himself, or more precisely, the new energy flowing within him.","\"So this is Limitless, huh?\" Yuan muttered as he was finally allowed to use it, which helped him gain a better understanding of it.","Although it felt similar to Eternal Essence, it was far purer—as though it had already been refined.","If Eternal Essence was the raw energy from which all existence originated, then Limitless was its refined, more accessible form. However, that purity came at a cost. While even humans could wield Limitless, it was nowhere near as powerful or destructive as Eternal Essence.","\"Hey, trash! What are you dozing off on?!\" The young man cursed at Yuan when he realized that he was being ignored.","<The match will begin in 10 seconds>","<9>","<8>","<7>","Yuan finally looked at his opponent, who was glaring daggers at him, and spoke with a calm smile, \"I will give you a ten-minute head start. I won’t attack you until the ten minutes are up.\"","<4>","<3>","\"You’re looking down on me?! Even though you’ve only reached Second Ascension as an adult?! How ridiculous!\"","\"Your cultivation level isn’t everything in a fight.\"","<2>","<1>","\"Maybe that’s true for you, who has an insignificant cultivation!\"","<Match start>","\"But I am different!\"","Without moving from his spot, the young man extended an arm toward Yuan and began gathering energy in his palm.","’What an obvious attack...’ Yuan inwardly shook his head.","In the very next moment, the young man unleashed a wave of Limitless energy from his palm, sending it hurtling toward Yuan like an energy blast—just as Yuan had predicted.","Although Yuan had anticipated the young man’s attack, he was still surprised by the amount of power behind it. It was almost as though the young man had no intention of conserving his energy and planned to end the fight in a single strike.","Of course, Yuan avoided the attack with ease and, after doing so, said to the young man, \"That was quite a powerful attack. I bet that would have done a lot of damage... if it had hit me.\"","\"T-This bastard...!\" The young man cursed in a low voice, sounding a little out of breath.","Yuan raised an eyebrow and remarked, \"Don’t tell me you’re tired already? After a single attack?\"","\"Shut the hell up! I am just getting started!\"","The young man shouted as he started bombarding Yuan with even more predictable attacks.","Seeing this, Yuan could only shake his head. It felt as though he were fighting a greenhorn who possessed a powerful treasure but had no idea how to wield it properly.","\"Why do you not just surrender?\" Yuan asked the young man two minutes later. \"I really do not want to spend the next eight minutes watching you catch your breath.\"","However, the young man did not respond. No—he could not. After unleashing everything he had in only a few attacks, he was already completely out of energy.","\"...\"","Yuan was left speechless by the way his first match was unfolding. Although he had kept his expectations low, he had at least expected a proper fight.","Instead, his opponent was so inexperienced that Yuan felt as though he were bullying a little kid who had never fought before.","\"Is this your first match, too?\" Yuan asked.","Unbeknownst to Yuan, this was the young man’s fourth match, and he had two victories under his belt.","\"Y-You dirty little bastard...! If you are a real fighter, then fight me properly instead of using such dirty tactics!\" the young man finally shouted in frustration, accusing Yuan of playing dirty."]},{"number":2560,"title":"Chapter 2560: Win Streak","paragraphs":["\"I’m using... dirty tactics?\" Yuan could hardly believe his ears.","\"So you expect me to just stand there and take your attacks?\"","\"I expect you to fight me properly, not run around and force me to waste my energy!\" the young man exclaimed indignantly, as though he were the one being wronged.","Yuan scratched his head and asked, \"So you are blaming me for your own lack of control and efficiency? Instead of wasting your energy like an idiot who refuses to learn, you should try a different approach when one method does not work.\"","\"I am doing you a favor by letting you attack me for free, yet here you are, wasting my generosity...\" Yuan shook his head.","In truth, Yuan had wanted to see how the cultivators of this world used Limitless, but he quickly realized his miscalculation.","’If I want to observe a proper cultivator, I should do so at a higher rank. Most people at the lower ranks will probably be like this amateur...’ he sighed inwardly.","Yuan used a movement technique and suddenly vanished from the young man’s sight.","\"H-He vanished?!\" the young man cried out loud.","Then, he heard a familiar voice resounding from behind him.","\"I know I said that I’d give you ten minutes, but... I doubt anything would change even if I gave you a hundred minutes, so I will end things here.\"","Before the young man could react, he felt a sharp, piercing pain in his neck.","<You have died>","When the young man came to, he was back in the waiting room, a death notification floating before him.","\"What the hell was that?!\" the young man cried out loud.","He had watched many matches prior to participating in them himself, but he had never seen a cultivator fight the way his opponent had.","Meanwhile, Yuan was also teleported back to the waiting room after his victory.","<You have won your match>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<Your cultivation has reached Second Level Second Ascension>","\"My cultivation increases just like that? I still have five months before the recruitment, so I might as well increase my cultivation as much as possible!\"","With that in mind, Yuan immediately started matchmaking for his second fight.","A minute later, he was teleported to the arena.","This time, he found himself on a floating platform in the middle of the sea—the same arena he had seen on the display not long ago.","Standing on the opposite side of the platform was another young man, seemingly in his teens, and his cultivation was also at the Third Ascension.","The young man raised an eyebrow after seeing Yuan’s cultivation. He rubbed his eyes and looked again to make sure he wasn’t imagining things.","\"Haha! A free win!\"","<Match will begin in 10 seconds>","This time, Yuan remained silent as he waited for the countdown to reach zero.","Ten seconds later, the match began. The young man made the first move, attacking in a manner similar to Yuan’s previous opponent.","Yuan avoided the attack with ease, and the young man immediately followed up with another powerful attack.","\"...\"","\"W-Why aren’t my attacks hitting him?!\"","The young man exclaimed in shock.","Once the young man began to show signs of exhaustion, Yuan struck, defeating him in a single blow.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 2>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<Your cultivation has reached Third Level Second Ascension>","Yuan didn’t waste any time and immediately started his next match.","Half an hour later, Yuan won his 10th match in a row.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 10>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<Your cultivation has reached Sixth Level Second Ascension>","<You have won 10 matches in total>","<You have reached Novice Rank>","Over the course of those ten matches, Yuan closely observed his opponents during the first minute of each fight. Seven of them fought in a similar manner, while the opponents in the final three matches actually tried to confront him head-on.","However, they only did so after exhausting more than half of their energy.","Back in the waiting room, Yuan pondered aloud, \"The cultivators of this world seem to lack stamina...\"","At first, Yuan thought they were simply wasting energy without restraint, or that they didn’t know how to control it properly. However, even if that were the case, cultivators comparable to Absolute Gods should not be exhausting themselves in a few short minutes, even if they fought at full power.","\"Is there a reason why they’re exhausting themselves so quickly?\" Yuan wondered as he left the waiting room.","Although he wanted to continue fighting, he wasn’t alone, and, not wanting to make Officer Mei wait too long, he decided to take a break.","Once he returned to the lobby, Yuan quickly spotted Officer Mei among the crowd near the spectators’ area, watching the matches displayed overhead.","’There are a lot more people now...’ Yuan thought to himself as he approached the crowd.","\"What are you watching?\" he asked when he reached Officer Mei.","\"Hm? You are done already?\" Officer Mei responded without looking at him, her eyes fixed on the display.","Curious about what had captured her attention, Yuan turned to the display as well.","There were two individuals locked in a fierce battle, much like how normal cultivators in his world would fight.","\"Hm?\"","Yuan’s eyebrows rose in surprise when he saw them. However, it was not their experienced movements or their weapons that caught his attention. Rather, it was their faces—their familiar faces.","\"Wang Ming and Shi Lang?\" Yuan muttered in disbelief.","And just like the men Yuan knew, Wang Ming wielded a sword-like weapon, while Shi Lang fought with a long spear-like weapon.","\"What are those glowing weapons they are using?\" Yuan asked Officer Mei a moment later."]},{"number":2561,"title":"Chapter 2561: Gaia Points","paragraphs":["\"Their weapons? They are called Limitless Armaments,\" Officer Mei responded.","\"So the glowing blades are created from Limitless? Who are these two, anyway?\"","\"The one with the spear is called Shi Fa, and his opponent is Wu Wang. They are both Gladiators and in the top 500.\"","\"Top 500, huh? That’s pretty impressive,\" Yuan muttered, wondering if he needed to reach such a high rank before he could fight competent opponents.","\"How was your match? Did you win?\" Officer Mei suddenly asked him.","\"What do you think?\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, she responded, \"Quite frankly, even though you have a low cultivation base, your combat expertise is one of the best I’ve seen, rivaling even those two Gladiators. I think you have a good chance of winning as long as your opponent wasn’t in the Fourth Ascension.\"","Officer Mei trembled inwardly just recalling her spar with Yuan.","Yuan chuckled and said, \"Although the experience was not what I anticipated, it was fun nonetheless. I even managed to reach the rank of Novice.\"","\"What?\" Officer Mei finally stopped watching the display and turned to look at Yuan with a puzzled face.","\"How is that possible? You need at least twenty victories—or ten in a row to reach Novice as a beginner. How many matches did you do in such a short time?\"","\"Ten, and I won all of them,\" Yuan calmly replied.","Officer Mei’s eyes widened with shock at his words, as she’d only expected him to complete two to three matches in such a short time.","\"Hah!\" A disdainful sneer resounded nearby before mocking Yuan out loud. \"Buddy, if you’re going to lie to impress a girl, try not to make it so obvious.\"","Another remarked while chuckling, \"Ten wins in a row? At the Second Ascension? Hahaha!\"","Despite the mockery, Yuan remained calm, even ignoring them.","Meanwhile, Officer Mei doubted Yuan only for a moment—at least until she noticed his cultivation had skyrocketed to Sixth Level Second Ascension.","’Good lord! He actually went on a ten-win streak on his first day! And it hasn’t even been an hour since he started!’ she cried inwardly, realizing that Yuan was even more monstrous than she’d thought.","\"Are you going to continue?\" she asked him a moment later.","Yuan nodded, \"I want to see how far I can go. You can head back first if you want.\"","\"I don’t mind waiting,\" she said.","\"I want to see how long before you get a spotlight on the display.\"","\"Then I will continue my matches now,\" said Yuan.","However, as he turned around and started walking away, someone placed a hand on his shoulder, halting him.","Yuan slowly turned around to see a young man standing behind him with a wide grin on his face.","\"Want to spar with me instead?\"","\"What would I gain out of beating a nobody like you?\" Yuan asked with a puzzled face.","\"I’d rather not waste my time,\" he added.","\"What did you just say?\" The young man immediately frowned.","Then, a look of realization crossed his face. \"Oh, I see. You are just afraid that you will lose to me and expose yourself.\"","\"If you went on a 10-win streak, you should have no issues fighting me, who also just happened to reach Novice.\"","Yuan sighed out loud and said, \"I couldn’t care less whether you believe me or not, but I am not going to waste my time if fighting you has no benefits.\"","\"Benefits, huh? How about this? If you manage to defeat me, I will give you fifty points.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and asked, \"Points? What is that?\"","The young man stared at Yuan with a dumbfounded look.","\"You don’t even know about points?\"","Officer Mei quickly spoke, \"Ah, I forgot to mention it to you earlier since I wasn’t expecting you to reach Novice so quickly, but once you reach that rank, you can obtain points for every win, and you can use them to exchange for additional rewards. Of course, you can also trade them.\"","’Sounds like a system that can easily be abused...’ Yuan thought to himself.","\"Fifty points, huh? Is that a lot?\"","\"Well, you get around 5 points per victory, more if you’re on a win-streak,\" Officer Mei said.","\"Sounds good.\" Yuan nodded. \"However, I don’t have any points.\"","\"That’s fine,\" said the young man, as he just wanted the opportunity to put liars like Yuan in his place. \"I don’t need anything from you even if you lose to me.\"","\"Alright. How do we do this?\"","\"We can set up a custom match. It won’t count towards your records, either. What’s your player name?\"","\"Yuan.\"","\"My name is Gu Kecheng. Make sure you accept my request once you see my name.\"","Yuan fell silent after hearing the young man’s name.","\"Alright...\" he said a moment later.","They went to the waiting room shortly after.","After waiting around for a few minutes, Yuan received a custom match request.","<Player Gu Kecheng(Novice) has sent you a match request for One Above All>","<Win Condition: 50 Gaia Points> <Lose Condition: N/A>","[Player: Gu Kecheng]","[Cultivation: Fourth Level Fourth Ascension]","[One Above All Rank: Novice]","[One Above All Highest Win Streak: 3]","Meanwhile, inside Gu Kecheng’s waiting room, his eyes widened with shock after Yuan accepted his match request.","<Player Yuan(Novice) has accepted your match request for One Above All>","[Player: Yuan]","[Cultivation: Sixth Level Second Ascension]","[One Above All Rank: Novice]","[One Above All Highest Win Streak: 10]","\"T-Ten wins in a row?! He actually has a ten-win streak?!\" he cried out in disbelief.","As the challenger, Gu Kecheng could not view their opponent’s status, except for their rank, until the challenge was accepted, so he was caught off guard by the unexpected situation.","\"Fuck! My fifty points! I am screwed!\"","<Match will begin in 10 seconds>","\"N-No! This doesn’t automatically mean that I will lose to him! My cultivation is still two realms higher than his!\"","<Your match will begin now>","<Teleporting to arena in 3...2...1...>"]},{"number":2562,"title":"Chapter 2562: Custom Match","paragraphs":["Yuan and Gu Kecheng were both teleported to a snowy arena, surrounded by towering white mountains, their knees buried in soft, pristine snow. Not only that, but there was an ongoing snowstorm so extreme that it blurred their vision.","’Whiteout! This is my favorite map!’ A wide grin appeared on Gu Kecheng’s face after seeing his most experienced arena.","This map not only hindered one’s movement and vision but was also bitterly cold. Because of its extreme temperature, it was considered one of the most hated arenas available.","However, Gu Kecheng enjoyed the cold and had always won on this map, so his doubts vanished instantly.","The falling snow did not just block one’s vision; it also had a unique characteristic that messed with one’s divine sense, making it more difficult to find people.","As for the thick layer of snow on the ground, it reached their knees.","’Whoever makes the first move wins!’ Gu Kecheng thought as he focused entirely on locating his opponent. In an arena like this, the first to find the other usually claimed victory.","Ten seconds... twenty seconds... half a minute...","An entire minute later—","’What is going on?! I cannot sense him at all!’ Gu Kecheng cried inwardly.","Normally, even the slightest movement would produce a sound in the snow. Yet, Gu Kecheng could not hear a single sound.","’Is he also standing still? Then I just need to find him using my senses. With my superior cultivation, there’s no way he could find me before I find him!’","Although he had already been trying to find Yuan using his divine sense from the very beginning, he wasn’t completely focused on it.","Suddenly, a calm voice resounded, and it came from directly behind Gu Kecheng.","\"Are you going to stand there all day?\"","\"?!?!\"","Gu Kecheng was greatly startled to hear Yuan’s voice so close to him.","’When did he get behind me?!’ he exclaimed inwardly.","Despite his shock, Gu Kecheng immediately spun around and unleashed a wave of Limitless, blasting everything behind him away. He poured so much power into the attack that it dispersed half of the snowstorm temporarily and even obliterated an entire mountain.","Gu Kecheng expected to be teleported back to the waiting room with the victory notification before him soon, but his expectations were betrayed once again when Yuan’s voice returned.","\"Where are you aiming? I’m right here.\"","Once again, Yuan’s voice came from behind Gu Kecheng—only this time, he sounded even closer than before.","\"Fuck!\"","Gu Kecheng cursed out loud as he attacked in the direction of Yuan’s voice.","\"...\"","\"That was close. You almost hit me,\" Yuan’s voice continued to provoke him.","\"Stop messing with me, you bastard!\" Gu Kecheng screamed loudly.","\"So you want to lose already?\"","Before Gu Kecheng could respond, he felt someone pressing a hand on his shoulder, sending chills down his spine.","\"You’re dead!\"","Without looking back, Gu Kecheng swung his arm, creating a massive arc of Limitless that tore through the air like an unstoppable blade.","Yet, Gu Kecheng could still feel someone’s hand resting on his shoulder.","’What the hell am I fighting?! A ghost?!’ he cried inwardly as cold sweat formed on his forehead, only to freeze moments later.","\"You’re not any better than my previous opponents. No... You might be even worse...\" Yuan sighed, sounding disappointed.","Gu Kecheng trembled in anger before his aura exploded like a bomb.","\"DIE!\"","He roared and unleashed as much power as he could, releasing Limitless in every direction.","\"...\"","For a brief moment, silence filled the white world. The only sound that remained was Gu Kecheng’s heavy breathing.","\"D-Did I finally get him...?\" Gu Kecheng mumbled, his vision blurred from exhausting all his energy.","However, a black silhouette suddenly appeared not far in front of him, slowly approaching him like a ghost.","Gu Kecheng wanted to attack again, but he had completely exhausted his energy and could only watch helplessly as the silhouette drew closer and closer.","\"Weren’t you watching those two Gladiators fight just now? Yet here you are, wasting your energy and blindly attacking.\"","\"W-Why can’t I sense your presence even though you’re standing right in front of me...?\" Gu Kecheng asked with a bewildered look on his face.","\"Try to figure that out yourself.\"","Suddenly, the silhouette vanished before Gu Kecheng’s eyes.","A split second later, his vision went black.","Before he realized it, Gu Kecheng was back inside the waiting room with a notification before him.","<You have died>","\"Argh!\"","Gu Kecheng fell to his knees while screaming as a searing pain erupted from his neck. Although one could not die within Gaia’s Sanctum, one would still feel the pain of it.","Meanwhile, Yuan returned to the lobby after winning the match.","When he approached Officer Mei and the group gathered around her, they all stared at him with wide eyes.","Unbeknownst to Yuan, his custom match against Gu Kecheng had been broadcast on the display at Gu Kecheng’s personal request.","Although Gu Kecheng could not find Yuan to save his life, everyone in the lobby had witnessed the entire match. From their perspective, Yuan had been teleporting around like some kind of ghost.","\"W-Was that some kind of movement technique?\" Officer Mei asked him.","\"What?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"We saw your match,\" she explained, pointing at the display above them.","\"Oh. Well, I wouldn’t call it a movement technique, but it’s something like that, I guess.\"","\"H-Hey! I will buy that technique from you for 500 Gaia Points!\"","Someone in the crowd suddenly shouted.","Yuan turned to look at him and responded with a calm smile, \"Sorry, but it’s not for sale.\"","He then said to Officer Mei, \"I am going to see what I can purchase with Gaia Points.\"","She nodded.","\"I’ll take you there.\"","However, just as they started walking, a familiar face blocked their path.","\"Stop!\" Gu Kecheng shouted.","\"What do you want now?\" Yuan asked him.","\"R-Rematch! I want a rematch!\" Gu Kecheng demanded.","\"Sure...\" Yuan calmly responded.","A smile started forming on Gu Kecheng’s face, but it swiftly vanished when Yuan continued, \"Once you have more points to give me, that is.\""]},{"number":2563,"title":"Chapter 2563: Gaia’s Exchange","paragraphs":["\"W-What did you just say?\" Gu Kecheng muttered with a dumbfounded look on his face.","\"How many times do I have to repeat myself?\" Yuan sighed, sounding annoyed. \"I don’t want to waste my time. If you want to fight me, make sure you have some points. At least 50.\"","Gu Kecheng stared at Yuan in utter silence, looking completely stunned.","After a moment, his expression shifted, and his face rapidly turned bright red.","Then, without warning, he stepped forward, drew back his arm, and attempted to throw a punch.","Yuan, who saw the attack coming from miles away, casually dodged it before grabbing Gu Kecheng by his neck and slamming him onto the ground with a heavy thud.","\"If you can’t beat me with your entire cultivation, what makes you think you can beat me without it?\" Yuan sneered as he looked down on Gu Kecheng with disdain.","\"B-Bastard...! Do you know who I am?!\"","\"No, I don’t—but let me guess. You are some brat from an influential family, and you’re going to cry to your parents about me, begging them to take care of me because you’re too pathetic to do anything yourself.\"","\"You—!\"","\"Shut up.\" Yuan slammed his head onto the ground, interrupting him. \"If you’re going to cry to your parents, go ahead. But be prepared for the consequences.\"","Yuan released Gu Kecheng the next moment and wiped his hands on his suit, as though he had touched something filthy and wanted to clean them.","\"...\"","Officer Mei watched the entire exchange with a nonchalant expression. Since Gu Kecheng had made the first move, she did not blame Yuan for retaliating. And because their confrontation was nothing more than a minor scuffle, she saw no reason to intervene.","\"Let’s go.\" Yuan walked around Ge Kecheng, who could only sit on the ground, his head as red as a tomato.","Ge Kecheng turned to glare at Yuan’s back and muttered, \"I will make you pay for this humiliation!\"","Some time later, Officer Mei brought Yuan to a location with several machines arranged in an orderly fashion.","\"You can exchange your points here.\"","\"How many points do you have, Officer Mei?\" Yuan asked her out of curiosity.","\"Just call me Mei Xiaoyun,\" she said. \"Anyway, I have about a thousand points.\"","\"A thousand points? That sounds like a lot. What rank are you?\"","\"I’m only at Expert since I don’t come here often.\"","Yuan’s eyes widened at her words.","If a single victory earned an average of five points, then she would have needed to win at least two hundred matches to accumulate one thousand points. Yet, she was only ranked Expert.","This made Yuan wonder how many matches he would need to win before reaching Gladiator to fight Wu Wang or Shi Fa.","Yuan turned his attention to the machines a moment later.","\"How does it work?\" he asked.","\"Place your hand into the slot over there,\" Mei Xiaoyun pointed.","The moment Yuan slotted his hand into the machine, a screen appeared before him.","<Reading Player Status>","<Available Gaia’s Points: 50>","<Welcome to Gaia’s Exchange, Player Yuan>","[Martial Techniques]","[Cultivation Techniques]","[Cultivation Resources]","[General Resources]","There were several categories, and Yuan slowly looked through each of them one by one.","He started with Martial Techniques, and surprisingly, there were a ton of them. Tens of thousands, in fact.","’There are so many martial techniques, yet every cultivator I have fought so far has used Limitless like an amateur without a single technique... Why is that?’ Yuan wondered inwardly, but he quickly realized the problem shortly after when he considered buying one to examine it.","Even the cheapest martial technique costs more than a thousand Gaia Points, and if Mei Xiaoyun—an Expert with over 200 victories—could barely afford one, then the vast majority of players would have no chance of purchasing it.","Yuan looked at the Cultivation Techniques next.","\"Wow...\" Yuan muttered in surprise at how cheaply the cultivation techniques were sold compared to the martial techniques.","Although there were only around a hundred cultivation techniques, the cheapest cost just one hundred Gaia Points, while the most expensive cost ten thousand. In comparison, the most expensive martial techniques cost a million points.","However, once Yuan thought about it, the pricing made sense. After all, nearly everyone in this world cultivated through Gaia’s Cultivation System, making traditional cultivation techniques basically obsolete.","He moved on to Cultivation Resources next, and the first item on the list he noticed was Gaia’s Stone.","\"A single Gaia’s Stone costs only ten points? It’s cheaper than I imagined,\" he muttered aloud.","Hearing this, Mei Xiaoyun said, \"That’s largely because they are already widely available with limited usage.\"","\"Take a look at the cost of Gaia’s Gift,\" she then said.","Yuan looked through the list until he found Gaia’s Gift.","His eyes widened when he saw that a single Gaia’s Gift would cost him ten thousand points.","\"Ten thousand points! Not only that, but it’s the lowest quality!\" he exclaimed.","Besides the high cost, Yuan was also surprised to see several tiers of Gaia’s Gift available.","[Gaia’s Gift: 10,000]","[Superior Gaia’s Gift: 75,000]","[Flawless Gaia’s Gift: 500,000]","\"Hm? What is this Gaia’s Blessing that costs two million points? It’s double the cost of the most expensive martial technique,\" Yuan asked when he saw it.","\"You need it to reach Rank 9 Cultivation Speed,\" Mei Xiaoyun explained. \"However, nobody has ever reached such a level, and most people do not even surpass Rank 5.\"","After a slight pause, she continued, \"You asked me about the differences between the ranks of Heavenly Refinement, right? Now that I think about it, it was recently proven that the stronger one’s physique is, the higher their cultivation speed can improve.\"","\"So even if one with a low-ranking physique consumes Gaia’s Gift, it’s not guaranteed that their Cultivation Speed would rank up?\" Yuan asked.","\"That’s correct.\"","\"I see...\"","After going through Cultivation Resources, Yuan looked in the final catalog, General Resources.","\"Hm?\"","His eyes suddenly lit up when he recognized some of the names listed, as they were also available in the Nine Heavens."]},{"number":2564,"title":"Chapter 2564: Third Ascension","paragraphs":["’T-These treasures! They also exist in the Nine Heavens!’ Yuan cried inwardly upon recognizing some of the treasures listed.","This was a huge discovery, as it implied a connection between the Nine Heavens and this world.","Some time later, Yuan removed his hand from the machine and said, \"There are some interesting things for sale, but I do not have enough points to purchase the things I want.\"","\"Well, the only way you can get more points is through matches.\"","\"What about earning points from other players, like the fifty points I earned from Gu Kecheng? It would be much faster if I could keep earning them that way,\" Yuan said.","\"There is a limit to how many points you can earn through custom matches, and that limit depends on your rank. At your current rank, you can only earn around one hundred points per year through that method. Also, the system can tell when people are exchanging points through custom matches, which is prohibited and punishable.\"","\"Hm? What about that one guy who offered to pay me 500 points for my technique back there? How would he go about doing that?\"","\"It just means he’ll purchase the items in your stead using his own points. That’s how most people do it.\"","\"I see... Well, I have to raise my rank anyway, so I’ll earn them through normal matches. What are you going to do while I fight?\"","Mei Xiaoyun calmly replied, \"Since I am already here, I might as well participate in a few matches, too. Once I am bored, I’ll return to my job. Make sure you don’t forget about the recruitment, which will happen in five months.\"","Yuan nodded, \"I won’t. Then, see you later.\"","Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun separated after going to their own waiting room.","<You have entered matchmaking for One Above All>","<Opponent Found>","<Your match will begin in one minute>","\"...\"","<Your match will begin now>","<Teleporting to arena in 3... 2.. 1...>","Yuan began his grind in One Above All, participating in match after match without pause.","Since each match lasted anywhere from one to five minutes, Yuan would complete at least thirty matches per hour.","Every opponent he faced in the Novice Rank was between the Third and Fourth Ascension, and due to their lack of combat experience, none of them could even touch Yuan’s shadow before being defeated.","It didn’t take long before Yuan racked up a high Win Streak.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 51>","<You have earned 5 Gaia Points>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have earned 20 additional Gaia Points for your win streak>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<Your cultivation has reached First Level Third Ascension>","<You have reached Warrior Rank>","In just a little over an hour, Yuan achieved his goal of Third Ascension, fulfilling the requirement needed to join the military.","\"I reached my goal much faster than I anticipated...\" Yuan muttered as he sat on the soft bed in the waiting room.","\"Should I keep going and see how much I can improve my cultivation before the recruitment? I doubt many of those attending will be barely meeting the requirements, after all.\"","After taking a moment to rest, Yuan began his first match as a Warrior.","Unbeknownst to him, his high win streak had caused his matches to start being broadcast in the lobby for everyone to see.","Normally, the lobby displays only broadcast matches from Master Rank and above. However, on rare occasions—such as when someone with outstanding performance, like Yuan, appeared—they would cast a spotlight on them, regardless of their rank.","As a result, Yuan became one of the very few Novices whose matches were displayed for everyone to see.","\"Hey... Isn’t that the guy who claimed to be on a 10-win streak not long ago?\"","A few spectators remembered Yuan, recalling his match with Gu Kecheng.","\"Heavens! He’s beating his opponents with seemingly zero effort! And what kind of movement technique is he using?!\"","Those who were unfamiliar with Yuan were immediately captivated by his fighting style, especially his movement technique that allowed him to vanish and appear anywhere at will, almost as if he could teleport on demand.","\"Hey... that technique...\"","Although most spectators present were unfamiliar with Yuan’s movement technique, a few immediately recognized it.","\"That fucking idiot! Which Division does he belong to?! Isn’t he aware that we’re strictly forbidden from using that technique in public?!\"","\"There’s no way he doesn’t know the rules. He’s definitely doing it on purpose!\"","One of them suddenly rushed to the reception desk and shoved a badge in front of the worker.","\"Who is the Warrior-ranked player being broadcast on Display 2 right now?\"","The worker initially wore a puzzled expression, but the moment he saw the badge—one issued only to military personnel—his demeanor immediately turned serious.","\"Give me a moment to check!\"","A few moments later, the worker said, \"That player is named Yuan, and he signed up only a few hours ago today!\"","\"Which Division does he belong to?!\" The soldier immediately inquired.","\"Uhh... he doesn’t appear to belong to the military,\" said the worker when he couldn’t see Yuan’s affiliation.","’What?! That’s impossible! How’s he using a technique that’s only accessible to us?!’ The soldier cried inwardly after learning that Yuan was a mere civilian.","\"Check again!\" The soldier demanded, not willing to believe that a civilian could learn their technique. One of their most difficult to learn, to the boot.","\"You can come back here to check yourself if you don’t believe me,\" said the worker while shaking his head. \"He really doesn’t belong to the military, and there’s no way to hide that information.\"","The soldier gritted his teeth in frustration. After all, he knew better than anyone that it was impossible for a soldier to conceal their identity.","’Are you telling me that a civilian somehow gained access to Void Control and even mastered it to a level that most senior soldiers cannot achieve?!’ the soldier cried inwardly, the shock so overwhelming that his entire body went numb."]},{"number":2565,"title":"Chapter 2565 - 100th Win Streak","paragraphs":["\"Hey.\" The soldier glared at the worker and demanded, \"Restrict and remove all records of Player Yuan’s matches.\"","\"T-That would be a little...\" The worker hesitated.","Even if the man was a soldier, unless he had enough authority, he couldn’t make such demands.","The soldier shoved his badge into the worker’s face and said, \"Look closely again.\"","The worker narrowed his eyes at the badge.","\"!!!\"","The moment he recognized the rank engraved on it, his eyes widened in shock.","\"M-My apologies! I will carry out your command immediately!\"","A few moments later, the display broadcasting Yuan’s match suddenly vanished, replaced by another, leaving the spectators confused.","\"What the heck? What happened to that guy’s match?\"","\"The only time a match is removed in the middle of a fight is when the workers deliberately change the display.\"","\"Why would they do that? What was wrong with his match?\"","Displeased by this, some of the spectators went to complain to the workers.","\"Hey! Why’d you cut off Player Yuan’s match? There are a lot of people watching that!\"","\"I apologize for the inconvenience, but it was requested by a soldier,\" said the worker with an apologetic bow.","\"A soldier...?\"","The man turned and spotted the soldier who had requested the removal walking away in the distance.","\"W-Wu Wang?!\" he exclaimed in shock, unable to understand why someone so powerful had intervened.","A few moments later, Wu Wang returned to his colleague, who immediately inquired, \"So, which Division does that asshole belong to?\"","Wu Wang shook his head and responded, still with a doubtful look on his face, \"Apparently, he doesn’t belong to the military.\"","\"What?! That’s impossible!\" Shi Fa exclaimed in disbelief, reacting similarly to Wu Wang minutes ago.","\"I don’t know how he’s acquired the technique, but this has some serious implications,\" said Wu Wang with a deep frown on his face.","The only way for a civilian to acquire a technique restricted to the military was for a soldier to share it with them, and such a crime could be punishable by death.","\"What now?\" Shi Fa asked a moment later.","\"We can only wait for him to come out to question him,\" said Wu Wang.","\"Should we contact our supervisor?\"","\"No... Let us handle this ourselves for now. If it turns out that we truly have a leaker, we will deal with it then.\"","Thus, the two of them started waiting for Yuan. Unbeknownst to them, they’d be standing there for a long time.","Meanwhile, completely unaware of this, Yuan continued fighting in matches.","For his first match as an Expert, Yuan faced a Fifth Ascension cultivator for the first time.","’Oh?’","Yuan was pleasantly surprised when his opponent did not immediately bombard him with large, powerful attacks from the get-go and instead spent time analyzing him.","However, they lacked patience, and when Yuan did not act for a few minutes, they attacked without learning anything from him.","’At least they are not attacking at random...’ Yuan thought as he evaded their attacks with precise, skillful movements, weaving between them like the wind.","’Who the heck is this guy?! He’s dodging all of my attacks with ease!’ Yuan’s opponent cried inwardly.","He knew something was wrong when his opponent, as an Expert, was a mere Third Ascension, but he could’ve never anticipated Yuan would be so skillful.","’His movements are similar to those of Gladiator rank! How the hell is he only at Third Ascension?!’","Although he felt pressured, the Fifth Ascension cultivator fought with everything he had. Yet, no matter how much effort he put into his attacks, he could not even catch Yuan’s shadow, let alone touch him.","He also tried using large-scale attacks that were impossible to dodge, but Yuan would vanish into thin air right before his attack would’ve struck him.","\"What?! Where did he—\"","Before the Fifth Ascension cultivator could even realize what had happened, his vision blurred for a split second. The next moment, he found himself back in the waiting room, staring at a defeat screen.","Of course, his neck was burning, feeling like he had just had his head chopped off.","\"Replay the match for me!\"","The man shouted loudly. Shortly after, another screen appeared before him, replaying his entire match just now.","After watching his match to the end, the man finally realized what had caused his defeat, but he was still puzzled by Yuan’s movement technique.","\"What technique is that?! Did he acquire it from the exchange? No, there’s no way he could afford such a profound technique at his rank! He must have come from an influential family!\"","The only logical reason for an abnormal existence like Yuan’s was that he’d come from a powerful family, allowing him to acquire techniques and training that were far beyond the level of an ordinary civilian.","As the day went on, Yuan continued fighting matches nonstop. He’d hoped to reach at least Fourth Ascension by the end of the day, but he realized that after reaching Third Ascension, his cultivation had stopped improving as fast.","Still, he’d managed to reach the fourth level.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 100>","<You have earned 5 Gaia Points>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have earned 20 additional Gaia Points for your win streak>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<Your cultivation has reached Fourth Level Third Ascension>","Yuan intended to continue until he experienced his first lost, but when he attempted to start his 101st match, he was stopped by a certain notification.","<You have reached your match limit for the month>","\"What? I can only do a hundred matches a month?\"","Yuan wanted to be surprised, but he immediately understood why there was such a limit.","’If there wasn’t a limit, everyone’s cultivation would be much more inflated,’ he thought to himself.","However, rather than leaving, Yuan decided to remain inside the waiting room to study Limitless, completely unaware that there were people waiting for him outside."]},{"number":2566,"title":"Chapter 2566: Definitely Not Me","paragraphs":["\"Fuck! How long does he intend to fight?! It’s been two weeks now!\" Wu Wang cursed out loud as his patience started to run thin.","\"At the rate he was winning matches, he should’ve reached the 100-match limit long ago,\" Shi Fa muttered out loud, looking confused. \"Let’s wait a little longer. He’s probably taking a break.\"","However, even after an entire month, Yuan remained nowhere to be seen.","\"That little fucker! Did he sneak out while we weren’t looking?!\" Wu Wang exclaimed, aggressively tapping his foot on the ground.","\"There’s no way. We haven’t left since we started waiting for him, so he’s definitely still inside. Don’t tell me that he waited an entire month inside for the monthly reset?\" Shi Fa sighed out loud.","Although such cases were uncommon, it was not unheard of.","\"Damn it... What now? It’s not like we have unlimited time here, either. Hell, we have to go back to base next month!\" Wu Wang gritted his teeth.","\"We can only hope for him to come out before we have to return to base... or we’d have to report the situation to our supervisors,\" Shi Fa shook his head.","While they could have gone to their supervisor immediately, the main reason they haven’t yet is that they want the credits to themselves.","\"Wait. I have an idea.\"","Shi Fa said.","\"What is it?\"","\"Wait right here. I will be right back.\"","Without elaborating, Shi Fa left the scene.","Meanwhile, Yuan continued to matchmake as soon as the monthly limit was reset.","However, instead of finishing each match within minutes, Yuan decided to take his time over the next hundred matches. After all, there was no reason to burn through all of his matches in a single day when he could prolong them while experimenting with and training his control over Limitless.","\"Hm? Third Ascension?\"","Yuan’s opponent raised his eyebrows in a surprised manner.","\"You must be that monster from the rumors,\" he remarked, as if he recognized Yuan.","\"What rumors?\" Yuan asked with an intrigued expression.","\"There’s been a certain rumor going around Gaia’s Sanctum over the past month. According to it, there is a Third Ascension cultivator who is not only ranked Expert but also possesses combat skills rivaling even those of a Gladiator,\" his opponent explained.","\"Surely, that rumor must be referring to you.\"","\"That’s definitely not me then,\" Yuan calmly replied, dumbfounding his opponent, who was certain that he would admit to it.","Before his opponent could respond, Yuan continued, \"Although I am indeed at the Third Ascension, my combat experience far surpasses that of a mere Gladiator. Therefore, I am not the one being mentioned in the rumor.\"","\"...\"","His opponent stared at him in stunned silence, as though he had never encountered anyone so arrogant before.","Although he wanted to keep chatting, the match had begun.","\"I will determine for myself whether your ability surpasses a Gladiator!\"","\"Unfortunately, you’re not qualified.\"","Instead of avoiding, Yuan began attacking from the very start for the first time. However, he made sure to control his strength.","Although his cultivation was far inferior to that of his Fifth Ascension opponent, Yuan had already proven that even his reserves of Limitless were enough to defeat them. This was largely because his opponents did not know how to protect themselves with Limitless, essentially fighting as though they were naked.","Of course, these people did not temper their bodies either. In other words, the people of this world possessed immense potential, yet they were wasting it due to their lack of experience.","At first glance, their cultivation and world appeared incredibly advanced, but the more Yuan learned about them, the more he realized how weak they truly were.","However, this didn’t mean Yuan looked down on them. After all, he knew that there were some capable people in this world, such as Wu Wang and Shi Fa.","Unfortunately, he was restricted from their world and secrets until he joined the military.","’H-How is he wielding so much Limitless without exhausting himself?! He has been expending Limitless since the beginning of the match, and more than half an hour has already passed!’ the Fifth Ascension cultivator cried inwardly as he barely dodged Yuan’s attacks.","’Not only that, but his attacks are incredibly deceiving! While they are small and appear weak at first glance, they are ridiculously destructive, possessing more power than anything someone at his cultivation level should be capable of!’","The Fifth Ascension cultivator had doubted the rumors from the very beginning, but he was now shocked to the core, as the truth turned out to be far more terrifying than the rumors, which had made Yuan seem like a mostly defensive fighter who spent the majority of his time evading attacks.","Eventually, after running out of Limitless and stamina, the Fifth Ascension cultivator fell to his knees.","He lifted his head to look at Yuan with a defeated look.","\"You were right... I was not... qualified...\" he muttered in a low voice before his vision blurred, and he was sent back to the waiting room.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 101>","<You have earned 5 Gaia Points>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have earned 50 additional Gaia Points for your win streak>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","’Limitless... What a unique energy,’ Yuan thought to himself as he stared at his palm.","Now that he was actually using Limitless, he could accurately compare it to the other energy.","\"If I had to compare it with something similar, it would be Chaotic Essence... but for humans,\" he thought out loud.","While it was not as destructive as Chaotic Essence, which was the main reason why humans could not cultivate it, it was just as powerful.","Some time later, Yuan started another matchmaking.","Meanwhile, the Fifth Ascension cultivator left his waiting room and returned to the lobby after spending some time contemplating his match with Yuan. However, right as he returned to the lobby, two individuals stepped in front of him and blocked his path.","\"G-Gladiator Wu and Gladiator Shi!\"","The Fifth Ascension cultivator’s eyes widened with shock as he immediately recognized the two standing before him."]},{"number":2567,"title":"Chapter 2567: The Gladiators’ Message","paragraphs":["\"H-How can I help you, Gladiator Wu, Gladiator Shi?\"","The Fifth Ascension cultivator bowed respectfully before the two soldiers.","But even if Wu Wang and Shi Fa weren’t ranked in the top 500 in One Above All, the Fifth Ascension cultivator would still have shown the same level of respect because of their status as soldiers.","\"You just fought with Player Yuan, correct?\" Wu Wang questioned with a serious face.","\"Player Yuan...? Oh, you mean that Third Ascension monster? Yes, I just had a match with him. Is something wrong?\"","\"No, it’s nothing. You may leave,\" Wu Wang said, immediately beckoning him to leave.","\"Huh?\"","The Fifth Ascension cultivator wore a puzzled expression on his face after being dismissed so quickly. Admittedly, he wanted to continue talking with them a little longer since they were his idols. However, not wanting to be a nuisance, he nodded and left.","’What was that about?’ he wondered inwardly as he left.","\"That bastard is really still fighting inside!\" Wu Wang gritted his teeth in frustration after confirming that Yuan was still inside.","He turned to Shi Fa and asked, \"What is your plan now? Although it’s great that we’ve confirmed his presence inside, it is not as though we can forcefully kick him out.\"","Although they had the authority to remove Yuan’s matches from the lobby displays, that was the extent of their power.","\"Since we know he is currently Expert-ranked, we can deliberately send other Experts into the matches. If they encounter him, we can have them relay our message on our behalf,\" Shi Fa said.","\"Wait! That’s actually genius! Why didn’t we think of that sooner?!\" Wu Wang’s eyes lit up with excitement.","Thus, they started gathering as many Experts that were present in the lobby. Given their status as soldiers and their rank, everyone listened to their instructions without issue.","To make things more efficient, they went to the reception, where they had the workers broadcast their recruitment.","About an hour later, a little over a thousand Experts gathered before Wu Wang and Shi Fa.","\"Alright, listen up, everyone. We need to contact someone currently fighting inside One Above All, so we would like you to matchmake until you find him. This person goes by Player Yuan, a Third Ascension cultivator. You should immediately recognize him since he’s probably the only one with such a low cultivation at that rank.\"","The Experts immediately started mumbling to each other.","\"There’s a Third Ascension at our rank? Who’s this Player Yuan?\"","\"He must be the one from the rumors that started spreading about a month ago.\"","\"Oh, I’ve heard about him, too. I thought it was exaggerated and fake when I first heard about it, though.\"","Not everyone recognized Yuan, but many of them had because of the rumors.","\"We’re not asking you to do this for free, either. Whoever relays the message to him will receive 100 points, as well as a training session with one of us,\" Shi Fa added.","When the Experts heard this, excitement flickered in their eyes. Although one hundred points were already enticing—equivalent to roughly fifty free victories—the most appealing reward was the chance to train with a Gladiator.","Shortly after, Shi Fa revealed their message before sending these Experts inside to begin their matchmake.","Although a thousand Experts might sound like a lot, more than a hundred times that number were constantly competing in One Above All. In other words, there were at least a hundred thousand Experts fighting each other at any given moment.","One might wonder how there could be so many players when the lobby itself was nowhere near that crowded. However, multiple Gaia’s Sanctums existed simultaneously, much like the Myriad of Techniques in the Nine Heavens without the dimensional nonsense, and everyone gathered within Yuan’s Gaia’s Sanctum came from Sectors 10 through 19.","\"Now we can only hope that our people can find him before he fully uses his monthly limit again...\" Wu Wang sighed.","While the two soldiers continued waiting for their results, Yuan was honing his Limitless against other players.","One win... ten wins... fifty wins later—","\"H-Hey! Player Yuan!\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow when his opponent called out to him for the first time.","\"Who are you?\"","\"It doesn’t matter who I am. All you need to know is that I’ve been looking for you!\" His opponent spoke with a wide grin, clearly very excited to see him.","\"Why are you looking for me?\" Yuan’s eyebrows raised a little higher at the puzzling situation.","\"Because I’ve been sent here to relay a message to you from Gladiator Wu and Gladiator Shi!\"","\"Gladiator Wu? Gladiator Shi?\" Yuan had to think for a moment before finally recalling the two men who resembled Wang Ming and Shi Lang.","\"Oh, those two? I don’t remember even speaking with them, so why do they have a message for me?\" Yuan inquired.","The man cleared his throat before telling Yuan what he had been asked to say, \"Player Yuan, you are to stop all matches and return to the lobby immediately.\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"That’s it?\" Yuan asked when the man stopped speaking after a mere sentence.","\"That’s it.\"","\"They didn’t tell you the reason I have to return to the lobby?\"","\"They did not. Regardless of their reason, they are not only Gladiators, but soldiers too. And when a soldier gives an order, we, as mere civilians, must obey.\"","\"Is that so?\" Yuan murmured with a thoughtful expression.","He could not help but wonder why two men he had never met or spoken to would suddenly tell him to stop fighting, even going so far as to send people after him.","After a moment of silence, Yuan nodded and said, \"You can tell them that I have received their message.\"","\"Good. Then let’s—\"","Before the man could even finish his sentence, Yuan vanished from his view, and a second later, he was back inside the waiting room with a defeated message staring back at him.","\"W-What?!\" the man exclaimed in shock."]},{"number":2568,"title":"Chapter 2568: The Gladiators’ Message(2)","paragraphs":["After losing his match to Yuan before he could even react, the man left the waiting room to notify Wu Wang and Shi Fa of the good news.","\"Gladiator Wu! Gladiator Shi! I’ve done it! I met with Player Yuan and relayed your message to him!\" he said with a prideful look on his face.","\"Finally!\" Wu Wang excitedly clenched his fists at the news.","And over the next several minutes, they waited for Yuan to leave matchmaking and return to the lobby.","However, when over ten minutes had passed and Yuan was nowhere to be seen, Wu Wang glared at the man and spoke in a cold voice, \"If you think we’re fools...\"","\"N-No! I swear on my mother that I am not lying to you! I really matched with Player Yuan and told him the message—word for word!\" The man hastily shook his hand, swearing that he was telling the truth and nothing but the truth.","\"Then where the hell is Player Yuan?!\" Wu Wang angrily shouted.","\"It’s possible that our message had scared him into hiding,\" Shi Fa suddenly said.","\"What? That’s so pointless! Unless he intends to stay inside for the rest of his life, he will have to surrender himself eventually, so why drag this out?\"","\"Who knows? But we can only continue waiting for him to come out right now...\"","Meanwhile, Yuan continued to matchmake despite receiving the Gladiators’ message.","’I don’t know what sort of business they have with me, but if they can’t even tell me the reason, they can wait for me to finish this month’s limit,’ Yuan said to himself.","Several matches later, Yuan encountered another opponent who had been sent by the Gladiators to relay their message to him.","Since there was no way for these people to know that someone had already spoken to Yuan, they could only keep going until they either gave up willingly or found Yuan.","\"Player Yuan! I have a message for you from Gladiator Shi and Gladiator Wu, who are waiting for you in the lobby outside! You are to stop all matches and return to the lobby immediately.\"","\"Is that so? Let them know that I have received their message,\" Yuan repeated what he said to the last guy.","Then, he defeated his opponent and continued matchmaking for the next round.","Meanwhile, the one who just fought Yuan returned to the two outside with a grin on her face.","\"Gladiators! I have encountered Player Yuan and relayed your message to him!\" she proudly declared.","However, the two only frowned at her words, confirming their suspicion that Yuan was still inside and deliberately avoiding them.","\"Wait a second!\" The man who’d found Yuan first suddenly said. \"I was the first to relay the message to him!\"","The woman sneered at his words and replied, \"If that were the case, then why was Player Yuan still inside, even matching with me? Because you didn’t really encounter him.\"","She refused to believe the man’s claim, even calling him a liar outright.","\"Bullshit! I really did meet him! He is just refusing to come out for some reason!\" The man exclaimed, defending himself.","\"Just you wait! He won’t come out!\"","\"He will!\"","\"He won’t!\"","Sure enough, just like the man had predicted, Yuan was nowhere to be seen even after ten minutes of waiting.","\"No way...\" The woman fell to the ground, dazed.","\"What did I tell you?\" The man sneered.","Then, he turned to look at the Gladiators and asked, \"Um... about the reward.\"","Wu Wang narrowed his eyes at the man but said nothing.","Seeing this, Shi Fa spoke, \"Since we cannot really confirm whether or not anyone here has actually encountered him until he comes out, we will delay the rewards until we can.\"","\"I understand...\"","Although the man was disappointed, there was nothing he could do but keep on waiting.","Over the next several days, more and more people would encounter Yuan and relay the Gladiators’ message to him, unaware that others had already done so.","Of course, Yuan would always reply with the same words.","\"Let them know that I have received their message.\"","Eventually, after nearly two weeks of fighting after the monthly reset, Yuan reached his second limit.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 200>","<You have earned 5 Gaia Points>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have earned 50 additional Gaia Points for your win streak>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<Your cultivation has reached Ninth Level Third Ascension>","\"Now then... now that I have reached the monthly limit and amassed plenty of points, it’s about time that I take a break.\"","Yuan calmly left the waiting room despite knowing what was waiting for him on the other side.","The moment Yuan returned to the lobby, he was met by a large group of people standing outside, surrounding the entrance with enraged expressions.","\"T-That’s him! He’s Player Yuan!\"","One of them immediately shouted the second they saw Yuan coming back out.","Then, two figures approached Yuan and stood directly before him, their expressions looking the most angrily out of everyone there.","\"Player Yuan, I presume?\"","\"Indeed. Who’s asking?\" Yuan asked, pretending not to know them.","\"We’re the ones who sent these people to relay our message to you!\" Wu Wang shouted angrily.","\"Oh, Gladiator Wu and Gladiator Shi? How can I help you?\" Yuan calmly responded.","\"So you did receive our message! Why didn’t you come out immediately, as we told you?!\"","\"Why should I?\" Yuan remarked. \"My mother always taught me not to listen to strangers, and all I was told was that there were two strangers looking for me. If you were in my shoes, would you come out? Moreover, I only said that I’d received the message, nothing about agreeing to it.\"","\"Are you mocking us right now?\" Shi Fa finally joined, a deep frown on his face.","\"No, I am dead serious,\" Yuan replied with a serious expression. \"Try to see things from my perspective. Two strangers had sent hundreds of people after you without giving any reason. Wouldn’t you also be a little nervous and afraid if you were in my shoes?\"","\"Anyway, what business do you have with me?\" Yuan continued, his complete lack of concern for the situation leaving everyone present speechless."]},{"number":2569,"title":"Chapter 2569: Void Control","paragraphs":["\"This arrogant little...\" Wu Wang gritted his teeth in frustration. Despite having his bearing trained in the military, he could barely restrain himself from punching Yuan.","Shi Fa raised his hand in front of Wu Wang and said to Yuan, \"Before we talk business, I want to know who here had relayed our message to you first.\"","Immediately, the man who had encountered Yuan first rushed to the front and said, \"It was me, right?!\"","However, Yuan shook his head and said, \"I don’t remember.\"","\"What?! You’re lying!\" The man shouted while pointing at him with a trembling finger.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Fine, if you insist, let’s just say it’s you.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Shi Fa sighed out loud, \"Since the situation is like this, rather than just rewarding one person, we will reward everyone who has encountered him before he came out. However, since we don’t have that many points to give out, we’ll just give everyone here a training session. Anyone displeased by the outcome?\"","Everyone present shook their heads.","\"Good. Give Wu Wang your information, and we’ll reach out to you once we are ready.\"","\"Now then... You, follow me.\" Shi Fa glared at Yuan.","Yuan didn’t make things difficult for him any longer and quietly followed him.","Some time later, Yuan entered a private room with Shi Fa.","After closing the door, Shi Fa turned to face Yuan with a serious expression.","\"I will get straight to the point. Who did you learn that technique from?\" Shi Fa questioned.","Yuan raised an eyebrow, looking genuinely puzzled by his question, \"Excuse me?\"","\"You heard me!\"","\"I don’t know which technique you’re referring to.\"","\"Are you still playing dumb?! There’s only one technique I am talking about—the one that a civilian like you shouldn’t possess!\"","Yuan frowned and responded in an irritated tone, \"Can you stop being so damn vague and tell me the name of this technique because I really have no idea what you’re talking about?\"","\"Void Control! I am talking about Void Control!\" Shi Fa exclaimed angrily.","\"Void... Control?\"","Yuan was unfamiliar with the name of this technique, but he knew of one with a similar name.","’Is he talking about Void Manipulation? So it’s a technique that’s only accessible by the military, huh?’","\"I think there’s been a misunderstanding,\" Yuan said a moment later. \"The technique you think is Void Control is called Void Manipulation. And quite frankly, it’s technically not even a technique.\"","\"What are you talking about? Of course it’s a technique!\" Shi Fa replied with a deep frown.","However, Yuan then said, \"Regardless of whether it’s a technique or not, I didn’t learn this technique from anyone.\"","\"Are you claiming that you discovered and learned it all by yourself? Do you really expect me to believe that?\"","Of course, Yuan didn’t discover Void Manipulation alone. However, since telling the truth would only complicate things, he decided to lie.","\"Well, I am a genius,\" Yuan replied in a bragging tone.","Shi Fa narrowed his eyes at Yuan and spoke, \"If you aren’t aware, a civilian possessing this technique is strictly prohibited, regardless of how you acquired it, and if we report you, there’s a good chance you’ll be executed.\"","\"Is that a threat?\" Yuan asked.","\"No, it’s the law and your reality in the near future. However, if you tell us who gave you the technique, we’ll put in a good word for you and avoid the death penalty.\"","\"So what you’re saying is, as long as I join the military, everything will be fine? That’s great, since I plan on joining during the next recruitment.\"","\"That... That’s not how things work!\" Shi Fa exclaimed.","The door suddenly opened, and Wu Wang, who had just finished with his business outside, walked inside.","\"Did you learn how he acquired Void Control yet?\" Wu Wang asked as he closed the door behind him.","Shi Fa shook his head and sighed aloud, \"He claims to have discovered the technique by himself.\"","\"Hah!\" Wu Wang immediately sneered loudly. \"He discovered the technique himself? Even a monkey can make more believable lies!\"","He turned to look at Yuan with narrowed eyes and continued in a cold voice, \"If he won’t willingly tell us, we can beat it out of him.\"","Wu Wang approached Yuan with a wide grin.","However, Shi Fa quickly stopped him and said, \"Even if he’s committed a crime, we cannot harm a civilian if he’s not an active threat, unless you’re also trying to get in trouble.\"","\"Then what do you suggest?\" Wu Wang asked.","\"I have a suggestion,\" Yuan suddenly said.","\"Huh? Who the hell is asking you?\" Wu Wang sneered.","\"Let’s hear it.\" Shi Fa said.","\"Let’s play a game. If you win, I will tell you how I acquired the technique. However, if you lose, you’ll forget about the whole thing.\"","\"A game...?\" Shi Fa raised his eyebrows with a puzzled face.","\"Have you ever played tag before?\"","\"I have.\"","\"Good. Then in a custom game, we’ll be playing tag. However, we can only use Void Control—unless you cannot use it.\"","\"Of course I can use Void Control,\" Shi Fa said.","\"In that case, what do you say? If you don’t want to play, you can just go ahead and report me. I highly doubt I’ll get the death penalty, though. Hell, just to make things even more entertaining, I’ll make it two on one.\"","Shi Fa turned to look at Wu Wang and asked using voice transmission, \"What do you think of his proposal?\"","\"Why not?\"","To Shi Fa’s surprise, Wu Wang actually wanted to play.","\"We just need to catch him, right? Even if his Void Control is stronger than ours, there’s no way he can defeat both of us at once!\" Wu Wang continued with a confident smile.","\"Also, if we form a contract, he won’t be able to back out of his own words. In other words, it’s a win-win for us.\"","\"Alright.\"","Shi Fa then said to Yuan, \"We’ll play your little game.\""]},{"number":2570,"title":"Chapter 2570: Tag","paragraphs":["\"We’ll make the contract,\" Wu Wang said.","A few moments later—","<You have been offered to sign a contract by ’Wu Wang’>","[Contract Details: Wu Wang and Shi Fa will play ’tag’ with you in a custom match. If you lose, you will reveal to them every detail pertaining to how you acquired ’Void Control’. If you win, they will no longer question you, nor report you to the military, and let you go.]","[Breaking the contract will result in penalties]","<Do you accept the contract?>","<Accepted>","\"Great. Now let’s get started,\" said Wu Wang.","Yuan then said, \"I should have asked earlier, but is it possible to have 2-on-1 custom matches?\"","\"Yes, it’s possible, as long as we do it for Last Man Standing.\"","They left the room shortly after and made their way straight to the entrance for Last Man Standing.","\"Don’t even think about running away,\" Wu Wang warned him.","Yuan silently shrugged before entering the waiting room.","A few minutes later, he received a custom match offer.","<Player Wu Wang(Grandmaster) and Player Shi Fa(Grandmaster) has sent you a match request for Last Man Standing>","<Win Condition: N/A> <Lose Condition: N/A>","[Player: Wu Wang]","[Cultivation: Second Level Sixth Ascension]","[One Above All: Gladiator]","[One Above All Highest Win Streak: 122]","[Last Man Standing: Grandmaster]","[Last Man Standing Highest Win Streak: 5]","[Endless Assault: Round 30]","[Player: Shi Fa]","[Cultivation: Third Level Sixth Ascension]","[One Above All: Gladiator]","[One Above All Highest Win Streak: 131]","[Last Man Standing: Grandmaster]","[Last Man Standing Highest Win Streak: 5]","[Endless Assault: Round 31]","Meanwhile, Shi Fa and Wu Wang were left speechless by Yuan’s player record.","[Player: Yuan]","[Cultivation: Ninth Level Third Ascension]","[One Above All Rank: Expert]","[One Above All Highest Win Streak: 200]","\"This bastard actually has a 200-win streak!\" Wu Wang could hardly believe his eyes.","A few moments later, the three of them were teleported to the arena—a massive 500-mile-long round platform seated in the middle of a colossal colosseum.","Since Last Man Standing was designed for one hundred people to fight simultaneously, the arena seemed far too spacious for only three participants. However, considering they were about to play tag, it was the perfect setting.","\"So, let’s make this clear. The moment either of us touches you, it’s our win,\" Shi Fa said.","Yuan nodded, \"Sure.\"","\"What about the time limit?\" Wu Wang asked.","\"I’ll let you decide.\"","\"You’ll regret it.\"","\"Try me.\"","Shi Fa and Wu Wang spent the next minute discussing the time limit with each other.","Eventually, Wu Wang said, \"Since we don’t want to bully you, we’ll make the time limit 15 minutes.\"","\"Fifteen... minutes?\" Yuan muttered with a dumbfounded look on his face after hearing it.","\"What? Is it too long? Well, too bad.\" Wu Wang smiled.","\"Hahaha!\" Yuan suddenly burst out laughing.","\"No, I am fine with fifteen minutes,\" he continued as he wiped the tears in his eyes.","The reason Yuan allowed them to set the time limit was that he anticipated they would give themselves less time than they would have received had he set it himself.","However, in Wu Wang and Shi Fa’s eyes, fifteen minutes was already more than enough time. Continuously using Void Control rapidly drained one’s energy, and Yuan would be facing two opponents at once.","\"In that case, we will start at your signal,\" Shi Fa said.","\"The moment you use Void Control, we will begin.\"","Yuan nodded.","After a few seconds of stillness, Yuan suddenly vanished into thin air.","A split second later, both Wu Wang and Shi Fa also disappeared, chasing after Yuan.","Yuan appeared about half a mile away a second later, and the two soldiers swiftly appeared beside him half a second later.","However, before they could even start reaching for him, Yuan vanished into the void again.","’He’s fast! Much faster than what we witnessed before!’ Shi Fa quickly realized that they had been underestimating Yuan.","\"He’s faster than before. Instead of going after him simultaneously, we’ll go at intervals,\" Wu Wang said.","Shi Fa nodded in agreement. \"I’ll go first.\"","Once Yuan reappeared, Shi Fa chased after him.","The moment Yuan vanished again, Wu Wang made his move.","The two continued this pattern for the next five minutes. Yet, even after using Void Control more than a hundred times, neither of them came close to tagging Yuan.","’Fuck! This is bad!’ Shi Fa cried inwardly.","Even though they still had ten minutes remaining, the rate at which they were exhausting their energy meant they realistically had only another five minutes before they ran out completely.","After another two minutes, both Wu Wang and Shi Fa noticeably slowed down.","’How is he not slowing down at all?!’ Wu Wang cried inwardly.","Logically, Yuan—whose cultivation was far inferior to theirs—should have been exhausting himself much faster. But somehow, he did not appear tired in the slightest.","Suddenly, Yuan teleported right behind Wu Wang and spoke, \"Do you know why I laughed?\"","\"You!\"","Wu Wang quickly swung around to tag him, but Yuan had vanished already.","\"Because I was expecting you to give yourselves a couple of hours to tag me.\"","Yuan’s voice resounded right behind Wu Wang again.","Shi Fa tried to tag him from behind this time but failed.","\"If this is all you’ve got, you’ll never tag me even if I gave you a lifetime to try,\" Yuan said.","After hearing his provocation, Wu Wang and Shi Fa stopped caring about their strategy and started chasing him together.","However, they quickly realized something was different—something had changed.","’I...I cannot sense where he’s going anymore!’ Shi Fa’s eyes widened with shock as he halted and stared at the empty space before him.","Wu Wang also froze when he could no longer sense Yuan.","\"What did he do?! How come I cannot sense him anymore?!\" Wu Wang exclaimed in disbelief.","\"I don’t know... I have never seen this before,\" Shi Fa shook his head, looking just as puzzled."]},{"number":2571,"title":"Chapter 2571: Limitless Cultivation Technique","paragraphs":["\"Are you sure you want to stand there and waste time? You have... two minutes left to catch me,\" Yuan said.","Wu Wang and Shi Fa gritted their teeth in frustration. Even though they knew they had no chance of catching him at this point, they didn’t just want to give up and used whatever little energy they had left to chase after Yuan.","Unfortunately, not only were they exhausted, but they couldn’t even sense Yuan after he disappeared into the void, almost as if he vanished from existence completely.","Two minutes... one minute... thirty seconds...","\"And... time’s up,\" Yuan said to them as he calmly emerged from the void, looking completely fine.","Meanwhile, both Wu Wang and Shi Fa were soaked in sweat and panting like dogs, completely out of breath.","\"How... How is that possible?\" Wu Wang questioned with a puzzled frown.","\"What are you talking about?\" Yuan asked.","\"How come we cannot sense you when you use Void Control? We have never seen anything like that before,\" he elaborated on his own confusion.","However, Yuan smiled and said, \"I would tell you... But that would break the contract, as you’re no longer allowed to question me regarding the technique.\"","\"T-That’s...!\" Wu Wang opened his mouth to respond but quickly closed it again without uttering another word.","Shi Fa patted Wu Wang shoulder and shook his head, \"Forget it.\"","He then turned to Yuan and spoke, \"Since you’ve won, we will pretend to have seen nothing, nor will we report you to the military.\"","\"But I must ask... are you really planning on joining the military?\"","Since Shi Fa’s question had nothing to do with the contract, Yuan answered truthfully, \"I am, and I will be at the next recruitment.\"","\"Is that so?\" Shi Fa mumbled.","A few moments later, Shi Fa and Wu Wang abandoned the match and left Gaia’s Sanctum without speaking another word to Yuan.","Now that he was alone and had narrowly avoided trouble, Yuan left the waiting room and made his way to the exchange machines to spend his Gaia Points.","Despite having a two-hundred-win streak, Yuan had only managed to accumulate a little over six thousand and five hundred points.","’Is it even possible to obtain enough points for the most expensive items through matches alone?’ Yuan wondered as he went to look at the cultivation techniques category.","After reviewing the list of cultivation techniques again, Yuan purchased one for 1,000 points rather than the cheapest option.","<Confirm Purchase of Limitless Cultivation Technique(1) for 1,000 Gaia Points>","<Confirmed>","<You have purchased Limitless Cultivation Technique(1)>","Rather than acquiring a physical manual for the technique, it was directly transferred into his mind.","’As I thought... this technique allows humans to cultivate Limitless in the traditional method without the system!’ Yuan smiled inwardly after reading through its contents.","Although this technique may be pointless to the cultivators of this world who solely rely on Gaia’s Cultivation System, Yuan wanted to bring it back to the Nine Heavens and see if the humans of his world could cultivate Limitless through it.","However, there was one major problem.","The Limitless Cultivation Technique he had just purchased for a thousand points was only one part of several available ones. In fact, there were three other parts, all available on the exchange.","Yet, as far as he could tell, he didn’t need the other three parts to start cultivating Limitless.","’What will change with the other parts?’ Yuan wondered inwardly.","Unfortunately, the next part required 10,000 points, and he had only a little over 5,000 left.","\"Hm? Wait a second...\"","Yuan suddenly thought of something.","’Although I am limited to a hundred matches a month... does it apply to every single mode, or is it simply just One Above All?’","Yuan approached a worker and asked, \"If I have reached my monthly match limit for One Above All, does it affect the others, such as Last Man Standing?\"","\"No, each mode has its own limit, so if you finish all hundred matches for One Above All, you can still do another hundred matches for Last Man Standing,\" replied the worker.","Yuan’s eyes widened at this new information, kicking himself inwardly for not asking earlier, as he could’ve earned many more points by now.","\"Thank you.\"","Without wasting any more time, Yuan immediately made his way to Last Man Standing, as he still had about two weeks before his monthly reset for One Above All.","<You have entered matchmaking for Last Man Standing>","While he waited for matchmaking, Yuan recalled what Mei Xiaoyun had told him about the mode, where a hundred players fought in an arena until only one remained.","<Your match will begin now>","<Teleporting to arena in 3...2...1...>","A moment later, Yuan found himself back in the colosseum where he played tag with Wu Wang and Shi Fa not long ago. But instead of only three participants, there were a hundred this time.","’Hm?’","Yuan raised an eyebrow when he realized that everyone there was at least in the Fourth Ascension, with a few even in the Fifth Ascension.","Since his ranking in One Above All does not carry over to other modes, he should be unranked right now, so it was a bit surprising to see so many cultivators who would be in Expert rank in One Above All for his first match.","Unbeknownst to Yuan, since Last Man Standing was much more difficult than One Above All, most people tend to wait until they are at least Expert in One Above All before trying the mode.","Regardless, it didn’t matter to Yuan.","The match began half a minute after everyone was teleported to the arena. Immediately, it was as though a war had erupted, with dozens of people clashing at once, their Limitless spewing in every direction.","’I should refrain from using Void Manipulation to avoid unnecessary trouble,’ Yuan thought to himself, as he did not want more soldiers going after him before the recruitment."]},{"number":2572,"title":"Chapter 2572: Last Man Standing","paragraphs":["\"Hah!\"","\"Yah!\"","After the match began, it didn’t take even a full minute for participants to start dropping. Meanwhile, Yuan, who decided not to use Void Manipulation, used Shadow Veil to completely erase his presence, and with everyone focused on the fight, nobody noticed him even though he was standing still in the middle of the arena.","’If I want to finish a hundred matches in less than a week, I will need to be more active...’","With that in mind, Yuan started going after the easiest targets first—those who had just defeated their opponent and were exhausted—eliminating them in a single strike.","Using such a method, it didn’t take long for the number of participants to drop below ten.","Of course, even with so few people left, none of them noticed Yuan.","Eventually, there was only one participant left... or so the man thought.","\"Huh? Why am I still here? Everyone should have been defeated!\"","The man who thought he had won looked around to make sure he didn’t miss anyone, and sure enough, he couldn’t see or sense anybody in the arena.","Yet, even after waiting for some time, he was not teleported back to the waiting room. This made him worried that something might have happened with Gaia’s Sanctum, and he was stuck inside.","However, he suddenly felt a sharp pain in his chest the next moment. At first, he thought it was stress from the thought of being stuck, but when he subconsciously turned around, his eyes widened with shock and bewilderment.","\"H-How the—\"","Standing behind him was a handsome man whom he did not recall seeing at any point during the entire match!","But alas, before he could even question it, he was sent back to the waiting room with a defeated message.","While the man watched the replay to see exactly what had happened, Yuan moved on to the next match, repeating the same tactic and winning with ease and little to no effort.","Soon, a new rumor began spreading throughout Gaia’s Sanctum, mentioning a ghost who roamed Last Man Standing!","\"I’m telling you! That man did not exist until the very end! It’s a ghost! A real ghost, I say!\" Someone who had managed to make it to the end, only to be killed by Yuan, attested to the rumors’ truth.","Mei Xiaoyun, who had just finished her matches and prepared to leave Gaia’s Sanctum, stopped when she overheard the rumor.","\"Ghost of the Colosseum?\" she muttered at the nickname the people had given to Yuan.","\"L-Look! He’s right there! Ghost of the Colosseum!\" Someone shouted, pointing to the display showcasing Last Man Standing.","Curious, Mei Xiaoyun walked over to the screen and watched it.","\"Hm? Isn’t that...\"","Mei Xiaoyun’s eyes widened with surprise when she saw a familiar face nonchalantly approaching and defeating his opponents in the arena.","’What’s going on? How come everyone is ignoring him, even when he’s standing right in their view?’ Mei Xiaoyun wondered, curious and baffled at the same time by what she was witnessing.","’No... they’re not ignoring him! It’s more like they don’t even notice him!’","The other spectators were just as baffled—if not even more shocked—by what they were witnessing.","Those who had refused to believe the rumors had no choice but to accept them after seeing the Ghost of the Colosseum firsthand, while those who had spread the rumors felt vindicated, as this proved they had not been exaggerating.","\"Surely, this must be some kind of elaborated prank, set up to mess with us...\" Someone there muttered in a dazed voice.","\"And how would they achieve that? It’s not a custom game, so everyone there was randomly chosen by the matchmaking...\"","\"I don’t know, but it’s easier to believe that whatever I am seeing right now...\"","\"Hey, isn’t he the same guy who was using that weird movement technique in One Above All?\"","Someone there recognized Yuan.","\"Who?\"","The man proceeded to recall the last rumor about Yuan.","\"Seriously, who the hell is this guy?\"","Mei Xiaoyun stayed and watched several matches before leaving Gaia’s Sanctum, returning to work.","Time passed quickly, and in just five days since he started his first Last Man Standing match, Yuan reached his monthly limit.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 100>","<You have defeated 42 players>","<You have earned 42 Gaia Points>","<You have earned 50 Gaia Points for being the last man standing>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<You have earned 100 additional Gaia Points for your win streak>","<You have reached Third Level Fourth Ascension>","<You have reached Expert Rank>","\"Last Man Standing sure gives a lot more points than One Above All,\" Yuan remarked with a satisfied smile.","In less than a week, Yuan had earned more than twenty thousand points—more than enough to purchase the second part of the Limitless Cultivation Technique, and twenty times what he had earned from One Above All.","However, Yuan did not immediately exchange his points; instead, he went to participate in Endless Assault.","Unlike One Above All and Last Man Standing, since Endless Assault did not involve fighting other players, Yuan was able to start immediately.","<Start Floor 1?>","<Starting Floor 1>","Ten seconds later, Yuan was teleported to a seemingly boundless, empty plain with no walls and a blank sky overhead.","<Enemies will spawn in ten seconds>","Soon, a single enemy appeared.","Yuan raised an eyebrow. His opponent was a faceless, human-shaped entity.","Although it lacked a face, Yuan could tell that it had taken on his appearance, as it possessed the same height and build as him.","As for its cultivation, it was also at Third Level Fourth Ascension, mimicking his own.","\"Do I have to fight it barehanded, too?\" Yuan wondered out loud.","<You may choose a weapon>","\"Oh? In that case, give me a sword.\"","A moment later, a large sword materialized before him.","A smile tugged at Yuan’s lips when he saw its shape. It closely resembled Number One Under Heaven, making him wonder if the system had read his mind and chosen his preferred weapon."]},{"number":2573,"title":"Chapter 2573: Come Find Me","paragraphs":["<Match Start>","Shortly after acquiring his weapon, the match began.","However, neither Yuan nor his opponent moved.","Yuan wanted to see what his opponent was capable of, but it did not move at all.","Seeing this, Yuan took a step toward it.","The faceless figure also moved, but its movements made Yuan raise his eyebrows in puzzlement, as it moved like a complete amateur.","Yuan assumed it was because he was only on the first floor, so his opponents would all be easy to defeat.","He silently approached the faceless figure using Void Manipulation before defeating it in a single strike, proving his theory to be correct.","<You have cleared the First Floor>","<You have received 10 Gaia Points as a reward>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<Proceed to Second Floor?>","\"Proceed.\"","Not wanting to waste time, Yuan quickly rushed through the floor. As he climbed higher and higher, his opponent would become more skillful and have higher cultivation.","Yet, Yuan completely demolished all of his opponents with a single strike until the 10th floor.","And since he was fighting an artificial being, he used Void Manipulation without reserve.","Of course, there was still a chance his matches might be displayed in the lobby, so he left after defeating the 10th floor to ask about it.","\"Endless Assault? No, that mode is the only one that won’t be displayed.\" The worker responded to Yuan’s question.","Once his concern was resolved, Yuan returned to climbing Endless Assault with an ease of mind.","In less than an hour, he reached floor twenty-five. Then, after another ten minutes, he reached floor thirty.","At this point, all of his opponents moved like experts, and their cultivation was even at Ninth Level Sixth Ascension.","But despite their superior cultivation, Yuan’s combat expertise and techniques were still far superior, allowing him to continue defeating his opponents, albeit with more difficulty and a little more time.","Eventually, he reached the 40th floor.","\"?!?!\"","Yuan’s eyes widened with surprise when his opponent from the 40th floor started exuding Eternal Essence even before the match began. Although it was very subtle, it didn’t change the fact that he would start fighting opponents who could wield Eternal Essence.","\"Now that I think about it, I haven’t tried using Eternal Essence in this world yet,\" Yuan muttered in a low voice, as he’d been focused on Limitless this entire time.","When the match started, Yuan immediately tried to use Eternal Essence.","However, when he tried, a notification popped up before him.","<The usage of Eternal Essence is strictly prohibited>","<Reading the user’s status>","<You have been granted temporary access to the usage of Eternal Essence by Gaia>","\"What?\" Yuan wore a puzzled look on his face, wondering if it meant that he was specifically granted access by Gaia, the creator of the system.","\"Am I... being watched by Gaia right now?\" Yuan frowned at this thought.","Unfortunately, there was nothing he could realistically do in this situation.","Then, another notification appeared.","<Come Find Me>","\"?!\"","Yuan’s eyes widened at this notification, which confirmed his suspicion that Gaia could see and hear him through the system.","\"Who are you? Are you an Eternal? Why did you bring me to this world?\"","However, the system did not respond.","\"I know you can hear me!\"","<Come Find Me>","The system repeated.","Yuan wanted to keep questioning Gaia, but the match had begun, and his opponent was already attacking him.","\"Get lost, I am busy here!\" Yuan roared as he unleashed a wave of Eternal Essence at his opponent, defeating them in the blink of an eye.","\"Answer me, Gaia! Who are you?!\"","But alas, Gaia would not respond again, no matter how many times he tried speaking to them.","\"Fuck... at least give me a hint or something.\" Yuan cursed at it and gave up on trying to communicate with Gaia.","With no other choice, Yuan continued to climb the floors.","However, every single floor after the 40th floor greatly increased in difficulty, and the Eternal Essence wielded by his opponents became more profound and powerful.","By the time he reached the 45th floor, his opponent wielded Eternal Essence that was on par with Saaruk during their last fight.","Meanwhile, their cultivation peaked at the 7th Ascension. Of course, now that they were wielding Eternal Essence, their cultivation had become irrelevant.","\"Now this is getting really interesting...\" Yuan mumbled with an excited smile on his face.","A moment later, they clashed, their Eternal Essence scattering in every direction.","Meanwhile, shortly after Yuan reached the 40th floor, the lobby went into an uproar, with nearly everyone gathered before a screen displaying three lists of names.","Obviously, these lists were the rankings for the three available modes at Gaia’s Sanctum.","As for what caused the uproar... the ranking for Eternal Assault was suddenly updated with shocking results that left everyone shocked and speechless.","\"L-Look! Someone else has managed to breakthrough past the 40th floor for the first time in over a hundred years!\"","It was such a big deal simply because there were fewer than 10 names on the ranking that had managed to ascend past the 40th floor, and all of these people were legendary figures. However, the newly introduced name was one that most people were not familiar with.","\"Player Yuan? Who the heck is that?\"","\"Surely, it can’t be the same Player Yuan from the rumors, right?\"","\"That’s impossible! I investigated him recently and learned that he’d only just started participating in Gaia’s Sanctum less than two months ago! Moreover, his cultivation is nowhere near enough to reach the 40th floor, much less climb past it!\"","\"To think there are two people with the same name, both of whom have been doing ridiculous things... what a crazy coincidence.\"","The crowd only continued to grow larger as time passed, as pretty much everyone wanted to see how far this individual could climb.","A few hours later—","\"My lord! He’s reached the 41st floor! And in such a short time, too!\"","The crowd started celebrating as if it were their own achievement."]},{"number":2574,"title":"Chapter 2574: Foolish Mortal","paragraphs":["\"42nd floor! He’s reached the 42nd floor now!\"","The spectators stared at the screen with wide eyes, their gazes filled with awe and anticipation.","A day later, the leaderboard was updated again with Yuan reaching the 43rd floor.","\"43rd floor! Do you guys think he will reach the 50th floor?\"","\"I don’t know who this Player Yuan is, but there’s no way he’d be able to beat the 50th floor when even the strongest cultivator in the world couldn’t pass it.\"","\"Is there a reason why most people are bottlenecked at the 40th floor?\" Someone there suddenly asked, genuinely puzzled.","\"The enemies from the 40th floor and onward wield a weird and powerful energy that most people cannot deal with,\" someone replied.","Someone else then said, \"According to one of the cultivators who barely managed to clear the 40th floor, one must reach at least the Seventh Ascension and Imperious Heavenly Refinement to even attempt the 40th floor.\"","\"Heavens, that’s quite a harsh requirement...\"","\"There’s a reason why there is only one individual who has managed to make it to the 50th floor.\"","After that was mentioned, everyone there subconsciously glanced at the name at the top of the list.","\"Tian Yuchen.\"","A few people there mumbled this name.","\"Tian Yuchen... the first cultivator to attain the Invincible Heavenly Refinement physique two thousand years ago.\"","\"If anyone could beat the 50th floor, they’d need at least the Perfected Heavenly Refinement physique of legends.\"","After another day, Yuan reached the 44th floor, placing him in the top five.","As for those ranked above him, two were stuck on the 46th floor, one had reached the 47th floor, and Tian Yuchen, who held the top position for over two thousand years, had stopped at the 50th floor.","Two days later, Yuan reached the 45th floor, where his opponent was as strong as Saaruk.","However, this only meant that his opponent’s Eternal Essence was on par with Saaruk’s. In reality, the faceless figure was much more difficult to deal with since it had a human body and fought like an expert.","In fact, even with his millions of years of experience, Yuan struggled slightly against it.","Despite that, Yuan welcomed the challenge, as it was nearly impossible to find an opponent who could make him struggle these days. More importantly, this helped him grow.","For the first time in a long time, Yuan could feel himself improving and getting stronger through battle against a powerful opponent.","One day... three days... five days...","It took an entire week, but Yuan finally managed to defeat his opponent.","<You have cleared the 45th Floor>","<You have received 100,000 Gaia Points as a reward>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<Your cultivation has reached Seventh Level Fourth Ascension>","<Proceed to the 46th floor?>","Yuan did not proceed immediately and instead took some time to rest.","\"If the 45th floor is already this difficult, how much more difficult will the 46th floor be? What about beyond that? Will I have to fight an opponent with Eternal Essence on par with Prime Eternals?\" Yuan wondered out loud.","He could’ve never anticipated this place to have such a difficult trial.","\"Gaia... just who the hell are you?\"","Some time later, once he was prepared, Yuan proceeded to the 46th floor.","\"!!!\"","Yuan’s eyes widened at the figure standing before him on the 46th floor, his body instinctively trembling in fear beneath the aura and Eternal Essence it emitted.","Although his opponent’s Eternal Essence was nowhere near the level of a Prime Eternal, it was stronger than anything he’d experienced before.","\"Foolish mortal...\"","A low voice suddenly resounded.","\"Huh?\" Yuan wore a dumbfounded expression, wondering if he was hearing things—or if his opponent had spoken just now.","\"You can... speak?\" Yuan asked it.","However, the faceless figure did not respond.","\"I must be getting tired from all that fighting...\" Yuan rubbed his eyes and sighed.","<Match start>","The moment the match began, the faceless figure struck, unleashing a wave of Eternal Essence that surged toward Yuan like a colossal tsunami.","\"This is?!\"","Yuan immediately countered, releasing as much Eternal Essence as he could muster. However, even with his one trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence, it was completely overwhelmed by the incoming attack.","The second Yuan saw that he could not defend against the attack, so he used Void Manipulation to avoid it.","\"Foolish mortal...\"","The voice echoed in Yuan’s ears once more.","The next moment, Yuan found himself back in the waiting room, a defeat message hovering before him as his entire body ached with immense pain.","<You have been defeated>","Yuan stared at the message before him, barely paying attention to the pain.","’He killed me in the middle of my Void Manipulation!’ Yuan cried inwardly when he realized what had just happened.","Yuan suddenly felt an odd sensation, prompting him to look down.","His hands were trembling, not from fear but from excitement.","In all of his lifetimes, he had never experienced such an overwhelming defeat before.","\"Hahaha!\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan suddenly burst out laughing.","\"Damn it, that was fun! Let’s do it again!\"","Without hesitation, he immediately went for round two with the faceless figure on the 46th floor.","\"Foolish mortal...\"","The entity uttered the same two words before attacking Yuan in a similar fashion.","Yuan used Void Manipulation again.","This time, he saw the entity attacking him through the void. However, even though he could see it, the attack was too fast for him to react. No, it was almost as if his opponent had perfectly anticipated where he’d go, striking before he even moved.","A moment later, Yuan was sent back to the waiting room.","\"Is it impossible for me to defeat the 46th floor at my current level?\" he wondered out loud with a heavy sigh.","Despite that, he did not feel discouraged. If anything, his motivation was through the roof.","After taking a moment to calm his emotions, Yuan challenged the 46th floor again... again... and again.","He wanted to keep challenging the 46th floor until he cleared it, regardless of how long it would take, but alas, he was forced to stop when a certain notification appeared before him.","<You can only challenge the same floor 50 times a month>"]},{"number":2575,"title":"Chapter 2575: Tian Yuchen","paragraphs":["\"So I can only do this fifty times a month, huh? What a pity,\" Yuan sighed out loud after seeing the notification, as he was beginning to get the hang of the 46th floor.","’With that said... I don’t think I can clear the 46th stage simply by brute forcing it,’ he thought inwardly as he exited the waiting room.","\"Anyway, now that it’s a new month, I can continue matchmaking for One Above All and Last Man Standing.\"","But before he continued matchmaking, Yuan made his way to the exchange to purchase some items with the points he’d amassed from Last Man Standing and Endless Assault.","<Reading Player Status>","<Available Gaia’s Points: 575,533>","<Welcome to Gaia’s Exchange, Player Yuan>","\"Half a million, huh?\"","He thought Last Man Standing rewarded a lot of points, but it turns out that Endless Assault rewarded the most points, with floors 41st and onward rewarding over 50,000 points.","<Confirm Purchase of Limitless Cultivation Technique(2) for 10,000 Gaia Points>","<Confirmed>","<You have purchased Limitless Cultivation Technique(2)>","The first thing Yuan purchased was the second part of the Limitless Cultivation Technique, as he wanted to see how it differed from part one and whether he should continue collecting the other parts.","’Interesting... although the second part appears gibberish at a glance, if combined with the first part, it greatly improves the technique’s efficiency and speed.’","In the end, Yuan decided to finish the collection. However, he was only able to purchase one more since the final part was too expensive for him at the moment.","<Confirm Purchase of Limitless Cultivation Technique(3) for 150,000 Gaia Points>","<Confirmed>","<You have purchased Limitless Cultivation Technique(3)>","The final part of the technique required 750,000 points, so Yuan decided to put it on hold for now and purchase something else that would directly benefit him.","<Confirm Purchase of Superior Gaia’s Gift for 75,000 points?>","<Confirmed>","<You have purchased Superior Gaia’s Gift>","After purchasing the treasure, Yuan heard something small drop from the machine. When he looked down, he saw that it had produced the treasure.","He grabbed the Superior Gaia’s Gift and, without hesitation, tossed it into his mouth as if it were a piece of candy.","<You have consumed Superior Gaia’s Gift>","<Your Cultivation Speed has increased by 1>","[Cultivation Speed: 4]","Since he still had plenty of points, Yuan purchased another one.","<You have consumed Superior Gaia’s Gift>","<Your Cultivation Speed has increased by 1>","[Cultivation Speed: 5]","After some consideration, Yuan decided to purchase another one.","<You have consumed Superior Gaia’s Gift>","<Your Cultivation Speed has increased by 1>","[Cultivation Speed: 6]","Most people would not consume so much Gaia’s Gift at once since they needed to have the proper physique. However, Yuan was already at Perfected Heavenly Refinement, so he wasn’t worried that his cultivation speed might be bottlenecked by it.","’Wow! This feels great!’ Yuan thought to himself as he examined his own body.","With his current cultivation speed, it rivaled his true cultivation speed in the Nine Heavens.","No... it even surpassed it!","Once he was done, Yuan immediately made his way to the matchmaking room for One Above All.","However, on his way there, he noticed a massive crowd gathered.","With his interest piqued, Yuan approached the crowd to see what they were all looking at.","That was when he discovered the rankings.","\"He’s not moving past the 46th floor... do you think he’s reached his peak?\"","\"Give it a few more days. It took him several days to clear the 45th floor, after all.\"","\"...\"","Yuan ignored the crowd’s chatter and focused on the Endless Assault leaderboard.","\"What...?\" Yuan muttered in surprise when he saw the ranking and that there were four people ahead of him—technically two since the other two were also stuck on the 46th floor. But since they’d reached it earlier than Yuan, they were above his name.","’There are eight other people who have cleared past the 40th floor, and four of them have even cleared past the 45th floor?!’","’Not just that, but someone has reached all the way to the 50th floor?!’","Yuan narrowed his eyes at the name on the top of the leaderboard and swallowed nervously.","’Tian... Yuchen?’","The surname ’Tian’ made him wonder if it was just a coincidence or if they had a connection with him.","’50th floor... I cannot even imagine how powerful the enemy would be on the 47th floor, much less the 50th floor!’ Yuan shook his head inwardly.","Yuan did not linger and left the crowd shortly after, entering One Above All to matchmake.","A week later—","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 300>","<You have earned 5 Gaia Points>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have earned 50 additional Gaia Points for your win streak>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<You have reached Eighth Level Fourth Ascension>","<You have reached Master Rank>","After reaching his monthly limit for One Above All, Yuan made his way to Last Man Standing.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 200>","<You have defeated 38 players>","<You have earned 38 Gaia Points>","<You have earned 50 Gaia Points for being the last man standing>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<You have earned 200 additional Gaia Points for your win streak>","<You have reached First Level Fifth Ascension>","<You have reached Master Rank>","’Oh? I am already at Master Rank?’ Yuan had anticipated it would take another hundred wins to reach Master, but it seemed like one could rank up faster in Last Man Standing than One Above All.","Now that he’d reached the monthly limit for both One Above All and Last Man Standing, Yuan prepared to challenge the 46th floor again. However, rather than rushing to fight it, he spent time studying the Limitless Cultivation Technique.","’It’s unlikely that the people of this world can use Eternal Essence, so Tian Yuchen must’ve reached the 50th floor using Limitless alone. In that case... I must figure out how he achieved it!’ Yuan thought to himself."]},{"number":2576,"title":"Chapter 2576: Leaving Gaia’s Sanctum","paragraphs":["After spending an entire week studying all three parts of the Limitless Cultivation Technique, Yuan gave up and sighed, \"It’s no use. I will need the complete technique if I want to study this technique properly...\"","Without any choice, Yuan entered Endless Assault and proceeded to die fifty times in a row to the enemy on the 46th floor.","Of course, every time he died, he would hear the faceless entity mocking him.","\"Foolish mortal...\"","\"Damn it... Not only does its Eternal Essence far exceed mine, but it can even predict where I am going with my Void Manipulation, so its Void Understanding is also likely higher than mine...\"","It had been a long time since Yuan felt such a bottleneck, and it was one that he couldn’t brute-force.","Some time later, Yuan returned to One Above All and Last Man Standing, continuing his dominance in both modes.","By now, his name had become so widespread that nearly everyone below the rank of Elite Gladiator knew about him.","In One Above All, he was nicknamed the Win-Streak-Killer because anyone who encountered him was practically guaranteed to lose, and many lost their win streaks to him.","In Last Man Standing, he was still called the Ghost of the Colosseum by many, but some have started to call him the Immortal Ghost, as he was essentially unkillable.","\"Damn it! Where the hell did this guy come from?! He’s been terrorizing everyone for the last three months!\"","\"I’m just glad that he’s no longer in Expert rank. I don’t ever want to fight him again.\"","\"Imagine having to fight a monster like him as an unranked or even as a Novice...\"","\"I don’t get how he’s so powerful with such a low cultivation base! There must be a secret to his strength!\"","Meanwhile, Yuan achieved his 400th win streak for One Above All and his 300th win streak for Last Man Standing.","But alas, he was still stuck on the 46th floor of Endless Assault.","Then, another month passed.","Since the military recruitment was scheduled to start this month, Yuan did not waste any time on his matches and finished them as soon as possible.","For One Above All, he defeated all of his opponents almost as soon as the match started.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 500>","<You have earned 100 Gaia Points>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have earned 500 additional Gaia Points for your win streak>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<You have reached Fifth Level Fifth Ascension>","<You have reached Grandmaster Rank>","As for Last Man Standing, Yuan stopped waiting for the other players to defeat one another and instead actively hunted them.","<You have won your match>","<You are on a winning streak!>","<Win Streak: 400>","<You have defeated 88 players>","<You have earned 88 Gaia Points>","<You have earned 1,000 Gaia Points for being the last man standing>","<You have received Limitless as a reward>","<You have received bonus Limitless for your win streak>","<You have earned 1,000 additional Gaia Points for your win streak>","<You have reached Ninth Level Fifth Ascension>","<You have reached Gladiator Rank>","\"Has anybody figured out how he’s avoiding our detection for Last Man Standing?!\"","\"It must be some kind of concealment technique, but where did he acquire it? I didn’t see anything like that in the exchange shop, either.\"","\"He can’t keep getting away with this! Somebody! Anybody! Please stop him!\"","The people expected Yuan to keep terrorizing them, but unbeknownst to them, they would stop hearing from him for a long time.","In just three short days, Yuan reached his monthly limit for One Above All and Last Man Standing. And once he used all 50 attempts on the 46th floor, Yuan finally left Gaia’s Sanctum after spending five months inside fighting nonstop.","Unfortunately, he was unable to collect enough points to purchase the final part of the Limitless Cultivation Technique before the recruitment. However, he swore to return as soon as possible.","Some time later, Yuan returned to Mei Xiaoyun’s villa.","\"You’re finally here!\" Mei Xiaoyun spoke aloud after seeing him for the first time in months.","\"Am I late?\" Yuan asked.","\"No, you’re just in time,\" Mei Feng, who was also present, said. \"However, in the military, if you’re not early, you’re late, so keep that in mind.\"","\"Am I going to take the recruitment right now?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Let me check your status first to see how much you’ve progressed in the last five months,\" Mei Feng said, pointing to the nearby machine she had prepared in advance.","Yuan casually approached the machine and fed it some of his blood.","\"What the hell is this?! What in heaven’s name did you do in the last five months?!\" Mei Feng exclaimed in shock after seeing Yuan’s status and improvement, her eyes and mouth as wide as saucers.","\"...\"","Mei Xiaoyun was stunned speechless.","[Yuan]","[Cultivation: Ninth Level Fifth Ascension]","[Physique: Superior Heavenly Refinement]","[Credential Rank: 3]","[Cultivation Speed: 6]","\"Ninth Level Fifth Ascension?! You improved your cultivation by nearly five realms in less than half a year?! That’s impossible!\"","\"Really? I just spent all of my time inside Gaia’s Sanctum,\" Yuan calmly replied.","Mei Feng stared at him in silence.","A long moment of silence later, she spoke in a dazed voice, \"Quite frankly, I’m a little afraid to ask you about your time there...\"","She turned to look at his status again.","\"Your cultivation speed... did you consume three Superior Gaia’s Gifts?\" she asked.","\"I did. I purchased them with Gaia’s Points.\"","\"You acquired over 225,000 points in half a year...? That usually takes even Gladiators decades to acquire...\"","Unbeknownst to her, Yuan had actually acquired several times more than that amount.","\"Haaa... I’m glad that you went out of your way to improve so much, but this... this is a little troublesome,\" Mei Feng said after another moment of silence.","\"Why? What’s wrong?\" Yuan asked, looking puzzled by her words."]},{"number":2577,"title":"Chapter 2577: Military Base","paragraphs":["\"Your cultivation speed is too high for someone with only a Supreme Heavenly Refinement physique,\" Mei Xiaoyun explained the issue at hand to Yuan.","Mei Feng nodded and said, \"I should’ve explained it to you earlier, but I never anticipated you would progress so fast. This is partially my fault.\"","However, Yuan then said, \"Actually, Mei Xiaoyun already explained it to me earlier. I guess it slipped my mind since I was so focused on improving as much as possible before the recruitment. So, what should I do now?\"","\"We will need to adjust your physique again, but I didn’t bring the machine with me, and quite frankly, it’s too risky to bring it out now. Luckily for us, the recruitment will take place on base, where the machine is located. I’ll bring you there under the pretense of a tour,\" Mei Feng said.","\"Okay,\" Yuan nodded. \"Anything else?\"","\"...\"","After a brief moment of silence, Mei Feng sighed out loud, \"I was going to personally test your combat abilities, but seeing how you acquired so many points at Gaia’s Sanctum in such a short time...I won’t need to waste my time.\"","Some time later, they prepared to leave for the base.","\"Can I come with you?\" Mei Xiaoyung suddenly asked.","Mei Feng raised an eyebrow and responded in a somewhat surprised tone, \"I thought you hated the military.\"","\"I still do,\" she said, but refused to elaborate further.","\"Do as you please,\" Mei Feng said with a nonchalant shrug.","After leaving the villa, the three of them teleported to the military base, which was located somewhere outside the city.","\"G-General!\" The guards at the gate hastily saluted Mei Feng as she approached.","\"I am bringing two civilians into the base with me. Sign them up,\" she said.","\"Right away!\"","The soldiers moved with precision and swiftness, signing both Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun in the guest log within a minute.","Normally, they would check guests’ backgrounds and have them sign paperwork, but because of Mei Feng’s rank, they skipped those steps.","\"I have been wondering about this for a while now, but what’s your mother’s status within the military? How high is a General?\" Yuan asked Mei Xiaoyun.","\"General is the second-highest rank in the military,\" Mei Xiaoyun responded.","\"That’s...pretty incredible.\"","He looked at her and continued asking, \"What about you? Why aren’t you in the military?\"","\"Why would I be?\" she answered in a somewhat disdainful tone, as if offended by his question.","Seeing her reaction, Yuan decided not to pursue further.","Once they were registered, they followed Mei Feng into the base.","\"Get in.\" Mei Feng said to them as she entered a nearby vehicle.","The military base was so vast that traveling on foot was impractical. As for teleporters, they were strictly prohibited inside the military base for security reasons.","’So they do have cars in this world...’ Yuan thought to himself as Mei Feng drove them around the base until they reached a massive building that stretched for miles and miles at a glance.","But before they could reach the building, they had to go through another security checkpoint.","\"Greetings, General!\" The soldiers saluted her.","\"I’m going to give these two a tour,\" she said to them, but she gave them more information this time.","\"One is my daughter, and the other is someone who will join our ranks soon. I personally recruited him.\"","The soldiers’ eyes widened at her words, but they remained silent.","Once Mei Feng left the scene, the soldiers spoke to each other.","\"How long has it been since General Mei recruited someone?\"","\"I think it’s been twenty years since she recruited that monster.\"","\"Her standards are so high that everyone she recruits turns out to be monsters. I wonder if and how this new one will shake the military.\"","\"Wanna make a bet? On whether this new one will surpass the last one.\"","\"There’s no way he’s more talented than the last one she recruited. That kind of monster shows up once in a lifetime.\"","\"Is that your choice? Then I’ll bet that he’s even more ridiculous.\"","\"What’s the price for the loser?\"","\"How does lunch sound?\"","\"Sounds good.\"","Upon arriving at the building, Mei Feng scanned her badge on the pad by the door, opening it once it verified her credentials.","Once they entered the building, the number of people drastically increased, all of them wearing a similar black uniform.","\"General!\"","\"Good morning, General!\"","\"General!\"","Every soldier they passed would stop in their tracks to greet Mei Feng.","’They’re treating her like the Celestial Emperor, and she’s only the second-highest rank?’ Yuan thought to himself.","Some time later, they entered a certain room—an office.","The first thing Yuan noticed upon entering the room was the portraits on the wall, all of which featured Mei Feng.","\"Is this...your room?\" Yuan had to ask.","\"Yes, this is my private office,\" she said, pointing at the machine by the wall.","\"Let’s get this over with as soon as possible.\"","\"Why do you even have this in your office?\" Yuan inquired as he entered the machine.","\"For work. And it’s the only reason I could sneak it out last time.\"","A few moments later—","<With the authority of Mei Feng, your physique has been changed to Inexhaustible Heavenly Refinement>","\"Although your cultivation is a little low for someone with a Rank 6 Cultivation Speed, it’s believable enough.\"","\"Any questions before I take you to the recruitment area?\" Mei Feng asked.","\"I do, but it’s not related to the recruitment.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"I want to learn more about Gaia. Your credentials as a General should be pretty high, so can you—\"","\"No.\" Mei Feng rejected his proposal before he could even finish his sentence.","\"Can I ask why?\"","\"Because anything Gaia-related is top secret. If you want to know, you have to climb the ranks and increase your credentials.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes at her words and said, \"You told me that you didn’t know about Gaia’s existence before.\"","\"Evidently, I lied. Because it’s not something a civilian should know about.\"","\"Then do you know Gaia’s identity?\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Mei Feng nodded, \"I do, but don’t even bother asking because I won’t tell you.\""]},{"number":2578,"title":"Chapter 2578: Military Recruitment","paragraphs":["\"If you’re not going to tell me anything about Gaia, can you at least tell me what Credential Rank I need to acquire to learn about them?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Why do you even want to know about Gaia? Aren’t you from another world?\" Mei Feng replied.","\"I need to meet them,\" said Yuan, but he didn’t elaborate.","\"You want to meet...with Gaia?\" Mei Feng raised her eyebrows, looking surprised.","\"Are you going to tell me that it’s not possible because nobody has ever seen them before?\" Yuan sighed.","\"What are you talking about? Gaia is very much real, and I have even personally met h—\" Mei Feng abruptly stopped herself, even putting her hands over her mouth.","’Damn! I nearly revealed top secret information to a civilian!’ she cried inwardly.","\"I’m done with this topic,\" she quickly said. \"Any other questions?\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before asking, \"Then do you know about Tian Yuchen?\"","\"Tian Yuchen? The legendary cultivator from 2,000 years ago?\"","He nodded.","\"I know that he’s renowned for his cultivation and Endless Assault achievement in Gaia’s Sanctum, but that’s pretty much it. Why are you suddenly asking about him?\"","\"Because I saw him on the Endless Assault ranking and got curious.\"","\"Well, if you want to learn more about him, you can visit the library after you join the military. We have access to things that the rest of the world isn’t privy to,\" said Mei Feng.","\"Actually...\" Yuan then said, \"While we’re on this topic, why is the military hiding so much from the civilians?\"","\"This is just how things work around here,\" Mei Feng said, shrugging and showing no desire to elaborate further.","\"Alright. That’s all I want to ask.\"","Of course, he still had a lot of questions, but he had a feeling that Mei Feng would simply refuse to answer or give him vague responses.","’If she’s anything like the Meifeng I know, it’ll be virtually impossible to get any information that she doesn’t want to reveal out of her.’","Some time later, Mei Feng brought Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun to the recruitment area.","Although several days remained before the recruitment was scheduled to begin, a massive crowd had already gathered at the recruitment area.","At a glance, there were at least a hundred thousand people present. Most of them were young men and women, with only a small portion appearing older.","\"Want to join the military with me?\" Yuan suddenly turned to ask Mei Xiaoyun in a half-joking and half-serious tone.","She immediately sneered, \"If I wanted to join the military, I would’ve done so ages ago.\"","Suddenly, Mei Feng’s voice resounded in Yuan’s head as she spoke to him using voice transmission, ’If you can convince my daughter to join the military, I’ll give you a reward.’","Yuan raised an eyebrow at such a random request, but before he could respond, Mei Feng said, \"I have somewhere to be, so I will be taking my leave now. Good luck...not that you need it.\"","She turned around and quickly vanished into the distance.","Once Mei Feng was gone, Yuan turned to ask Mei Xiaoyun, \"If you don’t mind me asking, why do you seem to hate the military so much? Is it related to your grudge for your mother?\"","\"Why are you suddenly being so nosy?\" Mei Xiaoyun glared at him with narrowed eyes.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Believe it or not, I know someone in my world who looks exactly like you and your mother. Coincidentally, they are also mother and daughter. And since I am very closely related to them, I cannot help but be curious about your relationship with your mother and if there’s anything that can be done to fix it.\"","\"There’s nothing to fix,\" Mei Xiaoyun said. \"And my reason for disliking my mother and the military is very simple, too. I was neglected as a child, with the root cause being her job in the military.\"","\"You should be more honest with yourself,\" Yuan suddenly said.","\"What the hell are you talking about?\" Mei Xiaoyun frowned.","Yuan chuckled and said, \"You may be able to fool yourself, but you cannot fool my eyes. Whenever you look at your mother, there is clear admiration in your gaze. If you ask me, I think you actually admire her.\"","\"T-That’s absurd!\"","\"You followed us because you wanted to spend more time with your mother, right? I think there is a better way to do that—and that is to join the military. Not only would it make seeing your mother easier, but you would also be able to talk about things you normally cannot.\"","\"Your mother is quite similar to the person I know in my world. If that is the case, then I am willing to bet that she actually wants to talk to you, but simply does not know what to talk about. After all, she cannot disclose anything military-related to you, even if you are her daughter.\"","Mei Xiaoyun stared at him with her mouth slightly opened, a stunned expression on her face.","After a moment of silence, she responded in a nervous voice, \"S-Shut up! Don’t speak as if you know everything about me or my mother when we’re basically still strangers!\"","Yuan did not give up and said, \"How about this? If you join the military with me, I will...\"","Yuan continued his sentence using voice transmission, \"I will teach you how I acquired the Perfected Heavenly Refinement physique. Hell, I will even train you.\"","\"I don’t need your training,\" she sneered.","Despite saying that, she was enticed by his offer. After all, in less than half a year, Yuan had somehow managed to catch up with her cultivation. Of course, there was also his Perfected Heavenly Temperament physique.","\"Take some time to think it over,\" said Yuan before falling silent and waiting for the recruitment to begin.","Two days later, several people in military uniforms appeared in the area, their presence instantly silencing the entire area."]},{"number":2579,"title":"Chapter 2579: Military Recruitment(2)","paragraphs":["\"Welcome to this year’s military recruitment. I’m Sergeant Zao, in charge of overseeing this year’s recruitment. First and foremost, I’m delighted to see so many eager to join the military this year, but unfortunately, we have only so much space, and we want only the best. Therefore, we will be hosting several trials to weed out those not qualified.\"","Without wasting any time, Sergeant Zao immediately went into the details of the first trial.","\"For the first trial, all of you will be required to run two laps around the base, which is about a thousand miles per lap. During the run, not only do you have to wear weights, but you will have to avoid the traps that will constantly try to hit you. Being hit by a trap won’t automatically disqualify you as long as you’re not hit in any vital spot. That means if you’re hit in the head or heart even once, you’ll be disqualified.\"","\"Also, there won’t be any time limit, but there will be a limit to how many people can proceed to the next trial, so don’t try to take your time.\"","Sergeant Zao pointed toward the east and continued, \"Before you begin the run, you will each grab a badge, a tracker, and your weights.\"","\"I don’t want to waste my breath since at least half of you will drop out, so I will speak more in the second trial. Good luck.\"","After Sergeant Zao ended his sentence, several soldiers could be heard beckoning the participants to acquire their items.","\"Come over here and get your gear! If you’re missing even one item before starting the run, you will automatically be disqualified!\"","The sea of participants immediately moved toward the soldiers to grab their things before they ran.","\"Don’t push! Your time r won’t start until you receive all items and pass the starting line!\"","\"Are you coming with me?\" Yuan turned to ask Mei Xiaoyun.","\"...\"","\"You can go ahead,\" she said.","Yuan nodded and left without saying anything else.","Some time later, Yuan received three items: a badge with the number 42011, a paper-thin silver bracelet, and a black necklace.","Although the black necklace was weightless in his hands, the moment Yuan put it on, he felt his entire body grow several times heavier, as though he were suddenly carrying a mountain on his back.","Though it was still manageable.","Meanwhile, many participants dropped to the ground the moment they put on the necklace and were unable to get back up, which disqualified them on the spot.","However, even more people were disqualified before they put on the necklace, as the bracelet they wore was used to detect those who did not meet the bare minimum cultivation and credential requirements.","\"Requirements not met. Disqualified.\"","The bracelet would glow crimson red and even announce it aloud to those who did not qualify, publicly shaming them for trying to sneak past the requirements.","As for those who qualified, their bracelets would glow azure.","Once Yuan wore all three items and walked past the starting line, he started running at full speed, shooting forward like a bullet.","\"What the hell is that speed?!\"","His speed shocked not just the other participants but also the soldiers there.","\"There’s no way he’s moving that fast while weighted! Is his necklace even functioning properly?!\"","The participants cried out, suspecting that something was wrong with Yuan’s necklace, which allowed him to run at full speed.","At the same time, somewhere inside the military building, a large group of high-ranking soldiers were watching the recruitment on a big screen.","\"Who is that kid passing everyone?\" Someone suddenly asked.","\"Number 42011. According to his bracelet, he’s at Ninth Level Fifth Ascension, his physique at Inexhaustible Heavenly Refinement.\"","\"What? Those stats are on par with some of our elite soldiers! Where the hell did he come from?\"","\"Give me a minute to look him up.\"","However, even after several minutes, the soldier could not find any information on Yuan.","\"How odd... I cannot find any information on him.\"","\"What? How is that possible?\"","\"Look. It says I don’t have enough credentials to see his information.\"","\"Huh?\"","The people in the room shifted their gaze; their eyes widened with surprise.","\"Who the hell is this bastard that blocks even your rank 7 credentials?\"","\"That would be my recruit,\" a calm voice suddenly responded.","The people in the room turned to look behind them and saw Mei Feng entering.","\"General Mei!\" They stood up to greet her.","\"Wait... what did you just say?\" one of them asked.","\"I said I found him, so keep your grubby hands off him. He’s mine.\"","The room fell silent as the soldiers wore shocked looks.","\"General Mei, don’t you think you’re being unreasonable?\"","A voice responded as another individual entered the room right behind her.","Mei Feng turned around to see a middle-aged man wearing a rank identical to hers.","\"General Gu,\" she muttered. \"How am I being unreasonable?\"","\"Don’t you think having one monster is already enough? You should give the others a chance.\"","\"Hah!\" Mei Feng sneered. \"That’s rich coming from you, who has the most elite soldiers under his command.\"","General Gu shook his head and said, \"It’s not like I personally chose them. They were the ones who chose to stand under my banner of their own accord.\"","\"In any case, that one is mine. If any of you dare to touch him, I’ll fucking kill you.\"","After saying that, Mei Feng walked out of the room.","\"That was quite intensive even for General Mei...\"","\"I don’t think she reacted that way even for that woman...\"","\"Are you implying that this 42011 is even more monstrous than her last recruit?\"","The soldiers trembled at the thought.","Meanwhile, General Gu took a seat at the table and narrowed his eyes at Yuan.","\"Let’s not get ahead of ourselves. It’s still too early to tell how talented he is.\"","\"General Gu is right. Let’s continue watching for now.\""]},{"number":2580,"title":"Chapter 2580: Military Recruitment(3)","paragraphs":["The path for the trial was a simple one-way road, and for the first hundred miles, there were no obstacles or traps.","However, the moment Yuan reached the hundred-mile mark, the real trial began. Arrows suddenly flew at him from both sides, and since his view was obstructed by large bushes on either side of the path, he had to rely on his senses and reflexes to avoid them.","Naturally, such traps were no different from a child’s play in Yuan’s eyes, and he could avoid them even with his eyes closed. However, for the other participants, the traps were difficult to handle because many had not been properly trained.","Yuan avoided all traps without stopping, but the participants around him had to stop moving to dodge the arrows.","\"His senses and reaction are quite spectacular, but it’s not unprecedented.\"","\"It’s still too early to judge him since the trial has just begun.\"","The high-ranking soldiers continued to chat as they watched the trial from their private room.","Of course, Yuan wasn’t the only one being shown on the screen.","\"Recruit 24,192 is mine.\"","\"He’s not bad, but I’m calling dibs on 64,123.\"","Since Mei Feng had already claimed Yuan for herself and nobody wanted to fight with her, they had no choice but to scout other soldiers for their division.","Some time later, Yuan reached the two-hundred-mile mark, and the traps changed slightly. Although arrows continued to fly toward him, something new had been added.","’Hm?’","Yuan noticed a red laser aimed at his body. When he looked down, he saw a red dot marking his heart.","The red dot was initially as large as a fist, but it quickly shrank until it became so small that it vanished entirely.","Just before the red dot disappeared, Yuan twisted his body, narrowly avoiding a bullet that shot toward the exact spot where it had been aimed.","As Yuan continued forward, the number of arrows and bullets flying toward him increased. Still, it was nowhere near enough to challenge him.","’This is a bit boring...’ Yuan thought to himself, even feeling an urge to yawn.","Meanwhile, the participants around him continued to fall left and right...With Yuan somewhat contributing to their failure because of how much he distracted them.","\"?!?!\"","\"What the hell?! How is he moving at that speed and avoiding the traps simultaneously?!\"","Eventually, Yuan ran a thousand miles, completing the first lap.","On the second lap, the traps did not activate for the first hundred miles, just like the first.","Yuan prepared for the traps to activate past the 100-mile mark, but he reached the 200-mile mark without being attacked by a single trap.","Just as Yuan began to wonder whether there were any traps on the second lap, his eyebrows suddenly twitched, and he tilted his head slightly to the right.","Whoosh!","A breeze brushed against his cheek as an invisible arrow shot past him.","\"Invisible traps now, huh?\"","Although the arrows were completely invisible to the naked eye, they were all imbued with Limitless. As long as one paid close attention, they could still sense them approaching.","By now, Yuan had surpassed every participant who started before him and had reached first place.","\"If he continues at this pace, he’ll break the record by a landslide!\"","\"This guy might just be even more monstrous than the last one General Mei recruited!\"","Upon realizing this, the high-ranking soldiers began contemplating whether they should try to recruit Yuan despite Mei Feng’s warning—whether he was worth offending her over.","Even though Mei Feng had found him first and called dibs on him, there was no rule stating that he had to join her division, nor was there anything preventing the others from trying to recruit him. In fact, such a thing was quite common.","A few of the soldiers suddenly felt the urge to look at General Gu. When they glanced in his direction, they saw an excited—almost perverted—smile on his face, as though he were staring at something he deeply desired.","Seeing this, they quickly realized that General Gu was likely planning to compete with Mei Feng and recruit Yuan to his side.","’Looks like things will get chaotic soon...’","The soldiers sighed inwardly.","After reaching the 700-mile mark, the red dots returned, but several would appear at once, and the frequency of their appearance also increased.","Yet, it did not slow down Yuan in the slightest. If anything, he sped up because he wanted to end the trial as soon as possible since it was too boring.","Eventually, Yuan reached the end.","\"T-Two hours and fifty-nine minutes?!\" The soldiers cried out loud after seeing Yuan’s time.","\"He broke the record by seven whole hours!\"","Yuan approached one of them and asked, \"What now? I just finished my second lap.\"","The soldiers stared at him in silence, their mouths agape.","\"Um... you can keep the badge and bracelet, so you just need to return your necklace.\"","Once the soldiers acquired Yuan’s necklace, they immediately began examining it just in case it was actually broken.","However, they were unable to find anything wrong with it even after looking through it twice, meaning it was working properly, and Yuan’s record would stand.","\"Hm?\"","Meanwhile, Yuan raised his eyebrows when he noticed that Mei Xiaoyun was nowhere to be seen.","’Did she leave? Or did she...?’ he thought inwardly.","\"You can rest until the others are done,\" one of the soldiers said to Yuan.","\"Alright.\"","A few hours later, Yuan smiled when he saw Mei Xiaoyun again.","Turns out she did not leave and had decided to participate in the recruitment as well.","Although her performance was nowhere near as spectacular as Yuan’s, she still managed to attract some attention.","\"Who is that woman?\" one of the high-ranking soldiers from the room asked.","\"That’s number 111,781...Huh?\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...No way!\"","\"What is it?\"","\"T-That woman is Mei Xiaoyun, General Mei’s daughter!\"","\"What?! General Mei has a daughter?!\"","\"You didn’t know?\"","\"She never talks about her family.\"","\"But from what I heard, they have a rocky relationship.\"","\"If that’s the case, there’s a good chance she won’t go to her mother’s division, so we can try to recruit her.\""]},{"number":2581,"title":"Chapter 2581: Military Recruitment(4)","paragraphs":["A little over twelve hours after Yuan finished the first trial, a second participant finally finished their second lap.","The moment the man finished his lap, he looked around until he spotted Yuan, who appeared to be napping beneath a tree, shielded by its shadow.","\"Hey, what was that guy’s time?\" he asked the soldiers as he returned his necklace, sounding a bit hesitant, as if he was nervous to know.","\"Two hours and fifty-nine minutes...\"","\"What?! But the last record was ten hours! How is it even possible to go so low?! There must have been something wrong with his weights!\"","\"No, we’ve checked the necklace. It was working and active the entire time.\"","\"No way...\"","After a moment of silence, the man approached Yuan and asked, \"How did you do it?\"","\"What do you mean?\" Yuan responded without opening his eyes.","\"You know what I mean! How did you finish the trial in such a short time?!\"","\"Well... you know... I ran.\"","\"Are you messing with me?!\"","Yuan picked his ears with his pinky and said, \"I’ve already answered your question. Now, can you stop buzzing in my ears like an annoying little bug?\"","\"You—!\"","The man’s face turned red in anger. However, he remembered where he was and, not wanting to cause a scene, quickly turned around and walked away. But he continued to stare daggers at Yuan from a distance until the next participant finished the trial a little over half an hour later.","Soon, more and more participants finished the race.","In the military’s eyes, anyone who finished within 24 hours was considered average. Those who finished within 20 hours were considered above average. Those who completed the trial within 14 hours were considered talented, while anyone who finished faster than that was considered elite.","As for Yuan... he was considered an anomaly.","Mei Xiaoyun ended up finishing in 12 hours and 22 minutes, earning elite status.","Meanwhile, as Sergeant Zao had predicted, more than half of the participants failed the trial, bringing the total to more than 70,000.","Once the last participant finished the trial, Sergeant Zao appeared before them again and spoke, \"Congratulations on finishing the first trial, but this is just the beginning. If you barely passed this one, you might as well just go home now because the second one will be even more difficult.\"","\"Follow me.\"","Sergeant Zao turned toward the military building and began walking.","After nearly an hour, intentionally giving the participants some time to rest, they reached the building and entered.","Sergeant Zao then led everyone into a massive, dome-shaped room containing an obstacle course filled with various obstacles.","\"For the second trial, you will need to complete this obstacle course,\" he said, giving them a brief and simple explanation.\"","The participants took a moment to examine the obstacle course, and one of them couldn’t help but mutter, \"It looks so simple...\"","While the obstacle course appeared massive, the courses themselves appeared simple, even easy.","Sergeant Zao chuckled after hearing that and said, \"Just wait until you start doing it.\"","\"Now, here are some rules for this trial.\"","After a moment of silence, he continued, \"There are no rules. Anyone who reaches the end will qualify for the next trial. A hundred participants will go at a time, and the selection will be randomized. If you hear your number being called, enter the obstacle course.\"","Soon, a hundred numbers were announced through speakers.","\"Number 21,132...91,533...5...1999....\"","Once all one hundred participants had gathered at the starting line of the obstacle course, a loud beep signaled the start.","Despite having 100 people standing in a single-file line with 50 meters between each person, there was still plenty of space for them to move around.","At the start of the signal, all of them rushed forward.","However, their movements noticeably slowed the moment they passed the starting line, causing those watching to raise their eyebrows in puzzlement.","Meanwhile, those on the obstacle course were shocked when their bodies suddenly felt sluggish and weak, as if all their energy had been drained.","As a result, some of them even tripped over thin air and fell face-first to the ground.","\"What’s going on?!\"","\"My energy! It’s all gone!\"","\"This must be the true trial!\"","The participants quickly adapted and began moving toward the first obstacle—a mile-long wooden log barely wide enough for an average man’s foot to step on.","Of course, since there were 100 participants, there were 100 such obstacles.","Although all of them struggled at first, as they got used to their exhaustion, they started speeding up.","However, when the first person reached the half-mile mark, an arrow suddenly shot from the ceiling at him. Since he was completely focused on the log and too exhausted to react properly, the arrow struck him directly in the center of his forehead.","As a result, he was knocked off the log and sent falling to the bottom.","When the others saw this, they immediately heightened their senses and prepared to be attacked too.","Yet, when they reached the half-mile mark, none of them were targeted.","Instead, the arrows struck at random intervals, making them impossible to predict.","As they moved closer and closer to the end of the obstacle, the arrows would appear more frequently, slowing many down and completely eliminating others.","While the arrows weren’t fatal, they were strong enough to crack bones, so a few participants ended up with cracked skulls in the end.","\"Since we have unlimited time, I think it would be better to take our time with this trial.\" One of the spectators remarked.","\"No, that might not be the case. If you haven’t noticed, those who are slower have been targeted more than those at the front.\"","\"Are you sure it’s not a coincidence?\"","\"It might be since it’s still too soon to tell.\"","Eventually, someone reached the end of the log and came to the second obstacle—a massive, lengthy pool resembling a sea with a sign right before it.","[Swim To The Other Side]"]},{"number":2582,"title":"Chapter 2582: Military Recruitment(5)","paragraphs":["When the first participant reached the second obstacle, he walked to its edge and looked down to see if he could spot anything in the water.","After several moments, the man sighed in relief when he saw nothing and, after taking a deep breath, jumped into it and began swimming.","The pool was even longer than the first obstacle. In fact, it was ten times as long.","As the participants continued to swim, they grew increasingly anxious, fearing that something might attack them from below.","Sure enough, once they reached the middle, they encountered a trap, but it was not what they had expected. Rather than arrows or attacks from beneath the water, whirlpools appeared on the surface, disrupting their rhythm and making it difficult to swim.","These whirlpools were weak at first, but they grew stronger and more violent the farther the participants progressed. Eventually, they became powerful enough to drag anyone who was not careful into the depths.","If the participants who were dragged into the water did not resurface after a minute, they would be teleported to safety by the mechanism available in their bracelets. However, this also meant their disqualification from the recruitment.","\"Are you not going to say anything to me?\"","A voice suddenly rang out behind Yuan as he watched the examination.","He turned around to see Mei Xiaoyun standing behind him, her eyebrows raised.","\"What do you mean?\" Yuan inquired.","\"I was expecting you to make fun of me or something,\" she replied.","\"Do I look like the kind of person to do such a thing?\"","\"Honestly? Yes, you do.\"","\"...\"","\"Well, sorry to disappoint you, but I won’t be making fun of you.\"","After a brief pause, he added, \"As long as you don’t fail the recruitment, that is.\"","Mei Xiaoyun sneered, \"I’ve seen and done it before. Several times, in fact.\"","\"Oh?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow in surprise.","\"My mother would occasionally bring me along and make me participate. Of course, those were some of the only times she visited—and the only reason she did,\" she sighed. \"And once I told her that I won’t be joining the military, she immediately stopped visiting.\"","\"Is that so...\"","Some time later, the participants reached the third and final part of the obstacle course. By then, nearly all of the original 100 had been eliminated, leaving only a little over 10 remaining.","The final obstacle was a towering wall designed to resemble a mountain cliff. As for its height, it was a staggering twenty miles, twice as long as the previous obstacle.","\"Haa...haaa...\"","The participants who made it to the final obstacle did not immediately start climbing; they took some time to rest, just as they had done at the second obstacle. After all, they had all the time in the world.","However, since there was a formation constantly draining their energy, they wouldn’t feel refreshed no matter how long they rested.","Once they were mentally prepared, they started climbing the mountain.","At the same time, the next 100 participants were called into the obstacle course.","\"Number 12,239...111,781...99...1,378...\"","\"My number got called,\" Mei Xiaoyun said.","\"Good luck,\" Yuan said to her.","Meanwhile, when the first group of participants climbed the first mile, their entire bodies suddenly trembled, as though they had sensed something.","A few seconds later, they heard faint sounds coming from behind them. Sure enough, they were being targeted by arrows once again.","And it was more than just a single arrow, forcing them to move their bodies entirely by leaping to another spot on the wall.","Of course, with their energy constantly near exhaustion, that was far easier said than done. Every movement felt as though they had just run a marathon, forcing them to conserve every bit of motion they could.","One of the participants chose to endure the arrows and allowed them to strike his body. However, the moment one hit a vital area, he was automatically teleported out of the course and disqualified.","\"What?!\"","\"I thought there were no rules!\"","The spectators cried out loud when they saw the participant getting eliminated, and they turned to look at Sergeant Zao, who was also watching nearby.","\"There are no rules, but it should be common sense not to get hit in the vitals. After all, how are you supposed to continue as a corpse?\"","What Sergeant Zao said made sense, and a few participants realized that as long as they didn’t get hit in the vitals, they wouldn’t be disqualified.","Although only a hundred participants could enter the obstacle course at a time, each group only took roughly an hour to reach the third obstacle, with some groups being eliminated entirely long before then.","A few days later, Yuan finally heard his number being called.","\"42,011! It’s number 42,011!\"","The moment the higher-ups in the private spectating room heard it, they all subconsciously straightened in their seats and focused their attention on him.","Shortly after Yuan entered the obstacle course, two individuals appeared beside Sergeant Zao in the room.","\"Hm? What are the two of you doing here?\" Sergeant Zao raised his eyebrows upon seeing these two individuals, clearly surprised by their appearance.","\"We’re here to watch,\" said Shi Fa.","\"Since when have you been interested in recruitment? Or did you hear about a certain somebody? I guess I shouldn’t be surprised that his record has spread by now.\"","\"Yeah, we heard somebody had gotten a sub-3-hour during the first exam, shattering every single record before it, including that monster’s record,\" said Wu Wang, pretending like he didn’t know about Yuan before it.","\"Do you think she’ll also make an appearance to see him?\"","\"Doubtful, since she was recently deployed for a mission.\"","\"I bet the higher-ups are all scrambling to recruit him into their division,\" Shi Fa chuckled.","\"He’ll probably be scooped up by General Gu, anyway.\"","\"Let’s see how he performs in this one, where his stamina is severely limited.\"","The moment the trial started, Yuan’s figure shot forward like an arrow, as if the exhaustion did not affect him in the slightest.","\"?!?!\"","Not only the others in his group, but everyone watching widened their eyes in shock."]},{"number":2583,"title":"Chapter 2583: Military Recruitment(6)","paragraphs":["\"W-What the hell?! Is the formation not affecting him or something?!\"","The spectators cried out loud.","\"No... I think he’s just showing off and will run out of gas soon.\"","The participants in Yuan’s group, as well as the spectators, believed that Yuan was just trying to show off and was using what little energy he had for the spectacle.","However, Yuan jumped onto the log and continued running on it until he reached the point where arrows began to appear.","Of course, he dodged all of them without slowing down.","\"How is he still going?! Where the hell is he getting his energy from?!\"","\"Hey! Call the technicians!\"","The higher-ups immediately asked the technicians on duty to double-check whether the formation suppressing their energy was working properly.","\"The technicians have confirmed that the formations are working as intended!\"","\"How is that possible?!\"","Everyone was in disbelief.","General Gu then said, \"The formation suppresses everyone at a fixed rate. Therefore, if someone possesses the ability to regenerate their energy faster than the formation can drain it, they could theoretically outpace its suppression.\"","Sure enough, Yuan was simply regenerating his energy faster than the formation was exhausting it, allowing him to move at full speed.","\"What is his physique rank, again?\"","\"Inexhaustible Heavenly Refinement, sir!\" Someone answered.","\"Inexhaustible Heavenly Refinement, huh? Although that in itself isn’t enough to out-regenerate the formation, if he has a technique to assist him further, it’s possible. Still, the formation gets stronger the longer they spend on the course, so it should suppress him sooner or later.\"","\"If he doesn’t finish the entire course by then, that is...\" someone remarked.","In the blink of an eye, Yuan arrived at the second obstacle course, immediately jumped into the water, and began swimming.","Since swimming was rarely required in the cultivation world, most cultivators actually never swam in their lives. However, because of its simplicity, it was extremely easy to learn, so even if Yuan lacked experience, he was able to quickly master it simply by watching others.","Once Yuan reached the whirlpools, he ignored them entirely and swam straight through, somehow overpowering their attempts to drag him into the depths.","\"H-He swam right through the whirlpool! I have never seen anything like that before!\"","\"Is such a thing even possible without using Limitless?\"","\"At this rate, he’ll catch up to the group who went before him! This is unprecedented!\"","Some time later, Yuan reached the third obstacle.","Meanwhile, the group that started before him had only recently started the climb.","\"Huh?\"","The participants from that group raised their eyebrows when they saw Yuan climbing past them.","They wore puzzled expressions at first, but when they saw his face and realized he wasn’t from their group, that confusion turned to shock and disbelief.","\"W-Who the hell are you?!\" One of them cried out loud.","Yuan stopped briefly and responded, \"Do you even have time to worry about me? You should focus on yourself first.\"","As he said that, arrows started flying at these participants.","While the others struggled to dodge the arrows, Yuan continued climbing the mountain with graceful, seemingly effortless movements, resembling a monkey that had spent its entire life scaling cliffs.","In the end, Yuan reached the top and cleared the entire obstacle course long before the previous group, setting a new record.","\"He actually did it! He surpassed the previous group!\"","\"And look at him! He doesn’t even look the slightest bit tired!\"","In the other spectators’ room, Sergeant Zao muttered in a low voice, \"What a monster... he’s even more ridiculous than General Mei’s latest elite soldier.\"","\"I can’t wait to see how he performs in the last two trials...\" Wu Wang said with a smile on his face.","After completing the trial, Yuan was teleported back to the room, where everyone who had passed before him was waiting. As for those who were disqualified, they were sent home immediately.","Everyone present stared at him in silence, as if they were standing before an otherworldly being beyond their comprehension.","Meanwhile, Wu Wang approached him and said, \"It’s been a while.\"","Yuan looked at him with raised eyebrows and asked, \"Do I know you?\"","\"What are you—\"","Wu Wang suddenly paused.","Then, after clearing his throat, spoke in a stiff tone, \"I mistook you for someone else. My bad.\"","He turned around and walked away, leaving the others puzzled.","After all, if the military discovered their relationship, they would likely question him about Yuan, potentially exposing the contract between them.","Some time later, all of the remaining participants had completed the obstacle course. By the end, more than three-fourths of them had been eliminated, bringing the remaining participants to just over 10,000.","\"We will proceed to the next trial immediately. Follow me,\" Sergeant Zao said before leading them into another room located beside the obstacle course.","The room was long and spacious, appearing empty at first glance.","\"For the third trial, we will be testing your control over your Limitless. Once we start the trial, the restriction on your cultivation will be temporary removed, allowing you to use Limitless.\"","\"Here is an example.\"","A moment later, a red target suddenly appeared a thousand meters away.","Then, without warning, Sergeant Zao pointed at the red target and formed a small orb of energy at his fingertip. He fired it like a bullet, striking the target and shattering it.","\"The target will begin 100 meters away and move farther back each time you hit it. To pass this trial, you must strike it a total of ten times. Of course, you may continue beyond that. Anyone who manages to hit the 10,000-meter, 20,000-meter, and 40,000-meter target will receive a bonus reward at the end of the recruitment.\"","\"Any questions?\"","One of the participants raised their hand and asked, \"Is there a limit to how many attempts we get to hit the target?\"","Sergeant Zao raised three fingers and replied to the question, \"Thirty. You get thirty shots.\""]},{"number":2584,"title":"Chapter 2584: Military Recruitment(7)","paragraphs":["\"Huh? Only thirty shots? Is it even possible to reach 40,000 meters with that amount?\"","Sergeant Zao sneered and said, \"You can worry about that when you reach that point, but I highly doubt anyone here... except one individual who will be able to achieve that.\"","Everyone there subconsciously turned their heads to look at Yuan when they heard such words.","\"One last thing. You have only 15 seconds to take each shot, and if you fail to shoot within that time, you will be disqualified, even if you are on your final shot. Just like the previous trial, if you hear your number, stand at one of the available spots,\" Sergeant Zao said a moment later.","\"Number 414... 21,381... 83,999...\"","A total of twenty people were called at once, and once they assumed their positions behind the line, a countdown began.","\"3...2...1...start!\"","At the signal, a single holographic red target appeared, hovering one hundred meters in front of the participants.","Seeing this, the participants immediately took aim.","A few seconds later, the first participant fired, striking the red target with their Limitless.","Immediately after the target was shattered, a second one appeared, but it was a hundred meters further than the last.","Whoosh!","The 2nd target was struck down a few seconds later.","Then, the 3rd appeared at 300 meters.","Seeing this made everyone present wonder how they would reach 40,000 meters with only 30 shots.","Eventually, the first participant reached their 5th target.","Although it was exactly where it was supposed to be—at 500 meters—it was no longer a still target. Rather, it moved around in a circle.","The sudden change left the shooter baffled for several seconds, disrupting their concentration and causing their first miss.","The 6th target was also moving, but instead of traveling in circles, it followed a triangular pattern and moved noticeably faster.","Several misses later, the sixth target was finally shot down.","The 7th target appeared and moved in a zig-zag pattern, also noticeably faster than the last.","Then, the 8th target appeared, moving in a completely unpredictable pattern and leaving the shooter speechless.","’Fuck! Why is the recruitment so fucking hard?!’ The participants cursed inwardly.","Meanwhile, Yuan felt an urge to yawn at how boring and easy these trials were.","The 9th target followed the same random, unpredictable pattern as the last, but it moved even faster.","Eventually, someone managed to reach the 10th target, and not only did it move in an unpredictable pattern, but it would even turn invisible for two full seconds before reappearing!","\"If it is already so difficult at 1,000 meters, I cannot imagine how impossible the 40,000-meter target would be...\"","After several disqualifications, someone finally managed to hit the 10th target, and when that happened, the 11th target appeared.","But rather than appearing at 1,100 meters, it appeared at 2,000 meters.","Although the distance doubled, it was back to being a still target.","Once the 11th target was conquered, the 12th target appeared at 3,000 meters.","The moment any participant is done shooting, another number would be called to take their place, so there was constant shooting with barely any breaks.","\"Number 111,781... range 12.\"","\"Good luck,\" Yuan said to her.","The moment Mei Xiaoyun stood at her spot, she took a deep breath and aimed at her 1st target.","Whoosh!","The second the 2nd target appeared, she took her second shot, striking it.","Then the 3rd... the 4th...","Mei Xiaoyun’s impressive shooting speed raised many eyebrows, as she was practically shooting a target every second until the 10th target, where she took twice as long... or two seconds.","Not only did she qualify in the shortest time among all participants, but she’d done so without missing a single shot.","\"W-Who is that beauty?!\"","For the first time, the participants began to notice her, shocked by her dazzling performance.","\"I don’t know, but I think I have seen her before...\"","\"That’s Mei Xiaoyun, and her mother is a General in the military,\" said someone who actually recognized her.","\"Her surname is Mei? So her mother is General Mei, the one they call Ruthless General?!\"","\"I’m surprised you recognize her.\"","\"If you want to take the military seriously, you should take some time to learn about those at the top...\"","Eventually, Mei Xiaoyun reached the 15th target, which began moving in a circle like the 5th target.","Then she reached the 16th...17th...18th...and the 19th.","\"Heavens! She’s the first one to reach 10,000 meters!\"","\"And all without missing a single bullet!\"","\"At this rate, she might make it to 40,000 meters!\"","The 20th target was reached for the first time, and its distance was doubled, reaching 20,000 meters. Not only that, but it still moved in an unpredictable pattern and turned invisible for two seconds at a time.","Woosh!","For the first time, Mei Xiaoyun missed a shot, but she did not panic and swiftly took another, this time hitting it.","With nine attempts left, Mei Xiaoyun continued shooting with a calm expression until she used her last shot.","In the end, Mei Xiaoyun reached the 25th target at 30,000 meters.","\"Amazing!\"","The other participants clapped at the end.","\"Not bad.\"","Even Sergeant Zao praised her.","As Mei Xiaoyun walked back, another number was called to replace her.","\"Number 42,011, range 12!\"","\"Huh? 42,011? Isn’t that...\"","Everyone stopped clapping and turned to look at Yuan, who was already heading to his spot.","\"Surely, he won’t completely dominate this one, too, right?\"","\"There’s only so much talent one can have...\"","The spectators held their breath as Yuan stood at his position.","\"Hm? What is he doing?\"","They raised their eyebrows in puzzlement when Yuan simply stood there with his arms at his sides, as though he had no intention of participating.","However, their eyes and mouths widened with shock when the trial began.","Without even using his hand to aim at the target like everyone else, Yuan created thirty bullets around him and started shooting them one after another without pausing for more than a split second.","Pop! Pop! Pop!","The targets were destroyed one after another instantly upon their appearance, leaving everyone stunned."]},{"number":2585,"title":"Chapter 2585: Military Recruitment(8)","paragraphs":["In the blink of an eye, before anyone watching could even comprehend what they’d just witnessed, Yuan had already reached the 25th target at 30,000 meters.","However, he did not stop there and continued shooting at the same pace.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The Limitless-made bullets tore through the air with precision, striking the 26th target at 32,000 meters, then the 27th at 34,000 meters.","Then, in the time it takes for one to blink their eyes, Yuan shattered the 28th target at 36,000 meters and the 29th at 38,000 meters, leaving just a single bullet left.","However, instead of shooting it straight at the target as he’d done with the last 29 bullets, Yuan made the bullet spiral as it flew toward the 30th target at 40,000 meters.","Crack!","The sound of the target being shattered resounded, even though the target was invisible at that moment.","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","Everyone stared at Yuan with stunned expressions, left completely speechless by his unfathomable performance, which took less than a minute to complete.","After finishing his trial, Yuan casually walked back to the group, all of them still gawking at him with bewildered faces.","However, a voice suddenly resounded through the speakers, \"Number 42,011. The higher-ups have requested that you continue the trial until you miss three shots back-to-back.\"","Yuan halted when he heard this and turned to look at Sergeant Zao with a puzzled expression.","Sergeant Zao swallowed nervously and slowly nodded his head before speaking, \"You heard the higher-ups. Continue until you miss three shots at a time.\"","Without saying another word, Yuan returned to range 12, where the 31st target was already flying 45,000 meters away.","Not only was it turning invisible, but it would stay invisible for five whole seconds before reappearing for a split second. Of course, it was also moving in an unpredictable pattern.","Despite that, Yuan attacked it without hesitation, hitting the target with precision.","The 32nd target appeared a second later at 50,000 meters.","A few moments later, Yuan reached the 40th target at 90,000 meters without missing a single shot, leaving the spectators bewildered.","Many of them couldn’t even see that far, let alone hit it!","\"Is it possible that he’s somehow cheating?\" One of the participants suddenly questioned aloud.","\"Cheating? And how would he achieve that with so many people watching?\"","\"I-I don’t know... I’m just throwing the possibility out there since it’s so hard to believe what I am seeing to be real.\"","\"I don’t blame you. I am also in disbelief right now. Just who is that guy? Does anyone know?\"","Everyone there shook their heads.","As for Mei Xiaoyun, not wanting to deal with the hassle, she remained silent.","Meanwhile, Shi Fa and Wu Wang watched from afar.","\"That fucking monster is casually achieving what experienced elite soldiers could barely achieve after decades of training!\" Wu Wang cried out loud.","\"He is already beyond what a monster can achieve...\" Shi Fa sighed before continuing, \"I doubt he’s even human.\"","Some time later, Yuan reached the 50th target at 200,000 meters. However, even though he was capable of hitting it, he deliberately missed all three shots because he couldn’t be bothered to continue.","Of course, he also deliberately started missing one or two shots for the last five targets to not make it too obvious.","\"Looks like that was my limit,\" Yuan said in a somewhat disappointed voice, pretending to look sad.","\"There’s no need to be disappointed. Believe it or not, you’re already at the level of our elite soldiers,\" Sergeant Zaos said.","\"Is that so?\"","Yuan then asked, \"Anyway, do I get any bonus reward for that?\"","\"That’s...\" Sergeant Zao opened his mouth but was speechless for a moment.","Eventually, he replied in a somewhat awkward tone, \"That will be up to the higher-ups. If they decided you deserve a bonus reward, then you will get it.\"","\"Alright.\"","The trial had stopped momentarily when Yuan was called back to the range, but now that he was done, the remaining participants who had yet to shoot were called to the range.","Meanwhile, in the private spectator’s room, the higher-ups spoke about Yuan’s achievements.","\"Quite frankly, I think we should just make him an elite soldier from the get-go,\" one of them suggested.","\"I agree. Not only are his capabilities far beyond the ordinary soldier, but he even rivals some of our most experienced elite soldiers.\"","\"I am afraid that might set a bad precedent since nobody has ever received such treatment before, and even that monster recruited by General Mei had to climb the ranks normally, albeit faster than others.\"","\"Then are you suggesting we throw him in with the other soldiers? His presence will undoubtedly affect their morale and confidence. Don’t you remember what happened with the other one? Her mere presence lowered morale to dangerous levels. I don’t even want to imagine how catastrophic it would be with this guy, who’s even more monstrous.\"","\"What is your opinion on this matter, General Gu?\" Someone there suddenly asked him.","General Gu pondered for a moment before responding, \"I agree that we shouldn’t mix him with the other soldiers. However, we also shouldn’t be too obvious with our favoritism. How about this? We won’t outright make him an elite soldier. Rather, we’ll give him a mission and promote him after he completes it.\"","\"That’s perfect! If we give him a mission that most soldiers cannot handle, nobody would complain about his promotions!\"","\"That’s good and all, but he still has one more trial to pass before he qualifies—\"","\"What nonsense are you talking about? Even if he fails the next trial, nobody would be dumb enough to actually disqualify him.\"","\"Speaking of the final trial... who should we pair against him? I doubt it would be entertaining if we followed the plan.\"","\"I already have someone in mind,\" General Gu said with a mysterious grin.","The others swallowed nervously after seeing his expression.","\"Try not to go overboard, General... After all, he is General Mei’s—\"","\"General Mei? If we let her get a hold of him, her position within the military will definitely become unshakable. We cannot allow such a thing to happen!\" General Gu shouted, slamming the desk in irritation and instantly silencing the room."]},{"number":2586,"title":"Chapter 2586: Military Recruitment(9)","paragraphs":["\"Listen carefully. I do not care if General Mei found him first. We cannot allow him to join her division!\" General Gu declared.","No one in the room responded, as they all understood why he was so determined to stop Yuan from joining General Mei’s division. After all, General Gu was currently competing with her for the military’s top rank, and she already held a slight advantage thanks to her latest talented recruit.","If she gained someone like Yuan as well, surpassing her would become countless times more difficult.","Although this was mostly a fight between General Gu and General Mei, each had their own people and sides, and everyone in the room sided with General Gu.","Meanwhile, in another room, Mei Feng and several other high-ranking soldiers were also watching the trial.","\"Where did you find such a monster? Do you have a special machine that brings you directly to them or something?\"","One of the soldiers asked her after witnessing Yuan’s performance in the third trial.","Mei Feng smiled and said, \"As much as I want to take credit, I wasn’t the one who found him. Instead, it was my daughter who found him.\"","\"Speaking of your daughter, why didn’t you tell us that she’d participate in this year’s recruitment? Do you have any idea how shocked I was to see her?\"","Mei Feng shook her head and said, \"I am just as surprised as you are since I also had nothing to do with her participation in the recruitment.\"","\"Hm? Does that mean your daughter joined because of 42,011? What’s their relationship? Don’t tell me that they’re lovers...\"","\"That is none of my business,\" Mei Feng said nonchalantly.","\"This isn’t the time for jokes, Captain Jing. Although it’s great for us that he’s so talented, I’m worried about what General Gu’s side might do. I highly doubt they’d let us have him without a fight, after all.\"","\"Do you think there’s a chance they might be able to steal him from us?\" someone else then asked.","\"No, it’s not possible,\" Mei Feng responded with confidence.","\"Did you already make a contract with him or something?\"","Mei Feng nodded, \"But that’s not the only reason why.\"","\"What other reason do you have?\"","\"Sorry, but I can’t tell you, even if it’s you guys.\"","\"Is that so?\"","\"As for General Gu...\" Mei Feng narrowed her eyes slightly. \"Let’s see what he has planned first.\"","Eventually, the third trial ended, and, surprisingly, more than half of the participants passed.","\"There is one last trial left before you are accepted into the military,\" Sergeant Zao said to the remaining 7,000 participants, then led them to another room.","This room was not as large as the previous rooms, and it had a single raised platform in the middle with rows of seats around it, most of them already occupied by soldiers.","\"For the final trial, each of you will have to fight a soldier,\" said Sergeant Zao.","\"What?!\"","The recruits exclaimed in shock; their expressions quickly turned concerned.","They were all civilians without proper training, and even those who had been trained because of their background couldn’t hope to come close to a trained soldier.","\"There’s no way any of us can defeat a soldier!\"","Sergeant Zao shook his head and elaborated, \"Nobody is expecting or asking you to defeat a soldier. In fact, regardless of the results, you won’t be disqualified.\"","\"Huh? Doesn’t that mean we’ve already...\"","\"That’s right. You have all technically already qualified to join the military, and this is simply a traditional event—a celebration of sorts.\"","In reality, however, it was anything but a celebration. While Sergeant Zao was telling the truth that no one would be disqualified by this event, its true purpose was to condition the newly recruited soldiers and instill fear into them. More than anything, it served as a humiliation ritual designed to break whatever arrogance or ego they might have.","Of course, several of the recruits, who had family in the military, were aware of this.","\"Once your number is called, enter the stage. If you manage to defeat a soldier, you’ll be given a special pass to skip the year-long training that everyone will be required to do after joining the military, so work hard,\" said Sergeant Zao.","Nobody was surprised to hear that they still needed to train for a year before they could become proper soldiers, but since many of them had no hope of defeating a soldier, they’d already resigned themselves to their fate.","Soon, the first recruit was called onto the stage to fight a soldier.","\"Number 8,091.\"","While the soldier could’ve easily defeated the recruit, they did not rush to do so. Instead, they messed around for a bit, like a hunter playing with its prey before consuming them.","After several minutes of light strikes, the soldier suddenly switched gears and began beating the recruit until his face was nearly black and blue.","The other recruits visibly paled at the sight, their eyes widening with terror.","Meanwhile, the soldiers clapped and cheered. Not a single one of them felt sorry for the recruits, as they had once stood in the same place and endured the same beating themselves.","By the end of the fight, the recruit on the stage was barely conscious and had to be carried off the platform.","One’s gender did not matter, either. Men or women. They were all beaten.","After witnessing a few more beatdowns, a recruit asked Sergeant Zao whether it was possible to avoid participating in this event.","\"Of course,\" Sergeant Zao said. \"However, if you don’t participate, your qualifications will be revoked.\"","When the recruits heard this, they felt like crying, but no tears came out.","At the end, they all accepted their fate and mentally prepared themselves for the beatdown...except for a few.","\"You nervous?\" Yuan asked Mei Xiaoyun with a calm look on his face, as if whatever was happening didn’t even faze him in the slightest."]},{"number":2587,"title":"Chapter 2587: Captain Gu","paragraphs":["\"I’d be lying if I said that I wasn’t even slightly nervous,\" Mei Xiaoyun admitted. \"But I should be fine.\"","She turned to look at his unconcerned face and continued, \"If I were in your shoes, I’d be a little worried.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and asked, \"Why?\"","\"Because this trial’s true purpose is to put us in our place so we don’t become too arrogant. You’ve done nothing but show off for the entire recruitment, so they will definitely prepare someone special for you...someone who will be able to defeat you.\"","\"I wouldn’t say I was showing off...\" Yuan remarked. \"If anything, I held back as much as I could.\"","\"You were holding back?\" Mei Xiaoyun muttered with a dumbfounded expression.","The other recruits around them also looked at him with dazed expressions, wondering whether he was telling the truth or just bragging.","Time passed quickly as the soldiers continued beating the recruits. However, not everyone received the same treatment. Those from influential families or with connections in the military were beaten far less severely than those from ordinary backgrounds.","Eventually, Mei Xiaoyun was called onto the stage.","\"H-Hey! Isn’t that Sergeant Lin, an elite soldier?! Why is she getting onto the stage? Don’t tell me she’s going to fight that recruit?\"","The soldiers were shocked when an elite soldier entered the stage, as they only appear for special occasions, and the last time such a thing happened was several decades ago.","\"Who is that recruit?\" One of the soldiers there asked aloud, hoping someone knew her.","\"I think that’s General Mei’s daughter, Mei Xiaoyun. I’ve seen her participating in the recruitment when she was much younger, but she’d never participated in the final trial.\"","\"Does this mean she’ll be joining the military for real this time? How exciting!\"","On the stage, Mei Xiaoyun narrowed her eyes at Sergeant Lin and asked, \"Did my mother send you?\"","Sergeant Lin smiled and replied, \"I don’t know what you’re talking about, but consider this an honor, as not many people get the chance to fight an elite soldier on this stage.\"","Mei Xiaoyun did not respond and readied herself.","\"Whenever you’re ready.\" Sergeant Lin beckoned to her.","A moment later, Mei Xiaoyun acted, moving to close the distance between them.","\"Nice movements,\" Sergeant Lin whistled.","Once Mei Xiaoyun was close enough, she struck without hesitation, her fist tearing through the air with speed and intensity.","However, Sergeant Lin casually caught her fists.","\"!\"","Mei Xiaoyun immediately prepared for the counter, but it never came.","Instead, Sergeant Lin released her and said, \"I’ll give you a few more tries.\"","Mei Xiaoyun did not respond and immediately went for a second strike...then a third...and a fourth.","However, no matter how much she tried, she was unable to even get close to hitting Sergeant Lin.","\"Not bad. With enough training, you’ll definitely become an elite soldier within twenty years,\" Sergeant Lin said.","\"Unfortunately, we don’t have all day, so I’m going to start attacking now.\"","After saying those words, Sergeant Lin stopped being defensive and went on the offense, quickly overwhelming Mei Xiaoyun.","A punch in the guts. A kick to the sides. A chop behind her neck. A slap in the face. Xiao Meiyun was struck in nearly every part of her body, and while Sergeant Lin wasn’t hitting her as heavily as the others, it was still quite brutal.","Despite the beatdown, Mei Xiaoyun did not give up, nor did she make any noises.","The match ended after several minutes, with Mei Xiaoyun barely able to remain conscious by the end.","\"Oh? I’m surprised you managed to stay awake. I wanted to knock you out, at the very least,\" said Sergeant Lin.","\"If you hadn’t gone easy on me, I would have,\" said Mei Xiaoyun.","Sergeant Lin shrugged and said, \"Well, it’s not like I can beat the General’s daughter too badly in front of so many people. You can come find me for a rematch whenever. However, I won’t go easy like I did today.\"","Afterward, Sergeant Lin left the stage, her eyes stopping at Yuan for a split second.","Mei Xiaoyun slowly exited the stage shortly after.","One would expect the recruits to receive medical treatment afterward, but most of them received no help and had to naturally recover, and only those who were beaten to the verge of death were treated.","By now, only a few people had not yet taken the stage, and they were all recruits who had shown impressive results during the trials.","Naturally, Yuan was one of them.","One...two...three more matches later, only Yuan and another recruit were left, and he was the one who finished second during the first trial.","\"Number 7,441!\"","\"Here!\"","Number 7,441 suddenly turned to look at Yuan and said, \"Just you watch! I will be the first to defeat a soldier today!\"","He entered the stage with enthusiasm the next moment, hoping to fight an elite soldier like Mei Xiaoyun, even if it would drastically lower his chances of winning.","However, his opponent turned out to be an ordinary soldier, leaving him disappointed and bitter.","A few minutes later, number 7,441 was beaten until he was unconscious and had to be carried off the stage.","Once Yuan was the only one remaining, every soldier present turned their attention to him.","Almost everyone there had witnessed Yuan’s performance during the trial, so they were aware of what he was capable of.","\"Number 42,011!\"","Hearing his number, Yuan entered the stage and calmly waited for his opponent to appear.","\"Who do you think will fight him?\"","\"Surely, it has to be another elite soldier.\"","The soldiers mumbled to each other while they waited.","Suddenly, a massive silhouette leaped onto the platform.","\"Heavens!\"","The soldiers exclaimed in shock upon seeing the figure, who stood nearly twice Yuan’s size.","However, it wasn’t the man’s size that shocked them.","Rather, it was the man’s identity.","\"C-Captain Gu?!\"","\"No way! Are they going to make a Captain fight a recruit?! This is unprecedented!\"","After all, the soldier standing on the stage was not just a mere elite soldier but someone who commanded them!"]},{"number":2588,"title":"Chapter 2588: Captain Gu(2)","paragraphs":["\"I’m Captain Gu, leader of the 3rd Company under the 7th Division,\" Captain Gu introduced himself shortly after making his appearance.","\"Yuan,\" Yuan responded with a simple, even lackluster introduction.","\"Before we begin, I have something to tell you. A proposal of sorts,\" Captain Gu suddenly said.","\"I’m not interested,\" Yuan rejected before even hearing it.","Knowing that the individual before him bore the surname ’Gu’, Yuan already knew that it was going to be some nonsense.","Captain Gu immediately frowned and said, \"You’re arrogant, but I don’t blame you. I would be too if I had your talents. However, no matter how talented you are, you won’t last long in the military with that attitude, especially toward those with a higher rank than you.\"","\"Anyway, you will listen to me regardless of whether you want to or not, as what I am about to say comes from a position way higher than mine.\"","\"If you’re going to say it, hurry up and say it already,\" Yuan sighed.","\"General Gu, who commands the Fifth to Eighth Division, has ordered you to join his division,\" said Captain Gu.","\"That’s not possible, since I have already promised to join General Mei’s division,\" Yuan calmly replied, admitting that he’d already made a deal with her.","\"Why aren’t they fighting? What are they talking about?\"","A formation had surrounded the arena the moment Captain Gu entered the stage, so the spectators were not able to hear their conversation.","Yet, many of them could guess what it was about.","\"Captain Gu’s probably trying to recruit him. There’s no way General Gu wouldn’t want a talented individual like him in his division, after all.\"","\"Right. He’s been anxious to find someone who can rival the monster under General Mei’s division.\"","\"I don’t blame him. The power dynamic in the military has shifted greatly since her appearance.\"","\"What did General Mei promise you?\" Captain Gu inquired before adding, \"Whatever she promised you, General Gu can double—even triple!\"","\"General Mei promised me her daughter,\" Yuan lied with a straight face.","\"...\"","His unexpected response left Captain Gu speechless, with a dumbfounded expression on his square face.","\"Just kidding,\" Yuan said a moment later.","\"YOU!\"","Feeling like he’d just been mocked, Captain Gu’s face quickly turned beet red.","Yuan continued, \"Regardless of what she promised me, it won’t change the fact that I am under a contract with her.\"","Captain Gu quickly controlled his emotions and replied, \"So what if you are under contract? There are ways to circumvent it depending on the details. For example, if you only promised to join her division, you can simply join her division and leave immediately afterward.\"","\"Even if you can’t, it’s not like you will die by breaking the contract, and General Gu will compensate you and more for your troubles. There is literally no disadvantage to joining him.\"","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent for a moment before asking, \"Why are you so desperate to recruit me?\"","\"What?\" Captain Gu frowned.","\"You heard me. Your desperation is so obvious and pitiful...\" Yuan shook his head.","\"Anyway, no matter what you offer me, I have no intention of joining your division.\"","Captain Gu trembled in anger and spoke in a low voice, \"This is your last chance, recruit... If you disobey General Gu’s order, you can kiss your career in the military goodbye. And if you think General Mei can save you... Even she won’t be able to stop us from destroying you.\"","\"I’ll give credit where it’s due... you’re persistent. However, I won’t be repeating myself, so do what you must,\" Yuan calmly replied.","\"Then don’t blame me for whatever happens after this point!\"","The next moment, Captain Gu leaped into the air before slamming his massive body at Yuan with the intention of flattening him.","Even without the usage of Limitless, Captain Gu was able to crack the platform and even create a small crater on it.","\"The fight is finally starting!\"","\"You rarely get to witness a Captain fight, too!\"","Yuan, who had moved away almost instantly after Captain Gu acted, dodged the attack with ease.","\"How dangerous. Are you trying to kill me?\" Yuan asked, even though he already knew Captain Gu’s intentions.","Captain Gu ignored him entirely and continued his relentless assault, his eyes brimming with unmistakable killing intent.","’If he refuses to join us... Kill him!’","General Gu’s command resounded inside Captain Gu’s mind repeatedly like a broken record.","\"Hmm...\"","Despite Captain Gu’s clear killing intent and aggressive attacks, Yuan remained calm and avoided all attacks with seemingly no effort.","\"I don’t know how high your position is within the military, but your combat experience is worse than those two in Gaia’s Sanctum,\" he remarked.","\"Hell, it’s even worse than some of the ordinary soldiers who’d fought before you.\"","Yuan shook his head in disappointment.","\"Is everyone under General Gu this weak?\"","\"SHUT UP!\"","Captain Gu roared, his aura suddenly expanding.","\"Hm?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow at the sight of Limitless suddenly emerging from Captain Gu’s body.","Unbeknownst to Yuan, soldiers of a certain rank can temporarily unseal their cultivation, and as a Captain, Captain Gu could unleash his cultivation up to the Fourth Ascension.","\"Captain Gu?!\"","The spectators were shocked to see Captain Gu suddenly use Limitless.","Inside a certain private room, Mei Feng narrowed her eyes at the situation.","\"These dirty bastards!\" Someone else in the room cursed out loud. \"To think they would go as far as to kill him just to stop him from joining my division! They’ve gone too far!\"","\"General Mei! We need to stop them before it’s too late! There’s no way that recruit can handle a soldier using Limitless while being suppressed himself for long!\"","However, Mei Feng did not move from her seat and merely said, \"Let’s watch a little longer.\"","\"What?!\"","The others in the room were completely baffled by her lack of reaction, wondering how she could remain so calm in such a situation.","But in reality, Mei Feng was anything but calm."]},{"number":2589,"title":"Chapter 2589: Captain Gu(3)","paragraphs":["Despite her calm appearance, Mei Feng was anything but calm. In fact, her heart was burning with fury.","’Even though he has the Perfected Heavenly Refinement physique, he won’t be able to deal with a Fourth Ascension cultivator without using Limitless. Not to mention, his opponent is a Captain,’ Mei Feng thought to herself.","However, something in her gut told her not to worry about Yuan.","’He’s far too calm...’ Mei Feng narrowed her eyes at Yuan’s nonchalant expression, giving her the impression that he was not worried about Captain Gu in the slightest.","Although that did not completely alleviate her concern about the situation, it was enough to help her to not freak out about the situation.","\"General... Are you sure we should just sit here and do nothing?\"","Meanwhile, her comrades viewed the situation differently, mistaking Yuan’s calmness for shock.","Mei Feng shook her head and said, \"Did you really think that I would let such a prominent recruit participate in the recruitment without supervision? I knew General Gu would do something, but even I could’ve never anticipated he would do something this bold. He won’t die, at the very least, so you can all relax.\"","\"If you say so...\"","They sat back down and continued watching the events unfold.","On the stage, Yuan smiled.","\"I didn’t know the soldiers could use their cultivation for this,\" he remarked.","Of course, they were not allowed to use their cultivation, but Yuan already knew that.","\"Now you do!\" Captain Gu shouted as he charged at Yuan, his speed several times faster than before.","\"Now this is a little more entertaining,\" Yuan chuckled, still somehow managing to react and dodge Captain Gu’s attacks.","\"Stop running away like a cockroach and fight me!\" Captain Gu roared.","\"Fight you? Without being able to use Limitless? You might as well tell me to jump off a bridge—not that it would kill me.\"","Yuan continued dodging Captain Gu left and right, which left the spectators speechless.","\"What the fuck is that idiot doing?!\" General Gu slammed his desk in anger upon witnessing Captain Gu’s humiliating performance.","\"How hard is it to take care of a single recruit?! He’s even using his cultivation!\"","\"Well... in Captain Gu’s defense, he cannot make it too obvious, or—\"","The individual who had just spoken hastily closed their mouth when General Gu suddenly glared at them with a cold, dangerous gaze.","One minute... two minutes... five minutes...","Soon, the amount of time Yuan and Captain Gu spent on the stage surpassed that of any of the recruits before them, and as Captain Gu’s embarrassment grew for not being able to hit Yuan, he stopped caring about concealing his intentions and began using Limitless for real.","\"C-Captain Gu’s using his Limitless without restraint now! This is my first time seeing such a serious fight during the recruitment!\"","\"Because as far as I am aware, it has never happened before...\"","\"I thought we weren’t allowed to use our cultivation for this...?\" Someone who had participated before mumbled out loud.","\"Well, nobody is stopping them, so Captain Gu must have received permission.\"","\"Even so, I think they are going overboard...\"","\"I think so, too. Captain Gu is fighting like he wants to kill that recruit.\"","\"I don’t blame them. That recruit is a freaking monster.\"","The spectators were divided over the situation. Some felt Captain Gu was taking things too far, while others believed such measures were necessary to deal with someone as powerful as Yuan.","\"Unbelievable...\" The soldiers in Mei Feng’s private room were bewildered by Yuan’s performance.","\"Just where in heaven’s name did he learn to fight like that?!\"","\"Those movements are something you can only learn through experience and an unfathomable amount of time... but he doesn’t look anywhere old enough to have even half of such experience!\"","While everyone was baffled by his combat capabilities, Yuan was starting to get bored with the whole thing and wondered how he should handle the situation.","’Should I just defeat him?’ he wondered inwardly.","But after some consideration, he decided not to do anything that would draw more unnecessary attention to himself, especially since he already had a target on his back.","If he defeated Captain Gu right now, he would have to deal with those in an even higher position, which would only make things more complicated.","’There are still many things I need to achieve in the military, so it would be unwise to offend too many people now.’","After sighing inwardly, Yuan suddenly pretended to stumble, deliberately leaving himself open.","Captain Gu did not miss the opportunity and immediately took advantage of it.","\"DIE!\"","The next moment, Captain Gu drove his fist into Yuan’s stomach—or at least, that was how it appeared to the spectators—sending Yuan flying off the stage and crashing into the crowd.","However, despite being certain that he had struck Yuan, Captain Gu could not shake the feeling that something was wrong.","’I need to make sure he’s actually dead!’","Without hesitation, Captain Gu leaped off the stage and launched another attack at Yuan, who lay unconscious among the crowd.","\"?!\"","The soldiers surrounding Yuan were stunned by Captain Gu’s actions, yet not a single one of them dared to intervene—not that they could do anything without their cultivation.","However, just before Captain Gu could reach Yuan, someone appeared before him like a ghost, catching his fist that would’ve directly smashed Yuan’s head into a bloody mess.","\"What do you think you’re doing?!\" Captain Gu immediately turned to look at the individual who stopped him.","\"I should be asking you that question, Captain Gu. Why are you still attacking him, even though he’s clearly unconscious? Are you actually trying to kill him?\" A woman’s voice responded to him.","\"Y-You are—!\" Captain Gu’s eyes widened with surprise when he finally realized who had blocked his attack. \"What the hell are you doing here? I thought you left for a mission!\"","\"I was on a mission, but I already completed it,\" she calmly responded.","\"You completed a mission that was estimated to take over a year in just a month?! That’s outrageous!\" Captain Gu exclaimed in disbelief."]},{"number":2590,"title":"Chapter 2590: End of the Military Recruitment","paragraphs":["\"Outrageous or not, it doesn’t change the fact that I have completed the mission,\" said the woman.","\"You—\"","\"If you insist on continuing this fight, I’ll be more than happy to take his place,\" she interrupted as Captain Gu opened his mouth. \"Or do you only prefer opponents who are unconscious?\"","Captain Gu gritted his teeth in frustration, but there was nothing he could do in this situation.","Not only was it no longer possible for him to kill Yuan without ruining his career in the military, but he had utterly no chance of defeating the woman standing before him.","With no other choice, Captain Gu pulled back his arm and said, \"It’s just a misunderstanding. I wasn’t actually going to hit him. I just wanted to see if he was faking it.\"","Without elaborating further, Captain Gu turned around and quickly left the scene.","The woman didn’t pursue things further and immediately went to pick Yuan up, taking him away.","Some time later, Yuan slowly opened his eyes to find himself lying on a bed in a quiet room.","Of course, he was conscious the entire time, but pretended to be asleep until he was finally alone.","’That was...’","Although Yuan didn’t get to see the face of the individual who stopped Captain Gu, as she’d immediately left after bringing him to the room, he recognized her just from her voice alone.","Suddenly, he heard the door to the room being opened.","When he turned to the sound, he could see two figures entering the room.","One of them was Mei Xiaoyun, and the other was Mei Feng.","\"Are you okay?\" Mei Xiaoyun asked him.","Yuan nodded with a smile, \"I’m not hurt in the slightest.\"","\"You know you won’t die if you stop acting tough for a second, right?\" Mei Feng sighed while shaking her head.","Yuan chuckled.","\"I am being serious, though. I know it looked brutal, but his attack didn’t even land on me.\"","Yuan patted his stomach aggressively to show them he was perfectly fine.","He then asked, \"So, what happens now? Are you going to punish that soldier for attempting to kill me?\"","An apologetic expression appeared on Mei Feng’s face as she responded, \"Unfortunately, it’s not that simple. Not only is he a Captain, but he’s also General Gu’s nephew. Not to mention the trial in itself is meant to rough up the recruits.\"","\"But he used Limitless during the fight, and as far as I am aware, that’s not allowed. Surely, you can punish him for that,\" Mei Xiaoyun said.","Mei Feng shook her head. \"Actually, there is no explicit rule prohibiting the use of Limitless during the fight.\"","\"No way... so we’re just going to let him get away with almost killing him?\" Mei Xiaoyun frowned.","Yuan then said, \"That’s perfect.\"","\"What?\"","The two ladies turned to look at him, their eyebrows raised, puzzled by his words.","\"There’s no need to punish him because I will do that myself,\" he elaborated.","\"What do you intend to do to him?\" Mei Feng asked with a slight frown, looking concerned.","\"Nothing... at least not right now,\" he shrugged.","Mei Feng rubbed her eyes and sighed aloud, \"Forget it. I don’t care what you do as long as you don’t kill him.\"","\"Anyway, with the recruitment done, you’ve officially joined the military and are a soldier now.\"","\"Never thought I’d join the military again...\" Yuan muttered in a low voice, his eyes suddenly full of nostalgia as he recalled his life in the military as Tian Xian, even though it was vastly different from his current situation.","\"You’ve been in the military before?\" Mei Xiaoyun asked, looking confused.","\"Yes, in my original world.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Mei Feng turned to look at Mei Xiaoyun and said to her, \"Go outside for a bit. I need some time alone with him.\"","Mei Xiaoyun nodded and left without question.","Once they were alone, Mei Feng said to Yuan, \"Now that you’re a soldier, let’s get some things straight.\"","\"First, regardless of your capabilities, you must obey anyone with a higher rank than you. Even though we’ve only spoken a few times, I have a good grasp of your personality, and if you want to stay in the military for long enough to learn about Gaia, you must obey our rules.\"","\"I will do my best,\" Yuan replied.","\"Second, because of your performance during the recruitment, you have been granted an exemption from the mandatory year-long boot camp that every new recruit must complete, allowing you to skip it entirely and begin serving as a soldier immediately.\"","\"Furthermore, for hitting the 10,000-meter target during the third trial, you’ve been granted an entire month’s worth of leave that you can use at any time. This is something that would normally take an ordinary soldier five whole years to accumulate.\"","\"For hitting the 20,000-meter target, you will be able to request personal training from an elite soldier, so someone at the rank of Sergeant.\"","\"As for hitting the 40,000-meter target, you will receive a direct promotion to the rank of Private First Class. Everyone starts out at the lowest rank, Private, upon joining the military, and it can take anywhere between two and five years to be promoted to Private First Class, depending on their merits.\"","\"Now then... You also broke the records for every trial during the recruitment. In recognition of such an extraordinary achievement, the military has decided to grant you another direct promotion—to the rank of Corporal, a position that normally takes ten years to reach after becoming a Private First Class.\"","\"Any questions so far?\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"I believe you are missing one more reward.\"","His gaze turned to look at the door behind her, or more precisely, at Mei Xiaoyun, who was standing outside.","Mei Feng sighed. \"Don’t worry, I haven’t forgotten about our deal. I’ll reward you for persuading her to join the military, but it will take some time to prepare. And since I want to keep it a surprise, I won’t tell you until then.\""]},{"number":2591,"title":"Chapter 2591: General Gu","paragraphs":["\"Now that I am in the military... what am I supposed to do next? How do I gain more credentials?\" Yuan asked.","\"Although you’ve passed the recruitment, you’re technically still not a soldier—at least not until the ceremony and you receive your insignia. Once you become a soldier, your credentials will automatically increase as you increase your rank and gain merits,\" said Mei Feng.","\"When is the ceremony?\"","\"In a week. Until then, you will need to take some classes, which will tell you more about our world.\"","\"Does that mean you believe my true origins?\" Yuan asked with a smile.","\"I think your existence is otherworldly, and I will leave it at that,\" she calmly replied.","\"Good enough, I guess.\"","\"Now, about which division you’ll be joining... I command the First to the Fourth Division, so you can join any of these four. General Gu commands the Fifth to Eighth Division, so keep that in mind when you meet soldiers from his division.\"","\"Speaking of General Gu... Do you think he’ll give up on trying to recruit me? Or rather, will he stop trying to kill me because I refused to join his division? He clearly intends to and has already attempted to kill me because of it,\" Yuan asked.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Mei Feng responded in a weird tone, \"As much as I want to assure you of your safety, I cannot do that with a clear conscience. However, I will try my best to get General Gu off your back. I will also have a few people guard you for the time being.\"","\"Thanks.\"","\"It’s too early to thank me,\" she sighed. \"But if you really want to thank someone, you can thank the one who saved you.\"","\"I would if I could. Where did she go? She left before I could thank her,\" Yuan said.","\"She’s a busy woman, but I’m sure you’ll get to meet her again soon.\"","\"I’m sure we will...\"","\"In any case, a nurse will be coming to check on you soon.\"","\"I’m fine, though.\"","\"That’s for the nurse to decide.\"","\"We’ll talk more later,\" Mei Feng said to him before leaving the room.","A few moments later, the door opened again, and Mei Xiaoyun entered the room.","\"My mother left, but she told me to stay with you until your nurse and bodyguards show up,\" she said before Yuan could speak up.","\"To think I’d need bodyguards the moment I joined the military. This place is pretty messed up for somewhere that’s supposed to be orderly.\" Yuan shook his head with a bittersweet smile.","\"It wasn’t always like this...\" Mei Xiaoyun sighed.","\"Let me guess. It all started after General Gu appeared.\"","\"Not just General Gu. The Gu Family in general. They are one of the most powerful families in the world, with authority and reach in nearly every corner of the world. They started in the business scene, but I guess they weren’t satisfied with whatever they had and wanted to control the military, too.\"","\"Is that so?\"","A few minutes later, the nurse arrived at the room and started examining Yuan’s body.","\"Huh? I heard you were struck quite heavily during the recruitment, but there don’t seem to be any injuries on your body,\" remarked the nurse, looking confused by the situation.","\"They were exaggerating,\" Yuan said with a calm smile.","\"Well... as long as you’re fine, but just in case, let me double-check.\"","The nurse proceeded to examine Yuan again. Once she was certain that he was not hurt, she signed out and left the room.","\"I heard we need to take classes until our ceremony next week.\"","Mei Xiaoyun nodded and said, \"The classes will start tomorrow. They briefed us after you were taken away, and they said that we’ll be assigned to our own residents later today.\"","Some time later, someone knocked on the door.","\"Is Corporal Yuan inside?\" A voice questioned from outside.","\"I am. Did Mei—General Mei send you here?\" Yuan asked.","\"Indeed.\"","\"Come inside.\"","The next moment, two soldiers entered the room.","Yuan raised an eyebrow after seeing these two soldiers. One of them was a man who looked like Hong Xiuquan, and the other was a woman who resembled Wang Bingbing.","\"I’m Sergeant Quang.\"","\"Sergeant Bing. We were assigned to be your bodyguard by General Mei.\"","\"Nice to meet you,\" Yuan said.","\"I don’t know who you are, but you must be fairly important to General Mei if she made two Elite Soldiers guard you,\" said Sergeant Bing.","\"Did you not watch the recruitment?\" Sergeant Quang asked her with raised eyebrows.","\"No.\"","\"This guy’s the top performer. Not only that, but he broke every single record held by the Ironwoman.\"","\"What?! That’s impossible!\" Sergeant Bing exclaimed in disbelief before turning to stare at Yuan with wide eyes.","\"Ironwoman?\" Yuan inquired.","\"The woman who saved you. That’s what we all call her since we don’t know her actual name.\"","\"Huh? You don’t know her name? That’s possible in the military?\" Mei Xiaoyun remarked, surprised.","\"It’s possible to hide your identity in the military if you have enough influence,\" said Sergeant Bing, and she continued, \"So she’s definitely from a powerful family.\"","\"And the military is fine with that?\" Yuan asked.","Sergeant Quang shrugged and said, \"Nobody cares as long as she does her duties as a soldier. And it’s not like nobody knows her identity. The higher-ups are aware, and that’s all that really matters.\"","\"Anyway, are you okay? Can you leave the infirmary yet?\"","Yuan nodded. \"The nurse said I can leave whenever.\"","\"Then we’ll take you to your living quarters.\"","Sergeant Bing looked at Mei Xiaoyun and added, \"General Mei also told us to show you your living quarters.\"","\"Okay...\"","While Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun followed Sergeant Bing and Sergeant Quang to their living quarters, Mei Feng approached a room that was guarded by two soldiers.","\"General Mei, what are you doing—\"","\"Scram,\" she interrupted. \"I have some business with General Gu.\"","\"I’m afraid that’s not—\"","Before the soldier could even finish his sentence, Mei Feng grabbed him by the collar and tossed him to the other end of the hallway.","\"What do you think you’re—?!\"","The other soldier reacted instinctively and reached for her, but instantly froze when Mei Feng’s gaze shifted to him.","\"E-Even if you’re the General, you can’t be doing this...\"","\"And what are you going to do? Report me to the higher-ups?\"","\"...\"","The soldier became speechless.","Suddenly, General Gu’s voice resounded from inside the room.","\"Let her in,\" he said.","Without another word, Mei Feng walked past the soldiers and entered the room.","At the other end, General Gu was calmly sitting behind his desk.","\"You’re here much faster than I anticipated,\" he calmly said.","\"If you knew that I would come here, then you must also know why I am here,\" she said.","\"I wouldn’t be too sure about that.\"","\"Let’s cut the bullshit. You tried to kill my recruit because you couldn’t get your hands on him.\" Mei Feng narrowed her eyes at him.","\"That’s a serious accusation, General Mei. Do you have any proof? I admit my nephew went a little overboard during the match, but he believed that level of force was necessary to teach such an anomaly a lesson. Moreover, nothing he did was against the rules, and that includes wielding Limitless.\"","Mei Feng sneered in disdain before responding, \"You can spew all the bullshit you want, but if anything happens to my recruit, I will not just come for you, but your entire family.\"","\"...\"","A stunned look appeared on General Gu’s face for a moment before he burst out laughing.","\"Are you really threatening me... my family? What can you possibly do to me with your puny little family, let alone my empire? You may be a General, but you have no power outside of the military!\"","\"Is that what you truly believe?\" Mei Feng chuckled. \"In that case, you know less about me than I thought. How surprising.\"","The smile on General Gu’s face quickly faded, replaced by a frown. However, before he could say anything, Mei Feng continued, \"You may bear the same rank as me, but you’re nowhere near being my equal, General Gu—not that I need to tell you, since I’m sure you’re already aware of this.\"","\"What did you say, you fucking bitch?!\" General Gu slammed his desk as he stood up in anger.","Mei Feng burst out laughing at his reaction. \"Don’t tell me you actually believe you’re my equal. Without your family’s influence, I doubt you would have even reached the rank of Major, let alone General!\"","\"Still, you’re free to prove me wrong. Instead of trying to steal my recruits, go find your own. If your Gu Family is truly as almighty as you claim, you shouldn’t have any trouble finding a few decent talents.\"","\"That’s all I have to say to you today.\"","With that, Mei Feng turned and walked toward the door. Just before opening it, she added, \"I won’t warn you again. If I find out you’re going after Yuan again, I’ll end you.\"","Once Mei Feng left, General Gu sat back down with a sinister expression on his face.","\"There are plenty of ways to kill someone and make it appear to be an accident...\" he mumbled to himself. \"I will make you regret threatening and belittling me today, Mei Feng!\"","Meanwhile, Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun arrived at their living quarters.","\"Normally, new recruits will live at the barracks and share rooms with several others, but as a Corporal and the top performer in the recruitment, you get to live in the same area as the Sergeants and have a building all to yourself,\" said Sergeant Quang.","\"I’m not a Corporal, though,\" Mei Xiaoyun said.","\"No, but you’re General Mei’s daughter,\" said Sergeant Bing.","\"I never asked for special treatment.\" Mei Xiaoyun frowned.","Sergeant Bing shrugged.","\"If you have any complaints, feel free to take them up with your mother. She was the one who arranged your living quarters.\"","\"...\""]},{"number":2592,"title":"Chapter 2592: The Military’s Purpose","paragraphs":["Shortly after being brought to their new living quarters, Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun said goodbye to each other before entering their new home.","Since there was nothing to do, they rested for the rest of the day.","The following day, Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun were led to the classroom, where all the new soldiers would spend the next several days learning about the military’s purpose.","\"You know that monster who fought with a Captain during the recruitment? I heard that he received a special promotion to the rank of Corporal for his performance.\"","\"Imagine starting out one right below an elite soldier... how envious.\"","\"Not just that, but he doesn’t even have to participate in the training that we all must.\"","\"Did you not see how he performed during the recruitment? A prodigy like that doesn’t need training and deserves whatever special treatment they throw at him!\"","The soldiers in the room had been discussing Yuan long before he arrived. The moment he entered, however, their conversations ceased as they stared at him in silence, their gazes filled with awe and, in some cases, envy.","Yet despite their curiosity and desire to approach him, no one dared to do so, mainly because of the two elite soldiers standing nearby and Mei Xiaoyun’s presence.","\"So that’s the General’s daughter... I wonder what their relationship is.\"","\"I was told that it was her mother who found and recruited him.\"","\"And who gave you that information?\"","\"My father... who is also a Captain.\"","Some time later, the class instructor entered the room and introduced himself, \"I am Sergeant Mu, and I will be your instructor for the next several days.\"","’Xi Murong...’ Yuan thought to himself as he recognized the instructor’s face.","By now, he’d met pretty much everyone in the Demon Sealing Faction with one exception.","\"Before we talk about the military’s purpose and your responsibilities as a soldier, let’s talk about the history of the military.\"","\"The military was created 2,000 years ago by a certain individual.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow when he heard this information.","’Huh? The military is only 2,000 years old? That can’t be right...’","After all, it seemed too young for such an advanced civilization.","\"Does anyone know who created the military?\" Sergeant Mu proceeded to question them.","Immediately, half of the room raised their hands.","When one of them was called upon, they answered, \"Gaia!\"","\"???\"","Yuan turned around to look at the one who’d just spoken with widen eyes.","’Gaia created the military?!’ he cried inwardly.","Yuan almost didn’t believe his ears. He could’ve never anticipated that, besides the system, Gaia would also be responsible for the creation of the military.","\"Correct. Gaia created not only the system that shaped our society today, but also the military,\" Sergeant Mu said.","\"Now then... who is Gaia?\"","Yuan’s ears immediately perked at this question, as he’d been wondering about Gaia’s identity ever since he learned of their existence.","Fewer people raised their hands this time, but there were still quite a few who knew the answer, which was much more than Yuan anticipated.","’I thought information on Gaia was top secret...’ he sighed inwardly.","Unbeknownst to him, the people with their hands raised were already connected to the military one way or another before they joined, so they possessed information that ordinary civilians did not.","\"You.\"","Sergeant Mu pointed at one of the soldiers at random.","\"Gaia is the Prophet!\" the soldier said in full confidence of their answer.","\"...\"","’A Prophet...?’ Yuan rubbed his eyes, immediately recalling how the first Celestial Emperor used the same tactics to take control of the world.","\"Indeed, Gaia is known as the Prophet.\" Sergeant Mu confirmed.","No longer able to remain silent, Yuan raised his hand and said, \"I have a question.\"","\"You are...\" Sergeant Mu narrowed his eyes at Yuan.","\"Corporal Yuan, correct? I’ve heard a lot about you. I usually don’t accept questions until the next, but go ahead.\"","\"What does it mean to be the Prophet? Does Gaia speak with ’God’ and relay their message to us?\" he asked.","\"God?\" Sergeant Mu raised his eyebrows, looking entertained by Yuan’s question.","\"What is a God?\"","Rather than Sergeant Mu, someone else in the room asked aloud.","’Does the concept of God not exist in this world or something?’ Yuan wondered to himself.","Sergeant Mu then said, \"I don’t know what you mean by ’God’, but as the Prophet, Gaia has the ability to speak to the universe.\"","\"The universe...? Can you elaborate?\" Yuan asked, looking puzzled by the response.","\"Unfortunately, I cannot.\" Sergeant Mu shook his head.","\"There are many things that even I’m not privy to. If you wish to learn more, you’ll have to climb the ranks and earn the necessary credentials.\"","\"Anyway, let’s move on to the next subject—the purpose of the military.\"","After taking a deep breath, Sergeant Mu spoke with a solemn expression. \"I’m sure some of you are already aware of this, but the military’s purpose is to protect this world and its inhabitants. In other words, us.\"","The soldiers immediately began mumbling to each other, and it didn’t take long before someone remarked out loud, \"But that implies our world is in danger...\"","\"It’s not an implication. Our world is not safe. We are not safe.\"","\"What is threatening us?\" someone quickly asked.","\"Instead of just telling you, I want all of you to experience it yourself in the near future,\" said Sergeant Mu.","\"With that being said, we’re not in imminent danger. In fact, it might not even happen in our lifetime.\"","Yuan raised his eyebrows at Sergeant Mu’s words, which implied the military was preparing for something in the distant future.","\"Now then, let’s go over the military structure, starting with the ranks,\" Sergeant Mu continued calmly, as if he hadn’t just dropped a massive bomb on everyone.","\"From lowest to highest, the standard ranks begin with Private, which is where everyone here starts—with the exception of Corporal Yuan. After that come Private First Class, Corporal, and finally Sergeant, the highest standard rank.\""]},{"number":2593,"title":"Chapter 2593: Ninth Division","paragraphs":["\"Above Sergeant are Captain, Major, Colonel, and General. However, for most soldiers, Sergeant is the highest rank they can attain. The ranks above it belong to a separate class of military personnel that requires more than just time and merits to reach,\" Sergeant Mu continued.","\"Now let’s talk about the military’s organizational structure. It consists of nine main Divisions, each made up of its own Battalions, Companies, Platoons, and Squads.\"","\"Each Division has its own mission and area of expertise. For example, the First Division is combat-oriented, while the Second Division specializes in support. The Third Division focuses on logistics, and the Fourth Division specializes in intelligence gathering.\"","\"The Fifth through Eighth Divisions follow a similar structure, with the Fifth Division being combat-oriented, the Sixth specializing in support, and so on. In case you weren’t already aware, General Mei commands the First through Fourth Divisions, while General Gu oversees the latter four.\"","\"Even though we’re technically part of the same military, it often feels as though we’re divided into two factions, with both sides constantly competing against each other.\"","After a brief pause, Sergeant Mu added, \"I probably shouldn’t be telling you this, but you’ll all find out eventually, so...\"","A soldier suddenly raised their hands.","\"What is it?\"","\"Sergeant, what about the Ninth Division? If General Mei commands the First through Fourth and General Gu oversees the Fifth through Eighth, then who commands the Ninth?\"","\"That would be the Supreme General, the highest-ranking soldier in the military.\"","\"Who is the Supreme General?\"","Sergeant Mu shrugged.","\"No clue. Only those in the Ninth Division and the higher-ups know the Supreme General’s identity.\"","\"Then how does one join the Ninth Division?\"","\"You don’t.\" Sergeant Mu shook his head. \"You can apply to join any Division from the First to the Eighth after your year-long training, but the Ninth Division is by invitation only.\"","\"Is it possible to be rejected by a Division?\" Someone then asked.","\"Of course, but such cases are rare.\"","\"What happens if you’re rejected from all Divisions?\"","\"I would like to know too, since it has never happened before.\"","Some time later—","\"Let’s talk about your year-long training, or what we call boot camp. Everyone here—except Corporal Yuan, once again—will be required to partake in training at the end of the classes. During the training, you will be taught how to fight properly, as well as other skills you will require to flourish in the military.\"","Sergeant Mu proceeded to spend the next two hours talking about the training and what they can expect.","\"Alright, that will be all for today’s classes. We will resume class tomorrow at the same time. You are all dismissed.\"","Sergeant Mu left the classroom immediately after dismissing them, and the soldiers swiftly left, returning to their living quarters since they were still not allowed to roam the military base.","As Yuan followed Sergeant Bing and Sergeant Quang back to his living quarters, he asked them, \"When will we learn about the sirens and the reason why everyone has to enter the underground?\"","\"You won’t learn about that until after boot camp,\" said Sergeant Quang. \"However, since you won’t be participating in that and are already a Corporal, you will learn about it after the ceremony.\"","\"I don’t get it.\" Yuan suddenly said.","\"What do you mean?\"","\"Why is the military so restrictive with information? If the world is truly in danger, what’s the point of keeping everyone in the dark?\"","Sergeant Bing shrugged, \"Don’t ask me. I am merely following the rules.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes.","’Something feels off about this...’ he thought.","’Why are they withholding such important information? I could understand keeping civilians in the dark to prevent mass panic, but why hide it from their own soldiers as well?’","’No... what if they have no choice but to hide it? If the information is dangerous, then everything makes sense!’","A look of realization appeared on Yuan’s face.","’There is a good chance that this information is related to Eternals, and the reason they’re not revealing it to everyone is that doing so would harm them!’","Since he experienced first-hand what it was like to learn about Eternals, Yuan understood the military’s decision to hide such information from everyone.","’Looks like I have no choice but to climb the ranks if I want to learn more...’ he sighed inwardly.","The next day, Yuan returned to the classroom.","\"Today, we’ll discuss the rules—rules that every soldier must follow, regardless of rank,\" Sergeant Mu said.","\"There are many, but the most important one to remember is that all information concerning the military is strictly classified and must never be shared with civilians.\"","\"I’m aware that some of you come from military families and may have heard certain things from your relatives, but most of that is already public knowledge. The information I’m referring to is what you’ll learn during training and after becoming full-fledged soldiers.\"","\"If you’re caught sharing classified information, the punishment can be death, so keep that in mind.\"","For the next several hours, Sergeant Mu would go over many rules of the military, including the unspoken ones.","\"That’s all for today. Tomorrow, we will talk about the base and its facilities.\"","After Sergeant Mu left, the soldiers immediately started complaining to each other.","\"Man, these classes are so boring. I’d rather we just start training immediately.\"","\"If you knew what boot camp would be like, you wouldn’t be uttering such foolish words.\"","\"What is it like? Tell me.\"","\"And spoil the fun? Nah.\"","Time continued to pass, and several days of classes later—","\"That concludes your classroom instruction,\" said Sergeant Mu at the end of class. \"Tomorrow, you will all begin boot camp. If you have any questions, you can ask the instructors there.\"","He then turned to look at Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun and said, \"Corporal Yuan. Private Mei. General Mei has called for you two. Head to her office after this.\"","\"Yes, Sergeant.\"","Some time later, Sergeant Bing and Sergeant Quang escorted them to General Mei’s office."]},{"number":2594,"title":"Chapter 2594: Joining the First Division","paragraphs":["Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun stood calmly before Mei Feng in her office.","\"How’s everything so far?\" she asked them, her gaze mostly on Yuan.","\"Boring,\" Yuan answered without hesitation.","\"Not surprising, considering you’ve just finished your classes.\"","\"When is the ceremony? I thought it was supposed to happen after the classes,\" he then said.","\"It will happen right before the others are sent to training. Although you won’t need to participate in the training, you still need to be present for the ceremony.\"","\"Why did you call us here?\" Mei Xiaoyun asked.","\"Are you in a rush to be somewhere?\" Mei Feng remarked.","\"...\"","When Mei Xiaoyun fell silent, Mei Feng turned to look at Yuan and asked, \"Have you decided which Division you want to join?\"","\"Whichever Division will help me rank up and gain credentials the fastest.\"","\"In that case, you’d want to join the First Division. They are always the first to be considered for missions. Moreover, with your combat expertise, I also think it’s the most benefiting place for you.\"","\"The First Division it is, then.\"","\"A quick warning. The soldiers of the First Division tend to be more arrogant and prideful than those of the other Divisions because of their abilities. Since you’re both new and received a rapid promotion, you may run into some trouble during your first few months. Just don’t let it bother you,\" Mei Feng warned.","\"Are you asking me to ignore them?\" Yuan remarked with a playful smile.","\"To the best of your abilities,\" she nodded.","\"You should also be aware that although I command the First through Fourth Divisions, not everyone under me will be friendly. Some of them are even aligned with General Gu, so it would be wise to avoid unnecessary conflicts whenever possible.\"","\"I’ll do my best, but if it comes down to it, I’ll defend myself.\"","Mei Feng nodded before clarifying, \"I’m not asking you to sit there and take it. I simply don’t want you drawing any more attention than you already have.\"","Mei Feng then turned to Mei Xiaoyun. \"I won’t ask why you suddenly changed your mind about joining the military, but if you ever need anything, speak to Sergeant Quang or Sergeant Bing. They’ll do their best to accommodate you.\"","Mei Xiaoyun narrowed her eyes slightly. \"I don’t want any special treatment.\"","\"As much as I’d like to leave you alone, it doesn’t change the fact that you’re my daughter, and as long as you’re in the military, there will always be people who try to take advantage of you—or use you to get to me. In a way, you’re in even more danger than Yuan.\"","Mei Xiaoyun silently sighed at Mei Feng’s words. Even without being told, she was already aware of her own situation.","\"I considered removing you from training, but ultimately decided against it. However, if anything happens, I’ll pull you out immediately. Understood?\" Mei Feng said a moment later.","\"I understand...\"","\"Now, back to you...\" Mei Feng returned to looking at Yuan.","\"After the ceremony tomorrow, come back here. I still have more things to tell you.\"","\"I understand.\"","Yuan and Mei Xiaoyun were escorted back to their living quarters, where they remained for the rest of the day.","The following morning, they were escorted to a spacious area, where every new soldier received their insignia after swearing the military’s creed.","As the highest rank of all the new soldiers, Yuan received his insignia last.","After receiving his insignia, Yuan had to place his hand into a portal machine.","<You have been enlisted into the military>","<You have been promoted to the rank of Corporal>","<Your Credential Rank has increased>","<Your status has updated>","[Name: Yuan]","[Age: ???]","[Cultivation: Ninth Level Fifth Ascension]","[Military Rank: Corporal]","[Physique: Inexhaustible Heavenly Refinement]","[Credential Rank: 4]","[Cultivation Speed: 6]","Once everyone had received their insignias, all of the soldiers except Yuan were ordered to form a formation and march to their new training grounds, where they would spend the next year.","\"See you later,\" Yuan said to Mei Xiaoyun.","\"See you in a year... if nothing happens between that time, that is,\" she said.","\"Let’s not jinx it.\" Yuan chuckled. \"And I’m sure your mother will have someone watch over you during training, even if she didn’t mention it.\"","Yuan remained until Mei Xiaoyun and the other soldiers vanished into the horizon.","\"Let’s go see General Mei again,\" Yuan said to Sergeant Bing and Sergeant Quang.","Some time later, Yuan stood before Mei Feng again.","\"First and foremost, let me congratulate you on officially joining the military,\" she said to him as she retrieved a piece of paper, placing it on the desk before her.","\"Once you sign this, you’ll also officially join the First Division, as well as complete our contract. Any questions before you do?\"","\"I do, but I doubt you’ll answer them even if I asked.\"","\"If it’s related to Gaia, I cannot answer them.\"","\"Then can you tell me about the sirens and the underground city? It’s the first thing I experienced after coming to this world, and I still have no idea why it happened.\"","\"Sure, I can explain that, since it’s something you should know at your rank, but only after you sign this.\"","Yuan signed the documents a moment later.","\"Great. Now you’re officially part of the First Division.\"","<Ding!>","<You have joined the First Division>","<You have fulfilled the conditions of your contract with Mei Feng>","\"Now, about your question...\"","\"I’m sure you’ve already learned this during your class, but our world is in danger.\"","\"Yes, but I was not given any details.\"","\"Because it’s for your safety. If this information is something we can reveal freely, we would’ve already done so long ago. Unfortunately, that is not the case.\"","\"Is it because this information is harmful? That it could literally kill?\" Yuan asked.","Mei Feng narrowed her eyes at such words, a look of surprise in them.","\"Where did you learn this information?\" she asked him in a wary tone.","Yuan shrugged and said, \"I am dealing with something similar in my world.\"","He continued, \"Since I am already in the loop, you might as well tell me everything.\"","\"That’s not how things work,\" she swiftly responded. \"Even if you know the reason we cannot reveal such information, it doesn’t change the fact that you don’t qualify to learn it.\"","\"And how does one qualify? Let me guess... through my Credential Rank.\"","Mei Feng nodded. \"The credential system isn’t merely used to measure an individual’s clearance and trustworthiness. It also determines whether they’re capable of handling the information. You have no idea how many people have died from learning something they weren’t supposed to learn.\"","\"If you say so,\" said Yuan. \"Let’s return to the subject. Why is this world in danger?\"","\"Because that’s what Gaia told us.\"","\"Gaia told you the world is in danger...?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, looking puzzled.","\"So you’ve spoken to Gaia before?\"","\"Of course. What kind of question is that?\" Mei Feng stared at him with a weird expression.","\"How do you speak to Gaia?\"","\"I don’t understand your question.\"","\"It’s exactly as it sounds. How do you speak to them? Through the system? In person?\"","\"Obviously, we speak to Gaia through the system. However, it’s also possible to speak to them in person, albeit much rarer.\"","\"Is Gaia... human?\" Yuan swallowed nervously before asking.","\"What else would they be? An animal?\" Mei Feng shook her head at his bizarre questions.","’So a human created Gaia’s System...?’ Yuan thought to himself after learning this new information.","’No... It’s also entirely possible that it’s an Eternal disguised as a human. If I want to know the truth, I will have to meet them in person.’","\"Then how does one meet Gaia?\" he then asked.","\"You don’t... at least not in your current state. If you want to even have a chance of meeting Gaia, you’ll need at least Credential Rank 8.\"","\"What a pain in the ass,\" Yuan sighed out loud.","\"Gaia is literally the most important individual in this world. There’s no way we’d let you meet them just because you want to.\"","\"Even though Gaia told me to find them?\" Yuan asked.","\"Huh?\" Mei Feng’s eyes widened at his words, looking baffled by it.","\"You heard that right. Gaia asked me to find them through the system.\"","\"Even if you say that, there’s no proof. Moreover, if Gaia really wants to meet you, they would’ve summoned you already. Anyways, enough about this subject.\"","Mei Feng then said, \"According to Gaia, this world will be under attack in the near future by powerful beings from beyond our sky.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes, immediately connecting these beings to Eternals.","\"How will they attack?\" Yuan asked a moment later.","\"They will invade our world and enslave us, using humans for their experiments.\"","\"...\"","\"You don’t look surprised,\" Mei Feng remarked, noticing Yuan’s lack of reaction.","Most people who first learned of the prophecy reacted with shock or fear, but Yuan gave the impression that he already knew or had been expecting it.","\"Should I be surprised?\" Yuan shrugged before asking, \"Did Gaia reveal when they will attack this world?\"","\"No... but it will happen soon.\" Mei Feng sighed.","\"And when they attack, this entire world will be engulfed in flames, hence why we created the underground city.\"","\"So the sirens and escaping underground... It’s just a practice drill for when the real thing happens? I heard that it would sometimes last for years at a time.\"","\"That’s correct.\" Mei Feng confirmed. \"When the real attack happens, we will likely spend decades, if not longer, underground at a time, so it’s for the best that we start early and familiarize ourselves with such a lifestyle.\""]},{"number":2595,"title":"Chapter 2595: Gravity Room","paragraphs":["\"What about the soldiers? I can assume that we won’t go underground like the civilians, right?\" Yuan asked after learning the truth.","Mei Feng nodded and said, \"Obviously. Who else will fight the invaders if not us? You’ll experience it yourself soon, too. The training drill, that is.\"","\"I can’t wait.\" Yuan smiled.","\"Anyway, let’s get to the main reason I called you here today.\"","Mei Feng’s expression suddenly turned serious.","\"This may seem sudden, but I am going to give you a mission. I know you just joined, and most new soldiers don’t receive their first mission until their second year in the military, but you want fast promotions, right?\"","He nodded.","\"Of course. What kind of mission is it?\"","\"Clearing trash outside the city.\"","\"...Excuse me?\" Yuan muttered, his eyebrows raised in a puzzled manner.","\"It’s not literal trash. You’ll understand once you get there,\" Mei Feng said.","\"Will I be doing this alone? I have never been outside the city.\"","\"Of course not. You’ll be going with a team—a squad consisting of soldiers that I trust. I am not stupid enough to send you on your first mission alone.\"","\"When do I start?\"","\"Next week. In the meantime, you can do whatever you want.\"","\"I understand.\"","\"If you have any more questions, you can ask them after the mission.\"","Yuan left her office shortly after.","As he was being escorted back to his living quarters, Yuan asked the Sergeants, \"What do soldiers typically do on a daily basis?\"","\"We train,\" Sergeant Quang replied.","\"What sort of training?\"","\"It’d be easier to show you. Want to take a look?\"","\"Let’s.\"","Instead of returning to the living quarters, Yuan was escorted to the military building.","Once inside, they led him to the training area.","\"You can find all of the training facilities here. It offers numerous training programs, ranging from combat proficiency to physical conditioning. Take this room, for example...\"","Sergeant Quang stopped in front of a room that had the words ’Gravity Room’ engraved on top of the entrance.","\"This is the Gravity Room, where you can temper your body under increased gravity. Want to give it a try?\"","\"Might as well, since we’re already here.\"","Yuan followed Sergeant Quang into the room while Sergeant Bing waited outside.","Inside was a long hallway lined with numbered doors on either side. Some of these numbers emitted a green glow, while others glowed red.","\"Any of the green rooms are available. The red ones are occupied.\"","Sergeant Quang gave him a quick rundown.","They entered the closest available room, number 17, a moment later.","The room was surprisingly spacious. At its center stood a mechanical pillar equipped with a screen and several buttons.","\"You can adjust the gravity with that device, but it can also be voice-controlled. For example...\"","\"System, increase the gravity by one level.\"","The next moment, Yuan felt the atmosphere in the room shift as the weight pressing down on his body doubled.","\"Each level doubles the gravity. In other words, level two subjects you to four times the normal gravity.\"","\"Pretty neat. How many levels does it go up to?\"","\"Twenty levels.\"","\"So a little over a million times normal gravity, huh?\" Yuan muttered.","\"What’s the highest level anyone has reached?\"","\"Level 12, so about four thousand times normal gravity.\"","\"What’s your limit?\" Yuan then asked.","\"My limit is level 6.\"","\"In that case... System, set gravity to level 5.\"","The gravity slowly increased, eventually reaching 32 times the normal gravity.","\"Not bad...\" Yuan muttered, looking completely fine, as if the increased gravity was not affecting him in the slightest.","\"You... what rank is your physique at?\" Sergeant Quang stared at him with wide eyes.","\"Inexhaustible.\"","\"The same physique rank as me? Yet, you can withstand level 5 much more easily than me.\" Sergeant Quang sighed.","\"How about it? Want to try level 6?\"","\"Sure.\"","\"System, set gravity to level 6.\"","The gravity doubled almost instantly, reaching 64 times the normal gravity.","Sergeant Quang immediately started sweating profusely, his knees bent as if struggling to withstand the increased gravity.","Meanwhile, Yuan’s legs remained straight, looking fine even under the new gravity.","Seeing this, Sergeant Quang couldn’t help but ask, \"Have you trained like this before?\"","\"Something like that.\"","A few minutes later, Sergeant Quang said, \"Alright, let’s stop here. I’m soaked in sweat. System, end training.\"","The gravity swiftly returned to normal.","\"This is a popular training area for those who want to improve their physiques,\" Sergeant Quang said as they walked out of the room.","They moved to the next training area afterward.","\"This is the shooting range, where you can practice your aim. Though I doubt you’ll need to train your aim anytime soon since you can shoot even better than many elite soldiers already.\"","\"This is the sparring room. If you want to spice up your training by sparring with other soldiers, you can do so here.\"","\"Have you ever tried Endless Assault in Gaia’s Sanctum?\" Sergeant Quang suddenly asked as they approached the ’Simulated Combat’ room.","\"I have,\" said Yuan.","\"This room is exactly like that. The enemies and difficulty are the exact same, too.\"","\"Oh? The exact same? How many floors or levels does it go up to?\"","\"Same as Endless Assault.\"","A smile tugged at Yuan’s lips after hearing this, as this would allow him to fight the being on the 46th floor without needing to return to Gaia’s Sanctum!","\"There’s no limit to how many times I can attempt a level, right?\" Yuan asked, just to be sure.","\"No. You can attempt it as many times as you like. Moreover, your record from Gaia’s Sanctum is automatically transferred here, so you can start from whichever floor you reached there.\"","\"Alright. I have decided. I am going to train here,\" Yuan declared.","\"You don’t have to wait for me since I won’t be coming out anytime soon,\" he said to them.","\"Even if you say that, we cannot abandon our duty.\" Sergeant Bing shook her head.","\"Also, we have to stay here and make sure you come out in time for your mission,\" Sergeant Quang added."]},{"number":2596,"title":"Chapter 2596: First Mission in the Military","paragraphs":["\"Don’t worry, I will definitely come out before then,\" Yuan assured them before entering the training room.","Inside was another hallway with multiple rooms.","A notification popped up the moment Yuan entered one of the available rooms.","<You will be teleported to the Simulated Training Area in 3 seconds>","<3>","<2>","<1>","After being teleported, Yuan found himself in a familiar area that resembled the waiting room in Gaia’s Sanctum.","<Reading Player’s Status>","<Transferring Player Status from Gaia’s Sanctum>","<Transfer Successful>","<You can now challenge up to level 46>","Without hesitation, Yuan immediately challenged level 46.","<You will be teleported in 3 seconds>","Three seconds later, Yuan was teleported to the arena, where he reunited with the faceless entity that had dominated him during his time in Gaia’s Sanctum.","\"I’m back, you bastard,\" Yuan announced to the entity with a cold smile on his face.","\"Foolish mortal!\"","Just like it did in Gaia’s Sanctum, the faceless entity spoke the same two words.","After acquiring his weapon of choice, a sword, Yuan immediately started fighting his opponent.","<Your restriction on Eternal Essence has been temporarily lifted>","However, to nobody’s surprise, he died shortly afterward.","Yet, Yuan did not stop there and continued fighting it over and over again, just as he did in Gaia’s Sanctum.","Time passed quickly, and in the blink of an eye, it was almost the start of a new week.","After hundreds of deaths and no progress, Yuan left the training room.","\"You’re finally out,\" Sergeant Quang sighed in relief the moment he saw Yuan coming out.","\"Am I late?\"","\"Not if we leave right now.\"","Without waiting for Yuan’s response, Sergeant Quang and Sergeant Bing started walking toward the exit of the training facility.","Seeing this, Yuan quickly followed them.","\"What level were you training on?\" Sergeant Quang asked him as they moved.","\"46.\"","\"...\"","Both Sergeant Quang and Sergeant Bing abruptly stopped moving and turned to look at him with widened eyes.","Yuan chuckled at their reaction and continued, \"I’m joking. I was training on level 25.\"","\"I-Is that so... You nearly gave me a heart attack,\" Sergeant Bing sighed.","\"Still, level 25 is quite impressive,\" said Sergeant Quang. \"My record is level 29.\"","As they continued moving a moment later, Yuan asked, \"Do you know what the mission entails?\"","\"General Mei didn’t tell you?\"","\"She said something about clearing trash outside the city, and that I’d understand it once I get there.\"","\"In that case, we won’t spoil the fun for you. This will be your first time leaving the city, after all,\" said Sergeant Bing.","\"Hm? How did you know that this is going to be my first time leaving the city?\" Yuan asked with a raised eyebrow. \"Did General Mei tell you?\"","\"What are you talking about?\" Sergeant Bing also raised an eyebrow, looking puzzled. \"Civilians aren’t allowed to leave the city, so of course this would be your first time.\"","\"Oh... right...\" Yuan muttered with a stiff smile, pretending it had merely slipped his mind.","In truth, he hadn’t known about the restriction until now.","Some time later, they entered a small room, where two others were already waiting.","\"Hm?\"","\"Huh?\"","\"Oh?\" Yuan muttered in a somewhat surprised voice after seeing these two individuals, as he recognized both of them.","\"Sorry for the wait, Shi Fa, Wu Wang,\" Sergeant Quang said.","Since they shared the same rank and were close friends, he addressed them by name rather than title.","\"The hell? What is he doing here?\" Wu Wang asked while pointing at Yuan.","\"He’ll be joining us for the mission,\" said Sergeant Bing.","\"Seriously? Didn’t he just join the military like a week ago? Which idiot is sending a boot like him outside the city already?\"","\"That would be General Mei.\"","\"...\"","Wu Wang’s facial features immediately stiffened.","\"I-I didn’t say anything just now...\" he said a moment later with a forced smile.","\"I don’t intend to question the General’s judgment, but are we sure we should bring him with us? We’re not going sightseeing, but clearing out those ’things’.\"","\"Then what do you suggest we do? Go against General Mei’s orders and leave him behind?\" Sergeant Quang said while shaking his head.","\"...\"","The room immediately became awkwardly quiet.","\"Are you really worried about me?\" Yuan suddenly said, breaking the silence.","\"How cute.\"","\"What?\" Shi Fa frowned.","\"Now that I am in the military, you can stop pretending not to know me.\"","\"What is he talking about?\" Sergeant Bing inquired with a curious yet puzzled face.","\"This isn’t our first time meeting,\" Yuan explained. \"We met a few months ago at Gaia’s Sanctum, and they even lost to me... in a two-versus-one.\"","\"What?!\" Sergeant Quang and Sergeant Bing exclaimed in shock.","Wu Wang rubbed his eyes and sighed out loud, \"Did you really have to bring that up? It’s not like we actually fought. We simply played a game of tag.\"","\"Whether it was a real fight or not, both of you know what I am capable of better than anyone in the military right now, including General Mei.\" Yuan shrugged.","\"Is that true?\" Sergeant Bing asked the two.","\"It’s true...\" Shi Fa sighed. \"I won’t go into details, but if anything happens out there, he’ll likely be the safest out of all of us.\"","\"However...\" Wu Wang then spoke, \"Just being able to survive won’t be enough out there since our mission requires actual combat.\"","\"So what? Do you want me to prove myself through a real fight with one of you or something?\" Yuan asked.","\"...\"","Wu Wang and Shi Fa exchanged glances with each other.","After a moment of silence, Shi Fa said, \"No... You can come with us. Even if you can’t fight on the front lines, you can still support us from the rear with your shooting skills.\"","\"You make it sound like we’re going to be fighting dangerous monsters or something out there. Now I really cannot wait to go out there,\" Yuan remarked with an excited smile on his face."]},{"number":2597,"title":"Chapter 2597: The World Beyond the City Walls","paragraphs":["\"The General really didn’t brief you on the mission, huh?\" Wu Wang sighed after hearing Yuan’s words.","\"She said that she wanted to keep it a surprise.\" Yuan shrugged.","\"I get that she’s probably confident in our abilities, but this mission isn’t a game...\" Shi Fa shook his head.","\"Anyway, let’s talk about the mission itself,\" he continued. \"For this mission, we are merely going to do a quick cleanup of the area around the city, which will take about a week or two at most.\"","\"We will meet at the southern gates tomorrow at dawn. Any questions?\"","\"...\"","Shi Fa turned to look at Yuan and asked, \"Are you sure you don’t have any questions?\"","\"I do, but I’ll figure it out tomorrow,\" he said.","\"Alright. In that case, see you all tomorrow.\"","Everyone returned to their living quarters shortly after.","\"Do you intend to leave your living quarters again before the mission?\" Sergeant Bing asked Yuan as they arrived at his living quarters.","\"No.\"","\"Then we’ll leave you alone to pack for the mission. If you need to go anywhere, make sure to contact us.\"","\"Pack? There are things to pack?\"","\"Oh, it’s mostly just our weapons and personal luggage. Since you don’t have a weapon, you don’t have to worry about it. You can also bring anything you want.\"","\"When you say weapons, do you mean Limitless Armaments?\" Yuan asked in a curious tone.","\"Yes.\"","\"How does one acquire them? I also want one,\" he said.","\"Only Sergeants and above can carry weapons,\" said Sergeant Bing.","\"With that being said, you can try asking General Mei for one. She’ll likely make an exception for you.\"","Yuan nodded.","\"I’ll ask her after the mission.\"","Some time later, Yuan entered his living quarters while Sergeant Bing and Sergeant Quang left to pack their things.","The following day, both of them returned to Yuan’s living quarters and escorted him to the southern gate.","Unsurprisingly, Wu Wang and Shi Fa were already waiting for them when they arrived.","\"Let’s double-check our luggage before we head out,\" Sergeant Quang said.","Once they were done, they signed out at the gate.","\"Teleport us to the city wall,\" Wu Wang said to the soldier on duty there.","\"Yes, Sergeant!\"","Moments later, the group stepped into the teleportation array and vanished from the military base, reappearing atop the city’s towering wall.","\"This is...\" Yuan muttered in a dazed voice as he stared at the breathtaking scene before him.","Standing atop the massive wall at the city’s edge, he was seeing the world beyond its borders for the very first time.","However, the sight was nothing like he had anticipated. Beyond the wall lay nothing but a barren wasteland, an endless expanse of sand and dirt stretching to the horizon like a scene from the apocalypse.","\"What am I looking at?\" Yuan asked out loud without turning away from the scenery, which was a stark contrast to the beautiful city that existed behind him.","\"Quite the shocking sight, right? I remember my first time seeing the world beyond our city walls. I couldn’t sleep properly for weeks on end,\" Wu Wang remarked.","\"I didn’t even know there was a city wall since I couldn’t see it from my Sector,\" said Yuan.","He then asked, \"What happened?\"","All four of them shrugged.","\"Nobody knows for sure.\"","\"What?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, dumbfounded by their response.","\"How do you not know what caused such massive destruction?\"","\"Who said that was the cause?\" Sergeant Bing said. \"As far as we’re aware, the world outside the city has always been like this.\"","\"It’s always been like this?\" Yuan repeated in a low voice.","\"Let’s go.\" Shi Fa said before he suddenly leaped off the city wall and into the barren land.","Sergeant Quang and Wu Wang quickly followed.","\"Follow us closely,\" Sergeant Bing said to Yuan before following the others.","The moment Yuan jumped off the city walls and exited the city’s premises, the suppression on his cultivation was immediately released.","Meanwhile, Wu Wang retrieved his weapon, wielding it as though he was prepared to enter combat at any moment.","Sergeant Bing and Sergeant Quang both wielded a sword like Wu Wang, while Shi Fa wielded a spear.","\"I don’t see any enemies,\" Yuan said.","\"You will soon,\" said Wu Wang.","They traveled for nearly half a day without encountering anything.","\"Stop!\"","Shi Fa suddenly came to a halt.","\"Enemies ahead.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes in the direction Shi Fa was looking, but he couldn’t see anything, so he expanded the range of his divine sense.","\"T-Those are...?!\" Yuan’s eyes widened in shock.","In the distance, several shadowy entities wandered aimlessly. Though their forms resembled humans, they appeared to possess no physical bodies, their entire beings composed of swirling black fog.","’Black Death?!’ Yuan cried inwardly, as these entities resembled the Black Death he encountered when he was inside Vanishing Valley.","\"We call them Void Specters because it’s almost like you’re staring into the void when you look at them,\" Shi Fa explained. \"They don’t have physical bodies and are immune to physical attacks.\"","\"All they do is wander this barren land, as if they’re constantly searching for something,\" Sergeant Quang continued.","\"So our mission is to... kill them?\" Yuan asked.","\"Well... not exactly.\" Sergeant Bing shook her head. \"These things are immortal. You can ’kill’ them as many times as you want, but they will return a few weeks later as if nothing happened.\"","\"Then why bother with them? Do they pose a threat to the city?\"","\"Not directly,\" Shi Fa explained. \"When they get too close to the city, their presence interferes with our technology.\"","\"That’s why, before they get too close, we have to ’clean’ them.\"","\"Is that so...\" Yuan mumbled.","\"I know you’re probably itching to fight them, but stay back for now,\" Wu Wang suddenly said. \"We’ll show you how it’s done first.\"","\"Sure.\" Yuan did not object.","Wu Wang and Shi Fa exchanged a glance.","Without a word, they nodded to each other before approaching the Void Specters.","\"Hah!\"","Their weapons surged with Limitless before they struck the Void Specters, slashing them in half without any resistance from the entities.","After being struck, the Void Specters dispersed like smoke, leaving behind a decent amount of Eternal Essence that lingered for a moment before disappearing as well.","\"?!\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow at the sight.","’These things leave behind Eternal Essence when killed? I can probably train my Eternal Essence with this!’ he immediately thought to himself.","However, the Eternal Essence disappeared after three seconds, so if he didn’t immediately absorb them, it would vanish completely.","A few minutes later, Wu Wang and Shi Fa returned after clearing out all of the Void Specters.","\"Is that it? That seemed a little too easy,\" Yuan remarked.","\"For some reason, the closer they get to the city, the less aggressive they become,\" Shi Fa explained. \"Once we venture farther out, they’ll start fighting back.\"","\"It still won’t be too dangerous, but you can lose your life if you let your guard down, since they kill anything they touch,\" Wu Wang added.","\"They don’t have any long-range attacks, so you’ll be relatively safe as long as you keep your distance,\" Sergeant Bing said. \"The real danger lies in their numbers. You’ll understand soon enough.\"","Shortly afterward, they continued venturing farther from the city.","A few minutes later, they encountered another Void Specter.","\"You can take care of this one,\" Shi Fa said to Yuan. \"Since you don’t have a weapon, you can just shoot your Limitless at it. Though, it won’t be as effective, and you might need to hit it a few times—\"","Before Shi Fa could even finish his sentence, Yuan shot a single bullet of Limitless at the Void Specter.","Pop!","The moment the bullet reached the Void Specter, it exploded, instantly erasing the entity.","\"...\"","Shi Fa’s mouth remained open for a good moment before he cleared his throat and spoke in a stiff voice, \"Not bad, I guess.\"","<You have absorbed some Eternal Essence>","However, Yuan was focused on the notification that appeared after he absorbed the Eternal Essence the Void Specter left behind.","Although it wasn’t much, it was better than nothing.","’At least I have a way to train my Eternal Essence now,’ he smiled inwardly.","Not only that, but the others did not notice what he was doing. No, they were incapable of sensing Eternal Essence without the system, so there was no way for them to even know in the first place.","They continued their mission, eliminating every Void Specter they encountered. As they ventured farther from the city, the number of Void Specters steadily increased.","At first, they encountered only two or three at a time. Now, more than a dozen roamed within sight.","While the sergeants fought on the front lines, Yuan picked off the Void Specters from afar and absorbed the Eternal Essence they left behind.","Before long, he realized that their numbers weren’t the only thing increasing. The Void Specters were also growing stronger and becoming increasingly difficult to kill.","However, that only meant Yuan needed two or three more bullets instead of just one to kill them.","Time flew by, and before they knew it, nearly a week had passed since they began their mission.","\"All right, that should be enough cleaning for now,\" Shi Fa said. \"Let’s start heading back now.\"","\"Huh? That’s it? I want to clean up a little more,\" Yuan replied, dissatisfied that it was ending so soon.","\"What? Why?\" Wu Wang looked at him with a surprised expression.","\"It’s not like you’ll gain bonus merit for going above and beyond for this sort of mission,\" he said a moment later, misunderstanding Yuan’s intent."]},{"number":2598,"title":"Chapter 2598: Weapon of Choice","paragraphs":["\"Wu Wang’s right. There’s no point in staying out here longer than we need to. It’s unnecessary risk,\" Shi Fa said.","\"I have my own reason for wanting to continue cleaning up these Void Specters,\" Yuan said. \"But we can head back for now.\"","\"A reason to hunt Void Specters, huh? That’s the first time I’ve heard such a thing,\" Sergeant Quang remarked. \"Everyone I know considers this mission a punishment because of its nature.\"","\"Then let’s head back now. I want to wash myself as soon as possible,\" said Sergeant Bing.","They immediately started making their way back to the city.","As they traveled, Yuan asked, \"How often do soldiers come out here to clean? And how are they picked?\"","\"Soldiers have to come out every other week for cleanup,\" Shi Fa replied. \"As for who gets picked, there’s a rotation, and it just happened to be our turn this week.\"","\"In that case, when will it be our turn again?\"","\"We usually do this twice a year, so you can expect our next cleanup in half a year.\"","\"Half a year? That’s too long.\" Yuan frowned.","\"Well, if you really want to, you can request to join the other squads for their cleanup,\" said Wu Wang.","\"I can do that?\"","\"Sure...\"","Wu Wang paused briefly before continuing, \"Probably.\"","He shook his head and clarified, \"Nobody has ever tried it before, so I can’t really say for sure, but it’s common to have additional soldiers or replacements for missions.\"","\"I see. I will ask General Mei later.\"","\"What is your reason for wanting to clean these Void Specters, anyway? They are literally just trash that needs to be cleaned every so often,\" Shi Fa asked.","\"Trash that can kill you if you let them touch you...\" Sergeant Bing added.","\"It’s a bit of a personal reason, so I’ll keep it to myself for now,\" Yuan said.","\"Is that so?\"","Realizing that Yuan didn’t want to talk about it, they stopped talking about the subject altogether.","Eventually, they returned to the city walls.","\"Uh... are we going to have to climb this to return to the city?\" Yuan asked as they stood at the very bottom of the towering walls.","\"Unfortunately,\" Wu Wang sighed.","Without another word, all of them started flying to the top of the city walls.","Fortunately, they were still able to use their cultivation, allowing them to reach the top without any effort.","After reaching the top of the walls, they used the teleporter to return to the military base.","\"It’s my turn to do the report this week, so you guys can go ahead,\" Sergeant Quang said to them as they entered the military base.","\"See you guys later.\"","Wu Wang and Shi Fa went their own ways after they reached the residential area.","\"When are you going to meet with General Mei?\" Sergeant Bing asked Yuan as she escorted him back to his living quarters.","\"Tomorrow,\" he said.","\"Alright. See you tomorrow. If you wish to go anywhere today, let either me or Sergeant Quang know.\"","\"I won’t go anywhere,\" he assured her.","Once Yuan entered his home, Sergeant Bing returned to her own living quarters.","The follow day, Sergeant Bing and Sergeant Quang escorted him to General Mei’s office.","\"Welcome back. How was the mission?\" Mei Feng asked him.","\"Pretty good.\"","\"Really? Most soldiers hate it,\" she remarked.","\"Well, I am not most soldiers,\" he replied with a smile.","\"In fact, I want to talk to you about putting me on more of these missions.\"","\"Excuse me?\" Mei Feng muttered with raised eyebrows, wondering if she’d heard wrong.","\"I want to keep doing these cleanup missions,\" he repeated in a slightly louder voice to ensure she heard him properly.","\"This is a first,\" Mei Feng said after a moment of silence. \"But just in case, you want to do the same mission, not a different one?\"","\"That’s correct. I want to be sent outside the city to deal with the Void Specters,\" he said, making it as clear as possible so there was no way to misunderstand his desire.","\"If that’s what you really want...\" Mei Feng nodded.","\"How often do you want to do these missions?\" she then asked.","\"If possible, I would like you to put me on the next one.\"","\"Huh? The next one?\" Mei Feng raised her eyebrows.","\"The next cleanup mission is scheduled to start in two days, but it’ll be performed by another squad,\" she said.","\"That’s fine.\"","\"No, it’s not. In case you forgot, there are two soldiers currently protecting you. If I send you on a mission, they will have to come with you, so I won’t just be sending a single soldier.\"","\"Actually, I was going to talk to you about that,\" Yuan suddenly said. \"I don’t need any guards while I am outside the city since my cultivation isn’t restricted out there, and I am more than capable of protecting myself.\"","\"You—\"","Mei Feng opened her mouth to speak, but Yuan interrupted, \"I understand that you’re only looking out for me, but I don’t need a babysitter everywhere I go. If you don’t think I can protect myself out there, I am more than willing to prove myself.\"","\"...\"","Mei Feng fell silent, her eyes narrowing as she pondered his words.","Eventually, she spoke, \"If that’s what you want, I have no obligation to refuse. However, if anything happens while you are outside, you’ll have nobody but yourself to blame.\"","Yuan nodded.","\"Thank you, General.\"","\"Then I will add you to the next cleanup mission and notify the soldiers doing it. Anything else?\"","\"One more thing. Do you think it’s possible for me to carry a weapon?\" Yuan then asked.","\"A weapon, huh? Normally, only Sergeants are allowed to carry them, but since you’re already doing missions...\"","Mei Feng spent another moment pondering before giving a response, \"Alright, I’ll approve of it. You can visit the armory after this and request a weapon.\"","\"I will.\"","\"If there’s nothing else, you can leave.\"","Yuan left the room shortly after.","\"Where is the armory?\" Yuan asked Sergeant Quang as they walked.","\"I guess the General agreed to let you carry a weapon,\" he said with a smile.","\"Not only that, but she agreed to let me go on the next cleanup mission, which will happen two days from now.\"","\"Huh? That means we’ll also have to—\"","\"No, you don’t have to come with me,\" Yuan quickly interrupted. \"I’ve told the General that I don’t need any bodyguards while I am outside since I am more than capable of protecting myself.\"","\"Are you sure?\"","\"I am.\"","\"As long as you’re sure—not that I am complaining, since this means more free time for me.\"","They arrived at the armory half an hour later.","\"This is the armory. Just approach any of the available counters and tell them you’re here to receive your weapon,\" Sergeant Quang said to him.","Yuan followed his instructions and approached one of the counters.","\"I’m here to receive my weapon.\"","The man working behind the counter gestured at the machine on the table between them.","A moment later, Yuan’s information appeared for the man to see.","The first thing that came up was Yuan’s rank, and when the man saw this, he immediately frowned.","\"Listen here, Corporal—\"","However, he suddenly stopped midway when he noticed that despite being a Corporal, Yuan had permission to carry a weapon.","’A Corporal with a weapon? Who gave him the permission?’","Out of curiosity, the man checked the individual who signed off on it.","\"General Mei?!\" he exclaimed in shock after seeing her name.","After snapping out of his daze, the man turned to look at Yuan and swallowed nervously before speaking, \"W-What kind of weapon are you looking to carry, Corporal Yuan?\"","Yuan did not immediately respond.","Before arriving, he’d already decided to pick what he was used to the most—a sword. However, now that he was moments away from receiving his weapon, he suddenly had an urge to use a different weapon.","\"You got guns?\" he asked.","\"Of course, we do. What kind of gun do you want?\"","\"Whatever lets me shoot the fastest.\"","\"That would be a minigun, but this kind of weapon is only really used for training since it exhausts your Limitless insanely rapidly, and most people run out of Limitless in a few seconds.\"","\"I want it,\" Yuan quickly said.","\"You want... the minigun?\" The man asked just in case he heard wrong.","\"I do.\"","\"Uh... sure...? Give me a moment...\"","The man disappeared into a room at the back before returning with a minigun nearly as large as he was.","\"Here you go.\"","\"Thanks,\" Yuan said, casually holding the minigun with one hand.","\"There’s no way you actually picked that as your weapon...\" Sergeant Bing remarked with a dumbfounded face when Yuan returned to them with his new weapon.","\"What are you thinking, picking that weapon?\" Sergeant Quang shook his head. \"Fortunately, you can change your weapon at any time.\"","\"I wanted something that would help me clean up the Void Specters as fast and efficiently as possible,\" Yuan explained.","\"While I can’t deny the minigun can do that, you’ll run out of energy in a matter of seconds,\" said Sergeant Bing.","\"I should be fine,\" Yuan responded with a confident smile.","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Sergeant Quang sighed, \"I know you said you don’t need a bodyguard outside the city, but I am going to follow you anyway.\"","\"Me too,\" said Sergeant Bing. \"Not only am I concerned, but I am also curious.\"","\"If that’s what you want.\"","Yuan nodded, not refusing their company since it was their own decision to follow him."]},{"number":2599,"title":"Chapter 2599: Minigun","paragraphs":["After receiving his weapon, Yuan returned to his living quarters.","\"Are you not even going to try it out before bringing it with you on the mission?\" Sergeant Bing questioned him.","\"No need,\" he said.","\"Is that so...\"","\"Then we’ll see you in two days. If you need to go anywhere, you know where to find us.\"","Sergeant Bing and Sergeant Quang left shortly after, returning to their own living quarters that were only a few steps away from Yuan’s residence.","Yuan remained at home the entire time, and in the blink of an eye, it was time for the mission.","At the eastern gates, four soldiers were standing around, seemingly waiting for someone.","\"What are we waiting for?\"","\"I just learned of this last night, but we’ll have an extra for this mission.\" The Squad Leader explained.","\"Really? Who?\"","\"I wasn’t given any details except that it’s some Corporal.\"","\"Huh? A Corporal? For cleanup duty? It must be punishment.\"","\"Even if it’s punishment, it seems a bit harsh.\"","\"A punishment for them or us? Since it’s a Corporal, they won’t have a weapon, which will make cleanup a lot more difficult.\"","\"We can just make them carry our luggage or something,\" one of them suggested.","A few moments later, they noticed three figures approaching them.","\"Hm? Sergeant Bing? Sergeant Quang? Are you also going out for a mission today?\"","The soldiers recognized them and asked.","\"Yes, we’ll be joining you on your cleanup mission.\"","\"What?\"","The soldiers exchanged puzzled glances with each other.","\"W-Wait a second... I was told that it would only be a single individual, and that they were a Corporal,\" said the Squad Leader.","\"That would be me,\" Yuan finally spoke up. \"They decided to join me. That won’t be a problem, right?\"","The soldiers raised their eyebrows when they saw Yuan and the large weapon he was carrying.","\"Is that... a minigun?\" one of them asked, sounding incredulous.","\"Sure is.\"","\"I won’t question why a Corporal has a weapon, but do you plan on going outside with that?\"","\"Of course. Why else would I bring it? For emotional support?\" Yuan responded sarcastically.","\"...\"","The group fell silent, and they turned to look at Sergeant Bing and Sergeant Quang with frowns.","\"Ahem...\" Sergeant Bing awkwardly cleared her throat before speaking, \"You guys don’t need to concern yourself with him. We’re here for that reason.\"","A moment later, the squad leader said, \"Since everyone’s here, let’s head out.\"","Shortly afterward, they teleported to the city walls and departed from there.","Just like on Yuan’s first mission, they encountered barely any Void Specters during the first several hours. However, as they ventured farther from the city walls, the number of Void Specters gradually increased.","When there were only a few Void Specters, the original group for the mission did all of the work while Yuan and his group quietly followed behind.","Of course, it wasn’t as if Yuan did absolutely nothing, as he had to absorb all of the Eternal Essence left behind by the Void Specters.","The others didn’t blame Yuan for standing back, either. As ridiculous as Yuan’s weapon was in their eyes, they understood that its outrageous energy consumption prevented him from using it recklessly.","\"So, when are you actually going to use that thing?\" Sergeant Bing eventually asked Yuan.","\"I followed you out here because I wanted to see how quickly you regret picking it as your weapon.\"","Yuan chuckled and calmly replied, \"Why didn’t you say so earlier?\"","After the original group finished cleaning up the Void Specters, Yuan said to them, \"You guys can sit back from this point forward. I’ll take care of things from here on out.\"","\"What are you talking about?\" They muttered, looking confused.","Yuan held his minigun before his chest and said, \"I’ve been itching to use this.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, their squad leader said, \"Do as you please.\"","None of them objected, as they had no reason to stop Yuan, after all.","Some time later, when they encountered more Void Specters, the squad leader gestured at them while looking directly at Yuan.","\"All yours,\" he said.","Yuan did not respond and quietly raised his weapon, pointing its muzzles in the direction of the oblivious Void Specters.","He gathered his Limitless and poured it into the minigun. Then, without warning, started shooting a barrage of bullets at the Void Specters.","Whoosh!","The bullets tore through the air, riddling the group of twenty or so Void Specters with dozens of holes and annihilating them in the blink of an eye.","Despite the spectacular display, none of the soldiers reacted. They remained completely nonchalant, as though they had witnessed the same scene countless times before.","Shortly afterward, they continued onward, and Yuan dealt with every Void Specter that appeared along the way.","Although everything seemed normal at first, and none of the soldiers reacted to Yuan’s performance, they eventually began to sense something was off.","\"Hey... how long has it been since he took our place?\"","\"About twelve hours. Why?\"","\"Don’t you find it odd...?\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"He’s using a minigun, you know? A weapon notorious for exhausting its user within a few hours, even when fired sparingly. Yet he’s been shooting nonstop for twelve hours!\"","\"!!!\"","\"Holy shit! You’re right! How the hell is he still able to shoot that thing?! That’s some insane stamina!\"","The others reacted with shock after realizing this anomaly.","\"It’s not just his stamina.\" Sergeant Quang suddenly said. \"If you didn’t notice, it only takes him four to five bullets at most to defeat a Void Specter, which typically takes over a dozen.\"","The soldiers swallowed nervously when they realized what Sergeant Quang was trying to say.","Not only was Yuan not exhausted after using the minigun for so long without a break, but he was even using more power than normal!","\"Who the hell is he?\"","The squad leader asked.","\"Corporal Yuan, a prodigy who joined the military not even a month ago,\" said Sergeant Bing.","\"Excuse me?!\"","The soldiers exclaimed in shock and disbelief."]},{"number":2600,"title":"Chapter 2600: Five Zones","paragraphs":["\"It hasn’t been a month since he joined the military?! And he’s already a Corporal?! Do you really expect me to believe that?!\"","\"He was promoted to Corporal right after the recruitment due to his performance, which broke all of the previous records,\" said Sergeant Quang.","\"I heard rumors of a monster with talents on par with the Ironwoman appearing in the recent recruitment... Are you telling me that individual is him?\" The squad leader swallowed nervously at this realization.","\"Of course. Why else would we, Sergeants, be accompanying a Corporal like him?\" Sergeant Bing remarked.","\"I thought you were friends...\"","\"Nope. He is under our protection... by General Mei’s orders.\" Sergeant Quang revealed.","The soldiers turned to look at Yuan with dazed expressions, seeing him in a new light.","Over the next several days, Yuan single-handedly eliminated every Void Specter they encountered.","Because he was clearing them so quickly, the squad traveled much farther than originally planned. In fact, they didn’t realize how far they’d ventured until they began encountering Void Specters that were noticeably larger than the ones they’d seen before.","Not only did the Void Specters become more durable as they ventured further away from the city, but they also grew larger in size.","Of course, this also meant that the amount of Eternal Essence they left behind increased.","\"Hey, I know you’re having fun, but it’s time to start heading back. There’s no point cleaning more than we should... and we’ve already gone overboard.\"","\"Can we stay for two... no, one more day?\" Yuan asked.","\"What are we, at the amusement park...?\" The squad leader remarked while shaking his head.","\"What are you trying to achieve by staying longer?\" asked another soldier.","\"He has a personal reason for wanting to clear the Void Specters,\" Sergeant Bing answered for him.","\"He volunteered to participate in this mission for a reason,\" Sergeant Quang added.","\"What did you say? He volunteered for this mission?\"","The soldiers looked at him with wide eyes.","\"I thought he was being punished.\"","\"Nope.\"","\"...\"","\"Well, whatever his reason is, it’s too dangerous to go further than this,\" said the squad leader. \"Hell, we’ve already entered the Orange Zone.\"","\"Orange Zone? What’s that?\" Yuan asked, as this was his first time hearing such a term.","The squad leader was prepared to mock Yuan for not knowing such basic knowledge, but quickly recalled that Yuan had just joined the military and held himself back.","\"The world outside the city is divided into five zones, with each color representing a different danger level. The Green Zone is closest to the city, followed by the Orange Zone. Beyond that are the Red, Purple, and Black Zones. Cleanup missions typically remain within the Green Zone,\" he explained.","\"What makes each zone different besides the Void Specters becoming larger and harder to kill?\" Yuan asked.","\"The Void Specters don’t just become harder to kill,\" Sergeant Quang explained. \"In the Orange Zone, they begin fighting back. In the Red Zone and beyond, they become aggressive and actively hunt anyone who enters.\"","\"Then what sort of mission requires one to traverse so far away from the city?\" Yuan continued to ask.","\"That’s...\" The soldiers immediately looked hesitant to tell him for some reason.","\"Let me guess... You can’t tell me because of my rank?\" Yuan speculated.","\"That’s right.\"","They admitted.","\"Then forget it,\" said Yuan a moment later. \"Anyways, we can start heading back now.\"","Thus, they started heading back to the city.","As they traveled, Yuan received a notification.","<You have received some merit for clearing a mission>","<Your credential has increased slightly>","’Since I am technically still in the middle of my second mission, this must be for my first one,’ Yuan thought to himself, thinking that it took rather long for him to receive credit for the mission.","After returning to the city, Yuan and the other group parted ways.","\"Do you even feel tired in the slightest?\" Sergeant Bing asked Yuan as they made their way back to their residence.","\"No,\" he answered.","\"No wonder you picked the minigun as your weapon... You have opened my eyes,\" she said.","\"Hey, I have been wondering... is it possible to go outside the city by myself?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"You want to do cleanup missions by yourself...?\" Sergeant Quang immediately guessed his thoughts.","Yuan nodded.","\"I don’t know, and you’re definitely asking the wrong people.\"","\"Guess I’ll go speak with General Mei again.\"","\"...\"","\"What is it?\" Yuan asked when he noticed Sergeant Quang staring at him with an odd expression.","\"Is it really okay for you to visit the General so often?\" Sergeant Quang asked. \"Besides the Ironwoman, you’re probably the only soldier to speak with her so frequently.\"","Yuan shrugged.","\"If she has an issue with that, she’ll tell me. Until then, I’ll take advantage of it. And since we’re already on the topic, I am going to visit General Mei tomorrow.\"","\"Alright...\"","The following day, Yuan visited General Mei in her office.","\"General, is it possible for me to go outside the city by myself?\" Yuan wasted no time and went straight to the topic.","\"You want to go outside the city and do cleanup missions... alone?\" Mei Feng repeated with a dumbfounded expression.","He nodded.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Mei Feng said, \"Don’t you think you’re moving a little too fast? You joined the military less than a month ago, and after only two missions, you’re already asking to go out alone? Sorry, but even if you’re capable, I can’t allow it.\"","\"Can I ask why?\" Yuan replied, unwilling to give up so easily. \"The soldiers don’t like this mission, right? I’m more than happy to handle all the cleanup myself. That would free everyone else to take on other—more important—missions, wouldn’t it?\"","\"I have a better question,\" she replied. \"What’s your deal? Why are you so eager to leave the city every chance you get?\"","\"This isn’t about me wanting to leave the city,\" Yuan said while shaking his head before elaborating, \"It’s the Void Specters. I want to ’clean’ them.\""]}]);
